window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3201,"title":"Chapter 3201: Chapter 3200 Eonic Brilliance! I","paragraphs":["Protector Waner gazed at Antonio with a difficult gaze as he went back to managing the Synthetic Existences and look for the Worms of Existence infecting this Omniverse.","She was a Protector, yes.","She was no longer a foolish girl, yes!","But...","She also questioned.","The one distinguished Viceroy...what if, unlike what everyone wanted to believe, his words held a hint of truth.","What if, sometime in the future, the Commonwealth would truly be involved in the Breaking of the Wheel?","Why? Why did nobody want to even entertain the idea of this possibility?","She questioned and questioned again.","But there was no answer.","—","In the Wheel of Weavings.","Inside the Gladiators' Arena.","After some time, nearly all the thrones floating before the massive round table were filled, with intents constantly weaving around from different entities as they discussed the prospects of being made Protectors!","After some time...","HUUM!","The round table displaying an illusion of the golden Arena began to flicker and change.","It panned out as more and more of the Arena was seen, the massive statues of past Champions being seen at this moment as from all around, instruments began to play!","The low beat of a drum.","Melodic horns of victory and power!","They slowly began to pick up pace before moments later, they were joined by a massive shout of cheers.","Cheers.","Apart from the statues, the scene displayed throngs of millions upon millions of Entities cheering on seats that circled the massive Arena!","The figures of mainly Simians raised their hands while billowing out in exhilaration and excitement, and a booming voice echoed out alongside them.","|Citizens of the Commonwealth!|","WAA!","A cherry voice filled with power.","It was met with resounding cheers across the Gladiators' Arena as it continued.","|There are a great deal of worries as the Commonwealth fights for Existence, but we never let these worries bog us down as we make sure to celebrate when it counts!|","...!","On the table, illusory scenes continued to flash as they finally panned to a single being floating above the golden Arena.","A Royal Existential Omniversal Simian with pure white fur and gold streaks across his chest.","His whole body emanated valor and battle as the beat of drums and horns booming out seemed to come from him!","|We celebrate, O Citizens of the Commonwealth, and on this glorious Celebration of Omniversal Discovery, the Commonwealth is proud to add a new Omniverse under our banner- an omniverse that from this day forth shall be deemed...Omniverse X- 999!|","Omniverse X- 999.","On the thrones observing all of this, Noah's eyes shone with interminable brilliance.","Their Omniverse had received a number.","His Natal Omniverse had officially been taken by others who stated that they discovered it, and they had now renamed it to what they wished!","|I am Nuntius Eshkeri, and I have been tasked with the glorious purpose of announcing the distinction of Omniverse X-999, as well as the even grander honor of introducing the presence of those who keep the Wheel turning.|","...!","|On this day of the Celebration of Omniversal Discovery, we have been blessed with the presence...of the Viceroy of the Commonwealth!|","BOOM!","Within the domain Noah and the others were in.","Boundless waves of authority erupted as many Entities showed genuine shock.","They showed shock because of the rarity of what was currently occurring!","The Viceroy...the governing body of the Commonwealth was rarely seen across the Omniverses, only making appearances within special Omniverses over the years.","Was this Omniverse that special? That even the Viceroy made his presence here?!","On the table showing the illusory scene of Nuntius Eshkeri, his visage turned towards the front of the Arena where at this time, a golden sea unfurled.","A glorious golden sea that showed resplendent thrones on it- 9 thrones in total!","The central throne was slightly bigger than the rest as above it, a golden wheel spun while releasing waves of brilliance.","Not all the thrones were filled.","Beside the largest throne, the three thrones to the left and to the right were filled, leaving behind two empty ones!","On the central throne, a relatively young looking Simian could be seen seated, his face showing immeasurable grace and power as an unfathomably few could even manage to look at his image for longer than a second.","He was draped in golden garments, his figure that of a regal Simian with gold and purple fur.","His expression emanated boundless brilliance and benevolence as beside him, the other occupied thrones were seated with aged Royal Existential Omniversal Simians whose presence alone could press down on an entire Omniverse.","There was a woman to his right who was actually fully human, not an ounce of fur on her fair skin as a head full of golden white brilliance of hair draped past her shoulders.","Adorned in a white dress, her eyes were extremely sharp as they stared forth coldly.","To the left of the central throne, there was a Simian filled with silver white fur- an Entity that even the illusory screen couldn't show too well as Existence seemed to be constantly distorting around him.","This being.","The one on the central Throne.","The woman to his right.","And all the other unique Entities occupying the other thrones...Noah looked at all of them as he confirmed with certainty.","None of these beings were remotely within the bounds of Autarchy or anything equivalent to it.","Their power had long since exceeded this stage!","|We welcome and thank the 81st Viceroy of the Commonwealth for his presence. The Palatine of the Commonwealth. The Cardinal of the Wheel! The Heir of the First Exalted Simian...Viceroy Gilgamesh!|","OOOOH!","Unfathomably profound shouts of valor and joy echoed out.","Seated on the throne, the young looking Simian waved his hand with grace and honor.","The Palatine of the Commonwealth.","The Cardinal of the Wheel.","The Heir to the First Exalted Simian!","His Distinctions were many.","His power was unfathomable.","His presence here today...marked the beginning of something glorious as all of the Gladiators' Arena was shaking from his mere appearance!"]},{"number":3202,"title":"Chapter 3202: Chapter 3201 Eonic Brilliance! II","paragraphs":["At the forefront of the Gladiators' Arena.","Basked with a sea of golden brilliance under them, nine thrones floated with unfathomable serenity.","On the Central Throne, the Heir to the First Exalted Simian waved his hands to the millions of masses seated all around the Arena.","Among the masses, the weakest ones were at the Sequor Stage as they ranged all the way to Paracosm- with a few dozen auras of Autarchical Equivalent Entities seated in special areas of the Arena!","With the spotlight on these grandiose Thrones, the voice of Nuntius Eshkeri continued to bombard outwards.","|With the Grace of the Heir to the First Exalted Simian, we shall kick off this Celebration of Omniversal Discovery with battles of Existence that have everything at stake- the Victors and renowned Gladiators having the chance to be chosen as Protectors of the Commonwealth!|","OOOH!","A blaze of cheers and valor.","A cacophony of noises reverberated throughout as Nuntius Eshkeri wrapped up his introduction.","|For this, we will welcome the first Gladiators and kick things off! From Omniverse X- 456, Prime Citizen Dexus shall go against Prime Citizen Mikah from Omniverse X- 433!|","...!","Within the Domain filled with floating thrones, two lit up brightly as in a randomized fashion, two Gladiators were chosen.","The thrones they sat on began to vibrate with a spatial light as they looked across and locked gazes, their figures being teleported out of this space as they reappeared thousands of miles away from each other atop the golden sands of the Arena.","On the table all thrones floated on, the scenes of these beings on the Arena flourished and enlarged as things were going to kick off.","In the skies, Nuntius Eshkeri turned back towards the Nine Golden Thrones as he bowed towards them and spoke with reverence.","|If Viceroy Gilgamesh will give us the grace to begin...|","The grace to begin.","The magisterial entity filled with an Unknown charm and power on the central Throne smiled as his hand swung down, booming voices roaring out within the Gladiators' Arena as on the golden sand, colorless authority began to burn.","Back on the Nine Thrones.","\"What a clown show this is. We already have details on everyone under us as we already know who among them we will choose as the new Protectors. Did I really have to show myself for this?\"","The voice of the Viceroy emanated out calmly as he uttered words others would be shocked to hear.","Those seated on the thrones beside him didn't show any falter of emotions on their faces as the human woman smiled while speaking out, her white dress and golden white hair making her seem like an eonic celestial from the wildest fantasy.","Her beauty was something very few could even imagine as her voice was even more so.","\"An Emperor should always take the time to show his presence to his subjects, my son, lest they forget or don't even know who rules over them.\"","...!","Her son.","The mother of Viceroy Gilgamesh.","That was the identity of this pristine woman beside him!","Viceroy Gilgamesh scowled at her words as he replied.","\"It is enough that I know I rule over them. I am the Viceroy. I have the Authority over the Commonwealth. Why must I pose a fa?ade?\"","...!","Why must he not show who he was to the people? Why did he have to paint and keep a certain image?!","The Mother of the Viceroy looked to the thrones around her as she was about to advise her son again when...","\"Do you remember any of the Viceroys that came before you?\"","HUUM!","A thick voice echoed out.","One that even caused the Mother of the Viceroy to change her gaze as it came from the other throne beside her son.","There, a man advanced in age could be seen as his figure was robust, with his body adorned in an armor that shone with multicolored brilliance m.","An Armor renowned in the Commonwealth as it was known by the distinction of The Omniversal Carapace!","Something rumored to have been forged with the backbone of a dying Omniverse.","The man who wore it held features of a Royal Existential Omniversal Simian, his fur being radiant white as his face was that of utmost regality.","The Viceroy of the Commonwealth held many titles, while this man held a single one.","|The Sword of the Commonwealth|.","An utterly terrifying Entity as when one looked at the positioning of the thrones, they may wonder if the order was wrong.","Because the power that this one being silently emanated...entirely outclassed nearly all others seated on these thrones.","Such a being calmly asked the Viceroy if he remembered any of the Viceroys that came before him.","Viceroy Gilgamesh's gaze became sour as he turned to face this Entity who didn't even look at him as he didn't reply.","But this being continued.","\"It may be hard to recall, with the last one being your father. But he lies dead somewhere- just like all the Viceroys before you. The highest mortality rate in the Commonwealth is that of Viceroys because of the duty it represents.\"","WAA!","\"So you will put up a fa?ade when told to do so. You will play your role when told to do so. There are many Viceroys that came before you, and there will be those that come after you. Do you understand?\"","...!","Immense silence followed.","The golden eyes of Viceroy Gilgamesh burned with countless splendor, but he didn't erupt or reply as he now only looked ahead.","A simple conversation.","But it showed a glimpse of the complex weavings of power of the Commonwealth as even a glimpse of their figureheads....showed that power did not simply burn with the seat of the Viceroy.","There were more complex weavings at work that others couldn't even imagine!","In the Arena.","Only seconds had passed, and yet the crowds were roaring out with fervor as on the golden sands of the Arena, the man from Omniverse X- 433 was standing over the one from Omniverse X- 456.","Above him, thousands of eyes were swirling with a hypnotic light- a light that was so potent that it put their enemy under their control before the battle could even unfold.","|An astounding victory for a very quick first match! Victory goes to Prime Citizen Mikah from Omniverse X- 433!|","WOO!","The announcer that was Nuntius Eshkeri bellowed out with fervor from above as the victor raised his fist up in the air- his body and the body of the defeated being wrapped by a spatial light thereafter as they disappeared.","|This next one is unique as one side, we have a combatant from this newly Discovered Omniverse X- 999, Prime Citizen Imperium! On the other side, we have Prime Citizen Entah from Omniverse X- 889!|","Brilliance flourished.","And soon after, atop the golden sand...the figures of the Imperium Autarch and a man shrouded in a crimson robe appeared!"]},{"number":3203,"title":"Chapter 3203: Chapter 3202 Eonic Brilliance! III","paragraphs":["On an arena being watched with the eyes of countless powerful individuals.","The figure of the Imperium Autarch appeared with stupendous grace and beauty as he seemed like an Entity outside of a painting.","When one thought of a hero. When one thought of a chosen entity who would rise to save his people.","His golden hair and eyes, his disposition...this being held it all!","Standing on the golden sands of the Arena that seemed sturdier than Planes of Existence, Imperium stared at his enemy from Omniverse X- 889.","And he asked calmly.","\"Entah...what might your System of Existence be?\"","Casual words.","Words that the crimson robed man with dark hair heard and smiled, his body beginning to burn into streams of flames that flowed upwards to open countless portals.","\"I am a Spiritualist. I've lived for eons contracting Spirits under my banner, their strength flowing through me as in an instant...\"","HUUM!","Around him, massive illusory figures of different mythical animals began to appear.","A Nine Horned Unicorn. A DragoPhoenix. A Three Headed Turtle!","One after another, each one bathed in colorless flames.","When they added up to 9 Spirits in total, the region around the Spiritualist burned with Infernal brilliance as he smiled.","\"What of you, Little Ankyra? What can you do?\"","...!","Words filled with mockery.","And Imperium smiled as he began to take steps forward.","\"I play with the laws and concepts that make up our surrounding Existence.\"","BZZT!","As he began to walk, the space above them trembled- colorless brilliance gushing out like a sea as he continued.","\"Take the concept of Aitiologia. It encompasses many things within this omniverse as its basics deal with cause and effect. I can look at the weavings of your Existence, Spiritualist, and question the link you have formed with your Spirits.\"","...!","\"I question the consequences of your actions of subjugating these Spirits...And I enhance these possible consequences. I distort the Causality of the forceful bond you have formed and bring forward only a single possibility...\"","The gaze of the Spiritualist rapidly changed.","A colorless Omniversal Authority had permeated the surrounding's Existence that caused his Spirits to roar out, their eyes quickly losing their stable light as, after a few roars, they shook their heads while turning their gazes below them.","At the man that bound them.","\"No...\"","The Spiritualist gazed up with incredulity as his control over his Spirits faltered, and he didn't regain it quickly enough as in the next moment, all the Spirits he had summoned dove towards him to rip him apart.","\"...!\"","Silence prevailed before moments later...","OOOH!","Roars of immense joy and excitement echoed out across the Arena.","Imperium had expertly and efficiently only utilized a single powerful Omniversal Authority, and he turned the force of his own enemy against himself in a show of grace and power.","Above, the voice of Nuntius Eshkeri roared out with valor.","|A smooth victory for the Omniversal Ankyra of this newly Discovered Omniverse!|","Golden brilliance spread out as a spatial light covered Imperium, his figure being teleported away as on the Arena, the Existence of a Spiritualist had been devoured cleanly by his own Autarchical Spirits that roared out with madness towards the surroundings- intent on going on a rampage and attacking others.","But the Simian Visage of Nuntius Eshkeri gazed down coldly and tapped his fingers.","From above, drops of golden rain fell.","The moment they came in contact with the Autarchical Spirits, they roared out as they felt their existence beginning to be extinguished!","Thousands of droplets rained down as within moments, not a glimmer of the Spirits remained.","|Next...!|","And the booming voice of Nuntius Eshkeri continued as the matches of the Gladiators continued on!","One after another.","Matches that showcased the power of unique Sources of Existence unfolded under the eyes of many, Noah watching all of it with a sharp gaze as after Imperium, dozens of other matches went on.","Noah's mind was on many things, but one of the foremost was the image he had saved in his mind of the Nine Thrones that were briefly shown to them.","The Thrones that held the Viceroy of the Commonwealth.","Was he truly the core power of the Imperium?","At a single first glance, he could see that none of the beings on the mostly filled Nine Thrones were not within the Autarchical Equivalent Stage.","But he couldn't say for sure if the seat of the Viceroy represented the utmost power of the Commonwealth!","Subconsciously, his eyes were drawn towards the Cold and calm gaze of a man beside the throne of the Viceroy.","His mind could see him there. His eyes could see him there. And yet it was also like this being didn't exist.","This glimpse of the possible leadership of the Commonwealth was critical as he didn't know when the next time would be, but just as he was lost in his thoughts...","|This next one is another unique combatant from this newly Discovered Omniverse X- 999, Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont On the other side, we have Prime Citizen Adaman from Omniverse X- 112!|","...!","His name was uttered out.","His throne began to shine as around him, other Gladiators drew sharp breaths.","This matchup...did not seem entirely fair.","The numbers of the Omniverses mattered as the lower they were, the earlier they were in being discovered by the Commonwealth.","It was a basic rule that more likely than not, those from earlier Omniverses held much more power.","It wasn't always true, but it was held to be true for the vast majority of instances!","And Adaman of Omniverse X-112...was a man known by a few here.","Silent prayers were made as in the next moment, Noah's figure appeared on the golden sands of the Arena.","His figure drew sharp breaths from many, the female entities within the thrones of the audience cheering out as his visage of tremendous beauty showed itself.","His colorless Wings stretched out behind his back and his feet as he looked like a celestial entity coming down to dish out judgment!"]},{"number":3204,"title":"Chapter 3204: Chapter 3203 Eonic Brilliance! IV","paragraphs":["A white battle robe wrapped around him as his enemy...was a burly man with his chest laid bare.","Dark hair danced wildly to his shoulders as his visage was frighteningly sculpted.","Black briefs covered his lower half, his visage humanoid as he smiled and spoke towards Noah.","\"The first guy from your Omniverse was curious what his enemy's System of Existence was, so I'll tell you mine...\"","The entity raised his hands as Existence faltered and trembled with his mere raise.","\"In my Omniverse, everyone is born with Attribute Values that we can designate to specific aspects of our Existence. All of the Attribute Values I've collected over the eons...have gone to the Aspect of Existence easiest to raise- my body. And over time...it has become impenetrable\"","HUUM!","The very weavings of Existence trembled.","With a flicker of his feet, this being disappeared.","An instant later, he was already above Noah- his fist thundering down his head as he could already see the scene of this head bursting like a watermelon- The Existence of this being soon after that dissipating!","But...","\"Interesting...\"","Noah's head turned up at the fist thundering down as his Eyes of Deorcnysse spun.","And all light faded in the next instant as if a light illuminating Existence was flicked off!","Light across the whole arena!","The only place where light couldn't even come close to being absorbed was around Nuntius Eshkeri and the dazzling Nine Thrones in the far distance.","In this darkness, a singularity of light bloomed above Noah's head as it turned into an unfathomable beam of light that radiated everything upwards, the enemy above him being flung out as he steadied himself in the space above!","His visage remained unblemished.","Within the Autarchical Equivalent Stage, this Entity far exceeded the power of Entities like the Faesinged Queen or Sunwinged Leprachanus.","But Noah still had not collected enough data to set up a staging of power within the Autarchical level- something he sought to do as he fought and observed more fights with beings of this stage!","He expected that at some point within these battles, he would have enough clarity to properly outline the Autarchical Stage and where he stood on it compared to others- and even such a staging system applicable across different Systems of Existence.","But first...","\"Since you pride your body the most, let me reciprocate.\"","...!","No weavings of concepts.","He simply tapped into his First Mundi of Power as silently, the Authority of the Laborer of the Atlas of Existence flowed over his body.","An authority that had already been terrifying, but it was further enhanced when multiple concepts relating to Natural Laws and Decreta were taken to the level of Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities.","When he was designated as Anti-Life and all concepts dealing with the end received significant boons!","All of it only strengthened this authority as he had it come out in the form of dancing white flames that covered his body, and he then tapped his feet on the golden sand below as he instantly appeared before his opponent in the space above, his hand thundering out.","Adaman was only just barely capable of reacting, his gaze becoming stern as he blocked this fist coming with both hands!","CRACK!","His impenetrable body.","On this day, the palms on his hands felt a tremendous impact as the skin on them actually cracked, blood beginning to leak out as Adaman gazed forward incredulously!","Yet the man who had breached his defenses actually showed disappointment in his eyes as he shook his head while disappearing.","\"Not sufficiently different enough.\"","WAP!","Not sufficient different enough.","This was the last thing Adaman heard before the figure bathed in white flames disappeared, his senses only tingling to let him know something was coming from above.","By the time he tried to dodge, he felt another strike from the side, below him, and above him again as his enemy moved at speeds he couldn't match!","So the only thing unfolding next were horrific indentation of fists appearing on the supposedly impenetrable body of Adaman, his figure becoming deformed as after a second...","SHAA!","Noah reappeared in front of him once more as he uttered out.","\"Fatality.\"","...!","His colorless wings fluttered.","\"Alchemical Processing.\"","Causality twisted and distorted.","Around the heavily injured Adaman whose very existence was shaken to the core with every attack Noah had thrown, a colorless Cauldron instantly manifested- his figure contained entirely within as the last thought he had was...","\"What the f-\"","HUUM!","His existence was then interrupted, displaced, and refined within an instant as within the Cauldron, everything that made this terrifying Autarchical Equivalent Entity was somehow ground down to a single colorless pill!","A pill that flew out of the dissipating cauldron and became devoured by Noah right away.","|A new Source of Existence is being analyzed.|","|The System of Existence of Attribute Value Allocation is being analyzed.|","|The newly discovered System of Existence is not complex enough to be placed in a Mundi of its own and will be assimilated into the First Mundi of Power.|","Unbeknownst to others, an array of prompts came before his eyes while roars of cheers echoed out across the Arena.","The booming voice of Nuntius Eshkeri echoed out.","|Yet another victory for the Natives of this Omniverse! Are they unstoppable?!|","OOOOH!","Cheers and roars echoed out amidst such a reality.","As a spatial light began to wrap around him, Noah gazed around at the cruel reality that was showing through the gaps of the Commonwealth.","In the Arena, Gladiators could finish the battle without decimating the Existence of others, but if one did entirely destroy the existence of their opponent...this received even more cheers as there were no consequences.","Destruction was craved by those watching.","Destruction was permitted by those officiating as Nuntius Eshkeri did not bat an eye, only proceeding with the next battle!","It showed just how cruel the next day was about to be as depending on how many people were like Noah...a great deal of Autarchical Equivalent Entities were about to fall!"]},{"number":3205,"title":"Chapter 3205: Chapter 3204 The Quantification of Autarchy! I","paragraphs":["The Gladiators' Arena.","Its golden sands gradually became painted with crimson-gold blood that glimmered with Existence.","The Royal Existential Omniversal Simians on the thrones of the audiences roared with fervor at the battles that showed the weavings of the very peak of Existence.","The Entities of other Omniversal Lineages- Citizens of the Commonwealth from a myriad of Omniverses, all had the same feeling of valor and glee as many Gladiators came and went.","Others finished their battles amicably, while many more were brutal as the opponent had their existence entirely shredded, destroyed, or devoured.","At this moment.","\"You are a child! I can see it in your Existence! You dare stand before me who has lived for millions of years?!\"","The roar of a massive Existential Omniversal Octopoda echoed out as thousands of tentacles unfurled, but from above...massive golden Pillars of Destiny surrounded by arcs of colorless brilliance thundered down and locked every tentacle in place.","Floating above the golden sands, Henry Osmont clasped his hands on his chest as he uttered out.","\"The Destiny of your Existence has been written in stone.\"","...!","Utilizing the thin strands of the Authority of the Laborer accessed from his father, Henry rewrote the Destiny of an Autarchical Equivalent Stage Entity to something he deemed.","And the Destiny of this Existential Omniversal Octopoda was to be devoured by the Pillars of Destiny surrounding it as its whole Existence would be an offering towards his Father!","Every strand of his attack carried the Authority of the Laborer- it meant that the Will and Intent of the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor was observing everything as if he were on the battlefield himself.","His Father.","Below the golden sands of the Gladiators' Arena, in the enclosed space with floating thrones around a circular table, many prompts were floating in front of Noah.","|Enough analysis has been made with multiple subjects exhibiting the Autarchical Equivalent Stage to formulate a fairly accurate distinction of power within this Stage, applicable to all Sources of Existence.|","A lot of samples were observed by Noah personally, from when Henry and others had their matches, and as he simply continued to silently analyze all the Autarchical Equivalent existences in this domain.","And after careful consideration and analysis, a mostly accurate quantification of the power of Autarchical Existences was made!","|Initial entry into the Autarchical Stage allows an Entity to utilize this apex authority of Existence commonly displayed with a colorless hue in a process that alters their Existence entirely. This enactment is akin to the building of a foundation that allows them to easily alter their surrounding Existence in absolute ways that cannot be overcome unless someone of similar power is present. This is the Autarchical Existence Foundation Stage, or simply the subject is a Foundation Autarch.|","|After enough time passes with the respective System of Existence continuing to enhance and elevate the level of the Autarchical Existence, they enter a vast Stage where they accumulate more and more Autarchical Authority in their existence- their Existence undergoing constant changes in this period as their usage of the colorless authority becomes much more complex. This is the Autarchical Existence Accumulation Stage, or simply the subject is an Accumulation Autarch.|","|Lastly, the stage where most of the observed Protectors of the Commonwealth seem to be in- the last Stage of Autarchy before a comprehensive jump is made towards another realm entirely, and the last defined stage under the umbrella of the Existential Dominium Realm. At this stage, the manner and usage of Autarchical Authority is one that could easily overcome anyone below it, with their outlook on Existence expressed and ensured heavily as they cannot be easily erased even with another Entity at the same stage. This is the Autarchical Existence Apogee, or simply the subject is an Apogee Autarch.|","...!","Three levels of Autarchy!","This was how Noah outlined a simple quantifying of the Entities he came across.","A Foundation Autarch, an Accumulation Autarch, and lastly- an Apogee Autarch!","The vast majority were Foundation Autarchs.","Henry. Sona. Piety.","The Entity that he decimated first in the Arena, Adaman, was someone within the early rungs as an Accumulation Autarch.","And then there were Entities like Protector Antonio.","Unfathomable in their power as Noah knew he couldn't eradicate them just yet.","Entities such as him were Apogee Autarchs as their brilliance was undeniable.","And they stood just below the next Realm of Power.","One that when Noah looked at the illusions of the terrifying figures seated on the Nine Thrones, he made a simple analysis.","'The next realm of power if one is capable and lucky enough to exceed Autarchy of the Existential Dominium Realm...'","|The Omniversal Realm has been selected as the distinction for the next stage of power succeeding the Existential Dominium Realm.|","...!","Omniversal.","The Entities that were far out of grasp for the current him.","The upper echelons of the Commonwealth!","He could only theorize regarding this stage as at this moment, his own power was still growing as it could be grouped in the Accumulation Autarch Stage.","With him though, there was always the factor of discrepancy.","Unlike others, he didn't just have a single System of Existence- with the Assimilated Systems of Existence so far scaling his Atlas heavily and unpredictably!","It was why even at this moment...a massive Existential Omniversal Octopoda was smashed to bits with the radiant Pillars of Destiny.","From above, the Nuntius Eshkeri roared out as always.","|Victor- Henry! The Natives of this Omniverse remain undefeated! Who would it take to stop their relentless advancement?!|","A bellow of showmanship echoed out from above, but in front of Noah's eyes- a brand new set of prompts came down.","|The Source of Existence of the Existential Omniversal Octopoda has been analyzed and is not sufficiently different enough to be placed in its own Mundi of Power.|","|The System of Existence of Aquatinium is being assimilated into the First Mundi of Power.|","Uniquely, he had yet to come across even a single System that was fully analyzed to be deemed sufficiently different.","He knew one of them to be under the banner of the powerful Simian Protectors, but their analysis wouldn't be done unless he had one decimated before him.","But this whole time, every System of Existence he came across was not deemed sufficiently different as he wondered...when would something unique actually appear?"]},{"number":3206,"title":"Chapter 3206: Chapter 3205 The Quantification of Autarchy! II","paragraphs":["Nuntius Eshkeri gazed down below as his white gold fur blazed with brilliance.","He initiated the command to send the owner of the Mark of the Gladiator who had just won- Henry, back towards his Throne of Waiting as in his mind, he was communicating with someone else.","'How about we take things up a notch? We can't have the natives continue with an over inflated ego...assimilating them into the Commonwealth will be that much harder. For the next one, let's beat them to the point of death while sparing them at the end, okay?'","...!","He sent out such an intent privately as after he received a reply of affirmation, he smiled brightly as he amplified his voice across the Arena and bellowed out.","|By a stroke of fate, we have yet another match lined up back to back that has a native of this Omniverse! Will they continue their glorious streak and etch their names in the sands of this Arena?!|","...!","Brilliance flashed.","Nuntius Eshkeri glanced down below the Arena as if he could see across all layers, his pupils dancing with majesty as he came to lock onto a singular figure.","Uniquely, this figure seemed to also be staring up at him as the smile of Nuntius Eshkeri became even deeper!","'Adding the tag of Emperor next to your name? Gazing at everything as if it were beneath you? Haha, how about we expand your perspective just a little bit? On how vast these Omniverses are?'","...!","As if they could see each other across the heavy walls of the Wheel of Existence.","Nuntius Eshkeri smiled and bellowed out.","|This next one is a returning combatant from this newly Discovered Omniverse X- 999, Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont! On the other side...we have Prime Citizen Zimo from Omniverse X-25|","WAA!","A wave of silence was ushered in after the announcement.","But it only lasted ever so briefly before...","OOOH!","The booms of excitement spread out all around.","Even the audience could feel it.","A bloodbath was coming!","Omniverse X-25.","A very early Omniverse to be discovered as a few knowledgeable beings smacked their lips in shock at such a choice.","And yet in the next moment, the visage of the winged Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont appeared calmly above the golden sands of the Arena.","Opposite him...","HUUM!","Was a man who seemed advanced in age, and yet also filled with boundless vitality.","Adorned in an obsidian robe, he had a head full of dark hair and eyes with pure white pupils.","He gave off a sense of eeriness and wonder at the same time as in his hands was a simple white sword!","He gazed towards Noah with a sense of apathy and calmness as he voiced out.","\"I've seen your actions. Your voracious thirst.\"","WAA!","He merely began to talk.","Yet immediately, the surrounding Existence became unstable while white points of singularities began to form.","\"You devour every enemy you come across as you take the easy way up. Or so you think. What you misinterpret about Existence is that the more you take from others...the less you actually have.\"","...!","\"I will instill this lesson unto you, Osmont. I am Zimo, a follower of the Tao of Ginnungagap, or what you may know as Primordial Chaos.\"","HUUM!","Incandescent brilliance unfurled from this being as he raised his sword calmly!","Around him, dense numbers of white singularities that seemed to contain the unfathomable light of beginnings and endings bloomed.","Opposite him, Noah's gaze was actually getting brighter and brighter even amidst sensing waves of potent danger, and this was because of one reason and one reason alone!","|A Source of Existence that potentially holds high complexity has begun to be analyzed.|","A possibility came before him.","One that he quickly wanted to grasp onto as very quickly, more prompts cascaded down!","|The enemy target known as Zimo is judged to be at the absolute peak as an Accumulation Autarch.|","Somebody who was at the cusp of the stage of power that most Protectors of the Imperium were at!","It was a heavy level of power to face as it would be a test of how far his Atlas of Existence had reached.","It would also be a test for something else that was being designed since the first experiment of Fat Monkey.","With bright eyes observing the waves of power ahead, he sent his intent out to a far distance.","|Is the production of the Second Generation Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction at a stage for viable usage?|","...!","His intent asked.","And of course, it was directed to the Infinite Omniverse that had an array of fantastical weavings in the works!","In the depths of the Aletheian Haven of Entropy.","The Manifestation of a woman filled with multicolored radiance handed a small point of singularity the size of a grain of sand carefully to someone opposite her.","A humanoid figure adorned in a crimson gold battle dress that was none other than Ruination!","Feeling Noah's intent, the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse nodded succinctly as she watched the singularity she handed to Ruination vibrate in her hands- a crimson brilliance wrapping around it before the single singularity became ten singularities instantly.","|The Production of Miniature versions of Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction has entered medium scaling. The first series are named Singularities of Unraveling as they can be deployed to display their effects in a contained aspect of Existence- whether this be in terms of a specific distance or targeted towards a specific concept. Their activation only requires a spark of the Authority of the Laborer. |","...!","A newer version of the Fat Monkey that didn't have such widespread effects of destruction as the first one that ruined an entire Eonic Omniverse Record.","But ones that were more specific and targeted- something that Noah was even bold enough to deploy right now before the eyes of the Commonwealth as they wouldn't even be able to connect their capabilities to what he had done to the powerful protector in the Wasser Eonic Omniverse Record.","Their purpose was a singular one.","The instant negation and unraveling of their targeted weavings of Existence- making them entirely useless no matter which powerhouse they belonged to.","And what better test subject could there be than someone nearing the Apogee Autarch level?","Within shining eyes ready for anything to come, Noah's command came down once more.","|Send half of all produced Singularities of Unraveling over. Record and analyze the effect of every single one.|","...!"]},{"number":3207,"title":"Chapter 3207: Chapter 3206 Complexity I","paragraphs":["An enemy filled with power and waves of confidence appeared before him!","Someone that after wading through so many dredges of beings who didn't have a sufficiently complex system of Existence, he appeared like a shining beacon of light.","Zimo.","Just what were the intricacies behind his System of Existence?","He had stated that he was a Follower of the Tao of Ginnungagap- or something termed the Primordial Chaos!","\"You space out at such a time, Osmont. A product of your upbringing and messy constitution of Existence. Let me give you an example of the purity of Existence in comparison to the messy products of Existence you and your people followed the path of.\"","HUUM!","His voice was light as around half of the Arena, dazzling white singularities had filled all space like drops of suspended rain.","At such a time, this being raised his sword above his head...and then swung down in a slow motion.","Yet with this single swing, all the formed white singularities in the surroundings disappeared and became absorbed into the sword, an inescapable sword light with unfathomable white brilliance instantly arriving before Noah!","Above him, his Innate Infinite Quintessential Bloodline Halo of Lumen spun with fluorescence.","His colorless wings were expanded wide and gushing waves of colorless brilliance- the Authority of the Laborer of the Atlas of Existence flowing out endlessly as his hands rose to grasp the sword light thundering down!","BOOM!","A heavy impact unlike any other observed before in prior matches echoed out, Existence fracturing as if spider webs were expanding outwards, and the visage of Noah was pushed down from the skies until his feet hit the golden sands of the Arena- the white sword light still pressing down and seeking to cut its target!","In the distance, Zimo watched on calmly as he began to take steps forward, his voice echoing it.","\"That is an authority of absolute purity. Those who can withstand it can be given praise, but you will find that unlike other authorities, you cannot profane this. You cannot devour it.\"","...!","...!","The Invictus Dominium Wings flared out with boundless dominance, the authority of the Laborer clashing with the opposing authority as Noah affirmed he could only oppose it and reach an endless tug of war after that.","It was formidable- and a good area to study and understand!","But here was where the most recent research of the Infinite Omniverse came in.","The Singularities of Unraveling.","Miniaturized versions of Fat Monkey that had a singular purpose of Unraveling Existence of its set target.","At this moment, Noah set the target to be this unfathomable white sword light- his hand releasing a Singularity of Unraveling as a spark of the Authority of the Laborer flowed into it.","WAA!","Brilliance erupted as it seemed like under the blazing pure white sword light, a flash of darkness had appeared.","And this flash of darkness was so heavy and undeniable that it began to scatter apart the white brilliance, the situation reversing so rapidly that the heavy strike that seemed like it would even cut the golden sands of the Arena soon was broken apart and broken down to particulates of white light!","...!","It was too fast.","The figure of Zimo paused in the distance and became stern.","Surrounded by particles of white light that were blasted with the unraveling light of his Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction, Noah looked like a disruptor of Existence itself as he spoke towards Zimo calmly.","\"Anything can be broken down. Even your purest light of authority.\"","WAA!","As he spoke to Zimo, his existence was picking up the unraveling shreds of white light as truly, he couldn't absorb or devour it.","But as the Weaver of Existence, he could still analyze it as he was coming to shocking conclusions!","|The so called authority of the Tao of Ginnungagap has the factor of Existential Undeniability due to mainly being outside the scope of Existence.|","|Under the guise of purity, it is an amalgamation of Existence and an Unidentified Complex Authority theorized to not belong to any possible viable Omniverse due to its differences.|","...!","He found the Source of complexity.","What made the System of Existence this being was using sufficiently different from what he had come across so far!","|The Unidentified Complex Authority is placed under scrutiny while everything else is discarded.|","|More samples of this Unidentified Complex Authority are required before it can be replicated and understood.|","The path forward was clear.","As the heavy sword light glimmering with purity was dispersed and broken down, Noah rose from the sands of the golden arena as his palm faced the skies, a ball of colorless flames beginning to form on his palm as he smiled towards the stern beings in the distance!","\"And when it comes to purity, I've come to find over the years that those who preach purity the most...actually turn out to be the dirtiest of creatures.\"","...!","His words caused the eyes of Zimo to flash with a wild light of power as who could exceed the provocation capabilities of the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor?!","As he spoke, bundles of colorless balls of fire formed all around him as at their center, a single Singularity of Unraveling lay.","Threads of the Authority of the Laborer surged all around them as they began to spin, the temperature of the surroundings rising to unprecedented levels as these fireballs shot out like a hail of bullets towards Zimo- the follower of the Tao of Ginnungagap!","\"For hypocrites like you, I've found that burning by flames is a particularly good way to die.\"","...!","Every word he uttered out was like a sharp needle on the visage of Zimo as his gaze turned utterly cold and apathetic, his sword turning its sharp point downwards as it sunk down and disappeared into nothingness.","An instantly later, streams of iridescent white brilliance that looked like celestial rivers of pure white light bloomed all around Zimo- these rivers smashing towards the speeding colorless fireballs as a heavy battle ensued!"]},{"number":3208,"title":"Chapter 3208: Chapter 3207 Complexity II","paragraphs":["Colorless balls of fire.","Pure white rivers of an amalgamation of an Existential Authority and an Unidentified Complex Authority!","The moment of impact...","PAH!","Was a stunning one as the moment the colorless fireballs smashed onto the seething white rivers of brilliance, these rivers were scattered as they were broken apart!","An unseen suction force then flickered from the tendrils of the Authority of the Laborer within the scattering fireballs as they devoured the scattered pieces of these white rivers, and this process repeated itself!","|The weavings of the Unidentified Complex Authority are being analyzed.|","|The Origin of the Unidentified Complex Authority is being analyzed.|","|The so called Tao of Ginnungagap is being analyzed.|","...!","What exactly was it.","A Tao.","It could be looked at as the Way of something.","This Zimo had said it himself.","He was a Follower of the Tao of Ginnungagap.","Naturally, the next question was....who exactly or what exactly is this Ginnungagap? What he referred to as Primordial Chaos?","Any meaning derived from it was relating to something outside the scope of Existence! Something that would have been there even before the myriad of Omniverses were.","How grand were the implications of such a thing?","So Noah wanted to know.","Amidst the booming impacts of colorless fireballs and countless blooming rivers of pure white brilliance, he bellowed out.","|Show me!|","HUUM!","|Show me this so called purity!|","...!","The formation of the colorless balls of flames around him turned up a whole octave.","They formed around Noah and shot out like mere glimmers of brilliance, their barrage dissipating and unraveling all pristine rivers of pure brilliance that were surging around like massive tentacles as in between all of this- all scattered authority was devoured!","The expression of Zimo became colder and colder as time passed, no longer handing out any words of wisdom as his white eyes radiated pure white light- the illusion of a massive sword forming above that would strike down towards his enemy.","But right at this moment.","SAA!","A colorless fireball flittered through the gaps of tendrils of massive White rivers and actually appeared before the visage of Zimo.","His hand naturally rose to intercept it as...","PAH!","The impact was a soft one.","A glow of white brilliance covered his palm, but it was dispersed and unraveled in an instant- threads of an authority Zimo in no way understood piercing his palm and spreading across his limb.","It should have simply been an injury.","His cold gaze was ready to treat it as such!","And yet in the next instant, his injured hand pulsed.","The amalgamation of the two authorities Noah had discovered being utilized by Zimo were naturally disrupted and unraveled, but this time...it was inside the body of Zimo!","And such a thing...carried drastic consequences that even Noah didn't know would unfold.","The moment the closely interlinked and fused authorities of this Entity were unraveled, it acted like an infection.","From pulsing hand, it spread to his shoulder and then onto his chest!","The gaze of Zimo rapidly lost its calmness as shock paved its way in, his whole Existence focusing on the unity of his two Authorities once more as at such a time.","PAH!","Another colorless fireball made its way through and smashed direction on the abdomen of Zimo.","...!","The weavings of an Existential Authority and an Unidentified Complex Authority were irreversibly disrupted – this disruption now centered on Zimo's body as it spread everywhere.","His face became entirely ashen at such a development as he turned his gaze and looked across the Arena, locking onto the eyes of Noah who seemed to be looking at everything unfolding with great interest!","|You...motherfuc-|","BOOOM!","A shocking chain reaction unfolded.","The unraveling of the two authorities of Zimo caused a spark of rejection, the Unidentified Complex Authority taking over and erupting out with fervor as it actually sucked in all surrounding weavings of existence!","The extremely pure and white authority surrounding Zimo instantly became discolored and turned pure black.","The illusionary white sword from above instantly changed and expanded, changing into the form of a structure instead!","The body of Zimo folded inwards- everything about him being devoured as an instant later, deeply obsidian tentacles erupted where he used to be.","The rivers of pure white light in the surroundings became entirely black, with Existence being devoured all around as an utterly terrifying aura blared out!","Up above, the visage of Nuntius Eshkeri showed an expression of shock as before Noah's eyes, a preliminary analysis was done.","|The Unidentified Complex Authority has been discerned to be of entirely different Origins of Existence not stemming from the weavings of viable Omniverses.|","|The Unidentified Complex Authority has been granted the distinction of an Outerversal Authority.|","...!","|Further analysis shows that this Outerversal Authority belongs to the Outerversal Morphon- Ginnungagap.|","|Above, the Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon- Ginnungagap, is being formed. Once complete, an Outerversal Entity will be capable of descending into the bounds of this Omniverse.|","HOONG!","A booming sound as if sounding a horn of the end echoed out.","Where the illusion of a white sword used to be, a massive obsidian shrine was being constructed as all surrounding Existence was devoured, thousands of slick, grotesque, and interminable tentacles swirling underneath it!","Where the figure of Zimo used to be, tens of thousands of obsidian tentacles squeezed out and spread all around.","Noah looked at all of this with immense fascination as from above, the visage of Nuntius Eshkeri bellowed out as his face became exceedingly cold.","|A Profanity of Existence! An Agent of Anti-Life!|","BOOM!","His simian figure instantly erupted with brilliance as he became adorned in majestic armaments that pulsed with grandeur.","The moment he voiced out, multiple other figures flashed and appeared in the skies as each of them pulsed with the Authority of an Apogee Autarch!","Their gazes were grim as they moved quickly, their faces filled with tremendous urgency.","And there was reason for urgency.","Because in the next moment, a pulse of obsidian brilliance flashed from the Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon- Ginnungagap!","It radiated waves of obsidian light all across the Arena, the golden sand below becoming tainted as this blast already towards the stands of the audience rapidly.","It already covered Noah's figure that was surrounded by tendrils of the Authority of the Laborer, everything occurring being analyzed as prompts cascaded out!","|The Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon has been utilized.|","|In the surrounding area affected by the Declaration, weavings of Existence are denied and rejected.|","...!"]},{"number":3209,"title":"Chapter 3209: Chapter 3208 Profane! I","paragraphs":["A declaration was laid down as a shockingly powerful enemy suddenly appeared!","From the follower of the Tao of Ginnungagap that was wrapped in the weavings of purity, there was actually a hidden agent of what Nuntius Eshkeri referred to as an Agent of Anti-Life.","Everything about his existence was concealed and stable, and the only reason everything became unveiled was because of a single man's actions.","The unraveling of Existence allowed what was hidden behind to unfold, and the grandeur of the Outerversal Morphon- Ginnungagap, made its appearance.","In the blacked sands of the Arena.","Noah's figure was taking everything in as unbelievably, his Atlas of Existence remained bright.","The Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon stated that weavings of Existence in the surroundings were denied and rejected.","And yet, the Authority of the Laborer of Existence still swirled with brilliance as at this moment, Authority was not being drawn into the First Mundi of Power.","On his Atlas, a second circle had begun to buzz with profound radiance!","|The Second Mundi of Power is setting up the foundations of a complex System of Existence.|","|The Source of Existence of Outerversal Descent is being reconstructed within the Atlas of Existence|","...!","The System of Existence from the entity known as Zimo was broken down to be that of Outerversal Descent.","Something far outside the scope of his Omniverse or other Omniverses had latched onto him, and his entire existence was made to follow this Source!","As Noah felt its weavings be constructed, his brilliant mind saw a single paramount issue.","|The System of Outerversal Descent requires for one to latch onto the influence of an Outerversal Morphon.|","Yes.","This System of Existence was sufficiently different and complex because it was something that had the equivalent of borrowing power from something far more grandiose.","Something far more powerful that didn't even stem from the Omniverse or any of the myriad of Omniverses- but something outside.","Outerversal.","\"...\"","If this was the case, then why would the Atlas of Existence still look at it as a viable Source of Existence to replicate?","Noah had no Outerversal Morphon he could draw Power from, and even if he had the chance to do so, he wouldn't draw Power from even the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap that had its shrine budding ahead of him.","This was because he could see the state of someone else who drew power from an Outerversal Entity and what had just occurred when their weavings of Existence were rejected to cause a disruption of their perfect equilibrium!","It was not a bond of equality.","It was more so of an enslavement.","And he did not wish to be enslaved under anyone for the sake of power!","The Atlas of Existence was a part of himself as it knew this, so...","|The System of Existence of Outerversal Descent requires the influence of an Outerversal Morphon to be viable in elevating your power.|","|The Owner of the Atlas of Existence will not be bound to another for the sake of power, so for the successful construction of the System of Existence of Outerversal Descent, part of yourself will have to be converged into an Outerversal Seed and sent along the observed pathways that the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap utilized to descend, but in reverse.|","...!","|It is an action filled with uncertainties, and a large portion of your authority and likely the Authority of the Infinite Omniverse will be required to increase the chances of success. If successful, there will be a budding version of you as an Outerversal Morphon- this version of you acting as the Source for the System of Existence of Outerversal Descent. A successful result holds unknown results and an unfathomable potential for even more power. Shall we proceed?|","A prompt burning with crimson gold radiance.","A prompt asking for permission to do something that would require a great deal of investment, but the results could be something outside of Noah's wildest dreams!","So with Quintessence and brilliance overflowing in his eyes, he gave an affirmation.","|Proceed.|","...!","BOOM!","Instantly, 80% of all his current reserves of the Authority of the Laborer were pulled upon.","Through his inseparable connection with the Infinite Omniverse, a heavy tug was felt as the Extremity Vein began to pulse and seethed with authority- a bean of cylindrical brilliance shooting out and disappearing towards the very peak of Aletheian Havens!","The Authority of a young budding Omniverse was utilized- all of it flowing towards Noah in a show of unfathomable might.","All the grandiose Aletheian Havens he had constructed and the brilliance of the Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities swirling within them pulsed, streams of authority flowing through them and directly into him.","All of it would only further increase the chances of success of an unfathomable action that went forward fully at this moment.","|The Observed Pathways utilized by the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap is being followed.|","|A collection of your existence filled to the brim with your own authority and the Authorities of the Infinite Omniverse had set off.|","At this moment.","Noah felt like more than half of himself separated from him, taking with it an unbelievable amount of authority as it disappeared into the fissures of nothingness that were spreading all around with the Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap!","And then...there was only silence.","---","A collection of his existence filled to the brim with boundless waves of authority.","An Outerversal Seed.","It was an outlandish idea that was only made possible by the Atlas of Existence and the assistance of the Infinite Omniverse.","The help of a young Omniverse. And the design of something entirely too fantastical for others to even dream of.","All of it culminated in a part of himself feeling cut off of all sensation as it traversed on a road it didn't know would lead anywhere.","A road that was only stipulated as the pathway that an Outerversal Morphon took to descend.","It was akin to seeing a paved road that right into the cover of trees, not knowing entirely where it led and how it curved for who knew how many miles.","It was akin to following such a path of uncertainty as if he veered off track...","BZZT!","A heavy impact smashed into him as he felt like he hit a patch, his Seed being redirected as 10% of the authority of the Infinite Omniverse protecting him was used up!","This journey...was not bound to be an easy one."]},{"number":3210,"title":"Chapter 3210: Chapter 3209 Profane! II","paragraphs":["He followed a pathway that he didn't know the end of nor the true direction of.","Ever so often...","BZZT!","As if he came upon a fork in the road, he grazed something that rapidly ate up the Authority protecting him before he veered forward in another direction.","Every time something like this occurred, the heavy waves of authority protecting him were reduced greatly!","If he didn't arrive where he should arrive before the Authorities protecting him were used up...this whole venture would be deemed a failure.","And the other part of himself may not even know it.","---","In the Gladiators' Arena that was currently tainted with an obsidian hue.","At the center of the grandiose Nine Thrones, the visage of the Viceroy rose up with a stern expression as in front of him, a thin of golden light prevented the expansion of the Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap from ever getting close to them.","\"For a vile creature to actually appear when one of my bodies is nearby...\"","His figure began to vibrate with a heavy authority.","And yet before it could be expressed...","\"Sit down.\"","WAA!","The man with levels of power far exceeding everyone else seated beside the Viceroy uttered out calmly.","The Sword of the Commonwealth actually spoke in such a way to the Viceroy of the Commonwealth!","Viceroy Gilgamesh did not look towards this being as he kept his eyes locked onto the rapidly spreading tentacles and Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap that was becoming ever so real, his voice veiling its anger as it spoke out calmly.","\"What lies before us is an enemy of the Commonwealth. Is it not my job to protect the Commonwealth?\"","One of the foremost enemies of the Commonwealth was right before them.","Did they not need to eradicate it right away?!","\"Your job is to do what you are told. And for now, you will wait. Let them taste the despair and hopelessness. Let them know the enemy they face and how outclassed they are against it. Let them seek for someone to save them as when you appear, it has to be at their lowest moments. This is how you gain loyalty.\"","...!","The voice of the Sword of the Commonwealth was filled with undeniable control and majesty as even the one taking the seat of the Viceroy could not deny it!","Beside him, the Mother of the Viceroy sat with sharp eyes- the rest of the Entities within the Omniversal Stage of power doing the same thing.","They watched as down below, a hellish landscape was unfolding as an unnatural enemy made itself ever present.","Everything was tainted with a revolting obsidian light as on the millions of thrones where Citizens of the Commonwealth stood, they felt their very Existence shutting down as they couldn't muster an ounce of their Authority.","They could only stare in shock and horror as from the center of the Arena, countless tentacles stretched out and enlarged as if a terrifying creature that would devour everything was coming out!","And they knew in the depths of their heart that the moment these tentacles reached them, they would be devoured entirely.","|Ah...|","The only solace they had was that above the murky sands of the Arena, Protectors had appeared as their bodies glowed with a golden brilliance- their Existence actually still capable of burning brightly amidst a Declaration that denied Existence itself!","But even they didn't seem like they had what it took to stop what was coming entirely.","And amidst all of this panic, one man remained immensely close to the unfolding tendrils of unfolding darkness, his Wings stretched out as they flapped- his figure moving across the space where Existence itself was being devoured as he evaded the erupting tentacles of grotesque brilliance.","His eyes were closed as he let the Authority of the Laborer of the Atlas of Existence protect him.","Only half of what he used to remain here as the Second Mundi of Power was pulsing rapidly at this moment, gathering all threads of the System of Existence of Outerversal Descent to ensure stability when something utterly profound succeeded!","When.","Not if.","For he could not fail in this endeavor- the cost would be too great!","But in the midst of all of this.","What he was seeing and sensing at this moment...he sent it across his Lineage- towards those most powerful.","|These are the enemies and entities we are coming across in this expanding playing field.|","Along with his words, images, and scenes showing the Worms of Existence, Protectors of the Commonwealth, and even the scene of the monstrosity currently playing out at this very moment were all expressed across his Lineage.","|There are those on the side of Existence, those on the side of Anti-Existence, and those on the side of Anti-Life. There are enemies as weak as they can be, to those exceeding the stages of the Existential Dominium Realm and stepping into the Omniversal Realm. All of these things...we are only just beginning to observe them. Be ready. And be prepared for what is to come!|","WAA!","His son heard his words as his eyes shone with sharpness.","Sona heard them.","The Sanctus Autarch heard them!","Many of his people were given information about just what was occurring around them and what was coming in the future, as they seemed to be touching upon a level of power where they had to move with extreme care.","They weren't the only ones","The Infinite Omniverse was receiving feedback and analyzing everything Noah was experiencing- even more closely than anyone else.","The Infinite Omniverse.","Its capabilities and potential were only just beginning to unfold.","Its distinction was that of a Young Omniverse.","What did it mean for an Omniverse to be sentient? For an Omniverse to be capable of moving freely with direction and purpose?","What it could do... it felt like it was only touching the tip of a very long iceberg as what it had done with Noah just now- the amount of authority it had access to and utilized to send part of himself to a place they knew nothing about...this was it beginning to explore the daring things it could now do.","The Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction was another part, the Signature of Existence it was sending out was another...and there should be much more!","Slowly, its true utilities would be unveiled.","But the most critical thing at this moment was to wait and see.","Wait for the result of their actions and see if the Second Mundi of Power would be successful in gaining a brand new System of Existence!"]},{"number":3211,"title":"Chapter 3211: Chapter 3210 A Moment in Time","paragraphs":["Inside of the Infinite Omniverse.","Within the Aletheian Haven of Dreams.","Out of the many Aletheian Havens out there, it was Dreams and Helios that Noah and his people found themselves frequenting the most.","Dreams held a certain sense of awe as with a little input of their own imagination, the surroundings would take on this shape and continue to change how they wished.","At this moment, in a small portion of the Aletheian Haven, Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Dreams was sitting on the edge of a golden waterfall, the waters passing by below his feet and thundering down below.","When one looked at them, one would notice the concentration of the water within the river extending from the waterfall rapidly increasing while the river itself continued to enlarge and expand.","And if one looked closer to the surroundings, everything else was also expanding as the process of Existential Terraforming continued unabated!","\"It's truly marvelous...\"","Beside Noah on the golden waterfall.","The figure of the golden haired Dr. Hall could be seen, his white coat adorned on his body as he observed this process along with Noah.","In the Infinite Omniverse, there were very few who could genuinely say they were a friend to the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor who lorded over these vast lands, but there were still some who managed to be themselves around him and form a stable friendship even with the complex relationship that made him seem grander than life.","For Dr. Hall, his love for understanding the profundities of Existence and all the wonders out there made it so that he would frequently come and talk with Noah.","Over the days in the Desecrated Existential Chronos Domain and even more days in the Var El Eonic Omniverse Record, Dr. Hall only found himself more and more around Noah as more wonders unfolded all around them.","Wonders of possibilities. This was how their interests aligned!","Dr. Hall looked above them to an incandescent gold sky as he continued.","\"I sensed the concentrations of all viable forms of energy dip in this place and in all the places my other Clones are into inside the Infinite Omniverse...what is doing now that requires so much energy? Can I assume it is half of all the Authority that was collected within the Infinite Omniverse?\"","He asked because he was curious.","And Noah smiled and nodded in a reply.","\"Over half of all the authority of the Infinite Omniverse. But it was all for my purposes. The images I just showed you all across the Lineage- this one deals closer to the new enemies we've just come across. The Outerversal Morphons. I'm trying to go to the same place they are in, to do something they're currently doing.\"","...!","The words caused Dr. Hall's eyes to widen with golden light, his glasses pushed up as countless thoughts buzzed inside of him.","Among the many people inside the Infinite Omniverse, he was spreading his reach out far and wide in regards to health and wellness, with many of his Practices and Business stretched across the different Aletheian Havens.","Anything new, he loved to understand and see if he could use.","But this concept of Outerversal Morphons...just seemed too grand.","\"What will that make you as an individual? If you succeed, would you still be considered a native of this Omniverse, or an Outerversal Entity outside of it? Which distinction trumps the other?\"","What exactly would Noah be?","At such a question, even he smiled as he didn't know!","Far from the positions of Noah and Dr. Hall.","Inside the Aletheian Haven of Helios.","The figure of Sona sat on a sandy gold beach, her body adorned in a yellow gold swimsuit that showed much of her radiant skin and icy green gold hair that drifted below her shoulders.","She sat on the beach and stared out into a golden sea burning with flames of helios, and yet they held a rejuvenating effect for anyone swimming within it as the figures of Emilliana and other Sanctus Princesses were freely swimming inside of it currently- taking what seemed to be a long overdue vacation after fighting wars for so long.","On Sona's head, Bubbles was bouncing happily in his blue slime form, while Little Caculatan shone with an obsidian gold radiance as its round furry body rested on Sona's lap.","Her eyes gazed ahead as she seemed to be thinking of far too many things.","\"You haven't gotten used to it? Sitting back and letting Noah do everything?\"","From behind, the blessed figure of Barbatos came by- her small but curvaceous visage adorned in a black two piece.","Her beauty only seemed to be getting more refined as she held in her hands two skewers of Dragon Meat grilled in the fires of Helios!","Behind them on this beach, the figure of Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Helios could be seen standing before burning flames of helios that roasted meat, his Son beside him learning the Extremity of cooking.","To their left and right, numerous figures could be seen as Erikson's bronze body was sunbathing in his proper beach attire, and Ayame and Lilith were seated nearby talking.","Even closer to Noah, the figures of Adelaide, Katelyn, Eowyn, and all the other Queens of the Infinite Omniverse could be seen seated on golden beach chairs surrounding an extended vertical table that held an overabundance of Quintessential Fruits of Existence and grilled meat from the most exotic fantastical animals.","At the head of the table, they all surrounded and happily talked to the figure of Amelia Osmost- their Mother-in-law!","Apart from them, the figures of Kazuhiko, Emperor Penguin, and many others could be seen doing their own things across this golden beach.","All of this was happening in the background and more as Barbatos came to sit beside Sona and offered her one of the skewers in her hands.","Towards her question, Sona could only shake her head while accepting the skewer and taking a bite.","\"It's not even that. I had these grand plans of an Initiative, and even when I think about it now, that doesn't seem to be it. It's just...\"","A sense of frustration was on her face as she didn't seem to be able to put into words what she was feeling.","Barbatos smiled towards her as she spoke like she understood.","\"Do you feel a sense of disconnect? Like you shouldn't be here doing this? Relaxing while it feels like out there, the whole world- well I guess Omniverse now; while it feels like the whole Omniverse is burning?\"","The words from Barbatos caused Sona to go entirely silent as the Necromancer of Existence smiled with gorgeous brilliance.","\"What I've come to learn over the months and years is that there is never a time when the outside Worlds, Cosmos, Existential Domains, or Omniverses aren't burning. But that can't stop us from enjoying the simple joys of life. Should we be serious and worried all the time? Ponder in silence for whatever is to come? I would tell you to put your trust in Noah and just be there for him when he needs you. Until then, enjoy yourself. The Fruits of his labor inside this endless Infinite Omniverse. And of course, don't forget the Dual Cultivation sessions...\"","She laughed while stating her last sentence, her figure rising as she patted Bubbles above Sona's head- turning back to where the party was brightest as she left behind words of advice.","No sooner had she left did another figure appear beside Sona, this being none other than the Sanctus Autarch.","She was on the more moderate side as she had not gotten used to things fully just yet, and she was adorned in a light green robe while on the beach as she looked somewhat out of place.","But when she looked at the Queen Mothers nearby and the Sanctus Princesses and Dragon Knights in the water, she felt a sense of security she hadn't felt in a long time as she came to sit beside Sona.","She didn't have to say anything.","One old.","One young.","Two women sat on the beach inside a grandiose Aletheian Haven of Helios, their emotions similar as all around them, Entities from different walks of life took a moment to just breathe and relax.","In difficult times, moments like these were rare to come, but were often times the most important."]},{"number":3212,"title":"Chapter 3212: Chapter 3211 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! I","paragraphs":["On the same golden beach within a corner of the Aletheian Haven of Helios.","Standing In front of the Grill of Helios that lashed out tongues of golden flames, Noah was putting the Extremity of Cooking to full use as he waited for the results of a heavy investment.","Until now, all feeling and sensation had been cut off from the other part of him traversing across an Unknown path that the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap had taken, so he didn't know whether it was still on its way, or already entirely destroyed!","But he didn't place too much emphasis on it as he continued to take care of things he could control.","Being present with this Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Helios with his family in the midst of all of this was something he could do.","To his right, his son could be seen with blue swimming trunks, his built figure showing the toned muscles that all the men had on this golden beach.","In his hands, two chalices containing the squired juices of Quintessential Fruits of Existence could be seen- two golden plates in front of him as he came to grab finished pieces of the dragon cutlets his father was grilling!","\"Rare, medium, or well done?\"","His father asked him with a nudge as Henry smiled while bringing the floating plates forward.","\"Rare for me, well done for her. If she sees any red on the meat, it'll stay on the plate. And she's too shy to ever send anything back to you.\"","...!","As Henry spoke, he was looking towards an area of the beach where a young woman could be seen sitting on a blue beach chair- her figure adorned in a white sundress as her blue hair calmly waved in the wind.","A young woman from Atlantis.","Last time, Noah had told Henry to be honest regarding who he was as this young woman he had a relationship with didn't know about his illustrious identity as the Son of the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor!","He had taken the next step and revealed all of this as it would have overwhelmed any common woman, but this young woman with a royal mermaid Lineage from Atlantis held a stronger soul than most as she was slowly introduced to the family.","Noah smiled as he placed pieces of meat radiating golden oils on the plate they were put on, potent life force brimming within them as he filled the plate of well done dragon cutlets a bit more.","\"We'll have a more private affair soon. A small banquet. Bring her and introduce her to everyone officially there.\"","He spoke calm words to his son- a Foundation Autarch, and this being actually nodded with nervousness as he walked towards a Young woman on the beach with vibrant plates in tow!","It was a simple glimpse into the slightly normal side of Entities with power that could distort destinies and Existence itself.","Noah reflected on this scene and the many still playing out across this golden beach of helios as this was it.","Part of the happiness that he was protecting.","This was why in the face of any larger than life enemies or mysteries.","In the face of the Commonwealth, Concepts of Anti-Life and Anti-Existence, and now even the concept of Outerversal Morphons. He didn't falter in the face of any of this as he kept on moving forward.","Until the day came when he had seen all the wonders and scales of power.","Until the day came when he could sit back and not have to worry about an Apocalypse, or a being stronger than him by many levels appearing and dictating how his life would be from there onward.","If and when such a time ever came, he would sit back and enjoy retirement as a farmer.","But until then...the brilliance and Fable of the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor would continue to spread out far and wide, his tendrils of influence seeking to now stretch across Omniverses as he prepared for the integration and slow dissemination of the Commonwealth!","The Commonwealth that was on full display of its attitude and standards at this moment as in the Wheel of Weavings.","In the Gladiators' Arena, where a Shrine of an Outerversal Morphon was becoming ever so real, its Declaration caused a sense of powerlessness on all weavings of Existence as obsidian tendrils erupted out to devour anything they came across!","It was an unexpected situation, yes, but there were many powerful entities of the Commonwealth here.","Noah remembered the Nine Thrones holding entities who very likely exceeded the Existential Dominium Realm and were within the bounds of the Omniversal Realm!","Yet they did not make a move.","Was it to inspire a sense of fear? Show others how hopeless they were against these powerful enemies?","SAA!","Noah cut through breaking weavings of Existence as he dodged thousands of sleek obsidian tentacles that only increased in number, his gaze going towards the distant seats of the audience as there, tentacles were about to reach as those who couldn't even muster up a semblance of their Authority would perish en masse!","Would the Commonwealth truly go as far as allowing for deaths of their Citizens before stepping in?","Just as this thought flowed from Noah.","HUUM!","A brilliant golden light shone from above and began to constrict the undeniable obsidian Declaration that was spreading out.","When Noah saw this golden light, his eyes couldn't help but constricted as it wasn't like any familiar light of authority he had come across!","It was encompassing. It was solid and without any gaps. What is sought to accomplish would be achieved with surety.","It was...Omniversal.","It pressed down from all directions as the expanding Declaration of an Outerversal Morphon actually began to shrink!","Not an Outerversal Morphon- but the infinitesimally small glimpse of the power of an Outerversal Morphon that had begun to seep out of the shell that used to be Zimo.","But at the center of the golden light pressing down on the Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap, the image of a grandiose Simian showed itself with unfathomable glory- his visage amplified and expressed to all!","Almost as if it was a show."]},{"number":3213,"title":"Chapter 3213: Chapter 3212 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! II","paragraphs":["A show.","This was how Noah could best describe it as a titanic illusory image of none other than the Viceroy of the Commonwealth was displayed far above, his hand pressing down radiating the golden light that was stopping the advancement of the Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap!","Golden brilliance enveloped everything around the Gladiators' Arena as the obsidian domain became constricted and smaller.","It was being pushed back towards the center of the Arena where the Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon was enlarging with grandiosity, the thrones of the audiences finally being taken out of what seemed an endless age of darkness where they were all about to be massacred in.","\"Ah...\"","The Citizens of the Commonwealth that visited Omniverse X-999 raised their hands up to the visage of brilliance that saved them.","Towards their Viceroy!","Feats of his brilliance here would undoubtedly be spread to the other Omniverses that the Commonwealth oversaw- his brilliance that was going against the influence of an Outerversal Entity personally!","|Profane!|","...!","His appearance bellowed out towards the obsidian Declaration as it wriggled as if it were an animal.","The seething golden brilliance converged together above as it shockingly took on the form...of a Wheel.","A golden wheel of interminable brilliance as it looked like a collection of many small circles contained in one massive circle – their center point showing another illusory image of the Viceroy seated in a meditative position as, at this moment, this wheel began to slowly spin.","HUUM!","A slow spin.","Yet the moment this spinning of the Wheel began, an unimaginably heavy pressure thundered down that reduced the size of the Declaration of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap by half.","At the center of the Arena, the rising Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap that was gradually becoming more real cracked and became more illusory.","And the Wheel continued to spin.","As if it were grinding down something.","As if with every turn the wheel made, an inviolable weaving of power came down.","When it completed a full turn...","CRACK!","The illusory Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap was cracked as the Declaration that had turned the golden sands dark was fully constricted mere miles around the Shrine!","The tentacles that were spreading out with shocking fervor and devouring everything screeched as if they had met their natural enemy before they began to shrivel and fade away into nothingness.","The singularity that was spitting out the emergence of the weavings of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap shrieked upwards towards the Wheel.","From it, a massive obsidian pupil opened along with an overlap of thousands of massive tentacles!","The pupil seemed to be etching its gaze with the entity stopping its entry, locking its gaze above as the apathetic expression of Viceroy Gilgamesh looked down.","And under him, the golden Wheel turned once more.","As it was about to complete the turn, it seemed to be meeting resistance- but this small point of resistance faded away the moment that Viceroy Gilgamesh pressed his foot down, the rings within his wheels pulsing at the turn was completed!","RIIP!","The sound of something being ripped apart echoed out as gloriously, the Shrine of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap was ripped apart as it folded into itself.","As if everything about it was being compressed and erased!","The myriad of obsidian tentacles that were spreading out were compressed into a fading singularity as in an instant...","...!","All Sources even emanating traces of the Authority of the Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap was eradicated.","Above, the image of the Viceroy was the only thing that remained.","Unfettered.","Brilliant.","Omniversal!","The golden Wheel he had called out only turned twice before the enemy was eradicated, the Royal Existential Omniversal Simians in the thrones of the audience instantly dropping to their knees while they raised their hands towards their Viceroy!","They raised their hands to him as they wanted to express their fervor. Their loyalty. Their awe and respect to the Viceroy of the Commonwealth.","Down below on the golden sands, Noah gazed up at the massive intricate golden Wheel that Viceroy Gilgamesh recovered with a wave of his hand, his gaze looking imperious as he looked over the masses, his voice echoing out.","\"This is who we are fighting against.\"","WAA!","\"We do what we do day in and day out to ensure that Existence is protected. That life is protected. The glory of the Commonwealth will continue to spread to all corners of known and unknown Omniverses as we ensure that none will fall to our enemies!\"","...!","A heartfelt speech!","One that the citizens of the Commonwealth heard and resonated with their hearts, their hands lifted up as they bellowed out in affirmation!","\"OOOH!\"","\"Glory to the Commonwealth!\"","\"Long live the Commonwealth!\"","\"Long live the Viceroy!\"","\"Long live!\"","An abundance of shouts of valor and honor.","Noah observed it all on the sands of the Arena as the visage of Nuntius Eshkeri floated down to stand before him.","Other Protectors floated in the space above as they looked respectfully towards the figure of the Viceroy, and only when he began to disappear did they begin to move.","Nuntius Eshkeri's expression was solemn as he spoke while walking toward Noah, his brilliant monkey tail behind him pulsing with golden arcs of light.","|Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont, you were able to unveil an Agent of Anti-Life today and prevent them from entering deeper ranks of the Commonwealth- this already distinguishes you as someone who does the job of a Protector. Thus, it is deemed for your status to be elevated to become a true Protector of the Commonwealth!|","...!","There was supposed to be an evaluation of the Gladiators as they battled each other in the Arena for a chance to become Protectors of the Commonwealth.","Something that came to be because a Protector was greatly hurt in an Eonic Omniverse Record!","And now, another incident occurred where someone who was part of the Commonwealth actually turned out to be an Agent of Anti-Life, and Noah incidentally revealed this.","And as a result...the position of a Protector was now being offered to him.","\"...\"","Cause and effect.","Noah looked at the visage of Nuntius Eshkeri looking at him with stern brilliance as his eyes curved into a devilish smile!"]},{"number":3214,"title":"Chapter 3214: Chapter 3213 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! III","paragraphs":["The Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Nuntius Eshkeri gazed towards Noah with a stern gaze, his body still simmering with golden brilliance.","Opposite him, Noah gave a light nod while retreating all waves of authority unto himself.","\"If it is deemed so, then I will take on the role of a Protector of the Commonwealth.\"","His voice held no grandiose authority as he replied, but Nuntius Eshkeri nodded with solemnness as he came beside him and raised his hand while amplifying his voice towards the rousing Arena that still had their hands raised in the air.","|From the ranks of this recently discovered Omniverse, the first entity who shall join the ranks of new Protectors after this grand Celebration of Omniversal Discovery is none other than Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont!|","WAA!","A moment to show utter awe and wonder.","|As the one to unveil an Agent of Anti-Life among us, his actions are those of a role model to follow as from this day forth, from the ashes of Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont...comes the rise of Protector Osmont! A brethren of the Royal Existential Omniversal Simians, a Defender of the Commonwealth!|","...!","A Protector of the Commonwealth.","A grandiose title as with the simple motion of raising Noah's hand in the air, Nuntius Eshkeri actually dared to discern Noah's body as a form of assurance that he didn't have any threads of Anti-Life within him!","Noah felt the intrusive authority of this Apogee Autarch as of course, it wasn't able to discover anything about the Atlas of Existence nor the Authority of the Laborer, and instead...","|A new authority stemming from a uniquely different Source of Existence has sought to analyze your weavings.|","He instead gained a glimpse of another wonder as he looked towards Nuntius Eshkeri and smiled.","He was having a hard time finding a sufficiently different System of Existence these past days, and yet in the span of minutes, he came across two.","This Apogee Autarch saw Noah's gaze but didn't care, his intent coming out only for Noah to hear at this moment.","|That was a preliminary test to ensure that your Existence is pure. I will transport you to an area where you will be received and proceed as a Protector. From here onward...we will be colleagues.|","HUUM!","A burst of golden brilliance came with his words and wrapped around Noah's body, his voice now echoing out to everyone as the newly ordained Protector disappeared.","|As the fruits of the Commonwealth, we will not fear and let this incident interrupt our rituals- so how about we continue to showcase the strength of the Commonwealth with more battles on this Arena?!|","OOOH!","The crowd cheered for more blood as the threat to their lives that had just been taken care of had all but been forgotten.","Below the Arena, the throne where Prime Citizen Emperor Osmont used to be was all but empty.","In the distance, seated on his throne, The Imperium Autarch and the Eonic Uterra locked gazes with each other as out of the three of them- one had managed to make the jump and become a Protector!","Who else would follow?","---","Across weavings of things not capable of being fully understood at this moment.","Part of Noah's Existence was traversing across an Unknown road that he didn't know the end of nor the direction through it.","No vision.","No feeling.","Nothing.","He would occasionally smash into an obstruction before he was steered forward as the Authority protecting him lessened more and more.","The Authority of a young Omniverse that had been expanding itself constantly with the process of Existential Terraforming!","BZZT!","His body felt like it grazed past a high frequency oscillation of something that ripped apart Existence itself as another portion of authority was shaved away.","Within him, his Authorities were burning with everything they had.","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of the Protagonist steers any possible weavings to ensure your survival and success as befitting a Protagonist.|","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Quintessence states there can only be a single Quintessential result!|","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Entropy feels like the path being traveled is one that leads to the most basal and earliest form of chaos.|","|Entropy seeks the freedom of utmost chaos. No direction. No expectation. No reaction. Let the path being formed be the one of true and unfettered entropy.|","...!","Freedom of chaos.","The moment this prompt came, Noah felt an inkling of a sensation that this might be the answer!","He felt his existence visibly relax.","And he went with the flow.","No sooner did he do so, his existence once more smashed into an interference that felt like a wall on the road he was on, and as per precious times, he would direct himself away from this interference to return to the road itself.","But this time, he didn't take any action.","He just went with the flow.","BZZT!","The Authority of the Infinite Omniverse protecting him rapidly decreased as it went towards critical levels!","But she still did nothing.","BOOM!","And so, the interference smashed into him fully without any sense of protection as everything about him disappeared!","He was bounced around.","He still couldn't feel or sense anything as the interference he ran into exponentially increased, the Authority protecting him falling into dangerous levels as very soon, his Outerversal Seed that had yet to sprout would be unveiled and decimated!","And yet...he still did nothing.","|Entropy burns with exhilaration.|","A flash of a prompt.","And thereafter...","PAH!","The last defenses of Noah's Existence were shredded apart by an interference as it seemed like the only path thereafter was erasure.","From all around, a prickling sensation surrounded him as they would decimate him right away!","And he still did nothing.","And so, the interference smashed into him fully without any sense of protection as everything about him disappeared!","\"...\"","Failure.","Or so it should be as every part of Noah seemingly flashed out of Existence instantly, his consciousness fading entirely.","And yet another instant later...","SHAA!","As if his consciousness was waking up from a long slumber.","It could have truly been an instant, or it could have been millions of years.","He couldn't say for sure.","The only thing he could say with surety...was the sensation he currently felt.","The most apt description he had for it...was like he was being born!"]},{"number":3215,"title":"Chapter 3215: Chapter 3214 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! IV","paragraphs":["He was being born!","He was being born...but who was he exactly?","This question came quickly and rapidly, but it didn't have a full answer as a sense of Distortion and cloudiness permeated all around.","Within the depths of his beings, he could feel small voices trying to rise up.","Each one tried to overcome another in an effort to reach him, but they were too faint.","Their reach in this place was so, so small.","But these tiny voices didn't give up as they acted like jolts of electricity that were constantly trying to unearth something.","First was the question of what.","He seemed to make out himself as if he was a budding singularity. A mass of extremely dense energies constantly twisting, contracting and expanding.","A mass full of power that he couldn't yet understand!","But this mass was coming to fruition...where exactly? When?","He thought of looking at his surroundings, but realized there was only darkness.","The absolute lack of light.","Apart from himself, he couldn't see anything.","More and more of himself was budding and becoming more concentrated, the power contained within himself feeling tremendously full and significant as it told him he could do anything!","So he wanted to answer the first question he had.","Who he was.","The small voices he could barely hear within him rose in a cacophony of noises.","He was...","He was...!","Osm...!","Ozm...!","HUUM!","His existence fully formed. Interminable waves of crimson obsidian radiance flashed out.","His identity unveiled itself!","He was...","\"Ozymandias!\"","...!","\"I am...the Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias!\"","A deep and guttural voice that seemed like it was echoing out of the very depths of countless endings.","It was a voice that seemed to know innately that it was an Outerversal Morphon- that this was its first identity!","The name that came after that seemed to be from a long distant memory as the voice that uttered it out held a hint of melancholy.","One filled with resonance and Distinctions of unfathomable origins, one that seemed to be trying to remember.","What exactly was he trying to remember?","In the midst of this question, another voice shockingly echoed out as it was filled with depth and ancientness.","\"What you are is loud, Young One.\"","...!","Another voice.","Was he not alone?","He tried to look around, but he could see nothing apart from the lack of light around him.","\"You cannot even see, and yet are raucous enough to have already developed an ego? Take things a step at a time, Young One.\"","The ancient voice came out again.","This time, it felt kinder and filled with understanding as Ozymandias asked cautiously.","\"How...do I see?\"","Something that was simplicity itself, and yet seemingly impossible at the same time.","\"To see in this place, you must properly outline your form. Your Outerverse. Only when you have substance can you begin to see.\"","Ozymandias heard these words as he looked within the depths of himself and pondered, the small voices that had been trying to rise up making a cacophony of noises at this moment as he repeated.","Form.","Substance.","Ozymandias heard these words as he looked within the depths of himself and pondered, the small voices that had been trying to rise up making a cacophony of noises at this moment as he repeated.","\"A form...\"","HUUM!","A blast of a unique authority erupted with him at the center.","He knew this authority.","He was born with it.","It was a type of Innate, undeveloped, and young authority. It was his Outerversal Morphon Authority!","It erupted out as it released humming droning sounds, wrapping around his body as it began to form into something else.","And the form that was coming to fruition...he could see it.","A base trunk formed first as it seemed to be made from trillions of tentacles stacked on top of each other.","These tentacles glimmered with a stellar purple blue hue- each one made from millions of budding singularities as it looked entirely otherworldly.","Moments later, four limbs exploded out, the amalgamation of tentacles forming what Ozymandias knew to be hands and feet.","Then, another trillion tentacles erupted from behind as they were covered by a crimson obsidian light, these tentacles forming into wings of utter horror as at their center- a pupil opened for each!","An eye on the center of each wing.","The eyes held rings of nine pupils uniquely connected to each other as they gave off heart throbbing unease and power.","They blinked.","BZZT!","And trillions more tentacles bloomed behind that formed into Halos!","Rings of tentacles came together, burning with crimson obsidian stellar radiance as they formed into nine Halos that successively became larger the further away they were from him.","A stellar purple blue body, crimson obsidian wings, nine halos of crimson obsidian radiance, and his head...only had two glowing singularities on his face.","Nothing else.","These singularities blinked as within them, threads of countless tentacles throbbed. Countless tendrils of weavings.","But when they all came together and he could see his exemplary form...","\"Ah...\"","He also became capable of seeing around him.","An expanse of shimmering obsidian darkness stretching out endlessly.","And in the middle of all of this...","\"Can you see now, Young One?\"","...!","The deep and ancient voice that had been talking with him this whole time.","He saw it.","He saw him.","Someone. Something that was horrifically millions of times larger than he was.","In front of it, he seemed like a mere speck of dust.","It was round, carrying the features of an eye, with trillions of titanic tentacles wriggling in all directions on the rims of this eye.","It pulsed with deep stellar purple radiance as its pupil was a massive triangular collection of brilliant purple light with a circular singularity at its center!","The massive pupil seemed to smile as it looked at Ozymandias.","\"Are you out of words now, Young One?\"","Ozymandias looked at this massive entity in awe as his own deep voice echoed out.","\"Who are you?\"","His ego had formed as he had spoken about who he was.","But what about this Entity before him that was millions of times larger in size alone?","The mere vibrations of his voice caused the surrounding shimmering obsidian darkness to vibrate as his triangular pupil pulsed.","\"I am the Outerversal Morphon Phulax. The Observer of Old and Young.\"","...!"]},{"number":3216,"title":"Chapter 3216: Chapter 3215 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! V","paragraphs":["Outerversal Morphon Phulax.","A being with a circular form, a massive eye millions of times bigger than Ozymandias, with countless tentacles stretching all around its rims as its pupil was triangular in nature!","At this moment, within the center of the triangular pupil where a blazing singularity lay, Ozymandias naturally felt its gaze locked onto him.","And he had many questions.","As if this creature knew this to be the case, its deep voice echoed out again.","\"You have just come to be, so many things must be confusing for you. You know who you are innately, but you don't know anything else. What is it that you wish to know?\"","The voice was immaculately heavy as it seemed tinged with amusement.","It could say many things, but it purposefully chose its words to urge Ozymandias himself the freedom of what he wanted to know!","And Ozymandias looked within the depths of himself.","His stellar purple blue body and crimson obsidian wings.","The nine halos of crimson obsidian radiance behind his wings and his head that only had two glowing singularities.","And the barely discernible voices he could almost hear. With all of this, what exactly would be the first thing he wanted to ask?","A tremendous need filled him and burned within his very being, this need transforming into a question that he blurted out an instant later.","\"What is my purpose?\"","...!","A question that caused the Outerversal Morphon Phulax to squint its triangular pupil into a smile came out, and his reply was just as heavy.","\"You have no purpose. You have just been born in the Megalos Beyond as your existence has no meaning. Over the cycles, I have seen Young Ones like you appear again and again as the first thing all of you innately seek...is your purpose. I will tell you now that as an Outerversal Morphon, you can choose your own purpose- and this will in turn shape your existence.\"","He could choose his own purpose.","But...what could he possibly want when he had just been born?","Inside of him, the buzzing voices were only becoming louder and louder as they continued to try and tell him something to no avail.","His purpose.","How could he possibly find his purpose?","\"A way to help you, Young One, is for you to expand your perspective. A way for Outerversal Morphons to expand their perspectives is none other than going fishing.\"","\"...\"","What?","\"Fishing?\" Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias repeated this word that represented an action that didn't entirely feel like the norm.","But why was it not the norm? For something that was just born, why would there be any prejudices on what was the norm or not the norm within him?","As his thoughts were rising, Outerversal Morphon Phulax replied with brilliance.","\"Yes, fishing. It is a way for Outerversal Morphons to be connected to all things within the Megalos Beyond and outside of it. It is our Innate capability to take a part of ourselves and stretch it like an endless string across the Megalos Beyond, and we then wait for something to bite. The instant something bites, we gain access. We gain information, and we gain control over the Source of Existence we have managed to fish.\"","...!","\"Those that take the bait and dangle on the strings we cast out are known as our Delegatus. If you go fishing and are able to catch any Delgatus, your vision will be expanded. You will see what is out there in the Megalos Beyond, and this can aid in informing you of your purpose.\"","The words were unique ones to hear as Ozymandias mulled them over, but within the center point of the Nine halos floating behind his wings, a thin tentacle began to form and extend behind him through the other nine rings gloriously.","Almost as if forming into an endless fishing line.","The Observer of Old and Young saw this scene as the millions of tentacles around it pulsed, its ancient voice echoing out.","\"Try and find your first Delegatus. They will link you to your first Source of Existence as the more you gain, the stronger you become. One day, you may even grow to be as big as me. It may take eons before you get even one, so do not be too hasty. Cast out your line, O Young Ozymandias.\"","HUUM!","Words of encouragement that Aldo felt like words that could never be denied.","The pupils on the wings of Ozymandias pulsed as the string forming in the center of his Halos rapidly lengthened as he moved with intuition, this string beginning to fall down behind him as a line was cast!","At this time, moments after being born, The Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias cast out a line of connection across the Megalos Beyond as he sought for something to bite on!","\"Hmm...\"","The Observer of Old and Young nodded at this scene as he was about to pull away when suddenly, its tendrils wriggled as its massive pupil turned towards a certain direction.","There, the expanse of shimmering stellar obsidian darkness flickered and distorted before an equally massive visage of another Outerversal Morphon appeared.","It was a titanic worm-like Outerversal Morphon whose entire cylindrical body was filled with countless wriggling tentacles coming together, its end showing an opening that unfurled to reveal millions of spiked teeth set in circular directions.","At the center of all of these teeth was a fair face with two eyes, a nose, and a mouth present as such a face currently looked towards the Observers of Old and Young with a smile.","This being wasn't alone beside her, someone who was thousands of times smaller than her floated serenity, her form being discernible as it glowed with pure white brilliance in the midst of all this darkness!","Being humanoid in nature, the form seemed to be an amalgamation of pure white illusory tentacles that even stretched out to form white wings behind her back, her face merely showing a form of beauty and grace as only two dark singularities blinked in the center of all this brilliance.","Yet the moment she appeared, everything was illuminated with unfathomable clarity!"]},{"number":3217,"title":"Chapter 3217: Chapter 3216 Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias! VI","paragraphs":["\"Esteemed Phulax, I have come to show you something quite literally brilliant.\"","From the worm like Outerversal Morphon with millions of jagged teeth and a fair face at the very center, a sweet voice echoed out that drew near.","\"Oh? It is a surprise to see you after all these cycles, Tabatha. Your appearance is due to the Young Light Morphon here? As rare as they are, it shouldn't be the only reason for your appearance here.\"","The deep voice of Outerversal Morphon Phulax echoed out in reply as Outerversal Morphon Tabatha and the one referred to as a Young Light Morphon drew nearer!","\"Not just that, Esteemed Phulax. This one was born not too long ago as I guided them in the ritual of Alieia. And within a Hundredth of a Megachronos, she had actually managed to bind her first Delegatus!\"","...!","Words that caused even the Observer of Old and Young to look up in surprise.","A Hundredth of the Megachronos.","A unit of time within the Megalos Beyond that represented a fairly short period of time.","For a rare Morphon to bind their first Delegatus within such a short period of time...this was definitely something worthy of note as this Outerversal Morphon was worth being looked at!","\"And-...oh?\"","Outerversal Morphon Tabatha was about to continue, but the Young Light Morphon tugged on the sides of its wriggling skin made out of countless tentacles.","When Outerversal Morphon Tabatha turned her gaze, she saw that the Young Light Morphon was pointing towards a small dot in front of Outerversal Morphon Phulax.","A small dot that, in comparison to the Observer of Old and Young, was akin to a grain of sand based on their sheer size, with even Tabatha and the Young Light Morphon only being somewhat bigger in comparison.","But one could almost miss this Entity based on his size, and yet the Young Light Morphon had discovered something that Outerversal Morphon Tabatha and the Observer of Old and Young had missed!","The visage of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias was there, a string falling out from the center of nine halos behind him and stretching down endlessly across the Megalos Beyond below them, but right now...it was shining with gorgeous purple blue radiance and pulsing back and forth.","It was a sign.","\"I didn't know you also had another Young Morphon here carrying out their first Alieia. I-\"","HUUM!","The tendrils of Outerversal Morphon Phulax buzzed as a terrifying pressure instantly descended to cover everything.","A pressure that stifled the words of the worm like Outerversal Morphon Tabatha.","A pressure that focused on the visage of Ozymandias as truly, his string that he had cast out across the Megalos Beyond...was tout and heavy.","It was shining with brilliance as this was a sign...that he had managed to locate a Delegatus and was undergoing the process of binding at this very moment!","...!","But!","\"It has not even been a Millionth of a Megachronos since he was born...\"","The deep voice of Outerversal Morphon Phulax echoed out with ancient shock and wonder.","His words caused the Outerversal Morphon Tabatha and Young Light Morphon to freeze as at this moment, all eyes were on Ozymandias!","---","The moment a line was cast out across the Megalos Beyond.","Alieia.","The process of an Outerversal Morphon casting out a part of themselves across the weavings of countless weavings.","Across the Megalos Beyond.","Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias had the words of the Observer of Old and Young ringing out in his mind as he knew it could take an uncountable passage of time before he would be able to find anything, but he was patient.","And yet, the moment he cast out his line, he came to realize that it...seemed to be shooting straight toward a certain direction.","As if it already had a predetermined pathway it was honing into!","Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias was puzzled by this, but it allowed things to unfold as they were.","The voices within his depths were getting ever louder.","Ever clearer.","But they still seemed too far away.","He utilized the innate capabilities of an Outerversal Morphon to cross the Megalos Beyond, his weavings crossing pathways he never knew existed as moments later...","PAH!","A should akin to a shell being pierced echoed out.","He instantly knew he was out of the Megalos Beyond and in a different space, but he couldn't freely move in this different space unless he had an anchor!","Unless he had something belonging to this space contain a part of him as he acclimated over time.","Even as these thoughts buzzed within Ozymandias, he was surprised to find that his cast line continued shooting out with purpose and direction as if it knew exactly where to go.","It arrived at a certain Omniverse.","It then arrived within an Omniverse inside this Omniverse!","The line then crossed glorious Aletheian Havens and weavings of unfathomable brilliance before arriving above a certain someone.","A multicolored throne connected to countless threads of multicolored lines floated behind him, his figure standing up at this moment as if he had been waiting.","His head was raised high as the cast out line of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias...smashed straight into him with Quintessential radiance.","BOOOM!","The line became tout and straight as if it could never be broken.","Purple blue stellar brilliance gushed and began to travel up this line, carrying with it interminable waves of knowledge and memories.","\"Ah...\"","Across uncountable weavings, the voices within the depths of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias became gloriously clear.","He knew these voices.","Voices of Entropy and Manadynamics.","Voices of Tyranny and of the Protagonist!","The Voice of Quintessence.","They all arose with clarity at this moment as the cogs of countless wheels began to turn, radiance stretching out for uncountable distances as a man found himself!","|The weavings of Outerversal Descent burn with interminable brilliance.|","Voiced began to resume their normal workings within Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias as at this moment, he recognized himself deeply.","He was Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias.","He was also...Noah Osmont!"]},{"number":3218,"title":"Chapter 3218: Chapter 3217 Outerversal Descent! I","paragraphs":["One's identity was always a critical factor in who they were.","And identity...was always warped into the very psyche of a being.","Their core.","At this moment, the core of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias was jolted awake and remembered everything about his identity, but at the same time...he still retained what he knew himself as!","The Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias in the distant Megalos Beyond would remain Ozymandias, even though he knew he was Noah.","And at this moment, the initial purpose for carrying out this grand experiment that cost the Infinite Omniverse over half of its authority...was achieved in full effect.","Within the depths of the Infinite Omniverse.","Noah's figure was anchored in place by a string of purple blue brilliance that shot straight into his Atlas of Existence, the Second Mundi of Power spinning with mad fervor as the Source for its power was located!","|The only source of Existence for the Second Mundi of Power has been identified and locked in|","|No other possible Source of Existence can be assimilated into the Second Mundi of Power regardless of any similarity or uniqueness.|","...!","Two prompts flashed as they let it be known that due to how complex and complete the Source of Existence of the Outerversal Descent was, nothing else could ever be added into the Second Mundi of Power.","This was how tremendous this Power was as from the extended string that led to the Megalos Beyond, a flood of interminable power of an Outerversal Morphon flowed out and filled the Second Mundi of Power!","|The System of Existence of Outerversal Descent has been successfully established, a constant Source of Existence generating across an unknown continuum from Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias to you.|","A complex and simple idea at the same time.","But simply.","Noah's Atlas of Existence began to rotate all Nine Mundis of Existence, its core beginning to gush out the Authority of the Laborer with extremely pure concentration and power.","It was a direct correlation to the waves of Outerversal Authority of Ozymandias flowing into the Second Mundi of Power!","And this correlation caused Noah's overall Authority to rise immensely in the stage of an Accumulation Autarch.","He was surging towards becoming a genuine Apogee Autarch- the level of most Protectors of the Commonwealth!","At the same time this process began.","HUUM!","The Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse appeared beside Noah.","Her hair shone with all the colors of Aletheian Havens of this Omniverse, her body wrapped by a veil of all Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities as she locked her gaze onto the unseen string connecting to Noah.","The string- the line leading up across immeasurable distances towards the Megalos Beyond.","What...exactly was the Megalos Beyond? Where was it in comparison to the Infinite Omniverse? To other Omniverses?","Why were the Outerversal Morphons considered enemies of the Commonwealth- what exactly was the answer to the question that Outerversal Morphon Phulax had posed to Ozymandias?!","The Infinite Omniverse sought to know.","Noah sought to know.","Their connection pulsed with resonance as Noah's voice echoed out while he closed his eyes to feel all the subtle changes.","\"Do it.\"","Words of affirmation.","And a moment later, the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse raised her hand and grasped the tout line leading towards the Megalos Beyond.","...!","Everything trembled.","Thereafter, gushing waves of Outerversal Authority began to surge into the Infinite Omniverse.","They wanted answers. So they charged ahead and took actions that may just provide them!","---","Within the Wheel of Weavings.","Another body of Nuntius Eshkeri greeted Noah's winged figure that was teleported into a unique domain.","A domain that had a massive golden portal at its center, a white walkway connected to the Wheel of Weavings leading to this portal as this walkway stemmed from the white walls of the Wheel of Weavings.","This was the very center of the Wheel of Weavings.","The surrounding space stretched out for light years as massive vessels floated in the surroundings, and the auras of multiple Autarchical Existences surrounded this space as their gazes covered every single spot!","|The distinction of a Protector is a unique one. Its appointment will not be completed in a newly discovered Omniverse with a lot of things still under construction. For your actions and honor, you will be given advanced privilege to head towards the Omniverse X-9, or more commonly known as...the Omniverse of the Protectors.|","The other body of Nuntius Eshkeri emanated such an intent as he beckoned Noah towards an ovoid golden vessel that burned with white flames.","His Simian visage turned around as it neared the rectangular opening guarded by two Foundation Autarchs , and he welcomed Noah in.","|In the Omniverse of the Protectors, you will undergo your official appointment to join us as our brethren. This Wayward Omniversal Vessel is already marked with the coordinates as after passing across the Omniversal Portal, it will take you on the pathway directly to this destination. Any questions at all for me before your departure?|","A calm smile on his glorious monkey like visage.","And Noah only shook his head while reciprocating this smile and stepping into the Wayward Omniversal Vessel, his words echoing out.","\"No. We shall see each other again soon, Brother Nuntius Eshkeri.\"","...!","A flash of brilliance.","And Nuntius Eshkeri nodded as the massive doors of unknown materials of this vessel closed- the white flames around it beginning to vibrate as it moved.","|Sooner than you know, Brother Osmont. Sooner than you know.|","With a glimmer of white flames, the Wayward Omniversal Vessel began to move towards the golden portal.","Inside of it, two gorgeous female Foundation Autarchs walked side by side to Noah as they went towards the depths of this vessel.","\"The trip to the Omniverse of the Protectors will take a few hours minimum, or over a day depending on any possible dangers we come across. We have many things for the Unofficial Protector to enjoy within this vessel, and of course...don't be afraid to ask anything of us. Anything at all.\"","...!"]},{"number":3219,"title":"Chapter 3219: Chapter 3218 Outerversal Descent! II","paragraphs":["Their fur was covered with white and black brilliance as they spoke, the curves of their figures magnified as they smiled towards him!","As existences whose very souls had achieved Autarchy, their beauty was at the peak of any others in existence.","Noah looked at them with interest as he spread his will across this vessel and replied.","\"Let's see the refreshments and food before anything else. And you can tell me more about the Omniverse of the Protectors we are going to.\"","\"Of course, this way...\"","He was led deeper into the Vessel that was on its way to leave his Natal Omniverse.","A heavy and profound step forward for him.","At the same time all of this was occurring, another body of his in the Infinite Omniverse was accepting the entry of terrifying waves of Outerversal Authority, but nobody over here sensed anything.","It was a time for many changes and entry into new places.","The Megalos Beyond.","And now, a journey towards another Omniverse!","All of it was surreal as Noah felt like he was just getting started!","And this feeling was all the more surreal when the memories of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias flowed into him.","Memories of the Observer of Old and Young- Outerversal Morphon Phulax!","How powerful was this being whose size was millions of times larger than him?","If size was truly a comparison to power, then as far as he had currently come...there was still a long way to go!","And when it came to power, Noah was very closely experiencing a very unique weaving of power at this time.","He kept it isolated to the body within the Infinite Omniverse.","The coursing power of an Outerversal Morphon, as well as the Distinctions that came with its workings!","The fact that with the System of Existence of Outerversal Descent, he had become a Delegatus of another version of himself within the Megalos Beyond.","But what did this truly signify?","The answers...lay in the Source itself.","Where the version of himself that was the Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias was born!","The answers...lay in the Source itself.","Where the version of himself that was the Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias was born!","---","Within the Megalos Beyond.","A titanic eye gazed at the tout pulsing line stemming from Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias glowing purple and blue silently as its own millions of tendrils floated serenely with grace and majesty.","A successful search, selection, and binding of a Delegatus outside of the Megalos Beyond in the span of less than a Millionth of a Megachronos.","Something like this may not hold any meaning for others or carry tremendous significance to those with a different type of knowledge.","The question was...the manner in which the newly born Outerversal Morphon achieved this feat.","The weavings of the Observer of Old and Young spread out as it stopped the voice of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha and the silent gaze of the Young Light Morphon.","It wanted to observe.","Surrounded by stellar obsidian radiance, the eyes of the wings of the Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias pulsed as they reveled in the feedback of authority across the singular fishing line he had cast which connected to another part of himself.","Even though Outerversal Authority was flowing down into it, the size and power of Ozymandias here actually scaled upwards as well!","Even though he was giving Outerversal Authority away, there was an overall net benefit to the existence of Ozymandias itself.","It was a unique feedback and reality as it caused him to question.","What was an Outerversal Morphon?","How could their power be defined?","When Ozymandias looked at this closely, the first thing he noted was the high threshold of power for these beings.","At birth, they already exceeded the power of any average Autarch.","At birth!","They didn't have to go through any of the tedious initial steps on the path of power, nor spend eons or millions of years to get here.","This begged the question of just how many there were across this Megalos Beyond.","And in terms of their power...could it truly be augmented and increased the more Delegatus they obtained?","When such daring truth regarding Outerversal Morphons danced in his mind, Ozymandias didn't sit still.","The Nine halos behind him began to spin as at their very center, one thin tentacle after another began to form into a string- into fishing lines that exited the center of the last Halo and were cast down across the Megalos Beyond!","They streaked down with beauty and horror as they seemed like tentacles seeking to latch onto the very weavings of Existence themselves.","And no sooner had they been cast down across the Megalos Beyond...","HUUM!","They began to shine with brilliant purple blue hue one after another.","Meaning every cast tentacle.","Every cast fishing line.","Each one had found a Delegatus almost as quickly as they were cast!","Of course, every single one went directly towards the Infinite Omniverse as after he himself was branded as his own Delegatus, Noah wanted to test the extent of power and uniqueness of this Outerversal Authority as he directed the lines of connection to those who were already connected to him through his Lineage.","Finding them from the Megalos Beyond was the easiest thing.","He knew where every single one had their main bodies within the Infinite Omniverse as he started his tests with the Enders of Existence.","Hyperion was the first as his draconic elephantine eyes blazed with complex brilliance- feeling this new power from the depths of his Lineage as he didn't reject it.","The lines of connection then proceeded towards other Enders of Existence as their Legions were vast!","After them, there were Legions of Illusory Weavings and Records of Entities from eons past.","Each was moving about freely before moments later, a line of connection came down and changed everything.","Within the Megalos Beyond, Ozymandias now had thousands of tout lines cast down from the center of his halos, his body being encased in brilliance as he began to enlarge rapidly.","As he did this.","The tentacles of the Observer of Old and Young buzzed.","The worm like visage of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha...began to tremble as her voice was barely heard.","\"The sign! The sign! When the day comes that a newly born Morphon will bind Existence the moment they seek it! O Great Phulax, the sign!\"","...!","One particular Outerversal Morphon was going mad as she watched the nigh simultaneous casting and binding of Delegatus with Noah's actions..."]},{"number":3220,"title":"Chapter 3220: Chapter 3219 A Sign! I","paragraphs":["A sign.","These were the ravings of a powerful Outerversal Morphon as she observed the casting of lines and instant luminosity thereafter that indicated an extremely rapid process of Alieia!","An extremely rapid process of wading one's weavings across the Megalos Beyond into other parts of Existence and somehow being able to locate and bind a Delegatus right away.","How else could this be explained?","In the vast knowledge of the Outerversal Morphon Tabatha, there was a shred of ancient words that many Morphons that had lived over the cycles knew.","It was so shocking to the Outerversal Morphon that she only gazed on in shock while repeating herself.","\"The sign...when a newly born Morphon will bind Existence freely the moment they deemed it. The sign...!\"","She recalled what it all meant as she seemed to be in a trance.","And the entity she was looking at, the one causing her to repeat her words like a broken record....he also seemed to be in a trance as more and more tentacles transformed into endless strings that were cast down.","Moments later, these strings shone with a glorious luster as the size of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias only increased exponentially.","How could such a phenomenon be explained by the Outerversal Morphons?","Were they supposed to suddenly think that somehow, the Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias before them was actually a part of an existence who ruled over an entire young Omniverse, his Lineage spread out to quintillions upon quintillions of beings that he was connected to all across the Aletheian Havens of this Omniverse?","Were they supposed to make a jump and think that somehow, such a being had reverse engineered a pathway into the Megalos Beyond after watching the entry of Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap, and this was what led to the current reality?","Such thoughts would be utterly outlandish to make any jump towards as of course, the first and only thought in their minds was something they knew for many cycles now.","Legends spread across the Outerversal Morphon.","As Outerversal Morphon Tabatha repeated herself again and again, the Young Light Morphon glowed brightly as she weaved her authority to interrupt while asking.","\"Great Mother Tabatha, what does such a Sign mean?\"","What did this sign mean?","The words woke Outerversal Morphon Tabatha out of her reverie as her wormlike figure buzzed while she echoed out.","\"A sign that for better or worse, the Megalos Beyond is about to change. It has been said that when such a Sign presents itself, it means the instrument of the final destruction or the final expansion of the Megalos Beyond across all of Existence will have been born!\"","Heavy words filled with oddities echoed out as the Young Light Morphon squinted her singularities while asking carefully.","\"So...is he the instrument that will bring about destruction or expansion?\"","Her words were straightforward.","But the visage of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha was not as straightforward as her many jagged teeth swirled with twists and turns.","\"Many Morphon across the cycles disagreed and argued about this as it was never explicitly stated. It is unknown as the Origin of the Instrument was never clarified! But what is clear is this sign that is unfolding right before us.\"","Words that didn't make things any easier to understand echoed out as the Young Light Morphon watched the ongoing scene carefully.","She then came across a critical issue that she turned to Outerversal Morphon Tabatha and asked innocently.","\"Great Mother Tabatha, who spoke of these signs initially? Why were they not asked to clarify?\"","...!","A simple question.","But it was one that caused the worm like visage of Tabatha to vibrate as she uttered out as if she were in a trance.","\"That ancient being...has disappeared since then. They-\"","\"Hush now.\"","HUUM!","The booming and thick voice of the Observer of Old and Young echoed out as Outerversal Morphon Tabatha became quiet.","The tendrils of his millions of tentacles had inadvertently covered everything around them- and they only came to a realization now as they realized everything around them was covered by the wriggling tentacles of the Outerversal Morphon Phulax as if they were endlessly twisting snakes.","\"You have spoken out a great deal and likely alerted others. Alas, that is how it was always meant to be.\"","His deep voice held power and misery, weakness and contentment, and even more in between as it was truly complex.","But it was solid and without any doubts as it continued.","\"Let the child finish what he is doing. We will see then.\"","...!","The child.","The Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias who continued to cast out strings across the Megalos Beyond at this moment- all these strings crossing thin gaps left open by the Observer of Old and Young as they stretched out across Existence!","---","In another area across the vastness of the Megalos Beyond.","An Entity of approximate size to the Observer of Old and Young had millions of lines cast down to the Megalos Beyond, her gaze filled with ancient brilliance as she had three crimson eyes shaped like nine pointed stars.","These eyes were attached to a massive visage that had the upper half of a humanoid entity, and a lower half that seemed to be a long trunk extending into countless roots across the Megalos Beyond!","These roots pulsed at this moment as some of them captured in distinct weavings that could only be picked up by those with unique dispositions and power across the Megalos Beyond.","|The Sign!|","...!","|Bind Existence the moment they seek it! The sign!|","Words that should have in no way reached such a vast distance did so.","The weavings of terrifying authorities that were always keeping a look out for anything to do with certain subjects picked it up.","It was so terrifying that it could be something occurring an infinitely far distance within the Megalos Beyond, and yet if certain authorities were set up to pick something relating to a specific issue...so long as something related to it arose, those who set up these authorities would know!","At this moment, heavy words spread that caused the countless roots of this massive Outerversal Morphon to flutter.","Her three eyes burned with brilliance and began to spin.","It wasn't entirely clear what she was about to do, but what thing was abundantly clear.","Certain words were uttered.","And these certain words had begun to, ever so slowly, permeate across the Megalos Beyond!"]},{"number":3221,"title":"Chapter 3221: Chapter 3220 A Sign! II","paragraphs":["Across the Megalos Beyond.","Regions of unfathomable distance and power waded across.","Myriads of tentacles seethed with ever confounding brilliance.","In yet another region of such a place, a mass of obsidian tentacles by the millions seethed as they were very familiar.","They were the tentacles of none other than the banished Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap who had one of his most prized Delegatus lost due to a sudden unraveling of his existence that caused his power to leak out as he sought to use the opportunity to do something bold.","Something only possible with a few of his Delegatus that he had raised to a high level of power!","But it was all for naught.","His Delegatus was wasted while his entry was stopped before making significant gains.","At times like these, it wanted significant gains.","It-","|The Sign!|","...!","Its countless mass of tentacles wriggled and arose.","There were so many that the form of Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap could not be entirely made out, but these tentacles picked up something from a far distance within the Megalos Beyond as they began to buzz with activity.","The Sign.","What they spoke out in the distant past cycles- weavings of possibilities.","When Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap remembered the words of that being everyone idolized- the being that disappeared to never be found many cycles ago...his tentacles began to crackle with obsidian brilliance!","That entity was many things.","A liar was not one of them.","If from what they mentioned cycles ago would come was actually appearing now...","|It cannot be allowed.|","HUUM!","His voice dripped of brutality and ancientness as this mentality of his was made many cycles ago.","A possible instrument for the destruction or expansion of the Megalos Beyond.","Even if it was only a possibility, why take the risk when it came to the Megalos Beyond?","And if it turned out he wasn't the instrument or the words of that person never came to be, then it was just that.","The countless tentacles began to move.","|No signs.|","...!","There were many more things that person said.","Some that only a select few, in addition to Outerversal Morphon Ginnungagap, knew!","They could not be allowed to come to fruition.","So...","|The erasure of any possible instruments is paramount.|","A daring Declaration was made.","And one of the oldest Outerversal Morphons within the Megalos Beyond began to move!","---","How could the sensation be described?","With every string he cast.","With every fishing line he threw out that came to connect with the people that he was already connected to, he felt like he was giving a part of himself away, and yet this part was given back, plus a whole lot more.","|The weavings of Outerversal Descent and the workings of this System of Existence are slowly being discerned.|","|The input of Existence from an Outerversal Morphon and onto any selected Existence is cycled before the Outerversal Authority naturally multiplies and is returned in an amplified form back to the Outerversal Morphon.|","A unique point in the workings of the Outerversal Morphon.","They didn't actually lose anything in this process, and they gained even more from it.","Arriving at such a point, Noah came to a critical decision.","In the Infinite Omniverse, his voice echoed out.","\"How is the continuity of Existential Terraforming?\"","|The size and breadth of Existence of the Aletheian Havens have so far more than tripled, with the process slowed down while seas of Mana act as an anchor to stabilize everything. Once a determined stable safety factor has been ascertained, Terraforming will resume again fully.|","He was answered succinctly as there was one last thing to confirm.","\"Any negative effects to the Outerversal Authority flowing into the Infinite Omniverse?\"","...!","The Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse had grasped onto the thread that came all the way from the Megalos Beyond as waves of Outerversal Authority had gushed out from it and into the Infinite Omniverse itself.","But what did this do?","| A view of it would be much more astute.|","Part of his consciousness was taken elsewhere.","He saw a portion of the vibrant halcyon sands of the Dream Aletheian Haven.","But in one area, these sands shone with a vibrant stellar obsidian hue reminiscent to the stellar obsidian brilliance of the Megalos Beyond!","|Preliminary tests show a high rate of conversion of the surrounding existence along with a rapid addition to the overall landmass of the Infinite Omniverse, and no negative effects have been discovered so far.|","It may actually be feasible.","So Noah nodded and made up his mind as his voice echoed out again.","\"Analyze all possible contingencies and prepare to receive a direct link from Ozymandias to the Infinite Omniverse.\"","...!","A shocking step.","How was the Infinite Omniverse to grow and advance?","Existential Terraforming was one of them even with its instability that was solved by using Noah as an anchor.","But thereafter, was it going to devour and assimilate other Omniverses?","As of this moment, the answer was no!","What was happening instead, was the introduction to the Megalos Beyond as for the expansion of the Infinite Omniverse, the possibility of its expansion containing a semblance of the vastness of the Megalos Beyond came to be.","And this possibility only came to be because of Noah's entry into the Megalos Beyond!","What would its full effects be? What would the Infinite Omniverse become in the future if its constructs had weavings of the Megalos Beyond within it?","Nobody could say for sure.","But since its Master gave the command...","|I will prepare everything, Master.|","The Infinite Omniverse followed and started the weavings of a grandiose project!","Far from the Infinite Omniverse, tracing up the countless lines of connections that were dropping from the Megalos Beyond- the weavings of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias felt all changes with pristine details.","He also felt the many changes to his own body and surroundings of the area he was in within the Megalos Beyond.","Along with the ravings of the one known as Outerversal Morphon Tabatha!"]},{"number":3222,"title":"Chapter 3222: Chapter 3221 Purpose! I","paragraphs":["Within the brilliance of the Megalos Beyond.","A massive eye with a triangular pupil stretched out millions of tentacles to cover everything in this area.","Enclosed within was a titanic worm like Outerversal Morphon, a Young Light Morphon, and the recently born Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias, whose body was enlarging at a rapid pace.","The ravings of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha were also heard by Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias amidst his brilliance.","Ravings of the Sign.","So after thousands of tentacles were cast down across the Megalos Beyond from him as he successfully bound many Enders of Existence as Delegates, he took a pause.","He waited for the computations and analysis from the Infinite Omniverse on what would happen if he carried out a grand ordeal and observed his own changes as well as those receiving tendrils of Outerversal Authority within the Infinite Omniverse.","His singularities that took the place of his eyes on his head blinked as he gazed around as if he were waking from a reverie, the eyes on the wings behind his back being even more brilliant!","As he gazed around, so did those who had been watching him this whole time further scrutinize him.","The voice of the Observer of Old and Young was the first one to ring out towards him as he came to.","\"What is your purpose, Young One?\"","...!","His purpose.","The Observer of Old and Young had told him before that after performing Alieia multiple times and expanding his knowledge of Existence, his purpose would gradually form.","So he had seen.","Thousands of lines were cast down as he bound multiple Delegatus and attained their memories, hopes, dreams, and livelihoods for as long as they had lived!","How did this inform his purpose?","Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias gazed deeply into the burning triangular pupil, weavings of tendrils of Outerversal Authority seething around him as he spoke with surety.","\"My purpose...is the Megalos Beyond!\"","Thousands of lines were cast down as he bound multiple Delegatus and attained their memories, hopes, dreams, and livelihoods for as long as they had lived!","BOOM!","How did this inform his purpose?","The surrounding stellar obsidian space shook with brilliance.","Off to the side, the worm like body of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha shook even more as she began raving again!","\"Ah! The sign! The sign!\"","Reality pulsed and distorted after a simple sentence was uttered.","Noah spoke of it daringly as truly, after entering this Megalos Beyond, he wanted to see how much more expansive it was compared to the vast array of Omniverses, and with the aid of the Infinite Omniverse...he may even be capable of taking the breadth and power of this Megalos Beyond!","It was all to fulfill his own greed.","His own overarching need for power that others wouldn't ever come close to matching.","But how would it be interpreted by these Entities who seemed to already have preset prophecies that they were associating with him when he had nothing to do with them?","The massive visage of the Observer of Old and Young seemingly let out a sigh before its thick voice reverberated out.","\"A clear purpose. One that is exactly the same as that Entity many cycles ago. \"","...!","The reason for the ravings of Outerversal Morphon Tabatha.","She had begun again as her beliefs were only confirmed further when Ozymandias revealed his purpose that actually turned out to be the same as that Entity all those cycles ago!","The tendrils of Outerversal Morphon Phulax wrapped around and protected everything currently to ensure to weavings of words were picked up and stretched out across the Megalos Beyond, his ancient voice leaking out again as his gaze remained on Ozymandias.","\"I observe the old and young, Ozymandias. I have personally seen the births of millions of Outerversal Morphons over the cycles as most times, I end things with observance. Other times, I do more than this. When I come across those with a unique purpose, I aid them. You...have a unique purpose and are currently surrounded by lore that will make it very difficult for you to live past even a single cycle.\"","...!","\"Whether this lore relates to you truly or not cannot be said with surety, but it has now been linked to you regardless. Not much can be kept secret within the Megalos Beyond, much less something that relates to this that many sensitive beings already set up securities to hear about it any time it is mentioned across the Megalos Beyond. So, Young One, will you take my aid as we ascertain certain lore and Fables from many cycles ago?\"","The aid of Outerversal Morphon Phulax.","A terrifying entity that is still millions of times larger than Ozymandias, with a level of power unknown in its stature across the Megalos Beyond.","So of course, the wings of Ozymandias pulsed with brilliance as he nodded with contemplation.","...!","A choice was made.","Outerversal Morphon Phulax gazed at Noah with scrutiny before tendrils of obsidian lightning flashed across its body, its massive size beginning to shrink.","\"Take on the smallest and weakest form you can take. What we are about to do requires a level of stealth to ensure it goes smoothly.\"","The smallest and weakest form.","The massive body of the Observer of Old and Young, which was larger than even Domains of Existence, shrank down tremendously as countless tentacles retreated into a small singularity, this singularity taking on a humanoid form.","The smallest. The weakest possible form.","It wasn't known what the Observer of Old and Young based this on, but he transformed into the image of an old man with tan skin that shone with a bronze luster.","Messy dark and white hair covered his head as he seemed hunched over, his hand thrusting out to weave millions of tentacles into a walking stick that he grasped and hit the pointed end on the space below him.","BOOM!","A circular obsidian wave of light shot out that began to cover all of the surrounding space- twisting and disrupting everything as if all their tracks were being covered.","Ozymandias himself looked at this scene as his body became smaller, the visible threads of thousands that sank across the Megalos Beyond disappearing as his authority allowed them to be visible or entirely invisible!"]},{"number":3223,"title":"Chapter 3223: Chapter 3222 Purpose! II","paragraphs":["The wings and nine halos of crimson obsidian brilliance behind him retracted into his body.","Purple and blue stellar brilliance flashed as he became shrouded in a purple robe that seemed to be made out of stars, his facial features becoming more defined as he gained more than just singularities for eyes.","His skin still gave off an otherworldly feeling as it held a paint as if he was forged from millions of shattered Cosmos- with his image almost melding with the obsidian stellar brilliance all around the Megalos Beyond!","Behind him, the figures of a shrewd woman adorned in a black dress and a pointed hat appeared, her fair face filled with wrinkles that would remind one of the segmentation of worms as her eyes his immeasurable brilliance.","Beside her, a young woman with white light radiating in her surroundings floated, her visage adorned with a white dress as she held a profound sense of beauty and eyes that seemed filled with insatiable curiosity!","With the visage of an old man with a cane leading at the front, Ozymandias in the middle, and Teo Outerversal Morphons in humanoid forms following from behind...","\"Let us go. There are many we must make contact with and gather the support of if you are to last even a single cycle in these Megalos Beyond. Whether you have any connection to the one mentioned in long forgotten Fables or not...will be ascertained in time.\"","...!","The old man took a step forward.","And their surroundings instantly distorted as the stellar obsidian space below twisted and formed into a disk that carried all of them.","From behind, the wrinkly visage of the old woman stared at Ozymandias as if she were looking at an object of taboo, her voice coming out in hushed tones as she asked.","\"Great Phulax, where do you have in mind to even go?\"","Across the Megalos Beyond, where and who would they go to?","The Observer of Old and Young remained placid as the stellar obsidian disk below them began to move, his voice steady and filled with depth as he replied.","\"The Clan that Entity stemmed from. They should have records more comprehensive than anyone else, and if there even stands a chance that the time their Predecessor talked about has come...they will not hesitate to throw their weight behind the Sign.\"","...!","In the corner of his eyes, he gazed at Ozymandias as he sighed internally.","Something so recently born and now, it would be thrust into the center of Fables that it may have nothing to do with.","'Poor thing.'","This was the thought of Outerversal Morphon Phulax as he went forward, their figures warping across the Megalos Beyond and heading towards a specific destination.","Even though Phulax felt empathic at the woes and dangers to come to this Young One, he still went forward regardless as this was his job.","He was the Observer of Old and Young, and he embarked on a journey that even he didn't know what ending it could have!","---","Far, far from the distant Megalos Beyond.","A vessel tore across the weavings of Existence and Non-existence- with tumultuous storms capable of shredding even a Foundation Autarch raging outside of it.","But inside, calmness and wonder were all that could be found.","Within, the figure of Noah was seated on a large white throne, a curved transparent circular screen showing him the deadly storms of Existence and Non-existence raging outside as the vessel powered on.","\"Made from the materials found on a unique Omniverse and the carapace of the Worms of Existence, this Vessel can cross unfettered from one Omniverse and into the next with ease. You'll come across the Forgers of the Commonwealth who design constructs like this and the Wheel of Weavings sooner rather than later.","Besides Noah, two female Simians gazed towards him with glazed eyes as none of their seductive efforts had succeeded, with Noah only asking for more information regarding the Commonwealth and nothing else as his devilish apathy only made a challenge for these Simians seem more enticing!","But their efforts were bound to end in failure as in the next moment, the vessel began to pulse and radiated waves of authority while the scene of storms around them faded, an encompassing multicolored radiance pulsing out from all around as a major jump was made.","BZZZT!","The flow of weavings rapidly changed.","And Noah's own weavings alerted him first even before the surrounding reality constructed itself all around.","|The weavings of another Omniverse have been discovered.|","...!","Space twisted and re-established itself.","As if lights had been turned on, stellar rays of verdant brilliance stretched out as far as the eyes could see.","In the surroundings, the allure of an endless void filled with vibrant stellar green roots appeared, these roots stretching out for light years.","The vessel floated silently as it went towards a construct seemingly made from nature- a construct that looked like a flower with incandescent verdant petals the size of Domains of Existence shining with glory.","Other Vessels could be seen floating around this space, along with auras of Many Teracosm and Paracosm Entities!","In the far distance, the massive construct of another Wheel of Weavings could be seen- its structure taking on the same verdant hue of the surroundings as it seemed different in color but exactly the same in structure like the Wheel of Weavings within Noah's Natal Omniverse.","Apart from it, other constructs were stretching out in between the ever present verdant roots that seemingly filled all of this Omniverse!","The vessel went towards the center of one of the nearby verdant petals of the massive flower the size of an Existential Domain, approaching a flat space where other vessels were stationed.","At the very front of this area, three Apogee Autarchs floated with their hands behind their backs as they gazed towards the vessel that Noah was flying in with.","\"We welcome you to the Omniverse of the Protectors. The Omniverse where the sharpest swords of the Commonwealth are forged- Omniverse X-9!\"","The female Simians beside him spoke in synchrony as Noah appeared in another Omniverse for the first time."]},{"number":3224,"title":"Chapter 3224: Chapter 3223 Protector Osmont! I","paragraphs":["Within the Omniverse of the Protectors.","Coming out of a vessel with two Foundation Autarchs in tow, Noah's will covered the few light years nearby as the fantastical structures and number of auras truly distinguished themselves, with one piece of important information presenting itself at this moment with clarity.","And that was the glimpse of the power of the Commonwealth.","They were within the Omniverse of the Protectors, and the one thing Noah observed after arriving here was the sheer number of powerful Entities at the Autarchical level of Existence!","His expression remained calm as he counted just the ones he could feel the auras of within the areas where one's will wasn't restricted, and he counted 1344.","1344 Autarchs!","Some were within the verdant Wheel of Weavings, others stretched out in some of the many unique constructs stretched out in the surroundings, and others were within this massive blooming flower with verdant petals.","This was a terrifying number that showed a glimpse of the power of the Commonwealth, and the surroundings of this place only added to the intrigue.","He didn't know how much Existential Terraforming had occurred, but the richness and potency of the surrounding Existence was so great that just by being in this space, one could feel their existence soothed.","Ahead of him, three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians stood with their hands behind their backs, their bodies emanating the powerful aura of Apogee Autarchs as the one in the center, a Simian with pure white fur all around, was the one to speak out. \"Prime Citizen Osmont...who shall now take the steps to become Protector Osmont...welcome to the Omniverse of the Protectors.\"","A smile on the Simian facial features that seemed to hold a trace of seriousness. HUUM!","With a flicker of his hands, a white portal bloomed behind them.","The Apogee Autarchs proceeded to step into this portal, Noah following along as the two Simian females that had been escorting him this whole time bowed while staying behind.","His existence passed through the white portal fearlessly as he felt himself pulled towards the depths of this flower like construct, reality reconstructing itself around him rapidly as he appeared in a much smaller domain.","He gazed up to see cloudy skies as drops of rain drizzled on his face, each drop carrying with it tremendous Vitality and life force as it seemed to contain the pure Nectar of Existence itself!","His existence passed through the white portal fearlessly as he felt himself pulled towards the depths of this flower like construct, reality reconstructing itself around him rapidly as he appeared in a much smaller domain.","He gazed up to see cloudy skies as drops of rain drizzled on his face, each drop carrying with it tremendous Vitality and life force as it seemed to contain the pure Nectar of Existence itself!","Akin to the Fruits of Existence that could bloom within his Omniverse.","This rain itself seemed to be highly concentrated weavings of existence that were so pure that one could absorb them on their skin as they fell.","Around him, the drops of rain fell on lush grasslands, with colorful trees budding with unique fruits stretched out around small rising mountains.","The white portal placed him on a path filled with cobblestones that ascended towards a small mountain which everything was centered on, and one could see a small dilapidated house made from straws and mud.","The three Apogee Autarchs were already standing in front of this dilapidated cottage, their bodies bent in a bowing motion towards an old man who sat in front of a chessboard!","The old man gave a nod of recognition to them before he raised his head and smiled towards Noah's figure in the distance.","When Noah saw this being, his eyes shone with somberness as he came across an Entity not within the bounds of the Existential Dominium Realm- the uniqueness and pressure of this being placing him in the Omniversal Realm!","Noah took a step to appear before this Entity as unlike the Apogee Autarchs, he merely gave a nod of recognition.","An action that the Apogee Autarchs became stern at, but the old man only smiled and waved his hands as he invited Noah to sit on the mat opposite him.","\"A new protector. A special one at that as you were capable of unveiling an Agent of Anti-Life. How were you able to do that, by the way?\"","His voice vibrated with power.","He seemed disconnected from the surrounding reality as uniquely, this old man's disposition was entirely human without an ounce of the Simian fur.","Noah looked at this being and replied calmly.","\"I made the same discovery as everyone else today. My authority attacked with the intent of disrupting and causing dissonance in the weavings of existence of my enemy. This...so called Agent of Anti-Life reacted so badly to my attack that it seemingly caused dissonance between him and whatever he was connected to.\"","Noah described the process of utilizing the miniaturized Fat Monkeys smoothly as the old man in front of him nodded while stroking his beard.","His fair skin glinted with brilliance, his dark and white hair messy as the simple white robes he wore made him look like a hermit from eons past.","\"That simple thing you just described is precisely the type of talent needed at a time like this. Tell me, Osmont, what do you know on the subject of Anti-Life? Or Anti-Existence?\"","The old man asked simply while moving a chess piece, and in their immediate surroundings, illusory screens flashed into existence that displayed fantastical scenes.","Noah looked at these scenes while shaking his head in a reply.","\"Not much aside from what I saw today.\"","He lied easily as there was no mention of how at this moment, he could be considered someone belonging to the camp of Anti-Life more than anyone else!","The old man nodded at this as he began to explain the scenes playing out around them.","\"Existence is vast. Vaster than any of us can ever imagine. We don't know the number of Omniverses out there, we don't know the possible number of existences- whether living or dead. There is a lot we do not know, but we do know about them routinely destroying weavings of existence en masse. We know of those who seek to destroy life in totality, and those who simply wish to deny Existence in totality.\"","As he spoke, the illusory screens showing titanic Worms of Existence and Outerversal Morphons became larger and even clearer!"]},{"number":3225,"title":"Chapter 3225: Chapter 3224 Protector Osmont! II","paragraphs":["The rain came down heavily, each drop passing through the illusory screens as everything nearby was filled with boundless weavings of existence.","One screen showed a massive segmented worm with wide open jaws that were Devouring the surrounding Omniverse- a dozen Royal Existential Omniversal Simians surrounding it and unleashing waves of brilliant attacks.","Another screen showed millions of crimson tentacles wrapping around clusters of Domains of Existence, an aura of decay spreading as a group of Draconians were caught within its grasp- their life quickly fading away as they were turned into mindless entities moments later that attacked their own people!","\"They made designations for Anti-Life and Anti-Existence, but for me...it's really all the same.\"","The old man at the Omniversal Realm continued as the scenes shown on the illusory screens became all that more graphic.","One scene in particular showed an Entity that seemed like this old man before him adorned in a multicolored armor, with dozens of stacked circles radiating pure white lightning rotating around him as he released heavy blasts of power against an outline of a titanic Outerversal Morphon!","The white lightning joined together to form multiple Wheels that spun with interminable glory- grinding down thousands of tentacles with ferocity and valor.","The area around them was laid to waste as Noah actually saw the surroundings gain a tint of the stellar obsidian hue of the Megalos Beyond.","Countless tentacles surged out in anger and defiance as they continued to be burnt by white lightning, the multicolored armament on this being's body seemingly supporting him amidst the deteriorating existence as he actually managed to push back this Outerversal Morphon!","\"The Worms of Existence are destructive and a tremendous threat, but at least their minds only have the thought of destruction as with many sacrifices over the eons, it is easy to face them. But these monstrosities of Anti-Life...their purpose does not seem to simply be destruction. They're more complex. Their reach goes far as across the Omniverses, they have already stained an Unknown number of Entities as their Agents. They offer strength and power, and many accept it without fully knowing the results that will come from it. They don't just destroy as they alter entire Omniverses to their will, and do things that most of us cannot analyze or understand. Outerversal Morphons, they call themselves. Outerversal...a term that if anyone tells you they can truly define, they don't know anything. To this day, I do not understand them. But, if there are more Protectors capable of identifying Agents of such beings...\"","The old man moved his gaze from the chessboard before him and locked onto Noah.","All the things he had talked about were actually things that Noah knew very well, especially the idea of altering entire Omniverses to their wills!","The old man moved his gaze from the chessboard before him and locked onto Noah.","All the things he had talked about were actually things that Noah knew very well, especially the idea of altering entire Omniverses to their wills!","What he was trying to do right now as he looked at the possibility of binding his Infinite Omniverse under his identity of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias would undoubtedly have grand consequences in the future to come.","But he simply took in all the waves of information he received as he asked with inquisitiveness before this being continued his monologue.","\"Who are you?\"","A humanoid entity that Royal Existential Omniversal Simians bowed down to.","Someone who the newest recruits of the Protectors were taken to once arriving at the Omniverse of the Protectors!","This old man smiled at Noah's question as he shook his head.","\"Just an old man that has been fighting for too long. You can call me Eudemus. You can call me The Old Protector. Some kids even play around and call me the Shield of the Commonwealth. But all I am is someone who has seen too many eons of battle and wishes to bring them to an end. Too many Omniverses have been destroyed, and too many lives have ended. And there is no victory in sight as truly, it had to end. Whether through peace. Whether through annihilation. Whatever way possible. Will you help me achieve that? If you can replicate what you did on that Arena and begin sniffing out Agents of Anti-Life across the myriad Omniverses, you will make great contributions to Existence itself. And of course, you can ask for anything your heart desires.\"","...!","The Shield of the Commonwealth!","The Entity standing atop the myriad Protectors of the Commonwealth was actually not a Royal Existential Omniversal Simian, and he sought to add another Protector under his banner to further his aim of ending an endless war.","But the words he uttered were very crucial as they could provide vastly different results!","Whether through Peace or Annihilation, he wanted things to end.","Noah looked at this being and gave a light nod of affirmation.","\"I will fight on behalf of Existence.\"","HUUM!","His words caused an eruption of power as they could mean any myriad of things depending on who listened to them.","He would fight on behalf of Existence. Not on behalf of the Commonwealth. Not on behalf of anybody else.","But on the side of Existence!","They could easily be taken the wrong way, but the Shield of the Commonwealth smiled as he waved his hands to reveal a floating sword between him and Noah.","\"Good. You can now officially be deemed a Protector of the Commonwealth, and to show you what awaits in store should you perform in an exemplary manner...this is a piece of a shattered Omniverse that was forged into a sword. An Omniversal Armament. Familiarize yourself with it as it should help you bridge the power of most Protectors, and then you can get ready to be deployed to Omniverses rife with war and decimation. Maybe, just maybe...you could be a breath of change in this eon to come, Protector Osmont.\"","...!","An Omniversal Armament!","The Shield of the Commonwealth, Eudemus, offered such a wonderful as the Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor was officially deemed a Protector of the Commonwealth!","|A Unique Armament has been discovered.|","Within Noah's mind, prompts had already begun to rise as his hand reached out to grasp the multicolored sword- his Distinctions as the Weaver moved rapidly as they sought to understand everything quickly!"]},{"number":3226,"title":"Chapter 3226: Chapter 3225 Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder! I","paragraphs":["[Kusanagi, Omniversal Cleaver]:: A Product made from a carefully preserved portion of a shattered Omniverse. It holds potent weavings of Existence within it and the rank of an Average Omniversal Armament forged by A Blacksmith whose weavings resonate and emanate that of an Omniverse itself. With a small input of Existential Authority, Kusanagi will release ten times the output while adding in trace amounts of Omniversal Authority. With the input of Omniversal Authority, the true form of Kusanagi can be revealed- its edge sharp enough to cleave small parts of an Omniverse. By merely holding it, your circulation, generation, and Regeneration of Existential Authority increases by 1,000%. With every Existence put to rest with Kusanagi, you will accumulate Omniversal Rage Points that can be released as an instantaneous blast of Omniversal Rage all around you. The more Points accumulated before the release, the more potent the release will be...","...!","A daring weapon!","Noah grasped it in his hands as instantly, his Atlas of Existence buzzed with activity.","Tendrils of multicolored brilliance surged from the sword and onto his hands, his Atlas of Existence that now had two Mundis of Power covered with brilliance spinning just a little bit faster.","This weapon alone and the entity who made it were both extremely distinguished as they harnessed the power of an Omniverse into an extremely small tool!","|The Omniversal Weapon, Kusanagi, has been fully analyzed. After being broken down, it is possible to mass produce Sword Type Omniversal Armaments like it from the Infinite Omniverse. Further analysis leads to the assertion that as of this moment, Omniversal Armaments can begin their design and planning for future production within the Infinite Omniverse.|","...!","Others had Omniversal Armaments, yes.","But he had a genuine Omniverse under his belt as he could even attack an enemy with the terrifying weight and breadth of this Omniverse!","It was one of his strongest possible attacks that came at a great cost, but it gave him confidence against any Apogee Autarch, and also made him surge with a challenging light against any Omniversal Realm Entities he would come to meet as enemies.","Would they be able to withstand being smashed with the breadth of the entire Infinite Omniverse?","|The first weapon under design and planning in the Infinite Omniverse is one suited to you, making it easier and less costly to release the breadth of the Infinite Omniverse onto your enemies. After analysis, the modification of Ruination into an Innate Omniversal Armament has been deemed as the most opportune sequence to handle the load of the Infinite Omniverse and your own Authority.|","The voice of the Infinite Omniverse rang out in Noah's mind as many things began to be planned the moment he first came across an Omniversal Armament.","Eudemus smiled while nodding to the three Apogee Autarchs beside him.","\"Take Protector Osmont to meet those within the newly established Equestris Protectors. After some acclimating, be ready for deployment at any time...\"","The last set of words were spoken to Noah as he rose.","The drops of rain smashed onto the chessboard and cottage atop this small mountain as the concentration of Existence became all that much more potent, but he nodded towards the Shield of the Commonwealth and followed the three Apogee Autarchs that he found were looking at the weapon he was given with a sharp light!","Within moments, they disappeared into the same white portal they came from as only an old man was left in this unique domain.","The rain that fell on him was instantly absorbed into his skin as he had a shrewd smile, his eyes radiating a piercing light as he looked where Noah had disappeared from.","\"Another one that I cannot see the future of...interesting!\"","A few words.","After they were uttered, everything faded to oblivion.","—","Within Noah's Natal Omniverse.","Inside the Wheel of Weavings where the golden sands of the Gladiators Arena were seeing even more blood.","|Unbelievable! The Omniversal Ankyra of this Omniverse is standing toe to toe with a past champion from this very same Arena! He is single handedly taking back the glory after the successive losses his compatriots faced!|","As the matches within the Gladiators Arena continued, more powerful Autarchs came out as Piety, Lilith, and Kazuhiko were among the few who were already knocked out.","But one being continued to blaze with brilliance.","Imperium.","The Omniversal Ankyra of this Omniverse!","His golden hair flowed freely in the skies as he stood opposite an Apogee Autarch, his eyes burning with golden flames.","The stronger this Omniverse became. The more Existential Terraforming that continued. The more powerful he became!","What about this was not understood?!","Behind the Imperium Autarch, multiple Autarchical Omniversal Authorities floated grandly as he echoed out coldly.","\"Come.\"","...!","Causality, space, and even time were freely distorted at an Existential level- a heavy battle blooming! —","Within the Megalos Beyond.","Standing atop an obsidian disk, Ozymandias followed the lead of the Observer of Old and Young, while the figures of a Young Light Morphon and Outerversal Morphon Tabatha who continued to spare glances towards him every now and then.","But his dazzling face was that of extreme focus as the potent power of an Outerversal Morphon coursed through him.","This whole time, he sought to quantify the power of Outerversal Morphons.","What Outerversal Authority actually signified.","He knew that an Outerversal Entity at birth held the terrifying power of an Autarch, but this was too vague and not entirely accurate.","The physiology was too different. The weavings of existence were too distinct!","As an Outerversal Morphon, he understood this unique type of power the most as after acclimating with it and thoroughly breaking it down...","|The power of an Outerversal Morphon has been quantified and broken down.|","|The basis of power of an Outerversal Morphon consists of [Megalos Regnum], and [Outerversal Physiology].|","The basis of power of these terrifying beings wading across the Megalos Beyond was broken down into two parts!","Megalos Regnum and Outerversal Physiology!","Two parts that made the power of Outerversal Morphons whole..."]},{"number":3227,"title":"Chapter 3227: Chapter 3226 Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder! II","paragraphs":["[Megalos Regnum]:: A comprehensive quantification relating to the influence, reign, and achievements within the bounds of the Megalos Beyond. It is broken into numerical levels to distinguish how far one has advanced their Megalos Regnum, and how much further they have to go until the next demarcation of Regnum.","[Outerversal Physiology]:: A comprehensive quantification closely related to the number of Delegatus a Morphon has bound, along with a relation to the influence, reign, and achievements outside the bounds of the Megalos Beyond. It is broken down into numerical levels to distinguish how far one has advanced their Outerversal Physiology, and how much further they have to go until they elevate to the next level and undergo Outerversal Evolvere.","These were the two aspects that showed the power of an Outerversal Morphon, and Noah was currently just starting out as a newly born Morphon.","His will gazed at the quantification of this strength that could be displayed in his mind whenever he wished.","[Megalos Regnum Echelon 1 (10/100)]","[Outerversal Physiology Echelon 1 (95/100)]","A visualization of where he was currently at.","Of the two sources of power that made an Outerversal Morphon, Ozymandias was much more advanced with his Outerversal Physiology- nearly reaching the next Echelon of power due to the sheer number of Delegatus he bound, along with other factors he was still getting clarification on!","The Source of power of Megalos Regnum was much lower, with him just entering the Megalos Beyond as he didn't truly have any sort of reign or influence.","The only reason for the increased value of 10 was due to how events had unfolded with Outerversal Morphon Phulax and Tabatha- with him gaining their favor as they looked at what he was able to do as a Sign.","But, he now quantified and clearly knew the distinction of power of Outerversal Morphons. He now knew how to elevate it.","All that was left was for him to do what he did best- ascend past these levels of power with speed that would make others question their own Existence!","\"We are here. And we luckily did not have any unforeseen forces stop us along the way.\"","Up front, the voice of Outerversal Morphon Phulax echoed out as the obsidian disk they were on that was rapidly distorting space slowed down, eventually coming to a stop near an area that shone with a distinct brilliance","Unlike the stellar obsidian hue covering the vast stretches of the Megalos Beyond, the area ahead of them had a translucent crimson barrier stretching out in all directions.","The barrier felt impenetrable even by the strongest Outerversal Morphon, or at the very least- Ozymandias felt that his current self could not pierce through this barrier freely if he wished!","Nothing could be seen beyond it, but the moment they came near, The Observer of Old and Young radiated his aura outwards.","An instant later, a portion of the barrier fluctuated as a circular singularity bloomed into an opening, and a titanic figure of an Entity with an elongated body and a stellar obsidian crimson head sticking out at the very top appeared.","On the head, no facial characteristics apart from two eyes that blazed with white light could be seen, this elongated being showing two limbs that closely resembled arms, with their lower body extending out and almost melding with the glory of the Megalos Beyond around them.","On one of the limbs resembling a hand, this Entity grasped a glowing crystal ball that seemed to be swirling with unfathomable waves of Existence within.","Their weavings came out in the form of an intent.","|O Great Phulax, this is a most welcomed surprise. Please, come in...|","The Observer of Old and Young seemed to hold a great status as they were invited into the opening of the stellar crimson translucent barrier.","Phulax gave a light nod as the disk they were on moved once more, with Ozymandias gazing at everything with sharp eyes as it was all under observation and analysis.","He had quantified and broken down the power of Outerversal Morphons into two aspects as he knew them about himself.","But now, he was analyzing and seeking to break down this quantification for the Outerversal Morphons around him!","Outerversal Morphon Phulax and Tabatha were far too powerful for him to get an accurate grasp, but the Young Light Morphon behind him was already nearing the last stages of analysis as he would see her progression within the first Echelon of Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum soon enough.","And now, they arrived at a place where even more samples revealed themselves for him!","He was bound to greatly increase his knowledge of Outerversal Morphons and the Megalos Beyond as after passing through the translucent crimson barrier, it felt like a brand new reality unfolded before his eyes.","|We welcome you back to Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder, O Great Phulax.|","HUUM!","Waves of radiance unfolded.","The translucent barrier behind them closed as ahead, the fantastical brilliance of massive stellar crimson Pillars floating in space could be seen stretching out for light years.","Actually, even this was false as they weren't simply floating, with Ozymandias noticing a small incremental movement of these massive Pillars that seemed to be following the pull of an endlessly humongous organ that held many openings!","On top of the rotating Pillars, the aura of Outerversal Morphons similar to the one who had invited them in could be felt.","Each shone with differing stellar hues for their bodies, with their round heads only burning with two singularities for eyes as many of them turned towards their newly arriving figures.","But what was more astonishing was that Ozymandias could feel even more auras of Outerversal Morphons within the depths of the obsidian crimson organ surrounded by these massive Pillars of brilliance.","They had arrived in Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder!","|Please, if you will follow me into the Heart of Misery. The Lady has heard of your arrival and welcomes you in.|","Into the Heart of Misery.","With steady steps, Ozymandias plunged into a Domain he knew very little about as a fantastical new reality unfolded around him!"]},{"number":3228,"title":"Chapter 3228: Chapter 3227 Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder! III","paragraphs":["Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder.","Inside the Heart of Misery.","In an area that shone with a radiant crimson brilliance, with the surroundings feeling like the interior of a pulsating artery or vein of something that was alive and well.","The lining of the surroundings was sleek and oddly slippery, but there was one central area that had budding rose petals on the floor. On these budding rose petals, two unique Outerversal Morphons could be seen.","The skin of the larger one shone with a deep stellar crimson hue as if she were carved from another part of the Megalos Beyond, her form being a cluster of pulsing tentacles that formed into two masses of circles connected by a singularity in between, while the skin of the smaller one shone with the exact glow of the obsidian stellar brilliance of the Megalos Beyond as she at times would nearly meld with the surroundings.","It was only due to the two blinding white singularities that represented her eyes on her head that one could make out her outline.","She held limbs and a form leaning more towards humanoid in nature, much of it covered with an obsidian garment as nothing within could be seen. But there were two tentacles sprouting from the top of her head and cascading past her shoulders that gave her a unique distinction.","The older entity spoke out with her intent as in her own way, she seemed to be gazing at the younger Outerversal Morphon with care.","|Out of all those born across the past cycles, you have the greatest purity and likeness to the Great Beyonder. Your purpose. Your weavings. The connection of your Physiology to the Megalos Beyond itself...all of it points to a greater purpose that I have been telling you to be ready for this whole time.|","The older voice spoke out with care.","And the Outerversal Morphon with the likeness of a humanoid form blinked with her singularities while nodding respectfully.","|Yes, Great Mother.|","The singularities lit up her face as even though she held no nose or mouth, her beauty was unfathomable to one's eyes.","|Mmm, that time may be coming. Whispers of a Sign have begun to spread as along with them...the Observer of Old and Young is making his way here. There are no coincidences. Watch carefully, and if you feel anything, let me know, O Aspasia.|","Aspasia.","This unique entity nodded her head as moments later, an area far ahead of them twisted before an opening was made on the sleek surface- the smooth muscular lining retracting as the figures of Outerversal Morphon Phulax, Tabatha, a Young Light Morphon, and Ozymandias made their entry while led by a native Outerversal Morphon of this Grave of the Great Beyonder!","As soon as he did his task of bringing them where they should be, this Morphon bowed while leaving. The Observer of Old and Young went forward freely with his hands behind his back, still in the form of an old man as he nodded towards the older Outerversal Morphon who took on the form of two circles connected by a singularity- almost adopting an infinity symbol!","\"It has been some time, Great Mother.\" As he spoke, Phulax gave a quizzical gaze towards the visage of Aspasia beside this being.","|Far too long, Great Phulax. What brings you to our little Abode?|","What could make the Great Phulax move? Was it as she expected? Was it due to...","\"I moved because of whispers. Because of the appearance of the one who can bind Existence instantly the moment they begin Alieia.\"","WAA!","Words that caused the Great Mother to tremble were uttered out as her tentacles expanded and contracted, a fervent light flashing on her as she asked.","|These whispers...have you seen the one in question yourself? Do you know where-|","...!","Her intent came to a stop as the Observer of Old and Young raised his hand and pointed towards the brilliant stellar visage of Ozymandias.","\"I've brought the one in question to you. I figured the devout followers of the Great Beyonder may be able to confirm things and shed some clarity more than anyone else.\"","|...|","The Great Mother was covered with a grander fervent light as she instantly warped to appear before Ozymandias.","His stellar brilliance.","The purple blue radiance on some parts of his skin, the crimson black stellar hue on others. His white singularities for eyes. The more she looked at him, the more mysterious he seemed as even with the profound pressure the Great Mother emanated, the singularities of this being didn't even flicker!","There wasn't even an ounce of fear.","'Could it truly be?'","Her many tentacles pulsed.","|Hello, Young One. Can you...show me?|","She voiced out towards Ozymandias.","Ozymandias who looked at this being and all the other Outerversal Morphon he came across as he continued to compile more data and information that would soon make an omniversal quantification of power more complete!","He could feel her expectations.","Her belief on something she had held onto for who knew how many cycles.","He had no problem playing on this misunderstanding!","With a light nod, his white singularities blinked and closed momentarily as behind him, nine Halos of tentacles flashed and began to swirl.","Within their very center...hundreds of threads of tentacles began to form.","Tentacles turned into fine threads as to the ever increasing shock of those watching, Ozymandias cast these hundreds of threads behind him- these threads crossing the sleek surface below them as if it didn't even exist and stretched down far towards the Megalos Beyond!","It was an astonishing scene as commonly, a single 'fishing line' would be cast before an Outerversal Morphon bound a Delegatus- with some even failing, while most took a long span of time.","But Ozymandias released hundreds of fine tentacles all at once.","And not even a moment after they were cast...","HUUUM!","They began to glow with a glorious purple blue glow one after another- night simultaneously as of the few hundred strings, not a single one was dull!","|Ah...!!!|","The visage of the Great Mother stumbled backwards in utter shock and elation!"]},{"number":3229,"title":"Chapter 3229: Chapter 3228 Odessos, the Grave of the Great Beyonder! IV","paragraphs":["The Observer of Old and Young became even more stern while Outerversal Morphon Tabatha began to whisper under her breath.","|The Sign...!|","Simultaneous casting and binding of Existence. No Outerversal Morphon could do this as when one who could do it appeared...the Great Beyonder had left behind many terrifying words when such a Sign came!","Amidst the shock of others, Ozymandias didn't stop.","Hundreds more tentacles formed into fine lines that were cast across the Megalos Beyond and straight towards his Infinite Omniverse, more and more Enders of Existence becoming bound to him even further as Delegatus!","He didn't stop because he could see the visible progress of his Outerversal Physiology.","At this moment, the process was tremendously close to elevating to the next Echelon!","It was...","[Outerversal Physiology Echelon 1 (99/100)]","...!","It was almost there.","HUUM!","The glow of purple blue brilliance only intensified from him as the Great Mother stumbled back with even greater elation at the scene, her tentacles pulsing and beginning to radiate crazed laughter!","|Haha! After all this time! After all those cycles! O Great Beyonder! Are you watching this?!|","Her words radiated ancient frustration and longing, with Ozymandias shining with even grander brilliance before her as within moments, thousands of lines were cast down as they glowed with glory. Until...","BOOM!","The space above Ozymandias cracked.","From the crack, the weavings of the Megalos Beyond could be seen as their stellar obsidian brilliance turned into a malleable river at this moment.","\"No way...\" Outerversal Morphon Tabatha cursed under her breath at the scene.","\"He was just born!\"","She screamed out the stern reality in shock as this being that was just born...was actually undergoing his first Outerversal Sanctification.","|Your Outerversal Physiology has reached the maximum value and is currently undergoing an evolution of its Echelon.|","|The resource for the evolution of one's Echelon seems to be the weavings of the Megalos Beyond themselves.|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has increased by +2.|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has increased by +3...|","Many prompts flashed within the mind of Ozymandias as above him, it felt like the Megalos Beyond itself was filling up his existence as if it were a vessel.","The rivers of liquefied Megalos Beyond acted like a catalyst- like a fuel that burned and elevated the very physiology and authority of the Outerversal Morphon that was Ozymandias!","His body was compressed to become more compact, and at the same time, he knew that the maximum size he could take was increasing rapidly.","What he could do as an Outerversal Morphon was being expanded!","A large part of the obsidian stellar brilliance cascading into him flowed towards the center of his chest, something heavy blooming in such a place.","Akin to an engine being born.","His form became even more regal as after the Sanctification by the weavings of rivers of Megalos Beyond, his skin now fully carried a stellar obsidian tint, his white singularities being the only thing contrasting this brilliant darkness.","By the time he blinked, the details of his Physiology had changed in his mind.","[Outerversal Physiology Echelon 2 (1/10,000)]---[Outerversal Organs]","|Your Outerversal Physiology has attained a budding Outerversal Heart. With it, you begin to generate tremendous levels of pure Outerversal Authority that course across your existence, and the excess forms an Innate Outerversal Veil that masks and defends you against your enemies. The stronger your Outerversal Physiology becomes, the more Outerversal Organs will be formed, and the stronger already existing Outerversal Organs become.|","...!","An elevation of an Echelon in terms of his Outerversal Physiology.","Due to elevation, he naturally unlocked the feature of Outerversal Organs as the level of power he wielded was steadily rising!","And this was only the beginning.","He had yet to bind the Infinite Omniverse as he was only waiting for all calculations to show absolutely no chance of errors or possible mistakes before he proceeded with it.","The only setback was the value needed before the next Echelon of Outerversal Physiology could elevate.","10,000.","Reaching the cap of 100 of the first Echelon had taken tens of thousands of bound Delegatus, and he Innately sensed that accumulating this value the higher up he went would be more arduous, with the contribution of Delegatus aiding to its increase slowly reducing the higher up it went.","But he wasn't too worried about this.","There were quintillions of beings in his Infinite Omniverse. By the time he bound all of them, just where would he be in terms of his Physiology?","|Astonishing...|","As his transformation came to an end, the Great Mother came close to him as a dozen tentacles erupted from her that came inches away from his skin, but never fully touching him as if she didn't dare to.","In the distance, The Observer of Old and Young raised his brows as he voiced out calmly.","\"Well, is he truly the Sign? And can it be inferred that he is the instrument of the final destruction or expansion of the Megalos Beyond?\"","...!","His words poured cold water over the austere surroundings as the Great Mother's tentacles became stern.","She looked with dissatisfaction towards Outerversal Morphon Phulax before she voiced out.","|The Words the Great Beyonder left before disappearing were many, and they all favored expansion and never before seen brilliance of the Megalos Beyond. And he...is undoubtedly the Sign that was promised all those cycles ago. As for whether he is the Instrument itself...|","The Great Mother stopped.","Her tentacles turned behind her, on the crimson red petals at the center of this Domain where a humanoid Outerversal Morphon with magisterial beauty had remained silent and calm this whole time.","|Little Aspasia here will be able to confirm for us. She holds the purest form of inheritance of the Great Beyonder, and carries their will inside her body. She will be able to confi-|","BOOOM!","An immeasurably heavy explosion carried by intense vibrations echoed out.","The gaze of the Great Mother became stern while the Observer of Old and Young sighed.","Moments later, the smooth muscular linings of this Domain once more opened as the Outerversal Morphon who had let the party of Ozymandias here came in and spoke with a bow!","|Great Mother, a few Heretical Morphons have gathered outside Beyonder's Boundary. They seek forceful entry to confirm whether we know anything regarding the Sign.|","...!","There were those who believed in the words of the Great Beyonder with hope and valor.","And there were those who believed in them...but they were not filled with hope.","Based on what was at stake, they interpreted the words of the Beyonder in a different way.","The instrument that would bring destruction or expansion...they could erase it before it began budding as this would keep the state of the Megalos Beyond as it was!","The followers of the Great Beyonder referred to them as the Heretical Morphons..."]},{"number":3230,"title":"Chapter 3230: Chapter 3229 A Following!","paragraphs":["|Heretical Morphons...|","The Great Mother released her intent with a hum as one could Innately feel like her tentacles forming the body of an Infinity symbol were smiling on all angles.","Ever since Ozymandias ascertained the weavings of the Sign, her entire demeanor had changed as a reverential look of utmost belief took over her entire existence.","|Haha, any efforts they make will be obsolete. Once the Sign appears, everything that comes after cannot be stopped. The future that the Great Beyonder painted...will undoubtedly unfold in a glorious direction.|","...!","She spoke with such confidence and valor that the Outerversal Morphon who was acting as the messenger paused and blinked before he continued.","|But Great Mother...dozens of Heretical Morphons have already gathered. Some of them with the Distinctions of [Great] just like you. They...|","|They will struggle endlessly, but what is meant to pass...| The Great Mother spoke reverentially as tendrils left her body to caress the obsidian radiance radiating from Ozymandias.","|Child...there are many things that are coming. If I can give you any advice- it is that you must trust yourself absolutely. You should still be forming your purpose as you are told that you are a Sign, and even possibly the Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of. Can you humor an old thing like me and trust in the possibility of this? Can you shed light on who you are?|","She asked earnestly.","Ozymandias looked at this Entity who seemed to have found something she had been looking for all her life, sighing internally as he knew that he wasn't some promised chosen or instrument.","But it seemed...his path of power could be streamlined if he took on this identity!","After all, part of the power of an Outerversal Morphon was the Megalos Regnum.","The influence and achievements within the Megalos Beyond.","If he rose to become some grand instrument that terrifying Entities looked for or feared...this would naturally aid in his influence and achievements!","So he looked at the Great Mother and spoke out calmly with his intent. |I am Ozymandias, and my purpose is the Megalos Beyond itself. In this, I have no doubt.|","...!","Simple words. And yet...","|Ah...| The Great Mother vibrated with euphoria as her intent echoed out.","His purpose was the Megalos Beyond itself. Did this not conform with the Instrument that would expand the Megalos Beyond in a way nobody could even imagine?!","The weavings of the Great Mother became even more potent as she began to direct things commandingly.","|Little Aspasia, we will leave you to ascertain with surety the distinction of Ozymandias. Since he is for sure the Sign, from this day forth, he shall be distinguished as the Dream of the Beyonder- the Young Master of the Grave of the Great Beyonder!|","BOOM!","A grandiose distinction.","The moment it came, Noah's body radiated with obsidian luminescence as many prompts arose!","|You have gained the distinction of the Dream of the Beyonder.|","|Your influence within a concentrated area of the Megalos Beyond has risen greatly.|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has increased by +80...|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has increased by +200...|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has increased by +950...|","|The Value of your Megalos Regnum has exceeded the limits of the first Echelon.|","Limitations were broken.","Above, space was cut open once more as incandescent rivers of the Megalos Beyond gushed onto Ozymandias.","[Megalos Regnum Echelon 2 (2,360/10,000)]---[Megalos Willpower]","He stepped on another Echelon as something new was unlocked!","Before he could look over it, the Great Mother spoke once more as one could see her silent smile as the brighter waves of incandescence around Ozymandias.","|Mmm, Great Phulax, will you come with me to stretch your muscles a little? I assume you will want to continue observing the growth of the Dream of the Beyonder. Whether he is truly what I wholly believe he is, or the impossible chance that I am wrong.|","Off to the side, the powerful Observer of Old and Young shook his head with a sigh as he took a step and disappeared, only leaving behind his voice as he pulled Outerversal Morphon Tabatha along.","\"Let us go, I can already sense some old friends who shouldn't have been all that riled up about this.\"","The Great Phulax went out first.","The Great Mother beamed at this scene as her tentacles nodded towards the graceful and impeccable visage of Aspasia behind them.","|I leave it to you, Little Aspasia. Channel everything you feel with your existence, and see if we can get your affirmation regarding Young Master Ozymandias as well.|","HUUM!","With a flicker of obsidian brilliance, she also disappeared along with the Outerversal Morphon that brought over the news.","Inside this Domain where the linings pulsed as if they were inside a living organ, only Ozymandias, the Young Light Morphon, and Aspasia were left behind.","The Young Light Morphon looked at the unfolding scene with great curiosity as I'm the next moment, the silent Aspasia began floating with her astonishing figure that seemed full of mysteries and grandeur towards Ozymandias.","|Hello.|","Her intent was akin to a fresh breeze.","Ozymandias gazed at the similar white singularities that were her eyes as he replied.","|Hello.|","A single word of exchange as soon enough, Aspasia was floating beside him, her obsidian garment that covered her stellar visage radiating a terrifying authority that seemed connected with the Megalos Beyond itself as she uttered out calmly.","|With your permission, I must connect with your Outerversal and Megalos Weavings fully...|","...!","As she spoke, her obsidian robe unclasped and revealed an astonishing figure of stellar brilliance underneath, Ozymandias raising his brows as the two tentacles stemming off of her head and past her shoulders moved like limbs towards him.","Her blessed chest and curved waist were the least of things to focus on in front of these dazzling tentacles.","Off to the side, the Light Morphon was ever so curious as she observed this unfolding scene!"]},{"number":3231,"title":"Chapter 3231: Chapter 3230 Echelons! I","paragraphs":["Away from the Megalos Beyond.","Within the Infinite Omniverse.","In front of Noah's humanoid figure near the multicolored throne, dazzling blue and gold prompts were flashing as he achieved a full quantification that covered the new knowledge gained from the Megalos Beyond.","|The levels of power of all Existences under the scope of the stretches of Omniverses have been quantified into an ever evolving scale.|","|Existential Authority is broken into the quantification under the umbrella of a System of Existence.|","|The quantification of the Weaver of Extremity is as follows.|","[Atlas of Existence Echelon 1 (8,385/10,000)]---[Laborer]","[Conceptual System of Existence Echelon 3 (650,234/1,000,000)]---[Dominium Organs]---[Omniversal Control]","[Outerversal Descent System of Existence Echelon 1 (43/5,000)]","His Atlas of Existence remained the firmest foundation, its values somewhat unique compared to others as the many systems of Existence he had incorporated fell under it.","It had its own Echelon.","But its strength and values rose in large part due to his Conceptual System of Existence- with his terrifying Extremes that were all rising towards the Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority stage or climbing up Phases of Ascendancy!","The ever expanding Infinite Omniverse and the Authorities it bound.","The ever radiant Quintessence and Infinity.","All of it had a part to play as when the values of the Conceptual System of Existence and the Outerversal Descent System of Existence increased, so would the status of his Atlas of Existence.","For Outerversal Descent, he had only established the initial connection as Noah could feel the Outerversal Authority of Ozymandias, but he didn't allow the full effects to course through the connection just yet!","Looking at the small Value under Outerversal Descent, the time seemed as ripe as any to see what power Delegatus were afforded after they agreed to be bound by Outerversal Morphons.","So Noah closed his eyes.","He felt the purple blue radiance of the unbreakable connection between him and Ozymandias. He felt the advancements Ozymandias had made, as well as the vast seas of Outerversal Authorities he held in his reserves.","And he then spoke calmly.","\"Let it flow.\"","HUUM!","From the Weavings of Ozymandias who was in the depths of the Grave of the Great Beyonder.","Stellar obsidian authority was focused on a singular line and directed to flow across it with freedom and fervor.","It didn't take the passage of an instant before a change could be seen above Noah within the Infinite Omniverse- his body becoming shrouded with gorgeous stellar radiance.","|Your status as a Delegatus of Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias is increasing.]","|The Value of your Outerversal Descent System of Existence has increased by +140...|","|The Value of your Outerversal Descent System of Existence has increased by +200...|","Ever so steadily, the different parts that contributed to Noah's power rose higher.","The Outerversal Authority coiled in his Second Mundi of Power within his Atlas of Existence, the Authority of the Laborer becoming more potent in response.","Alongside it...","|The Synchronization of entirely different Weavings of Existence of Noah Osmont and Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias has begun.|","|Two parts of a single whole, your Records, Influence, and Achievements will slowly assimilate to ensure stability in a field unventured by others.|","|The Value of your Conceptual System of Existence has increased by +300...|","|The Value of your Atlas of Existence has increased by +85...|","As the weavings of Outerversal Authority came down, Noah felt many parts of himself affected- with this even including some Extremity Authorities within his Conceptual System of Existence that held some inclination towards the weavings and Physiology of Outerversal Morphons!","Something like...the simple weavings of a Terror from a distant past Universe.","|The Existential Extremity Authority of Cthulhu has attained the distinction of Ascendancy. |","|The Existential Extremity Authority of Reality has attained the distinction of Ascendancy. |","|The Existential Extremity Authority of Dimensions has attained the distinction of Ascendancy. |","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Relativity has stepped onto the Third Phase of Ascendancy!|","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Entropy has stepped onto the Third Phase of Ascendancy!|","|The Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities of Manadynamics, The Protagonist, Tyranny, and....have stepped onto the Third Phase of Ascendancy!|","Multiple weavings of Authorities under him advanced as he fully accepted the Outerversal Authority from his other self.","\"The Megalos Beyond...the vast Omniverses...the Wheel of Existence...\"","His voice echoed out grandly as he opened his eyes.","His hands reached up to nothingness, and yet he felt like there was something he could grasp right there!","\"Just how can I get my hands completely around you all...?\"","WAA!","The Megalos Beyond! The Myriad of Omniverses! The Wheel of Existence!","The Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor dared to wonder how he could take all of this for himself!","His Invictus Dominium Wings spread out with colorless brilliance as the Halo spinning above him made him look ethereal.","Like he knew exactly where he was going, and yet lost at the same time.","\"Would I be able to rest after that? Will there be nobody who could threaten my safety or the safety of my people?\"","...!","If he rose across the Echelons he just quantified.","If he took the identity of an Instrument he had nothing to do within the Megalos Beyond.","If he took the identity of a Protector of the Omniverses under the Commonwealth and dismantled this behemoth entirely.","Would he reach a point where he could sit back and not worry?","Not feeling like an ant in a small box as a huge foot hung above, and it could crush everything he worked for any time it wished, and he had no power to stop it?","\"...\"","He didn't know.","His hand came down as his figure continued to be bathed with waves of stellar obsidian radiance.","Beside him, the visage of the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse came forward, her multicolored hands formed from threads of countless Authorities taking Noah's downcast hand as her intent weaved out.","|Whatever is to come, I will always be right beside you, Master.|","...!","The unflinching and absolute loyalty of the connection established from a small blue planet.","Noah gazed down from whatever distant thing he couldn't see as he looked at the Manifestation of the Infinite Omniverse...and let out a content smile!"]},{"number":3232,"title":"Chapter 3232: Chapter 3231 Echelons! II","paragraphs":["From the brilliant Infinite Omniverse.","Within the Omniverse of the Protectors.","After crossing the rainy isolated domain where the Shield of the Commonwealth resided, Noah's traversal across the portal let him him into a far bigger domain.","A Domain with endless blue skies and verdant grasslands that extended all around for light years, with the concentration of Existence being extremely profound as a single thing stood in the midst of all this while surrounded by floating vessels filled with powerful auras.","A tower.","Stretching out towards the skies and shining with white and green brilliance, it seemed to be a few light years in stature!","\"The Obelisk of the Protectors.\"","Beside him, the voice of one of the two Autarchical Existences rang out.","Turning to gaze at them, Noah's piercing eyes finally made a breakthrough in analysis after this whole time as...","[Protector Rigalis]","[Unknown System of Existence Echelon 3 (755,835/1,000,000)]---[@&%^#]---[@&#^#]","The Apogee Autarch that had spoken beside him had such an array of quantifications rise up above him only for Noah to see, the other Protector beside him showing similar values as Noah became more adept at analyzing and grasping the weavings of those around him.","If they weren't too far advanced that is!","The two Protectors beside him introduced the massive tower ahead of them as they walked on a white path constructed from crystals pulsing with existence, the serene reality of undulating verdant landscapes all around them passing by.","The focus was only on the pristine white and green tower rising up to the skies.","\"This is the Obelisk of the Protectors. A living, breathing, construct with 1,000 Floors that are filled with Miniature Existential Domains. There are 1,000,000 Restaurants stretched throughout some lower and upper floors, entire Miniature Existential Domains dedicated to various professions of Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Formations, Runeworkings, and more. An Existential Library with Records of all known Omniverses and Odditties, an Arena where you can sign up for friendly matches with other Protectors, Lounges, and Amusement Areas to rest your Existence and partake on the various Nectars of Existence from the myriad Omniverses...\"","...!","Noah whistled at the number of things being introduced within this single massive tower, the Protector introducing it seeming to take great pride as they neared one of its many entrances in a few steps!","Powerful auras of Entities at the Teracosm, Paracosm, and Autarchical Stage moved in the surroundings busily, some going towards the vessels floating in the skies as others left the Vessels to enter the Obelisk of the Protectors.","A majority of the entities seen were Royal Existential Omniversal Simians, with others ranging in terms of races and forms as the next in line were those with pure human forms.","But undoubtedly, any weaker Entities or even weaker Autarchs all bowed their heads respectfully whenever an Apogee Autarch appeared or passed by- such a being bearing the distinction of a Protector!","As they neared the Obelisk, an entrance that was a massive pulsing white portal stretching out for over a thousand miles stood before them.","\"In addition to all that, the Obelisk of the Protectors is also equipped with Suites for lodging clustered in the Miniature Existential Domains in the middle and top floors.\"","\"You can use this card to lead you towards your own designated personal Miniature Existential Domain that nobody else has access to and other unrestricted areas inside the Obelisk, and this one will take you directly to the Miniature Existential Domain where your team is currently stationed.\"","One purple card and one gold card were given to him, Noah nodding with a smile as he went towards the massive tower shining with verdant and white brilliance.","\"Thanks for the tour.\" He waved his hands towards the two Protectors behind him as his body buzzed and split into two, one taking the purple card and the other taking the gold card as they both disappeared into the blinding white portal.","The two Protectors looked at each other and shook their heads at this eccentric new addition to their forces as the one who had been speaking this whole time continued.","\"I give him a week. Paired with those guys and the possible ability to sniff out Agents of Anti-Life...a lot of unknowns will be gunning for him.\"","...!","A heavy prediction.","The other Simian only smiled and shook his head as he took a golden card of his own and disappeared into the Obelisk of the Protectors!","—","Inside the Obelisk of the Protectors.","There were many Miniature Existential Domains connected all around it, but one could only go where they were given access to!","Noah's body, holding a golden card, was wrapped up in a light of teleportation that took him to a specific Miniature Existential Domain that would hold the team of Protectors he was to work with- the Equestris Protectors.","His other body went to see what intricacies this Obelisk of the Protectors held- one of its first stops being the aforementioned Existential Library.","Holding the gold card that pulsed with a unique signature of Existence, Noah warped inside of a Miniature Existential Domain that seemed to be among many overlapping networks of Domains within the Obelisk, the new space unfolding before his eyes with wonder.","All around, sparkling white dwarf stars rotated in the skies above and below. At the center of this space, multiple auras honed in on Noah the moment he arrived.","All of these auras were anchored around thrones with gorgeous purple-gold galaxies rotating below them, and they were currently surrounding a massive illusory image of an Outerversal Morphon along with lines of words that talked about its weaknesses, strengths, and abilities!","They seemed to be in the middle of a meeting as the auras were five in number, four blazing with a similar brilliance while the fifth...seemed like an object everything gravitated against.","Hair dazzling red. Adorned in a multicolored robe that shone with the same brilliance of an Omniversal Armament like the Sword that Noah currently held in his hands.","Fair skin that pulsed with life and valor, it was an Entity at the Omniversal Stage who turned towards Noah's direction among many others, her voice echoing out at this moment.","\"The newest member of this little group that Old Man Eudemus mentioned has arrived early. Osmont, is it? Come on over, and let's have an introduction.\"","...!"]},{"number":3233,"title":"Chapter 3233: Chapter 3232 Echelons! III","paragraphs":["Her voice radiated undeniable waves of power as just from looking at her from a distance, her weavings barely made themselves clear!","[Protector @&$^%]","[Unknown System of Existence Echelon 5 (1,355,675/100,000,000)]---[@&%^#]---[@&#^#]---[@&#^$]---[@#$%]","...!","Someone multiple Echelons of power higher than most others.","Outside the scope of the Existential Dominium Realm, she resided in the Omniversal Realm!","Noah floated past the compressed background of stellar bodies and galaxies as he went towards the central area of this Miniature Existential Domain.","He came near the thrones where the five Protectors were as apart from the Omniversal Entity, there was one other woman who seemed extremely similar to her, and three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians with elegant or burly figures!","\"Haha, this is the newbie involved in the recent accident of a Morphon being forced by him to actually appear in the presence of one of the bodies of the Viceroy? Records of him do not do his presence justice!\"","Records?","Noah raised his brows at a burly Simian who sat lazily on a throne with an interested expression.","Seeing his gaze, this Simian smiled while waving his hands to show an illusory screen that played a grandiose video.","The video depicted the fantastical visage of the Viceroy pressing down an interminable wheel that ground down an Outerversal Morphon while saving the lives of his people in the Gladiators Arena of the newest discovered Omniverse!","\"This is who we are fighting against.\"","...!","The voice of the Viceroy Noah very distinctly remembered played out once more.","\"We do what we do day in and day out to ensure that Existence is protected. That life is protected. The glory of the Commonwealth will continue to spread to all corners of known and unknown Omniverses as we ensure that none will fall to our enemies!\"","WAA!","The scenes of what occurred not too long ago were displayed on the screen, along with the figures of rising audience members who raised their hands towards the Viceroy.","Ever so briefly, Noah's figure was shown for a fraction of a second as the one who uncovered the identity of this Agent of Anti-Life before the voice of the Viceroy thundered out again.","\"Long live the Commonwealth!\"","...!","An explosion of magisterial brilliance finished off the video before its illusory screen flickered out of existence, the Simian who had conjured it speaking out.","\"This Record has already been spread to all the stretches of the Commonwealth. You've made it in one of the disseminated videos of our dear great leader even before becoming a Protector- a rite of passage!\"","\"...\"","A record of propaganda.","Noah didn't even get a chance to reply before the aura of the Omniversal Entity blazed.","\"Enough of that. Osmont, this lazy thing that can't read the room is Protector Actaeon, and this is Protector Orpheus and Protector Ajax.\"","The three powerful Royal Simians who seemed to be on the cusp of breaking their shackles and entering the Omniversal Realm nodded towards Noah.","The Omniversal Entity then pointed to herself and the other woman who looked just like her on the nearby throne- a woman who was sitting on her throne while dangling her legs in the air freely as she had the same red hair on her head and was adorned in a simple white battle robe!","\"To my left is Protector Lucretia, and I am the Command Protector of the Equestris Protectors- Protector Valeria.\"","...!","Command Protector Valeria.","The woman emanated profound beauty and valor as she stared without blinking at Noah after she introduced everyone.","Noah smiled as he spoke out in turn.","\"Protector Osmont. I'm here to learn and observe exactly what it is we fight against.\"","\"Mmm, Osmont eh?\" With her legs still dangling in the air freely, Protector Lucretia twisted her body slightly to look at Noah as she continued.","As he spoke, he looked at the massive illusory display of an Outerversal Morphon that looked like an octahedron that shot out endless tentacles towards a group of Protectors in a Domain where existence looked decimated and destroyed.","\"Mmm, Osmont eh?\" With her legs still dangling in the air freely, Protector Lucretia twisted her body slightly to look at Noah as she continued.","\"I heard you are able to sniff out Agents of Anti-Life. How exactly do you do this? Do you just sniff them out or does there need to be a fight?\"","She seemed to hold immeasurable curiosity as her red eyes and hair shone with a stellar brilliance.","Noah looked at her with sharp eyes as he smiled while walking towards an empty throne already put in place amidst these powerful entities.","\"My authority has to come in contact with their Existence.\"","\"Oh...\" Hearing this, the curiosity and interest in the eyes of Protector Lucretia faded, her gaze going back to the image of the Outerversal Morphon portrayed above them.","Command Protector Valeria gave her a side eye as she gazed towards Noah and spoke out.","\"Don't pay too much heed to her wither and simply focus on your assigned tasks. Having just come from a newly discovered Omniverse, you likely do not know much about what Protectors truly do across the Omniverses. Such information will be critical in understanding before we set off for our next Incursion.\"","As she spoke, she waved her hands to minimize the image of the Outerversal Morphon and added a terrifying Worm of Existence beside it.","\"Outerversal Morphon and Worms of Existence. We designate the former as Anti-Life and the latter as Anti-Existence- with these two forces...having decimated or occupied more Omniverses than those that the Commonwealth has discovered and brought under their protection.\"","BOOM!","Heavy information echoed out that caused Noah's eyes to constrict.","He didn't know their reach was so extensive.","The other part of himself had just arrived in the Megalos Beyond as he didn't discover the structure and weavings of how these terrifying Morphons worked fully!","With a stern gaze, Command Protector Valeria continued by declassifying important information and sharing it with the new Protector freely.","\"We are on the side of life. On the side of Existence. The Worms of Existence...I truly hate this name for them as their existence is Anti-Existence, with the Omniverses they have devoured becoming Nests filled with Weavings of Anti-Matter.\"","\"Then, there are the Outerversal Morphons. The Omniverses they conquer and transform are made into domains of Dark Matter!\"","...!","Anti-Matter! Dark Matter!"]},{"number":3234,"title":"Chapter 3234: Chapter 3233 Matter! I","paragraphs":["The Worms of Existence- or truly, Worms of Anti-Existence, decimate and devour Omniverses as eventually, they turn into Nests full onto Anti-Matter.","Meanwhile, Outerversal Morphons transform Omniverses into domains filled with Dark Matter!","Was this what the Megalos Beyond was made of?","Immense and endless weavings of Dark Matter? Noah's Existence churned as it felt like countless networks were connecting as many pieces came together!","In front of him, the stellar crimson hair of Command Protector Valeria radiated continued wonder as the illusory scene above them showed the Outerversal Morphon and Worm of Anti-Existence disappearing.","In their place, two singularities could be seen- one white, and one black.","\"Let's take a step back and go towards the Origin of all things. What happens when Matter and Anti-Matter meet?\"","The singularities of black and white gravitated around each other, a heavy pull sucking one towards the other as when they came in contact...","BOOM!","\"Whenever Matter and Anti-Matter meet, there is a complete annihilation of both types- with their masses all being converted to energy- into photons\"","...!","A scatter of light was all that could be seen.","\"Some theorists of the Commonwealth call this Rationality, Continuum, Pertinency, or Relativity. The idea is that all forms of early energy were equal to mass and the product of the speed of light on that set domain. Thus, whenever Matter and Anti-Matter meet, their mass annihilates each other, as all that is left are photons. Just...light and nothing else. Endless eons of light. Endless cycles of light.\"","In between their thrones, the two singularities of Matter and Anti-Matter exploded into incandescent brilliance of light.","At this moment, even the visage of Protector Lucretia who was dangling her legs seeking to portray her boredom couldn't help but focus with interest.","And Command Protector Valeria continued without batting an eye as above them, countless white and black singularities bloomed.","\"Earliest theories state that there is no matter without anti-matter. That for countless eons, particles of Matter and Anti-Matter constantly clashed and annihilated each other. There was only the mixture of Matter and Anti-Matter destroying each other and birthing an endless existence of only photons. Only light. But then....something happened. Out of trillions of computations and clashes of Matter and Anti-Matter, a particle of Matter...did not find a counterpart Anti-Matter. It did not turn into pure energy.\"","HUUM!","Countless white and black singularities clashed and disappeared into light.","And yet...one white particle remained floating- no counterpart to smash into it!","\"Matter that did not turn into pure energy like all the endless cycles of transformations before it. It...acted like a spark. It was a change. This single particle of Matter...is theorized to make all of this.\"","Command Protector Valeria waved her hands around her surroundings.","All of it.","Everything around them.","All the Omniverses.","All of them.","From a single particle of matter!","Her face was illustrious as if she had peered into the secrets of Existence and was revealing them freely.","\"Of course, if there was a single particle of Matter that wasn't able to find a counterpart Anti-Matter, then it means there was a lone particle of Anti-Matter out there. Anti-Matter that could have given birth to who knows what. This...is who we refer to as Worms of Existence. Worms of Anti-Existence. Entities that nullify most of the weavings of Existence from us- from our Matter.\"","\"Entities that make us work extra hard to manipulate our own weavings of Existence to ensure that when we and then meet, it is not just annihilation. Because from their end, they have managed to do something that makes it so a lot of our weavings of Existence are ineffective against them, and only when we start touching upon higher stages of Existence can we manipulate things to stand against them.\"","She waved her hands as everything faded.","Noah silently stared at her as his mind buzzed- especially the Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities that were used as the backbone of the Infinite Omniverse.","Especially Manadynamics, Entropy, but more so than all of them...","Relativity!","It was currently dancing with profound radiance as if it was saying.","My origins are grand. What I represent is unfathomable!","HUUM!","Within him, the weavings of the Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Relativity began to burn with heavy brilliance.","\"Of course, all of this is just theory.\"","Command Protector Valeria continued in her multicolored Omniversal Armament.","Her beauty was something unheard of as her fair face glinted with immense power, charm, and intellect as she looked around the Protectors who would be moving under her and continued while her gaze locked back onto Noah.","\"You may then ask, what about the Outerversal Morphons? Their association with Dark Matter? How do they fit into all of this?\"","The Worms of Anti-Existence were related to Anti-Matter.","The Outerversal Morphons to Dark Matter.","But how did they fit into these aforementioned earlier theories?","The answer was...","\"We don't know.\"","...!","The face of Command Protector Valeria was calm as she uttered such a cold fact.","They truly didn't know.","\"That is why even though their threat levels vary, we understand Dark Matter much less than Anti-Matter as Outerversal Morphons are a terrifying enigma.\"","\"Dark Matter does not interact normally with Matter. An unknown force with unknown effects. It is invisible to us for the most part, and we only understand it by understanding its effects on us and Omniverses. We don't know how Outerversal Morphons latch onto and control our own people. How they share their power and taint things in such destructive ways. But...we are getting close to a breakthrough.\"","WAA!","What breakthrough?","Noah was thoroughly listening for more, but Command Protector Valeria seemed to have come to a wall as she didn't say any more about this.","The Protectors in the surrounding thrones looked at each other with smiles and interest as if they knew something, and Noah took the silence in stride as after getting here, Command Protector Valeria turned towards another direction entirely as she asked lightly.","\"Putting all of this together, Protector Osmont, what do you know about the Three Body Problem?\"","...!","The Three Body Problem.","Noah heard this term for the first time inside the Obelisk of the Protectors!"]},{"number":3235,"title":"Chapter 3235: Chapter 3234 Matter! II","paragraphs":["\"The Three Body Problem is a term that Old Man Eudemus has mentioned recently, and it talks about three objects- three bodies orbiting each other.\"","...!","Around Command Protector Valeria, weavings of nearby Existence began to gather around her as she seemed like a teller of glorious truth.","Above them, three pulsing singularities appeared as they began to rotate and gravitate around each other.","\"The very nature of their orbiting is full of chaos, and nothing can truly predict the three bodies rotating around each other. This unpredictable nature makes it so that small, minuscule changes to any initial conditions can lead to unfathomably drastic differences over time. This...is how Old Man Eudemus is looking at us, the Worms of Existence, and the Outerversal Morphons.\"","WAA!","\"Three bodies with unpredictable trajectories, and not a single possible solution in sight. If we do seek a solution though, we could try it by brute force and simplify the Three Body Problem by eliminating one of the bodies or both the other two bodies. It is much simpler to solve a two body problem or a one body problem.\"","...!","\"The utter annihilation of any bodies would truly...make things so much simpler.\"","\"...\"","A heavy silence hung in the air. \"Well, at least that is what I proposed to Old Man Eudemus when he mentioned this idea, but he then looked at me like a fool while shooing me away. But this is the crux of the issues plaguing us today.\"","Command Protector Valeria finished her introductory presentation as on the other throne; Protector Lucretia clapped while smiling.","\"Alright Sis, you've scared the new guy entirely with how massive of a problem we all face. Why don't we now go back to the mission at hand? The new guy can catch up on what we plan to do next.\"","Protector Lucretia spoke freely as her sister, Command Protector Valeria, gazed at her with sharp eyes that seemed to radiate a silent warning.","Lucretia said nothing else as she harrumphed, but in the next moment, Command Protector Valeria waved her hands as the rotating scene of three stellar bodies faded, and the image of a terrifying Outerversal Morphon that was there before Noah had arrived returned.","Noah gazed at it with calm eyes as he thought of everything he had just attained.","A more comprehensive source of information regarding the wonders and oddities out there unfolded, with Noah having grasped everything wonderfully as in the corner of his eyes, he stared at the red-haired woman with her legs dangling in the air with a bored expression.","Yes.","This was a very interesting group of Protectors to find himself in.","An Omniversal Entity in the lead, and..","When he looked at Protector Lucretia...","[Protector Lucretia]","[Unknown System of Existence Echelon 4 (5,766,685/10,000,000)]---[@&%^#]---[@&#^#]---[@&#^$]---[@#$%]","[Outerversal Descent System of Existence Echelon 5 (38,558,822/50,000,000)]","...!","Yes.","The one that seemed similar to the Omniversal Realm Command Protector Valeria, the sister, had another Identity Noah had already seen through- this Entity being a Delegatus of terrifying stature!","She was already an Echelon higher than Noah in terms of her Unknown System of Existence, and her Echelon as a Delegatus of an Unknown Outerversal Morphon was actually as powerful as her Sister.","From the perspective of Matter- of these Omniverses, she was just below the Omniversal Realm in power.","But in the perspective of Dark Matter- of the Megalos Beyond, she could already be considered of the Omniversal Realm in power just like Command Protector Valeria!","Noah smiled at such a finding as he kept it entirely to himself and listened on.","\"The target we are going to be coming across next is one sitting at the top of an Omniverse halfway turned into a Domain full of Dark Matter. A Half Tainted Omniverse. Transformed Agents of Anti-Life fill it to the brim as at the forefront is this Outerversal Morphon that has descended from a powerful Half-Omniversal Entity who had controlled this Omniverse since eons ago. The identity of our target...has been analyzed to be Outerversal Morphon Savitar.\"","WAA!","On the illusory screen.","A massive purple skull could be seen, thousands of equally titanic arms protruding from behind this skull as they grasped entire Existential Domains and threw them in its jaws.","On the sockets of this skull, purple flames burned brightly as around it, swathes of stellar obsidian brilliance already covered everything.","It was the taint of the Megalos Beyond as far as Noah could see!","Command Protector Valeria continued.","\"This form of Outerversal Morphon Savitar has been seen in 19 other Tainted Omniverses. It is powerful, but a weak body like this one is susceptible and possible to eradicate. The issue for all of you to acclimate to is the speed of the Transformed Agents of Anti-Life within this Half Tainted Omniverse and the speed of Outerversal Morphon Savitar himself. In a blink, your entire Existence could have been eradicated before you even do a thing.\"","...!","\"The Main Objective of the mission will be achieved when this body of Outerversal Morphon Savitar is destroyed as by getting past it, we will get the chance to destroy the Dark Matter Core that has been eating away and transforming that Half Tainted Omniverse. A normal Omniverse has no such core as it is made up of rulings that govern its weavings, but Outerversal Morphons taint and pull everything within an Omniverse into a single Dark Matter Core. This needs to be destroyed.\"","On the illusory screen, a radiant obsidian stellar singularity that was pulsing with irregularities was shown above them.","Noah looked at it as he asked lightly.","\"And what happens once a Dark Matter Core is destroyed?\"","First, erase the Outerversal Morphon Savitar and his forces.","Then, the Dark Matter Core!","But what did this accomplish?","Command Protector Valeria looked at him calmly before she replied.","\"The Half Tainted Omniverse will be destroyed soon after. We will have prevented the formation of a fully Tainted Omniverse that greatly enhances the power of Savitar and allows him and other Outerversal Morphons just like him to elevate themselves greatly in power.\"","...!","The Destruction of an Omniverse.","Granted, it was a Half-Tainted Omniverse that an Outerversal Morphon had already conquered, but wondrously...this would be the objective of Noah's first mission within the Equestris Protectors!"]},{"number":3236,"title":"Chapter 3236: Chapter 3235 Fabled! I","paragraphs":["The next Target of the Equestris Protectors was a body of the Outerversal Morphon Savitar that reigned over a Half Tainted Omniverse, and after this target was defeated, they would be able to destroy the Dark Matter Core that began forming the moment the Omniverse was first Tainted.","Destroy the Dark Matter Core, and the Half Tainted Omniverse itself would follow!","Noah repeated these words to himself as he looked at the calm figures of the five Protectors around him and asked.","\"Why just destroy this Dark Matter Core? Why not study it since we are looking for the solution for the Three Body Problem- for understanding Dark Matter, Anti-Matter, and Matter itself?\"","\"...\"","He asked as he received raised eyebrows from Protector Lucretia who was a hidden Delegatus of an Unknown Outerversal Morphon, and Command Protector Valeria replied while shaking her head.","\"We've tried many times to study the Dark Matter Cores we come across. An Omniversal Protector even tried absorbing into his own Fabled Omniverse, and the only thing that happened was everything within it becoming Tainted, his Fabled Omniverse acting as an Anchor that the Dark Matter Core resided in as from it came the Descent of an Outerversal Morphon that went on to decimate a dozen Omniverses before he was pushed back.\"","...!","Terrifying words echoed out from Command Protector Valeria as Noah gained another burst of history and information.","She was about to continue, but he stopped her with an interjection.","\"Fabled Omniverse?\"","The Omniversal Realm.","He wanted to peer more information on the stage of power of these beings, and Command Protector Valeria humored him as she smiled wryly for the first time and replied.","\"I guess you wouldn't readily know or have access to this information yet. To combat the weavings of Dark Matter and Anti-Matter over the eons, the Commonwealth looked at the best ways to purify existence to reach a terrifying pinnacle that could not be easily nullified or negated against them. The answer was the construction of one's existence into the smallest unit of Matter. A Quark.\"","HUUM!","A Quark!","\"Something that could possibly be traced back to the theories of Matter and Anti-Matter colliding. That everything was composed of Quarks or clusters of quarks, and from them...everything came to be. So the Commonwealth devised of a way to purify one's existence into a Quark, and from this single Quark...birth an extremely pure form of Existence. Something containing everything about you- your records, your power, your personality, and all else, but purified to an unfathomable level as at the end, you can establish your Fabled Omniverse.\"","As she spoke.","Around her body, Command Protector Valeria began to emanate a heavy pressure as a crimson illusory circle of unfathomable weavings began to circle around her.","The moment she did so, all weavings of existence in the surroundings began to distort and twist into different directions!","The thrones they say on trembled and began to move as if pulled by an undeniable gravitational force.","Noah felt his Atlas of Existence erupt with colorless brilliance as it was barely able to resist being affected- his eyes looking towards Command Protector Valeria with blazing brilliance!","\"Before this Realm of Power, nothing else matters.\"","Her eyes were currently aflame with crimson brilliance.","They didn't seem like the eyes of any normal Life Form- but akin to a being that had crossed over some unexpected and unfathomable stage!","\"From a single Quark blooms countless others of immeasurable purity, everything about you being gathered to form a Fabled Omniverse. This Fabled Omniverse...transforms your existence in a way that makes it capable and extremely efficient in withstanding Dark Matter and Anti-Matter. Almost as if you have taken yourself back to a time before any omniverses, when only Quarks smashed into each other endlessly. This...is the level you should all be seeking to obtain as only when you arrive here can you truly enact any sort of significant change on the larger weavings of Existence. On the Wheel of Existence!\"","WAA!","She finished her words as the circular brilliance she released was retracted into her body, everything around them calming down as everybody had their own unique expressions!","The three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians on their own thrones looked towards Command Protector Valeria with looks of hidden respect and adoration.","Protector Lucretia looked towards her sister with a gaze that briefly showed mixed emotions, while Noah looked at her as if he had found a piece of a treasure he wanted to dissect!","Her red hair danced wildly as she continued.","\"A Fabled Omniverse is one of the purest and most stable forms of power, and yet when one took in a Dark Matter Core, it became Tainted. So as strong as we have become, Devouring or Assimilating Dark Matter or Anti-Matter into ourselves has never worked. Only destruction or Annihilation provides any leeway.\"","...!","Destruction was the only path.","Noah smiled at this as Entropy continued to seethe among the many extremes within Noah that were currently surging.","He rubbed his chin thoughtfully as he turned towards Protector Lucretia while voicing out.","\"Isn't an Agent of Anti-Life someone that has successfully assimilated Dark Matter into them? With the level of their Existence being raised much higher?\"","He asked such a question while looking at Protector Lucretia whose identity as a Delegatus was unknown by those around her.","Her brows seemed to rise questioningly towards him as if asking him- why the hell are you directing such a question to me?","Her defiant beauty was a sight to see as Nkah smiled while turning to Command Protector Valeria who was always replying sternly.","\"Tainted Existences is what they are, nothing more. As you saw yourself, a small flicker of your power unraveled their impure dominium and caused the Agent of Anti-Life to reveal the weak traces of its Outerversal Morphon. Dark Matter, Anti-Matter...these two will never mix or assimilate with Matter. This...is not the answer to our existence, nor the answer to the Three Body Problem.\"","...!"]},{"number":3237,"title":"Chapter 3237: Chapter 3236 Fabled! II","paragraphs":["Her gaze was stern.","Noah nodded at this point as he stopped asking questions.","Command Protector Valeria looked at him carefully before she voiced out.","\"As a Protector, you gain Weavings of Contribution whenever you do anything on behalf of the Commonwealth. If you perform well in the takedown of one of the bodies of Outerversal Morphon Savitar, you should be able to gain the method of compressing everything about you into a Quark before you can forge your own Fabled Omniverse. After your existence is nurtured and elevated to a high enough level, along with exemplary records and with a strong foundation, a powerful Fabled Omniverse may appear within the Commonwealth. And we need as many Omniversal Entities as we can since others are either too lazy or not talented enough.\"","Her last words were directed to her sister and the Simian Protectors who laughed dryly while looking at each other.","Noah merely nodded at Command Protector Valeria as he replied.","\"Very well. When do we set off towards this Half Tainted Omniverse?\"","...!","The multicolored Omniversal Armament is his hands trembled with excitement.","The brows of all Protectors rose as Protector Lucretia scoffed and spoke out.","\"This newbie actually has no fear of what Outerversal Morphons are capable of...if only you knew the number of Protectors just like you that die to them.\"","The nature of the job of the Protectors was a tough one.","Unlike what the masses of the Commonwealth believed, they were not invincible instruments and shields to protect them as when they did go against the truly terrifying enemies aligned with Dark Matter and Anti-Matter, their casualties were high!","Thus, more seeds were sought from artificial weavings like the Gladiators Arena.","To bring out any unsharpened Gems to light and have them be forged to become swords of the Commonwealth.","Command Protector Valeria looked at her sister with sharp eyes as she rebuked her words.","\"For some people, it is not that they have no fear, but their Existence can already feel the urge against enemies that will not hesitate to decimate all of us.\"","...!","\"For our mission...all parameters have been cleared as within the next day, we will set off towards the Half Tainted Omniverse where one of the bodies of Outerversal Morphon Savitar resides.\"","Her last words were stated as she shifted her gaze from Protector Lucretia and towards Noah.","The parameters were set.","The pathway was clear!","The first true clash against an Outerversal Morphon within these vast Omniverses...its stage was set as who knew just what weavings would unfold? Within the same Obelisk of the Protectors where Noah was with the Equestris Protectors.","On another floor, another body of his appeared past a white portal into a fantastical expansion that shone with gold and white hues of light.","It was a Miniature Existential Domain within the Obelisk of the Protectors, and yet it seemed to stretch out endlessly as all around, one could see the radiant floating books, scrolls, and scriptures of different varieties floating serenely as if they were stellar bodies.","This was the Existential Library that contained the vast array of knowledge of the Commonwealth over the eons.","Knowledge of Systems of Existence among many others.","Of the variable Omniverses out there and different types of Existences that could be found.","Of course, Noah didn't think that any of this knowledge that a Protector like him could easily have access to was the core of what the Commonwealth knew, but its gains should still be significant!","He didn't expect to find any intricacies regarding the Wheel of Existence here, but at the very least, he could supplement eons worth of knowledge into his own Library in the Infinite Omniverse.","He floated towards the dazzling books and scrolls all around him as like a tide, his will went towards each of them to absorb whatever knowledge they held.","Around him, uniquely dressed Royal Existential Omniversal Simians and other forms of Existence only glanced towards his direction briefly after his entrance before each of them went back to whatever they were doing.","It was only a single pair of eyes within the far depths of the Existential Library that remained focused on him after he entered, and they belonged to a robed Royal Existential Omniversal Simian who crossed her legs while reading a thick crimson-covered book with the title- [Morphology of Outerversal Morphons].","Pure gold fur lined up her entire body, her gaze becoming locked onto Noah silently as around her, a faint illusion of a Fabled Omniverse shone!","She tapped her fingers silently on the book she was reading as her gaze never left a certain area for even a second.","Away from this vibrant Existential Library.","There was another vast Library that held Records of countless weavings of Existence, skills, and other oddities within.","Inside the Infinite Omniverse.","Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Entropy walked through grandiose golden bookshelves that held books radiating glory.","The floor he stepped on shone with golden brilliance as everything around him burned with majesty, and his voice emanated out calmly as his hands held a book with the title of [Relativity].","\"Dedicate a major percentage of your weavings to the understanding and analysis of Matter, Dark Matter, Anti-Matter, and the Three Body Problem.\"","...!","|Yes, Master.|","He spoke out to nobody, and yet a voice of affirmation rang out in his mind as he continued.","\"Anything to do with the theories of the weavings of existence itself. Atoms, Quarks, String Theory...expand it all under the banner of the research into the Wheel of Existence. Let's see if our inclination towards Matter and Anti-Matter will lead towards any results that the Commonwealth has not come across...\"","He had a part of himself on what could be considered the side of Matter.","His body here.","The Infinite Omniverse he soon wanted to change as he paused with caution some more before establishing a connection between the Infinite Omniverse and Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias.","It would be a connection between Matter and Dark Matter.","What would he be able to learn from it if he actually went through with it?","There were many unknowns as he proceeded with care!"]},{"number":3238,"title":"Chapter 3238: Chapter 3237 Origins I","paragraphs":["As his Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Entropy crossed the golden halls of an endless Library.","In front of his eyes, numbers had continued to rise as inadvertently...his body pulsed with a wave of colorless radiance as from the surroundings weavings of space, threads of countless weavings of Existential Extremity Authorities made themselves prevalent to him.","[You have stepped into the Fourth Echelon of the Conceptual System of Existence.]","...!","The Fourth Echelon.","The stage where most of the powerful Apogee Autarchs stayed.","For Noah, it was the elevation of his First Mundi of Power that currently released repetitive hums- his Source of Existence where all weavings of Existential Extremity Authorities and other similar assimilated Systems were being elevated by a large margin!","|The level of access into Omniversal Authorities has reached a critical level.|","|The Breadth of your Existence has resonated with multiple Autarchical Omniversal Authorities.|","|Your Existence is one that is loved by Extremes.|","All around him, his body felt the millions of threads of Existential Extremity Authorities that made multiple Autarchical Omniversal Authorities.","How within these Autarchical Omniversal Authorities, there were clusters of Greater Omniversal Authorities that made them, and smaller clusters that composed these very same Omniversal Authorities.","Aitia led to a grander form of an Autarchical Omniversal Authority.","Pompeii led to a grander form of another Autarchical Omniversal Authority.","But at the end of the day, they stood for the same thing- just more grandiose in quality at the Autarchical Omniversal Authority stage!","And now, after taking his Conceptual System of Existence based on these very same extremes, he became an Existence that was loved those very same weavings of concepts.","Was this not...the privilege of the Omniversal Ankyra?","The entity who held free reign over multiple Autarchical Omniversal Authorities? Noah felt like he had reached such a precipice, and that at the same time, he could do much more!","|Your existence has locked onto the weavings of Autarchical Omniversal Authorities that are inherently capable of augmenting your power.|","|Through Aitia, the Component of Efficiency has been selected and expanded upon- with the weavings of your Existence being taken towards Absolute Efficiency.|","...!","Absolute Efficiency.","100% Efficiency!","Something he could only change by decimal points before, and yet now....he was capable of rushing towards its absolute extreme as his existence reached a whole new level.","But it wasn't just this.","|The weavings of the flow of the Spacetime Continuum can be further augmented and modified within the Infinite Omniverse.|","|Your distinction as the Weaver of Existence and Extremity begin to exceed established parameters.|","|The weavings of Invictus Maximus get ever closer.|","He...felt the influx of far too many things at this moment actually.","But he slowed it all down as he breathed.","His colorless wings across all of his Clones vibrated.","The Clone in this Library.","The Clone near the multicolored throne of Authorities.","The Clone near the production lines of Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction.","The Clone overseeing the possible glimpse of the carving of the Infinite Omniverse to make Omniversal Weapons.","The Clones that were Dual Cultivating with Adelaide, Barbatos, Sona, and others as the resonance of existence was tested.","The clones stretched out across the Infinite Omniverse carrying out a myriad of tasks, as well as the Clones in a distant Omniverse of the Protectors.","He felt all of them as they were him, and at this moment, his Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Entropy raised his hand and asked lightly.","\"What am I?\"","...!","A question filled with simplicity.","But Noah's intent while asking it was very methodical.","As if he wanted to understand, truly, what he was.","And to understand what he was in his entirety, he had to begin by...","\"Break it all down.\"","WAA!","He had to break down exactly what made him as at this moment, multiple of his Clones began to be broken down.","The Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Entropy that had its hands raised observed his skin, muscles, and bones begin to break down into stellar particles.","Were he to break himself down completely, what would be the smallest thing he could observe regarding his own composition? Would he gain a better understanding of the [Matter] that made him, and how drastically different it was compared to [Dark Matter] that made his identity as an Outerversal Morphon?","He didn't yet know, but he had to see.","He had to see if he could track down his Origins!","And coincidentally, as multiple parts of himself in the Infinite Omniverse did this, his identity as an Outerversal Morphon in the Megalos Beyond was undergoing its own experience where it was connected to a unique Outerversal Morphon who was deeply inclined to the Great Beyonder that spoke of Signs and Instruments.","Away from the Infinite Omniverse.","Within the Megalos Beyond.","In the very heart of the Grave of the Great Beyonder- an Entity known as Aspasia was currently connected with Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias!","Her job was to confirm whether he was the Instrument spoken of from long-lost fables, so this being sought to deeply entrench herself and see whether this had any merit.","As she did this, Ozymandias was gaining a better grasp of Outerversal Morphons as a whole as while connected, he saw the millions of threads of obsidian brilliance stretching out from Outerversal Morphon Aspasia and towards the vast stretches of the Megalos Beyond below!","Millions of connections.","As he observed them, he wondered about the unique capability of Morphons to cast out minuscule parts of themselves across the Megalos Beyond and towards Entities of other states of Matter.","Why did their power work in such a way? Why did-?","'Oh?'","His thoughts stopped as they came to a realization.","The obsidian threads that only Aspasia should be able to see did not just extend down across the Megalos Beyond, with his will following some stretching out horizontally all around them.","And when he traversed across these threads, his gaze went past the organ they were in and quickly came to observe an endpoint within the Grave of the Great Beyonder where this thread connected to...a fairly weak Outerversal Morphon!"]},{"number":3239,"title":"Chapter 3239: Chapter 3238 Origins II","paragraphs":["A thread connecting to another Outerversal Morphon!","Their body was smaller than most as they had the form of a rotund creature with stellar fur and limbs, and it wasn't the only one connected to Aspasia as when Noah observed other lines extending from her, they stretched out towards the vast stretches of the Megalos Beyond itself.","Of course. An Outerversal Morphon could also bind those within the Megalos Beyond.","Just like they could reach out to weavings of Matter, they could also connect to the weavings of Dark Matter similar to them!","But the former seemed to be much easier.","'Hmm...'","Noah had a pondering expression as he wanted to know more.","So he sensed the resonance of the Existence he was connected to and delved even deeper.","...!","It was an action that caused a strong reaction, the visage of Aspasia below him radiating a blinding brilliance of obsidian light that caused half of his consciousness to be taken somewhere else entirely.","And when this consciousness opened its eyes, it found itself waking up above a calm obsidian body of water that stretched out with no end.","His reflection could be seen on it as he rose, his bare body shining with obsidian radiance reflecting back along with his powerful wings and nine Halos spinning behind him.","Even though it shone with stellar radiance, the muscular humanoid form could still be seen on its curves as his eyes, which were vibrant singularities, looked ahead of him to see the bare figure of Aspasia that seemed to be trembling slightly as she acclimated.","Her stellar obsidian skin outlines a unique blessed chest different in its finer details than what Ozymandias was normally exposed to, with her slender waist pulsing with stellar radiance as in the next moment, she waved her hands to cause a stellar obsidian robe to wrap around her figure.","She looked towards Ozymandias with a sense of modesty while breathing out calmly.","|You went a bit overboard there, but at least it brought us to this space. To the Nexus of Megalos Records.|","WAA!","|The Nexus of Megalos Records?| Ozymandias looked around them while he asked lightly.","Apart from the obsidian body of water stretching out with no end, there was only a similar hue of obsidian stellar space above them akin to the Megalos Beyond itself as it didn't seem all that different.","Aspasia nodded lightly while gazing at Ozymandias' blessed visage and the tool he had used to allow them to achieve this profound state of resonance they were currently in- her hand rising and tapping towards him as an obsidian robe came to adorn his body as well.","|Yes. It is moreso a Nexus between you and I, but the Nexus of Megalos Records exists for all Outerversal Morphons out there with a high level of power. It is a place to obtain knowledge and spread knowledge. Currently, we are in a Nexus that most closely resonates with something at the depths of my being. Something relating to the Great Beyonder. It is here that I will be able to rely on his weavings to come to any confirmation about who you are.|","|I see...|","Ozymandias scratched his stellar chin as he wondered, was he about to get exposed here? He could already do everything that these entities believed as he passed this Aspasia before him, everything would be set in stone.","He looked at her figure as he asked.","|Just who is the Great Beyonder?|","A name that rose ever since his entry into the Megalos Beyond!","A name with tremendous influence as its words were believed with damn near certainty.","Aspasia looked at him with analytical eyes as she waved her hands above and caused the stellar space to change- the outline of a blurry figure appearing as his sheer outline alone caused the space above to tremble.","|The Great Beyonder is one of the Oldest Outerversal Morphons known.|","...!","|Is?|","Aspasia spoke in the present tense.","And she nodded in affirmation as she continued.","|Is. He has disappeared for many cycles now, but he is not dead. We may be in a place called the Grave of the Great Beyonder, but this is simply a distinction and a place to honor him that Outerversal Morphons converge in. There are other places like this stretched out across the Megalos Beyond. Think of them like Shrines of the Great Beyonder as we await his return. If he chooses to return.|","An Entity surrounded by tremendous mystery.","Noah thought about his standing deeply as he probed.","|From the weavings I've heard, he disappeared after he made the revelations that put us where we are now. About Signs and an Instrument that would either expand or annihilate the Megalos Beyond. Why would he...disappear?|","A question seeking to get to the crux of the beliefs of the Outerversal Morphons.","And Aspasia took it in strides as she began to walk on the calm black Sea towards him while replying.","|Heretical Morphons like to believe that he paid a great cost to see the possible end or expansion of the Megalos Beyond. That his weavings unraveled and he spread out across the Megalos Beyond- with some areas converging clusters of his weavings as these became known as the Graves of the Great Beyonder.|","She arrived in front of him as her radiant obsidian skin pulsed with pure glory, her palm rising in front of him as Ozymandias raised his own hand to reflect his stellar palm.","|We believe something else entirely. We believe the Great Beyonder achieved a level of Existence that exceeded all of us so much that we cannot even perceive him anymore unless he wishes for us to. A different level of dimensionality entirely. To him, time moves differently. Space moves differently. For him to have been capable of seeing the possible expansion or destruction of the Megalos Beyond...he had to have transcended any common concepts we understand and seen things we cannot see. We very much believe that the Great Beyonder is right here.|","BOOM!"]},{"number":3240,"title":"Chapter 3240: Chapter 3239 Origins III","paragraphs":["A heavy assertion!","Aspasia- someone that the Great Mother stated that she had a unique connection to the Great Beyonder.","She stated that without a shadow of a doubt, The Great Beyonder was alive and well.","That he had Transcended what they commonly knew and understood to reach an entirely different dimension of existence!","Her palm was stretched out.","His own palm came forward as at this moment, waves began to pulse between them as their palms got closer and closer to each other.","|The Great Beyonder could be watching all of this right now, and we wouldn't be able to know. He could be watching our bodies out there, or even be capable of somehow seeing into this Nexus of Megalos Records that only you and I are in.|","...!","This was a terrifying level of power.","If it was true.","Ozymandias looked at Aspasia closely as he spoke inquisitively.","|You speak with great confidence in this. What gives you such confidence?|","HUUM!","Their palms touched after bursts of singularities clashed between them, waves of resonance spreading as the singularities of Aspasia smiled.","|The Sign and the possible Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of...actually showing skepticism about the Great Beyonder. How interesting. Let us see whether you are this Instrument, Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias.|","Waves of Outerversal Authority pulsed between them.","Aspasia seemed to be looking for a specific frequency of something.","And Ozymandias...was gazing at the very depths of what made himself. Just like his counterpart of Noah Osmont was breaking down weavings of Matter, Ozymandias sought to understand the component of the Dark Matter that made him!","—","Matter.","Across the myriad of Omniverses, everything was made up of matter.","Matter could be broken down into the smaller components known as Atoms!","Trillions upon quintillions and quintillions of atoms, endless particles that were too many to even count.","At this moment, Noah broke himself down entirely as after his body flickered into a stellar mass of cells, these cells further separated.","All of it required careful and effortful usage of Existential Extremity Authority.","The colorless Authority of the Laborer was coursing through him and everything within him as he found that Innately, all the matter that made him sought to be in what it considered a natural form.","A natural state.","And that was his humanoid body.","If he wasn't actively continuing to apply the pressure and authority, the countless particles he had broken himself down into would come together in fantastical weavings to reform back into himself!","|Your Weavings have naturally triggered a state of profound epiphany and understanding.|","As the Weaver, he was coming to learn many things about himself.","Especially when he watched the weavings of his Atlas of Existence be broken down, and different colored musings showed themselves for all 9 different Mundis of Power.","He applied even greater authority as rapidly, it seemed like a cloud of stellar multicolored brilliance was only expanding and being magnified around the golden halls of an extensive library!","Cells broke down rapidly and became atoms.","It may have seemed like something simple, but who could say they could easily break down their very existence into countless smaller compartments and observe them all freely?","When Noah broke himself down to countless atoms, he went even further to break this down as he began to feel the weavings of many Ascendant Existential Extremity Authorities buzzing!","Strong Nuclear Force. Weak Nuclear Force. Entropy. Manadynamics. Relativity. Electromagnetism. Gravitation...","Many concepts seemed to swirl heavily as he peered deeply into the weavings of his atoms, his going even deeper as he seamlessly broke his atoms down into Proton, Neutrons, and Electrons!","...!","When he arrived here, he felt a strain.","His existence became an endless field of dense multicolored particles as from them...he began to sense faint waves. Waves.","Strings.","Among these silent waves, other particles flowed here and there as they didn't seem as significant, but even they played a role.","Everything seemed to be moving and tugged with weavings of Existential waves of light, but as he looked at the smallest breakdown of atoms- at his Quintessential Protons, Neutrons, and Electrons, he found that they still seemed too big.","His penetrative gaze could see they were made of something even smaller!","This was...","|Quarks...|","HUUM!","The moment his intent buzzed out their identity, he saw his Protons and neutrons break apart to become blinding singularities that were Quarks.","But only his Neutrons and Protons!","His Electrons...they broke into different singularities that did not seem at all like Quarks.","They moved differently.","They spun differently.","They were tugged by different forces within his existence as the more he looked at them, he could feel his distinction as the Weaver analyze them as quickly, a word rose in his mind!","|Leptons...|","...!","Quarks and Leptons.","This was what he came across as the smallest fundamental parts of himself, his Authority of the Laborer buzzing at it felt a great strain trying to go any further!","He had learned of Quarks and how the Commonwealth had those who had reached a terrifying level of Existence condense everything they had into a single Quark that they would bloom into countless others to form a Fabled Omniverse.","But Command Protector Valeria didn't speak of anything to do with Leptons.","These were also small, minuscule particles that made him!","Their interactions.","How they behaved.","All of it was what made what he did possible.","Lifting a single finger.","Activating Mana.","Utilizing Existential Extremity Authority.","Around the interactions and weavings of his Quarks and Leptons, he could see threads- strings of Existential Extremity Authorities flowing through them!","And this whole time, even though his Authority was stopping it- the countless particles that made him wanted to resume their normal interactions to return to the glorious humanoid form, with Noah theorizing that no matter how he disrupted them, they would always return to be him.","These were his origins.","At this moment, he remembered the one thing Command Protector Valeria mentioned regarding Matter, Anti-Matter, Dark Matter, and the Three Body Problem.","Across the interactions of these three states, their unpredictability and interactions meant that even a small, insignificant change to initial conditions at this level could lead to unfathomable and unpredictable massive changes later on.","He looked across his broken down existence as he saw the colorful Quarks and Leptons that made up his Conceptual System of Existence.","He saw that the assimilated Systems he had taken in, whether it be from the Faesigned Queen, the Satyrus Nymph, or the Sunwinged Leprechanus...they all were still made up of Quarks and Leptons!","They were seamlessly assimilated, but he could still recognize them.","His Systems. Their Systems.","Ultimately, they were all made up of Matter!"]},{"number":3241,"title":"Chapter 3241: Chapter 3240 Origins IV","paragraphs":["Matter.","The components that made all different weavings of Existence.","In his state of profundity and epiphany, he was coming to realize that the different Weavings of Existence- the different Systems of Existence that entities utilized...were simply made up of different interactions of Matter. A difference in the makeup, weaving, or interaction of quarks and leptons that made an Existence!","There were other particles he couldn't yet readily see, but quarks and leptons made up the vast majority.","If they were too similar, his Atlas of Existence distinguished it as so.","Their interactions were grouped to be similar to his Conceptual System of Existence, and so they were assimilated into it!","They could be assimilated smoothly because of these similarities, and this only acted to further strengthen the weavings and interactions of the System placed in his First Mundi of Power.","If they were sufficiently different, their interactions and makeup would also explain this!","They wouldn't be able to assimilate smoothly due to their interactions and makeup being too different, and so they would be designated to have their own placement in another Mundi of Power.","The Outerversal Descent System of Existence was like this.","Its makeup was entirely different.","He looked at what made up the weavings of the Outerversal Descent System of Existence.","It was...starkly different.","He couldn't clearly make out the configuration of their smallest particles, nor whether they were made up of Quarks or Leptons entirely.","It seemed to be a mixture.","A mixture filled with Uncertainty.","A stable interaction of what he knew to be Matter, and the wonders of oddities known as Dark Matter!","The moment he saw this, he became certain.","And his will vibrated from the cloud of quarks and leptons as it buzzed out.","|We shall proceed with the connection between Ozymandias and the Infinite Omniverse.|","WAA!","Yes!","After observing the interaction of his own weavings of Matter and how the connection between him and Ozymandias interacted with each other, he was convinced that he had done his due diligence along with all the computations that the Infinite Omniverse itself made, and there should be no adverse effects from him pulling the weavings of the Megalos Beyond into the Infinite Omniverse!","|Yes, Master.|","And so, his will was carried out.","He didn't worry about what could be or what may come. He only got ready to observe how fantastical the interactions of Matter and Dark Matter would be on an Omniversal scale.","Far from here.","Within the Megalos Beyond itself where Ozymandias was connected to Aspasia, with part of their consciousness meeting in the Nexus of Megalos Records.","Here, Ozymandias could feel the weavings and interactions that seemed to be of even greater complexity than those of Matter, with his eyes constantly seeking to analyze and understand.","At this moment, Aspasia was looking for 'something' to tie him to an instrument that an ancient being spoke about cycles ago.","He was unsure whether what he had already done was enough to give her the thing she was looking for, so at this moment...he moved to fabricate it.","She was looking for something, so he would give her something!","HUUM!","From the interminable visage of Ozymandias, a massive tentacle larger than any he had released before erupted between his spinning Halos and was cast down.","It was cast across the organ they were in and through the Grave of the Great Beyonder, going across the Megalos Beyond as it already had a purpose and direction!","It wasn't seeking a Delegatus of simple standing or nature- with its target not even being an entity in the common scope of understanding.","Its target was an Omniverse.","And not just any Omniverse, but the Infinite Omniverse that held the oddity and wonder and endless expansion.","He didn't know what the full result of his actions would be, but within the scope of a fraction of an instant...","BOOM!","The obsidian fishing line of Ozymandias flowed across endless weavings, through the connection of Noah Osmont, and into the heart of his unbreakable connection with the Infinite Omniverse.","...!","|Another unbreakable bond is being forged.|","|A connection spanning across different scopes of Existence is being stabilized.|","His Existence trembled.","His Atlas of Existence spun with glory.","The Infinite Omniverse buzzed.","The visage of Ozymandias shook as the Entity he was connected to suddenly felt the eruption of something she had never sensed before.","This...what was this?!","She didn't know.","Nobody else would know but the person responsible for carrying out a heavy action at this moment!","|Stability has been achieved.|","...!","Noah felt every part of himself trembling as the interactions that made up everything around him seemed to be actively moving faster and faster.","He was still being taken towards absolute efficiency as everything about his existence was rising, and with the completion of this grand achievement...","|A stable pathway between the Megalos Beyond and the Infinite Omniverse has been established.|","|A pathway for Matter and Dark Matter has been formed.|","It seemed like a massive road that nobody could see.","Its structure seemed unbreakable as it radiated stellar obsidian radiance, and the moment it was fully stabilized...all of the surroundings of Ozymandias began to tremble.","The Grave of the Great Beyonder they were in began to buzz as from all around, the structure and weavings of the Megalos Beyond twisted as they began to curve and draw towards Ozymandias.","As if they knew that the undertaking that was about to occur would need an endless infusion of authority!","Outside of the Barrier of the Grave of the Great Beyonder, a heavy standoff was taking place between powerful Outerversal Morphons- some with the distinction of [Great] in their names.","From among them, the eyes of the Observer of Old and Young were the brightest as his senses covered everything.","He was the first to notice the oddity as far above the Grave of the Great Beyonder, he observed the Megalos Beyond to distort.","From this distortion, waves of stellar obsidian radiance then exploded outwards as the gorgeous hue of the Megalos Beyond...began to form small points of dew drops.","Dew drops.","Within the Megalos Beyond.","These dew drops began with the Grave of the Great Beyonder at the center, but gradually began to spread outwards.","It was...rain.","Rain in the fantastical space of the Megalos Beyond.","Seeing such a thing, The Observer of Old and Young sighed as around him, the Great Mother also noticed it and began to tremble with fanaticism!","It was...another Sign that the Great Beyonder had spoken of!"]},{"number":3242,"title":"Chapter 3242: Chapter 3241 Origins V","paragraphs":["Across the Megalos Beyond, there was only an endless obsidian radiance with stretches of Domains scattered across it.","In the Megalos Beyond, there was no rain.","Rain was a concept known and understood, with some entities even utilizing attacks in the form of rain or something similar.","But what was occurring at this very moment above the Grave of the Great Beyonder was a natural rain that seemed to be coming from the surrounding Megalos Beyond itself!","The rain bounced on the crimson barrier covering the Grave of the Great Beyonder and seemed to stretch outwards, with the bodies of the dozens of Outerversal Morphons outside this domain soon coming to feel the droplets.","PA! PA! PA!","The tentacles of the Great Mother rose as she felt the rain and trembled.","It was extremely pure condensed drops of the very makeup of the Megalos Beyond itself.","When they fell on her tentacles, they broke and scattered into dazzling obsidian waves that visibly made their surroundings brighter.","A shine of obsidian radiance became even more potent as it seemed that with the Grave of the Great Beyonder as the center, the concentration of atmospheric authority and the very weavings of the Megalos Beyond in this area were enriched!","Why was this? What could possibly cause this?!","|Rain shall cover the Megalos Beyond as it will cheer at the arrival of the instrument...|","The Great Mother weaved her intent outwards as her mind was all but made up.","Her intent traversed outwards towards the Herical Morphons who faced them as at the forefront, there was a massive Outerversal Morphon whose entire body was shrouded by a cyclical robe that covered and hid everything in darkness, with a single limb releasing from this cylindrical darkness that formed a purple hand which had an eye and a mouth with thousands of jagged teeth on its palm!","This mouth in the center of the palm opened and released guttural sounds in response to the intent of the Great Mother.","\"Rain shall cover the Megalos Beyond as it will weep at the arrival of the instrument...\"","...!","The sentence it said was almost exactly the same as what the Great Mother had said.","But a single word was changed.","He uttered weep, and she uttered cheer.","And yet...neither were wrong as both of these sentences were said back to back by the Great Beyonder all those cycles ago!","The mouth on the palm spoke out again as the titanic body of darkness it was connected to began to vibrate.","\"It is weeping, O Great Mother. Weeping in dismay at even the possibility of destruction to come. Why risk it? This second Sign only confirms things as we must get through, Great Mother. Whether we have your permission or not.\"","WAA!","Around and behind this terrifying Outerversal Morphon that bore the distinction of Great, others also moved.","The Great Mother looked at them in distaste as she got out of her reverie and bellowed out while beginning to make preparations.","|Hmph, the Megalos Beyond is cheering and expectant for what's to come! Can you not sense how much more vibrant everything is? Can you not imagine the wonders to come? Because if you seek to stop it...it will have to be over my corpse, O Great Enslaver.|","...!","Her words only caused the tension in the surroundings to burn ever brighter.","Her tentacles began to spin and cycle around her as she began to give off waves of ancient power that few would understand the true terror of.","After her words were said, there was no going back.","A deep sigh escaped from the Observer of Old and Young as he began to transform out of the form of an old man and into a terrific Outerversal Morphon.","Others did the same around him as dozens of Morphons of different forms with coiling tentacles lined up behind the Great Mother in solidarity!","The Great Enslaver looked at this scene and spoke deeply.","\"No Great Outerversal Morphon has fallen over the last cycles. If you protect the Instrument ...you will start fulfilling another Sign yourself.\"","...!","Another sign the Great Beyonder stated.","|Great Ones will fall like the drops of Rain....so what? Who knows which among us will live in the future to come? The ones following the Will of the Great Beyonder, or Heretics?|","She spoke daringly and without fear.","And in response, millions of tendrils began to buzz opposite her as another deep voice not belonging to the Great Enslaver echoed out.","|We also follow the Will of the Great Beyonder, O Great Mother, but we seem to see it differently.|","A voice that made the confident tentacles around the Great Mother to pause slightly as they developed some solemnity.","She didn't think even he would come this fast.","But what had to be done, had to be done.","With her mind made up, she initiated the safeguards she had put into place since many cycles ago around the Grave of the Great Beyonder as thereafter, her power exploded out!","As it did, she couldn't help but feel a tremendous sense of achievement and euphoria.","She wondered.","Would she be able to initiate the third Sign today? Would a Great One fall here?","As unlikely as it was due to their sheer power, she was expectant.","She had thought Great Ones falling would come much later, but who knew how the intricacies of the Great Beyonder worked? All she did know...was that she had come across the Instrument brought forth by the Observer of Old and Young as by now, seeing the Sign of the Rain, Aspasia must have confirmed everything!","'I will see you all again soon enough...'","She had a single thought that revealed a glimpse of what she planned to do.","With their surroundings now filled with drops of rain that scattered to cause the Megalos Beyond to shine with ever increasing obsidian radiance, a massive pop that ushered in the start of a bloody war ensued.","...!","POP!","A booming sound that stretched deeply into the protected Grave of the Great Beyonder behind them.","A sound that was felt by two connected beings, one of them being the entity responsible for ushering this change and releasing unseen and unknown waves of interactions even he didn't fully grasp as he established a stable channel of Matter and Dark Matter!"]},{"number":3243,"title":"Chapter 3243: Chapter 3242 Origins VI","paragraphs":["Across an extremely stable pathway, it felt like endless stellar obsidian seas were surging from all around and crossing this single path while heading towards a distant construct.","And yet no matter how much was drawn in, the surroundings didn't show any strain as Ozymandias realized the moment the connection was established, waves of interactions he couldn't yet understand erupted and caused some sort of a reaction.","A reaction with the countless particles of Dark Matter permeating all around this space!","The Dark Matter seemed to feed off of this connection in an unfathomable way, the concentration of authority and atmosphere of the Megalos Beyond itself rapidly increasing with this region of the Organ they were in as the center and only continuing this expansion outwards.","Within the Nexus of Megalos Records where a part of himself and Aspasia was, their touching palms vibrated as Aspasia was currently looking behind Noah as if she could see the blinding and massive obsidian pathway that was formed not towards an Entity, but something else entirely!","|You...!|","Her voice was filled with a sense of incredulity and confusion as she looked at him.","Her eyes squinted closely as if she wanted to follow the endless massive connection stretching out behind him, but Ozymandias looked at her ever closer as he asked calmly.","|Is something the matter?|","As if he had just done the most natural thing in the world.","Aspasia looked at him wordlessly as if she were gathering her thoughts before she asked, almost as if she was whispering so that nobody else could hear....but there should be nobody else here!","|What...did you connect to just now?|","She wondered.","She sought an answer.","And yet...she only saw the singularities of this mysterious being before her curve into a smile as he replied.","|Something big. I need to focus and understand it clearly, do you mind?|","He spoke while his stellar obsidian turned its eyes right ahead of him.","Only their palms had been touching, but unconsciously, Aspasia came to realize at this moment that her whole body was glued to him.","As if she wanted to enter the depths of his existence to understand exactly what had just happened!","|Ah...| As she realized this, Aspasia stepped back, naturally unclasping their palms as she felt the weavings of her own Existence.","|Did you manage to confirm what you wanted to confirm?|","His voice was ever present as it followed her.","Her blank gaze blinked and brightened up as she looked at him, and then sensed the changes occurring around them as well as her intricate connection to the Grave of the Great Beyonder that was currently getting drops of rain on it.","She felt the heavy inflow of rivers of what seemed like the Megalos Beyond itself- not just Outerversal Authority or something like it.","She felt it flow towards him and yet at the same time, nothing was lost.","Around them, the waves of Megalos Beyond seemed to be getting richer.","The weavings of Dark Matter seemed to be getting more potent!","Why was this?","She wanted to understand this unreal phenomenon as it was all connected to the entity before her, and when she looked closely, she could almost see the weavings of something new from the massive connection she only caught a glimpse of.","But now...they were no longer connected, and she couldn't observe it anymore.","So towards his question...","|Yes...I've confirmed what I wanted to confirm.|","She answered succinctly as his singularities blazed, and his figure sat in a meditative position even in this Nexus of Megalos Records as...","CRACK!","Cracks formed even in this ethereal space as obsidian brilliance began to flow towards him, his figure becoming encased by it!","And yet...this Nexus of Megalos Records did not lose anything.","It even seemed to be gaining more as imperceptible waves radiated from him and made everything richer!","|...|","Aspasia gazed at this scene with an inquisitive gaze.","She...was not able to find exactly what she was looking for that would confirm this Entity was the Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of.","But, the Sign outside of the Grave of the Great Beyonder right now gave him tremendous authenticity.","That was now two Signs, and the most recent one came directly as a result of his actions!","So he could be considered the one that the Great Beyonder spoke of. If the Great Mother asked her, this was what she would say.","But herself...she wanted to also look at this being and understand him more. So she also sat in a meditative position in the Nexus of Megalos Records and watched him.","Outside, their bodies were still connected as he pierced into the very depths of her existence. This was still a connection she could exploit to learn about this being as at this moment, within the core of the Organ they were in, seas of the Megalos Beyond were constantly sinking into his body and flowing into the connection extending behind him.","She felt her own Authority surge faster, her own connection to the Megalos Beyond become deeper, and her own power was steadily rising.","Almost as if she was connected to an agent of the Megalos Beyond itself!","She looked at this being closely as she sensed all the changes around them, and she wondered.","'Just who are you, Ozymandias?'","She wondered, and soon after, she also received a message.","A message from none other than the Great Mother.","|My Little Aspasia, did you see it? Did you see Rain?!|","Her intent drilled into her mind as she could feel her long fed fanaticism. And so she sent back the intent she had prepared.","|Yes, Great Mother. It came as a direct result of his actions.|","...!","She told the truth.","Even though it wasn't the full truth as she didn't mention that she didn't finish the full ritual of confirmation.","But from the other side, the cheer of the Great Mother was overflowing.","|Haha, good. Good! Keep yourself close to him, Aspasia. Guide him. If you can Imprint yourself on him and have him care for you, even better. I've activated the mechanism to take this Grave away from here and towards the nearest Megalos Pantheon. There, gather the support of other Outerversal Morphons. Spread the news of the arrival of the Instrument! There, he can challenge the Crucible of the Beyonder and further cement his position. There, we will begin gathering support as all others will follow.|","...!"]},{"number":3244,"title":"Chapter 3244: Chapter 3243 Change! I","paragraphs":["The nearest Megalos Pantheon.","A Domain of unfathomable size where millions of Outerversal Morphons reside.","A holy place among many others that the Great Beyonder deemed sacred, leaving behind his Crucible of the Beyonder there for all of these cycles!","In any Pantheon, conflict and fighting were not allowed.","Such places gathered the weavings of many Outerversal Morphons as across the Megalos Beyond, there were many ways for one to gain power.","Performing Alieia and connecting to Delegatus across the weavings of existence was one.","Another even more straightforward way...was to devour other Outerversal Morphons and inherit all their work.","The countless threads of connections an Outerversal Morphon had formed for who knew how many cycles could become the gain of someone else if they came across a particularly tyrannical Morphon!","So many Morphons made Megalos Pantheons their homes as they lived there for many cycles, only occasionally leaving by sending out clones of their bodies.","And the nearest Pantheon...was the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra!","Little Aspasia heard the commands of the Great Mother as she nodded with affirmation and replied.","|Understood, Great Mother.|","The stage was set.","Rain fell over the Grave of the Great Beyonder, but at this moment, it began to pulse with magnificent scenery.","Far below it, imperceptibly, millions of illusory tentacles formed into an infinity symbol that began to spin, its glow rising up and covering everything as even while surrounded by an unknown number of Heretical Morphons, it was bound to slip from their grasp due to nothing else but the sheer preparations and power of the Great Mother!","HUUM!","The massive illusory infinity symbol spun and gushed out waves of Outerversal Authority, the crimson barrier of the Grave of the Great Beyonder remaining intact as heavy Authorities clashed around it.","But inside of this barrier...one could only see the convergence of Black flames. The massive pulsing organ and floating Pillars of brilliance were nowhere to be seen.","Instead, a unique power shuttled an entire domain across the Megalos Beyond, its destination being one of the many large stretches of Pantheons stretching out across this endless space!","—","Brilliance.","The speed at which such a thing could traverse was unknown, but Noah felt it closely as seas of stellar obsidian radiance poured from a place he didn't even know existed days ago.","All of it was funneled across intricately as the first speckles of this brilliance landed on an Aletheian Haven!","Within the Infinite Omniverse.","Gravitating across a multicolored Extremity Vein, the Aletheian Haven of Dreams was by itself approaching the size of a hundredth of the known bounds of an average Omniverse.","This scope alone was shocking to grasp, but this Haven was one of the many that made the Infinite Omniverse as its size matched it!","The stretches of sandy gold brilliance seemed endless.","At the center of what used to be the Dream Dimension, the golden sands trembled as they ballooned upwards as if a mountain was forming.","Nearby, a group of Dreams could be seen as they looked like magnificent horses with golden wings fluttering on their backs and a sharp horn rising from their heads.","Their heads rose towards the distantly rising mountains as they felt something.","A mountain more massive than any Reality of Extremity Passages as it rose like a massive tower, and when it reached a certain point...","BZZZT!","Its absolute peak began to crack a moment later, as if it were an active volcano, everything exploded.","Endless waves of stellar obsidian radiance gushed from this golden mountain with so much force that it looked like a pillar of black light was tearing across the Dream Aletheian Haven and only going higher across the skies.","And it did just that.","It endlessly rose up before moments later...drops of stellar obsidian radiance began to wash over the Dream Aletheian Haven and all its nearby golden sands!","And here is where utter wonder unfolded.","As if set on fire.","As if poked and agitated.","The very weavings of the golden sands jumped, the small particulates that made them begin to dance and react to the obsidian brilliance falling from the skies.","PA! PA! PA!","Each clash between a golden grain of sand of the quintillions of grains of sand in this Haven clashed with an opposing grain of obsidian radiance.","Matter and Dark Matter collided.","Even the Commonwealth knew frighteningly little regarding the weavings of Dark Matter. Today, a lesson and a breakthrough would be made as after a single particle of golden sand smashed into an obsidian particle of Dark Matter once, they only repulsed each other.","BOOM!","Twice, they only repulsed each other.","BOOM!","On the third time, they gravitated towards each other as if there was an intricate array of waves and strings nobody else could see, the impact on the third time causing something fantastical.","They came in contact and opposed each other once more, but at the point of contact where they repulsed...a black gold singularity bloomed.","A black gold sand.","Such a phenomenon happened not to just a single grain of sand smashing and repulsive from a single grain of the obsidian radiance gushing down.","It happened to the millions of golden grains of sand nearby as after three clashes, millions of black gold grains of sand formed.","|A new particle...|","In the skies.","A figure of Noah floated grandly as he looked at what occurred with wonder.","The mixture of black and gold currently looked like the millions of stars gravitating around each other akin to a massive galaxy, and after three bursts of contact, millions of black gold stars were born as it only caused this spanning galaxy to become larger.","Once the black gold sands were born, they gushed out like waves towards the surroundings and caused a chain link reaction where even more of them were born!","Noah looked at this with shining eyes as he summarized.","|The interaction of Matter and Dark Matter...produced another particle entirely.|","It was a shocking finding!","One that had to be looked at closely for what it really was!"]},{"number":3245,"title":"Chapter 3245: Chapter 3244 Change! II","paragraphs":["They didn't assimilate with each other.","They didn't annihilate each other.","Whether it was due to him and the Infinite Omniverse being in a unique situation or not, Noah observed and discovered on this day particles of Matter and Dark Matter colliding as something entirely new was born thereafter!","Nearby, the Dreams in the form of Winged Unicorns gas unconsciously began to run, but flecks of the newly born black gold sand fell on their hair coat as wondrously, it only sunk in harmlessly.","But thereafter.","NEEIGH!","Cries echoed out from the golden Winged Unicorns as their furry hair coats bloomed with black gold radiance, their sizes beginning to increase greatly along with the level of their Existence!","Noah observed this closely as he continued to analyze everything that occurred.","|The newly formed particle is unnamed, but it is extremely reactive to lifeforms as exposure to it initiates a rapid change in Existence. And this change...|","The change was profound as after it covered a majority of their Existence, an invisible beam of obsidian light only Noah could see stretched out from the Winged Unicorns and rose upwards.","....!","It looked like a thin fishing line as it crossed the Infinite Omniverse rapidly, ascending ever higher as its target fantastically streaked towards the Megalos Beyond!","It was astonishing to see as for the first time, as far as Noah could tell, a link of a Delegatus would be formed, but it was initiated by the Delegatus itself.","The target of this fishing line...Noah could already tell it was none other than Ozymandias who was the one that all of these seas of Dark Matter were flowing through to reach here!","|...|","He stared at such scenes wordlessly as around him, the voice of the Infinite Omniverse could be heard.","|Theoretically, Matter and Dark Matter wouldn't clash as freely, with the likely scenario being Dark Matter passing through Matter and only affecting its subsequent interactions. But there seems to be something else causing the current phenomenon. Studying what the Commonwealth refers to as Tainted Omniverses would help in clarifying things.|","Yes.","The Commonwealth called Omniverses that had Outerversal Morphon ruling over them as Tainted Omniverses.","They held threads of Dark Matter with them as they even formed a Dark Matter Core!","A normal Omniverse didn't have a Dark Matter Core, and yet a Tainted one did.","What secrets was it hiding?","Noah had such a thought while observing the wondrous interaction of weavings of Megalos Beyond and his Infinite Omniverse become even more expansive.","From a few thousand miles.","To millions of miles in the span of a second.","To a single light year, and further on!","The Dream Aletheian Haven became a gorgeous black gold landscape gradually as even its skies began to change- the space taking of a glowing stellar black gold hue.","\"What changes are occurring to the Infinite Omniverse overall?\"","He asked lightly as a reply came soon after.","|With every clash and spread of the Dark Matter through the connection with the particles of Matter just in this Dream Aletheian Haven, more energy is generated. More complex weavings and interactions of existence are generated. Defying Manadynamics, energy seems to be emerging freely along with an increase in mass. It is more stable than Existential Terraforming as the Dream Aletheian Haven alone is on its way to double in size if not triple. The newly produced particle between the clash of Matter and Dark Matter is being studied for better understanding, and has been termed a Psioneutrino.|","...! He discovered a new particle and it was granted a name in itself","A Psioneutrino. What were its qualities? How did it behave? Noah waved his hands from the rapidly changing sands around him, his fingers coming to grasp a radiant dark gold grain of sand between two fingers.","He brought it up to his eyes as different types of Existential Extremity Authorities flowed into it.","He began with Manadynamics.","And...","BOOM!","The Psioneutrino particle in his hands instantly expanded in size and gained a blue ring of light around it!","|The infusion of authority into a Psioneutrino Particle instantly tripled the amount of energy available, with this particle being extremely conducive and stable with other forms of energy. The effects of the imposed authority can be expressed at three times their original output.|","...!","Shocking findings were being made in real-time.","Noah was enamored with it as he then infused the Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority of Entropy into the Psioneutrino Particle!","BZZT!","Arcs of light buzzed as the color blue was melded seamlessly with a dark purple brilliance of Entropy.","|Acting akin to an intermediary, the Psioneutrino Particle perfectly balances the weavings of two different authorities, allowing both of them to be expressed simultaneously without any rejection.|","\"...\"","Noah's eyes were dazed with brilliance.","This...","This was not just a product between Matter and Dark Matter, but something that only came to be due to the unique connection of him and Ozymandias, and then Ozymandias and the Infinite Omniverse!","There was something between them all that caused the birth of this shocking new particle; and it shouldn't be something that appeared even in Tainted Omniverses where Outerversal Morphons brought down the weavings of Dark Matter.","Noah felt like it could change many things in utterly profound ways.","Generation of energy. A tripling of authority flowing through it. Harmony of different Authorities contained in it!","And these were the only things he had discovered just in the first few seconds.","He looked at the enlarged particle of Psioneutrino in his hands as Manadynamics and Entropy flowed out from it calmly, its size reducing as it returned to its dark gold brilliance.","Noah looked at it with great interest as his gaze then went to the Winged Unicorns that had turned entirely dark gold.","Another pair of wings sprouted from their backs as on their heads, three bright horns could now be seen!","Their eyes were unfathomably bright as tendrils of dark gold lightning flashed from their pupils.","|New species of Existence have been discovered.|","Unknown as imperceptible changes came from the discovery of a new particle- a particle synthesized by Noah's own actions!","As he looked at it, he wondered.","What would happen if he placed a Psioneutrino within the makeup of his existence? Amidst his makeup of Quarks, Leptons, and all others? Just what type of being would he become?!"]},{"number":3246,"title":"Chapter 3246: Chapter 3245 Change! III","paragraphs":["3245 Change! III","There was always the question of unknowns for Noah. He loved to push the boundaries of the unknown as what he found on the other side was always something that brought him either an immense challenge or exhilaration.","Right now, the biggest unknown that he was looking at was the newly synthesized particle that came about as a result of the influx of what looked to be like the Megalos Beyond itself into his Infinite Omniverse.","In the depths of his existence, he could feel his heart pulsing as if he were on the cusp of something grandiose.","And the constant communication that he had with the Infinite Omniverse only further cemented this point, its monotone voice continuing to resound in his mind.","|The newly discovered species carry the attributes of both Matter and Dark Matter. While the core of their existence continues to be made up entirely of Matter, it is only the subtle interactions of the newly synthesized particles that have immensely boosted the functionality, efficiency, and weavings of their existence.|","He listened calmly as every part of his existence itched to start this process himself, but he wanted to be thorough. Currently, the influx of the Megalos Beyond was only within the Dream Aletheian Haven.","The Psioneutrino Particles were those that came about from the constant clashing of the Matter within the Dream Aletheian Haven and the Dark Matter of the Megalos Beyond.","He wanted to have an even wider pool than this, so he gave his command to the Infinite Omniverse.","\"Allow the spread of the endless seas of the Megalos Beyond onto the other Havens and start gathering all the newly synthesized particles from each one. Whenever it is ready, we shall see what will be born from the placement of multiple different newly synthesized particles into the very depths of my existence.\"","...!","|Understood, Master. I would also like to begin the establishment of a separate Haven made up entirely of these newly synthesized particles.|","A daring idea flowed from the Infinite Omniverse as Noah gave a light nod of affirmation.","He even continued further.","\"See how the forging of the Omniversal Armaments compares if this newly synthesized particle is introduced. You can even veer from the field of blacksmithing and into alchemy as well and judge the products.\"","His voice was succinct and filled with possibilities.","He didn't know where all of this would lead. He only knew that he would keep going forward.","Under his direction, another massive Haven floating around the Extremity Vein of the Infinite Omniverse burst with a pillar of stellar obsidian light.","Inside Genesis. Inside Apollyon, Helios, Penumbra, Avalon, Prana...weavings of obsidian brilliance began to emerge fully.","The size of these Havens increased multiple times over and from them, something new arose at every turn.","In totality, the entire Infinite Omniverse began to seethe with an influx of authority as this process fully unfolded.","It took on the path of an Infinite Omniverse in a true sense at this moment.","—","Across the weavings of the recently discovered Omniverse X-999.","The worms of anti-existence were veiled and hidden, but they were always there.","And a single entity knew exactly where they were this whole time, since the subjugated existences that he had been in control of had been devoured one after another by these very same worms.","Noah Eckert.","He experienced the annihilation of matter itself again and again as his will and consciousness entered the infinitely dark space inside of the Worms of Existence and experienced its annihilation multiple times.","Since the arrival of the protectors, it had been harder and harder to locate the Worms of Existence, but he tugged upon the sensation of annihilation and sent more and more of the forces of the Imperium that he had subjugated to fall prey to these Worms.","And finally, after thousands upon thousands of cycles of annihilation where parts of his soul were instantaneously devoured and obliterated, a different reaction occurred","Instead of the usual annihilation, he found himself still able to observe and see even after his soul was wiped out.","As if he had been baptized within the cycles of annihilation, as parts of his soul faced it again and again, the main component of his soul gradually developed a form of resistance.","And this was all that he was looking for.","It only took another few 100 deaths of his subjugated forces before his mutated will was capable of existing without being attacked as if it were a foreign object inside of the Worms of Existence.","When he arrived at this point, everything else was set in stone. He was patient. He was quiet and he proceeded slowly. He began the very slow but gradual domination of something but he did not yet fully understand.","He only hoped that he would be successful.","At this point in time, he did begin to realize that his soul, which was always distinct and different, had begun to subtly change for better or for worse.","But as always, he liked to believe it was for better!","One Entity delved into Anti-Matter.","One Entity delved into Dark Matter.","When the dust settled, it was hard to predict just what result would come from each of their actions.","—","Inside the Obelisk of the Protectors.","In the private domain only accessible to the Equestris Protectors, Command Protector Valeria suddenly changed her gaze and tilted it as if she were listening to something.","Soon after...her eyes became firm as she waved her hands to cause the massive illusory image of their target, which they had been discussing this whole time, to disappear.","\"Alright, you have been briefed with all the details on what you can expect inside of the Half Tainted Omniverse. The goal for you now is not to die, and contribute all you can in achieving the destruction of that Dark Matter Core. We have the clearance to set off!\"","Her words sparked the attention of the powerful three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians whose bodies danced wildly with power.","Her sister, Protector Lucretia, let go of her lazy demeanor as she sat straight on her throne!","And in the midst of this all, Noah only smiled as his eyes pulsed with readiness.","He sat there among them, and yet none of them knew that at this very moment, he was wildly spreading Dark Matter within his own personal Omniverse!"]},{"number":3247,"title":"Chapter 3247: Chapter 3246 Change! IV","paragraphs":["3246 Change! IV","The weavings of the Wheel were their own.","They could not be so easily grasped and understood.","The ebb and flow was something that common life forms would forever stare at in the distance, endlessly out of reach.","Countless things came and went, countless interactions weaved to and fro over cycles and eons unknown.","Could a single stone cast into all these cycles and chaos manage to effect any significant change?","—","Across the weavings of Existence.","Inside of an Omniverse undiscovered by the Commonwealth.","The weavings of Existential Extremity Authorities were prevalent here, but they seemed distorted and altered compared to normal.","They flowed like endless threads towards a single direction- a direction where a vibrant obsidian stellar hue pulsed and gave all the color in the surroundings.","The deeper one followed the threads of distorted Existential Extremity Authorities, the more suffocating a sensation of power they would feel as soon enough, they would come across titanic Entities with skeletal forms wading about.","Their numbers ranged by the trillions, from different species of all walks of life.","Without fail, their skeletal structures shone with a terrifying black and white hue- almost metallic in nature as they looked unbreakable.","Past these trillions of skeletal life forms, the converging distorted weavings of Existential Extremity Authorities flowed into an extremely heavy obsidian singularity that was surrounded by shattered remnants of millions of Domains of Existence.","It was a Dark Matter Core!","A complete one at that, not one stemming from a Half Tainted Omniverse.","In its very depths, a titanic skeleton the size of a cosmos bowed towards certain darkness, very little being visible in the depths of the massive Dark Matter Core.","|Any orders for me, Master? I hunger to conquer even more under your name...|","The voice was a powerful one, burning with Outerversal Authority and a fearsome sense of destruction!","The place it spoke towards was filled with boundless darkness, and yet the pure brilliance of an obsidian glinting skeleton was barely observable from the sockets that burned with white flames.","|Nothing on the horizon yet on this side, Bellerophon. One of my Chosen is going to put on an interesting show for me as she heads to take one of the heads of Savitar. If she is capable enough and succeeds, I will feed off of Savitar and reward her. If your blade seeks blood...follow up on these rumors of the Sign. I am getting whispers of Rain on the other side, Bellerophon. Rain! Haha, This is bound to make things more interesting as it means the weavings of the Great Beyonder are about to light up with activity. And once his weavings are lit up...|","...!","He spoke with great respect when talking of the Great Beyonder.","And when he spoke of the 'Other side' that referred to the Megalos Beyond, it was almost like he was speaking about one side of a single coin!","|Once his weavings are lit up, they will even affect things here in the Megalos Ynnere. Then, the already active Megalos Nihilos will get even wilder. In this wildness, Bellerophon, we will make grand moves.|","A dense amount of information was unveiled all at once as this being spoke of grandiose things.","He referred to where he currently was, within the space holding this Tainted Omniverse, as the Megalos Ynnere!","There was the Megalos Beyond where this entity stemmed from, and he also mentioned Megalos Nihilos.","Three inexplicable wonders.","Three bodies.","And each seemed as mysterious and endless as the one before it!","—","Inside of a Vessel the size of a small world.","Under the banner of the Commonwealth, there were many dazzling technological advances that allowed for the forging of fantastical vessels, but the ones carrying powerful Protectors of the Commonwealth more often than not were on the smaller size.","Something smaller wasn't seeking attention.","Something smaller could more easily bypass the attention of the horrors out there.","Inside of this vessel termed as the Omniversal Voyager, Noah walked across a crystalline white floor- his direction being towards the curvaceous visage of Protector Lucretia who was staring out through the transparent glass made of unknown materials.","The Equestris Protectors worked fast after being given clearance, with their leave from the Obelisk of the Protectors being quick while delving into this personal Vessel of Command Protector Valeria that instantly shot out of the Omniverse of the Protectors.","The figures of Command Protector Valeria and the three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors were at the very front of the vessel, Protector Lucretia being the only one in this area as Noah came to stand beside her while staring out into the endless dark brilliance with the occasional flashes of white around them.","The moment he arrived, Protector Valeria spoke out in a serene tone.","\"Do you know how the Outerversal Morphons refer to this endless expanse of Existence we are currently crossing? The Megalos Ynnere. We've heard them mention it many times over the eons as they truly believe in giving us such a distinction, as if we are only a part of something, and not everything. Where we are is the endless expanse of Existence itself, but they seem to indicate otherwise. What do you believe, Protector Osmont?\"","Her question was a thoughtful one.","Noah took in the information she offered while replying.","\"I don't think we encompass all of the stretches of Existence itself. On this, I would agree more with the Outerversal Morphons.\"","\"Oh? You would side with a viewpoint of Outerversal Morphons?\" The brows of Protector Lucretia were raised with interest as her crimson hair danced on her shoulders like flaming snakes, her face showing a playful smile.","Noah smiled with a sharp gaze as he nodded.","\"Yes. After all, apart from being able to unravel and expose Outerversal Morphons with my Authorities, my eyes can at times recognize an agent of an Outerversal Morphon with just a mere gaze if they ever happened to stand right before me.\"","...!","Calm words.","Yet the playful smile on Protector Lucretia faded as her eyes became immeasurably sharp while staring right into Noah!","Tomorrow's working chapter titles: Half Tainted Omniverse! I & II","Adui","Creator's Thought"]},{"number":3248,"title":"Chapter 3248: Chapter 3247 Revelations I","paragraphs":["The surroundings buzzed.","Protector Lucretia turned her head sideways as her fair neck was exposed, the tight multicolored battledress on her body pulsing with the light of an Omniversal Armament.","Behind Noah, his own Omniversal Armament buzzed as an air of profound tension bloomed in this small corner of the Omniversal Voyager!","|Your eyes can recognize an agent of an Outerversal Morphon if they were just standing right before you?|","Her voice echoed in his mind as an intent.","She didn't voice outwardly as her boredom and playful eyes became exceedingly calm at this moment.","Noah could see it.","She was contemplating.","She was judging and trying to see if his words held the meaning they held.","Towards her question, Noah smiled as his lips opened without bothering to use any intent.","\"Yes. Let's use you as an example. At this distance, if there was anything you were hiding, I would be able to see it plainly. Of course, not that you would be hiding anything whatsoever.\"","...!","His words only caused her eyes to become ever colder, but in the corner of her gaze, she could see that the few weavings Noah had uttered caught the attention of her sister at the forefront of the Omniversal Voyager.","Almost like an itch that represented the terrifying perception that Omniversal Entities had.","Noah felt this as well, and he wondered how this unique entity before him would react!","He wanted to understand her purpose and even obtain any information that others didn't know as he went about it in a straightforward way.","With the Will of Command Protector Valeria barreling towards them as she wondered what her sister could be discussing with the newly joining Protector, Lucretia lost all the coldness entirely as she walked towards Noah with an exotic gaze, her legs moving with a sense of enticement.","\"Mmm, how about you and I go somewhere a bit more private? It may take hours or even days to cross the endless weavings of Existence until we reach that Half Tainted Omniverse...\"","She came in front of Noah and put her hands around his neck, both of them noticing the heavy will of Command Protector Valeria observing them at this moment as Noah played along!","\"Oh? Then we do have some time on our hands.\"","His own hands reached out to grab onto her blessed waist, a flash of a chilling light blooming in her eyes that she pushed down deeply and instead gave him a smile, a unique golden authority bursting from her that moved their bodies from this area of the Omniversal Voyager and towards one of the few private lodgings that looked like miniature Havens.","Inside a private lodging filled with vibrant fruits and liquids full of Nectar of Existence and a few thrones surrounding a table, their figures reappeared as they still felt the gaze of Command Protector Valeria!","Protector Lucretia also felt the eyes of her sister as she moved forward with determination, pushing Noah's figure towards a throne nearby and straddling him while the multicolored Omniversal Armament in the form of a battledress began to unwind around her.","It was only when she did this that the gaze of Command Protector Valeria faded away as if she couldn't keep watching any longer.","The moment that occurred, the amorous expression of Protector Lucretia faded as the hands that were sweetly holding onto Noah turned into sharp pincers, her right hand raised as a multicolored Dagger appeared- its sharp tip pointed towards Noah's head as terrifying authority gathered on it!","The Authority was unique, as if no matter what happened now or what would happen in the future, its penetrative light would always find its mark no matter what.","The red hair of the woman holding it danced wildly as her eyes carried an angry light filled with wrath and exhaustion.","|Why won't you all leave me alone?! He promised. After the last news I gave him, he promised to not gaze at me or what I was doing! So why the fuck did he send you? I've done everything he asked. Why jeopardize my standing by blatantly sending a Morphon here when you know that is the one condition I fucking had?!|","...!","Her eyes carried immense rage.","Hatred.","When she spoke about Him.","The one who she thought sent Noah. When she spoke about Morphons.","She was filled with such immense hatred that her hands trembled!","It was the appearance of a Delegatus who utterly loathed that she even was one, and wanted to do anything in her power to make sure she wasn't exposed!","Noah gazed at the terrifying glint of the dagger above him as he smiled.","\"That was a lot of reveal in a single outburst...but you must have mistaken me for something else. I am no Morphon nor an Agent of one.\"","He lied blatantly and with a smile.","His words caused the pupils of Protector Lucretia to tremble before she became even more stern, her will spreading out and layering waves of a unique Existential Extremity Authority around them.","Thereafter, from the tip of her Omniversal Armament, stellar black light gathered.","It was none other than Outerversal Authority as it dripped from the dagger and onto Noah, landing on his forehead as it was akin to a drop of water that split into smaller droplets and slid off his face.","...!","Not even an ounce of a reaction.","Protector Lucretia's face became ashen at such a reality as she pulled her dagger back and got off Noah's figure.","|What? You...you aren't...?! Fuck!|","She made a mistake.","Seeing his knowledgeable eyes as if he had seen through his secret, she had revealed herself so simply!","Her graceful face, full of anger, still grasped the dagger tightly as she came to stare at Noah.","|Why...did you not say anything to others if you saw my identity? If you aren't involved with them, what purpose does it serve you to remain quiet when the only job you were given relied on exposing agents under Outerversal Morphon?!|","What purpose did he have?","When asked this question, Noah rose from the throne his body was pushed in as he shook his head.","\"Before that. The Outerversal Morphon behind you, who is it? Just how powerful are they?\"","|...|"]},{"number":3249,"title":"Chapter 3249: Chapter 3248 Revelations II","paragraphs":["Protector Lucretia was silent as she didn't say anymore.","She gathered herself as she still held the dagger in her hands, her authority beginning to rise once more as her face showed hesitation.","This being now truly knew her secret regardless of how they arrived here. She was having internal turmoil on how to take care of this if he truly wasn't involved with Outerversal Morphons!","But she didn't reply.","So Noah pushed even harder.","\"Is the one you are bound to Savitar? Or someone else? Are we walking into a trap right now as we head towards the Half Tainted Omniverse?\"","...!","His words caused her face filled with difficulty to change as she shook her head vehemently.","|What? I have nothing to do with Savitar. And he...that Entity...he promised safety for me and Valeria. He never goes back on his words.|","\"Safety for you and your sister. So the rest of those around you might die.\"","|...|","Noah nodded thoughtfully as he processed many things.","Looking at his nonchalant demeanor in the midst of all of this, Protector Lucretia seemed to have figured something out as she put the dagger down and sighed.","|This is just another one of your bodies, isn't it? Without the power of someone similar to my Sister, I cannot eradicate you along with the root of all of your possible Existence wherever you are.|","She stated something wholly and true as Noah gazed at her and nodded with a smile.","She looked at him deeply once more as if she were trying to figure him out.","|Who are you, really? What do you want?|","...!","Noah smiled.","He had been asked this question many times before.","And his answer always differed.","Towards this red haired entity before him...","\"Just think of me as a helper. Just like Old Man Eudemus, I seek to solve the same problems you all face.\"","|...|","His words caused Protector Lucretia to turn placid as she sighed and put her dagger away.","|You didn't say anything when you found out, so you won't say anything now, is that it? I have been tightly carrying this stain on my existence for many years now. Another person knowing of it fills me with great anxiety as if you suddenly decide to flap your mouth...|","She sat on another throne as she massaged her temples and thought of many possible paths she could take.","She made a ridiculous mistake today by being rash as now, she was in a predicament with someone she didn't know all too well.","Someone who, at this moment, was looking at her as if he were observing a certain exotic animal.","\"You won't tell me who the Outerversal Morphon behind you is? I may be able to help.\"","Lucretia turned her gaze towards him with a deprecating look.","|It doesn't matter, does it? What would someone like you even do? This isn't something that can be solved even if you attain a Fabled Omniverse. I am bound. I will remain bound. Until...|","Her gaze was filled with longing.","As if she wanted to be free.","But she could only shake her head and sigh.","She had tried far too many times.","|No. I cannot even say his name. If I do, he will use it as an excuse to gaze at me. I've already made many mistakes today, so I'll make another small one by saying that among Outerversal Morphons, he is granted the distinction of a Great One. Great...that single word means and stands for something more grandiose than you can ever imagine.|","Protector Lucretia shook her head as she seemed tired.","On the other side, Noah sat on his throne and nodded as he gained one piece of information after another.","Uniquely, he raised his head and looked at a high point inside of the miniaturized domain they were in within this Omniversal Voyager Vessel.","At the ceiling of this Domain, he was staring at something.","He was surprised about another thing this whole time.","Because even though Protector Lucretia felt the gaze of her sister fade away, the means of Omniversal Entities were profound.","Only Noah who had begun to look closely at Matter and Dark Matter, and had his status as the Weaver of Extremity and Existence elevated, was able to notice the thin pulsing of an interaction that was as small as a Quark dancing above them like an eye.","An eye that Protector Lucretia didn't see, but Noah saw clearly for it to still be the gaze of Command Protector Valeria.","She saw everything.","And yet...","There was only calmness in the surroundings as nothing happened.","After her sister making a mistake and revealing that she was a Delegatus of an Outerversal Morphon, nothing happened even though she witnessed it all!","\"...\"","Noah's eyes turned ever brighter.","The sister knew?","The Omniversal Entity of the Commonwealth leading a powerful team of Protectors knew that her Sister was an Agent of Outerversal Morphons?!","\"This gets better and better....\"","He stroked his chin while looking at the small unseen point above, making it clear to this gaze that he could see it!","This gaze that was originating all the way towards the front of the Omniversal Voyager where the Command Protector Valeria was, along with the three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors.","The three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians were talking amongst themselves as they reclined on radiant thrones while eating vibrant Fruits pulsing with Existence.","|This is the first time I see Lucretia sneak around with someone else since she was with The Great Luminary Protector. Wouldn't he be mad that his replacement is a newbie she met just a day ago?|","One Royal Simian, Protector Actaeon, had a gaze of interest as they sent a mental message to the other two Protectors- Orpheus and Ajax.","|An Omniversal Star of our Commonwealth or a newbie who has not even come close to a Fabled Omniverse...haha. Mmm, I heard they clashed and disagreed on something a while ago, so she can do whatever she wants. But hey...we've been with her for a while, but she didn't go for any of us. Do you think she prefers them furless? She doesn't know the pleasure of a Simian full of fur, or she wouldn't go bac-|","In the midst of what should have been their private weavings to each other, a sharp voice cut in that stopped all weavings entirely.","\"Are you all little girls who have so much time to gossip when we are heading to a Half Tainted Omniverse right now? Review the physiology of our enemy if you have so much time!\"","The booming voice of Command Protector Valeria shook them as they cleared their throats and rose straighter on their thrones.","Command Protector Valeria gazed at them coldly before she continued her sharp focus on steering the Omniversal Voyager while protecting them and veiling everything.","Her power was vast.","Her might was unfathomable.","She was even fearlessly going to hunt down a body of a Great One at this very moment!","But when she recalled what she just observed between her sister and Osmont.","When she recalled what her own little sister had never dared to even come to her for help.","When she recalled all of this...she felt so powerless.","But such a stifling feeling was temporary.","Inside her, a power that very few entities understood swirled.","With this power, she would cut down all Morphons herself if she had to.","The one they targeted now. The one behind her Sister.","She would eradicate every single one.","No matter the cost, she would find freedom for her sister!","As for this newly entering Protector Osmont that was an extreme unknown that could change many things...","Valeria's eyes became sharp as a part of her will stared straight into his eyes that were turned up in a distant room of this vessel.","As if he could see her clearly, and he was smiling freely as if none of that mattered.","—","While Noah stared fearlessly into the will of an omniversal entity in a corner of what the Outerversal Morphons considered the Megalos Ynnere, his Existence was about to undergo an unfathomable change within the Infinite Omniverse!","Inside of the Infinite Omniverse.","\"Megalos Beyond...Megalos Ynnere...\"","The words echoed from a dense stellar cluster interweaving Quarks and Leptons among other unknown particles that made up Noah.","At this moment, he went over the words of Lucretia as he put together many things; all the while, above him, a cloud of dazzling Psioneutrino Particles stably floated.","Some dark gold. Some dark blue. Some dark white, dark green, dark red, dark purple...and on and on.","From each of his Aletheian Havens, he brought multiple Psioneutrino Particles as he prepared.","He never even bothered to question whether altering the very basis of his makeup was possible, he just went ahead and began doing it at this moment!","With a devilish light of expectations, the clouds of countless particles that made him vibrated as he bellowed out.","|Come!|","...!"]},{"number":3250,"title":"Chapter 3250: Chapter 3249 A Higher Form of Existence! I","paragraphs":["Every action had an equal and opposite reaction.","Every choice had an effect. Causality could be twisted and distorted in any myriad of ways, but at the end of the day, what was intended or unintended would unfold!","On this day, Noah had an intention of what he wanted the result to be. It was unknown whether this would be exactly what he achieved.","|Newly synthesized Existential Elementary Particles are being placed alongside other Existential Elementary Particles that make up Noah Osmont.|","His stellar cloud of quarks, leptons, and other unknown wonders he didn't fully know of faced an intrusion of a multicolored cloud of Psioneutrino Particles, with even the idea of something like this not being feasible as if someone tried to do something like this....their existence would very likely break down.","How could you just add something else to a mixture that was already completed?","To do so would cause an imbalance as every single interaction that your Existential makeup utilized would be thrown out of order!","Very likely, your makeup would unwind from such an event as you would cease to exist.","But, the Elementary Particles utilized here were Psioneutrino Particles.","Unique constructs that seemed to perfectly meld into any authority they were placed in without fail.","So when placed into the Existential makeup of someone...","HUUUM!","A glorious multicolored brilliance overshadowed by a stellar obsidian light flashed.","| The Psioneutrino Particles were efficiently and smoothly placed between the weavings of Quarks and Leptons.|","|A slight disruption to the interactions of other Particles observed.|","His very existence trembled as he felt like he was smacked with the intensity and heaviness of trillions of suns.","A slight disruption to the interactions of his existence caused this!","The waves. The strings that his Particles followed the motion of as they interacted with each other.","They only felt a slight disruption as after it...","|New interactions are being established accounting for the Psioneutrino Particles.|","|Harmony and resonance between all that makes up your existence is sought.|","...!","A glorious stellar obsidian radiance covered the dense cloud of trillions of Particles that represented his existence as they all began to swirl.","It looked beautiful.","Akin to a radiant gravitating galaxy.","Akin to a system that was just...Quintessential.","|Quintessential resonance between the makeup of your existence has been achieved.|","|The accumulated results are now brought to fruition.|","...!","The cloud of trillions of swirling particles spun faster as it all began to converge towards a humanoid form.","But unlike what it used to be, it seemed to be larger in proportion.","More magnificent.","More glorious!","HUUM!","A beam of stellar multicolored radiance shot from him as his body came together, the inclusion of the Psioneutrino Particles causing shocking and unfathomable changes to his existence as the mere weavings of who he used to be were different!","The flow of energy.","The flow of existence.","The make up!","It was all different as the vibrant cloud of stellar brilliance came together to form a large humanoid entity, his fair skin scintillating with stellar luster as on his back, a pair of gorgeous wings unfurled.","One was filled with vibrant colorless white feathers, while the other radiated a pure black wonder.","The body looked muscular and chiseled as if sculpted with perfect proportions, and around the fair skin...vibrant obsidian bands that looked like tattoos began to appear.","Around the chest.","Around his hands.","On his lower body.","Thick and gorgeously proportioned obsidian bands formed all around as if they were black Halos wrapping around his body, with these bands pulsing to life at this moment as they felt like they were alive!","At this time, his face that looked like a celestial entity lost in time opened its eyes.","The eyes....were contrasted with pure white and black.","The moment they opened...","BOOOM!","A brilliant light flashed as in the next moment, his whole body was seemingly snuffed out of existence.","\"...\"","—","Inside of the transforming Infinite Omniverse. Within the Haven of Helios, inside a private Domain concentrated with dense Existential Authority.","A high rise skyscraper made from gold glass towered above the clouds, and on its topmost floor, there was an expansive room taking up the whole space.","Inside this room, a wide golden bed could be seen with gold silky sheets strewn about, with a figure of Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Tyranny lying back with eyes closed.","To his right, the blue hair of Adelaide fell on his chest as she nested on his side while breathing softly, while to his left, the visage of Barbaros was wide awake as her fair fingers were tracing the outline of his pectoral muscles.","It was a calm reality, and yet in the next moment...","HUUM!","The eyes of Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Tyranny opened its eyes that shone half white and half black.","And right away, Barbatos' hands that were tracing his chest and Adelaide's head that was leaning on him instantly...passed through him.","As if he wasn't material solid Matter.","Their bodies seemingly phased through his body as they hit the soft bedding they were on, and an instant later...","WAP!","Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Tyranny entirely disappeared before their eyes.","...!","\"Little Fish?\"","The gorgeous expression on Barbatos remained the same as she called out softly, not jumping to worry right after as in front of her, Adelaide was stern as she patted the area where Noah was just at!","There was no spatial light as if he teleported away, no eruption of weavings or authority.","It was just like he...blinked out of existence.","And it wasn't just in this place.","Far from here, in the Haven of Apollyon where crimson flames were raging.","Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Loot was standing in front of the Primogenitor of Steel, Ishtar, Sargon, the Seer of Sima, and a dozen other unique characters as they looked at the piece of an Armament radiating an omniversal light rising from a crimson gold lava filled mountain ahead of them.","Dazzling Blacksmith's Forges floated all around as each one was shining with an omniversal light at this moment!","Steel was talking to Noah's Clone when...","WAP!","His eyes flashed white and black, and his figure instantly disappeared right before their very eyes.","...!","Almost as if he never existed to begin with!"]},{"number":3251,"title":"Chapter 3251: Chapter 3250 A Higher Form of Existence! II","paragraphs":["Across what the Outerversal Morphons referred to as the Megalos Ynnere.","Within the Omniversal Voyager, Protector Lucretia thought of an uncertain future as she sprawled on a throne opposite to Noah.","Her mind was calculating many possibilities based on any actions she took as after a certain point of time...","|...|","She felt something off as she blinked and looked towards the throne where Noah was.","And...","|Huh...?|","He was no longer there.","As if he had never been there.","He was just...gone!","Protector Lucretia rose from her throne with incredulity as she blinked and spread out her authority, but she felt nothing nearby as she even slowly spread her authority across the Vessel they were in.","And...nothing.","|What the fuck?|","He disappeared as if he had never been in this vessel since the very beginning.","—","Flashes of interminable brilliance.","This was what Noah felt alongside the intents of prompts that allowed him to know exactly what was happening.","|A change irreversible across the weavings of the Wheel of Existence has been brought to fruition.|","|You have transcended the limitations of your designated form of life and existence.|","|You have become a unique and never before discovered form of Existence|","|Your Existence has gained the distinction of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer.|","|Your Existential Omniversal Lumen Emperor Lineage is transitioning to the Omniversal Archontes Engineer.|","|The weavings of Invictus Maximus have reached full saturation and begun their emergence.|","...!","A robust array of changes.","His very makeup was altered as the very core of his being changed.","His very lineage and form of life changed!","And yet uniquely...no changes were observed or felt by anyone in the Infinite Omniverse.","Under his own gaze, all the parables that made him were buzzing and interacting full of life and existence.","The introduction of the Psioneutrino Particles caused everything to act as if it were supercharged, the breadth of his existence tripling right away as it continued to rise even now.","The concentration of his Authorities. The level of power he could wield as a lifeform. Everything was scaled upwards in an unfathomable way.","When he opened his eyes, he could see the weavings of the Infinite Omniverse around him, and yet none of its weavings reacted to him.","Instead, his eyes felt like they were observing countless golden strings glowing calmly and with utmost stability all around him.","Golden strings.","Countless of such golden strings as from them, tendrils flowed out serenely and infused themselves unto his existence.","This was...","A higher form of Existence.","Something he gained access to by changing his own Existence!","The golden tendrils of light flowing through him were so pure and stable that the moment they touched him, they instantly traveled across all the trillions of cells that made up his existence.","The quintillions upon quintillions of quarks, leptons, Psioneutrinos, and other particles that made him- these golden tendrils of brilliance were absorbed into all of them nigh instantly before they felt ever so enriched!","He didn't fully understand it.","But at this moment, he had to put it aside as his Existence felt like it was exploding.","HUUM!","On his chest, nine brilliant singularities shone as they cried out from the very base of his existence.","His Mundis of Power.","Those that held his Systems of Existence!","They were crying out with emotion and fervor at this moment as they advanced far ahead!","|The Atlas of Existence has advanced from the Echelon of Laborer.|","[The Atlas of Existence has entered the Echelon of Administrator.|","|You have become the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence.|","...!","From a Laborer to an Administrator.","It was a fantastical change, but Noah felt a sense of oddity within his Atlas of Existence.","When the weavings of his existence came together, there was a foreign one that converged within his Atlas!","And he stared at this weaving of existence that came to be clustered...in the Third Mundi of Power.","|The weavings of a sufficiently different System of Existence have naturally flowed their makeup into the Third Mundi of Power.|","|The System of Existence of the Ingeniare has taken the place of the Third Mundi of Power.|","Ingeniare.","A word closely related to the distinction and type of existence he had just become- an Engineer!","An engineer was someone who designed and built things, and Noah had gained such a distinction by placing a newly found particle that came as a product of Matter and Dark Matter into his existence- achieving a state even he didn't fully grasp.","Noah stared closely at the fantastical change blooming within him as at this time, he felt a tug.","It was a unique tug that described...emotions of worry of those he deemed close, his existence blinking its eyes as the origin of this worry was actually right next to him.","In the Haven of Helios.","One of his many bodies was still lying on the wide golden bed, its visage much more radiant than before as unique obsidian bands wrapped his fair skin like ancient tattoos.","He could see Adelaide and Barbatos, and yet they couldn't see nor sense him as they tried communicating with him through their Lineage!","Their hands passed right through his body as if their very existence could not grasp anything about him.","Uniquely, Adelaide was still staring at the same spot on the bed where he lay.","As if her senses and connection to him were so deep to the extent that they told her he was there, and yet her authority and everything else said otherwise!","It was a shocking finding as under Noah's eyes, he gazed at the countless golden threads and strings only he could see stably moving around him...and blinked.","The vibrant bands of tattoos around his body then flashed with a golden brilliance.","And he felt like he moved his vision from a well-lit room and towards a slightly darker one, but the moment he did so...","\"Ah...\"","Barbatos screamed out as Noah reappeared in front of their eyes right where he was!","But...her small fair feet were standing and passing through his sculpted abdominal muscles.","Adelaide's vibrant blue hairs phased through his shoulders and chest as even though he was right in front of them, their hands and bodies passed right through him as if he weren't entirely real!","And yet there he was.","He smiled at them as his brilliance caused them to be dazed.","\"Did I worry you?\"","...!","It was the first sentence that the Omniversal Archontes Engineer spoke since his conception!"]},{"number":3252,"title":"Chapter 3252: Chapter 3251 Maximus! I","paragraphs":["He rose from the wide golden bed while looking at Adelaide and Barbatos.","The latter stumbled backward as her slender legs and small figure still phased through his body, her gaze one of worry as she harrumphed while her body lay bare.","\"Did you worry us...you disappeared all of a sudden, and even now...is everything okay?\"","Her tone gradually lost its gusto as she came down and spoke softly.","Noah smiled and felt the uniqueness of the surroundings under his gaze as the bands of tattoos on his body flashed again and...","\"Ah...\"","Adelaide let out a gasp as her fingers were able to feel him again.","It felt like they were finally back on the same weavings of existence as he wasn't something their hands could just pass through!","The eyes of Adelaide became moist at such a reality as she also spoke softly.","\"Is...everything okay? Have you made another advancement?\"","\"Mmm...\" Noah nodded as he saw the two were slightly shaken up, especially Adelaide who held on to his body and didn't let go as if she feared he would disappear again in the next second.","She looked at him up and down to make sure he was still all there.","She traced the bands of stellar obsidian tattoos on his body as Barbatos did the same.","Adelaide then looked into his eyes with tears forming in hers as she spoke tenderly with slight hesitation.","\"Do you...know my biggest fear? It is not some apocalypse or even death, but that one day, I would look straight into your eyes...and you wouldn't look at me the same. That you would reach an unfathomable level of Existence that when you saw me...you wouldn't think much of me. As if you were looking at a piece of stone or observing an ant on the ground below.\"","...!","Her biggest fear.","Her eyes trembled as she revealed this and continued. \"Sometimes...I even have thoughts of you stopping where you are. Not going any further. I...I know it's selfish. I know it's...I know.\"","Her words weren't able to finish as she closed her eyes feeling a sense of shame.","Tears ran down freely as Noah sighed lightly while giving her a hug, turning towards Barbatos beside him who was also sniffling slightly while keeping on a strong front as he also pulled her close.","His voice was deep and filled with determination as he replied.","\"A day will not come where I would gaze at you all with any less love than now. Likely, I will only ever look at you with boundless love that increases. You do not need to worry.\"","\"...\"","His words caused the two women to hug him ever tighter.","He had made heavy and powerful advancements that had taken him towards a new stage of existence entirely, and its implications were too grand!","He didn't even release the boons of his new Lineage to all others yet.","He had to understand it first before anything else.","His other parts of existence could do this as his body here hugged two women closely, reassuring them that no matter how high he reached, there would never come a point where he would look at his own family as if they were nothing.","That, he was sure of!","—","Inside the Omniversal Voyager.","WAP!","Noah's figure returned to what he was coming to call Lower Weavings of Existence, his visage causing the shocked Protector Lucretia, who was about to make some noise, to step back as she looked at him with scrutiny.","|You...what did you do? How did you do that?|","She was surprised more than anything as what had just occurred now showed a glimpse of a terrifying power!","Where this being could disappear at will and she wasn't able to even sense him no matter what.","He wasn't entirely honest with them about his capabilities.","Yet he looked at her calmly as if he were gazing at something small in the corner of his eyes, his hands waving dismissively as he replied.","\"You have your System of Existence with its secrets, and I have mine. I just made a little breakthrough there since I have to prepare for the unknowns of the Half Tainted Omniverse. You and your sister are guaranteed safety while the rest of us could be whisked off, remember?\"","He spoke so simply as apart from Lucretia, he could feel the hidden gaze of Command Protector Valeria even more closely honed in on him now.","He wondered whether his disappearance had also fully veiled him from the senses of an Omniversal Entity, or whether she could still capture weavings of his existence when he was in the place filled with threads of golden lines that he would label for now...the Higher Weavings of Existence!","With a glimmer, his vision switched to his many other bodies that remained within the glorious Higher Weavings of Existence, more details about the recent transformation unveiling themselves.","Very few if any others were affected by his advancement, but there was someone who kept the very core of her existence within a part of Noah's soul who was greatly affected after the recent elevation.","In the Higher Weavings of Existence.","Noah looked at the endless golden threads that still released tendrils of brilliance into him, his white and black eyes flashing as he saw the scene of an Infinite Forge within the depths of his soul.","There, a dense number of golden infinity symbols swirled with a terrific golden light filled with Psioneutrino Particles gushed down like an endless sea that gravitated around all the densely swirling infinity symbols- becoming more potent at every turn.","In the center of it all and absorbing a large part of this...was the figure of Ruination.","Her eyes were closed as her crimson red skin had unique tattoo like markings, the aura she emanated being a dreadful one!","|Inside of the weavings of your Existence, the Tool of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer is being refined.|","Ruination was gaining an unexpected boon while Noah himself broke down just where he was at, pulling his gaze away from her momentarily.","He closed his eyes and felt everything booming within him!"]},{"number":3253,"title":"Chapter 3253: Chapter 3252 Maximus! II","paragraphs":["Everything.","The countless threads and interactions within his body.","The threads and interactions outside of his body.","And information flowed.","|The Efficiency of your Existence has attained the absolute level of 100%|","|Your Resistance to Existence Based Weavings has reached 51%.|","|You have attained the Existential Veil of Transcendence.|","...!","The Existential Veil of Transcendence!","Noah focused on this new quality of himself to interpret exactly what had occurred, his will finding an intricate weaving of his Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrino Particles dancing around him in an unfathomable way to enact a thing film of golden brilliance around his existence.","It was these waves of interactions that responded to the countless golden strings all around him.","As if he had reached a new frequency or wavelength that corresponded to these Higher Weavings of Existence.","This was the reason he was able to appear in this fantastical space and even absorb the tendrils of golden light from these immeasurably stable strings.","|For any entities who have not escaped the grasp of the Lower Weavings of Existence, their very perception of you will be dulled to the extent that your very Records can cease to ever exist under their gaze.|","|The manipulation of your weavings of existence when facing others will be nearly impossible, with the degree of variation changing based on the level of their Existence. Entities extremely accomplished in the breadth of their existence and yet still incapable of escaping the confines of the Lower Weavings of Existence are still capable of affecting and perceiving you to an unquantifiable extent.|","He gradually understood.","His actions of changing his very makeup of existence had opened up a pathway to a new state of existence extremely early.","This place he was in.","The golden threads endlessly stretching out around him.","It was a form of transcending into another Echelon of existence based purely on his makeup and not on his actual power.","Other entities with an extremely high level of Existence were not able to grasp something like this- with an example being Command Protector Valeria or any other Omniversal Entity.","Their Existence itself was extremely potent and vast in its breadth, but they had yet to fundamentally change the very makeup of existence- or reach a stage where they naturally underwent such a change.","'Maybe further on...'","Noah mused as he looked at the golden threads around him.","Yes.","He theorized that likely, within the Omniversal Realm, one's existence would be potent enough for them to be able to alter their weavings and arrive to a place like this.","For Noah, he had multiple impossible factors to make it a reality this early on.","His action of following threads of an Outerversal Morphon into the Megalos Beyond with over half of his existence to bring about the fruition of Ozymandias.","Then, utilizing Ozymandias to come in contact with Dark Matter, and then owning something like the Infinite Omniverse with its Aletheian Havens as when he mixed all of them, he synthesized a brand new particle!","Only thereafter did all of these possibilities unfold.","Who could say that they had all of these things?","Who could have predicted such a sequence of events from the day that he obtained the Spiritual Land in the Beast World that had not grown to become the Infinite Omniverse?!","'A small and insignificant initial change to certain conditions...can lead to unfathomable results over time...'","HUUM!","His existence buzzed as he repeated these words he heard of a few times.","Behind him, his wings that burned with a colorless white and black grandeur expanded outwards gloriously, the countless threads of golden strings in this area of Higher Weavings of Existence overlapping on their feathers as they gave the illusion that they covered everything!","Causality.","Cause and effect.","When looking at the overall weavings of existence, the infinitesimally small actions and conditions initiated a long time ago always led to increasingly unpredictable results.","Noah learned this when looking at the chaos theory.","Noah heard of this again when looking at the Three Body Problem.","At this moment, his existence sought greater control of this unpredictability as...","|The Organ of the Archontes Engineer, Invictus Maximus, has been fully realized.|","...!","An Organ of his very being.","Something he saw a glimpse of what seemed like forever ago when it was actually not all that far away- something that gave him a glimpse of countless possibilities.","It blazed with brilliance behind him as after extending outwards, the blinding wings retreated to wrap around his body fully with unmatched radiance!","His eyes pulsed as waves of information began to rise.","He saw himself.","His initial conditions.","Where he was currently at.","He then saw the countless unpredictable future results.","Around his figure, his body pulsed with black and white radiance as multiple illusory scenes played out around him.","In one scene, he saw himself standing in an expanse of shattered Domains of Existence.","They looked like massive stretches of obsidian shattered glass, heavy tendrils of Outerversal Authority surging all around!","He saw Command Protector Valeria rushing ahead like a blinding light as a Golden Wheel began to manifest above her, the Three Royal Existential Omniversal Simians following her closely as from behind Protector Lucretia had her eyes closed as if she were trying to sense something.","And around them, flashes of obsidian radiance whipped out at such terrifying speeds that their Existence could barely be observed.","This...was a possible result of existence based on where he currently stood.","Other scenes showed variations of this- some being favorable, while others showed the deaths of some of the Protectors he was with!","At his stage of power, with entities of terrifying levels of existence around him, he could glimpse future conclusions.","And if he altered initial conditions powerfully enough with his knowledge, would he not be able to guarantee a certain result?","...!","His newly formed Organ of the Archontes Engineer blazed.","Invictus Maximus had only just begun to show a tip of its capabilities as its light only became ever more radiant!","With it, he would always ensure victory.","Unconquerable. Invictus!"]},{"number":3254,"title":"Chapter 3254: Chapter 3253 Tainted! I","paragraphs":["Unconquerable was the goal.","The end result after countless possible initial conditions and changes that could be made.","And after attaining this current stage of power...","|Hello!|","...!","All weavings came to a halt.","All scenes faded.","In the midst of countless golden threads, Noah turned to his right as there, shockingly, a figure of an Entity could be seen.","An entity he didn't sense the entrance of, nor warned about by his recently appearing Invictus Maximus or any other forms of his power!","It meant that it was an Entity far above him in leagues.","He knew that in this place he termed the Higher Weavings of Existence, there were bound to be other terrifying beings that had appeared before him, and he would slowly explore to see just what was out there!","What he didn't expect was to be found within minutes of his entry.","He looked at the entity where the intent had stemmed from.","Humanoid in nature by all accounts.","Legs and arms that were covered by a white robe, but his head...was entirely bald and far too circular as it only had two white singularities for eyes and a mouth!","No nose. no ears.","The mouth was currently curved into a friendly smile, the white singularities actually showing enthusiasm as they looked towards Noah.","Having such a terrifying entity before him, everything around Noah was retracted as he replied with a calm nod.","|Hello.|","His reply only caused the smile on the entity ahead of him to deepen as his fair skin shone with brilliance.","Around him, Noah could see the golden threads change their movements and gravitate around him in unique motions, entirely different from how they ignored him entirely.","|Hello friend! I haven't seen you around here before. I am Bob, who are you?|","...!","Bob.","A ridiculously simple name was given by this entity as Noah carefully looked at it while reciprocating its demeanor, a smile appearing on him as he replied.","|I am Noah, Noah Osmont. Are you familiar with these parts, Bob?|","Since this entity didn't make a move, neither did Noah.","And this entity, Bob, nodded his head vigorously as he neared Noah.","|Yes, my friend! I've traveled all around these parts. Did you just arrive? When I arrived here, it was hard to find lots of friends to talk to, but now, there are so many! I don't want you to be bored like I was when I first arrived, so how about I take you somewhere special? There's been something I'm itching to get my hands on for a while, and you might just be perfect to help me get it!|","|...|","His enthusiasm was unmatched.","He spoke of many things as a great deal of details could be discovered under his calm words, with Noah choosing to go along with it as he nodded.","|Sure.|","He didn't know much about the place he was in.","But he was curious just what oddities and wonders had already transcended their level of existence to arrive here.","|Haha, great! This way, Friend!|","Bob's smile covered all of his face as he came forward and...grasped Noah's hand.","...!","He didn't phase through or miss, Noah feeling the pincers-like grasp as thereafter, Bob squinted his eyes as his other hand tugged on a golden string a distance away from them.","And...","HUUM!","The golden strings vibrated as their figures instantly disappeared- covered by a golden light as Noah felt himself traversing unfathomably vast distances in an extremely short period of time!","As if they were utilizing the golden string that Bob pulled on and taking it to an extremely far away place.","Within moments...","WAP!","Their figures reappeared.","Everything here felt richer.","Golden strings pulsed in abundance.","Noah's eyes were bright as he gazed before them to see a dense cluster of golden strings that formed into the shape of a massive tree.","But this wasn't the most astounding thing.","It was the fact that surrounding this massive tree, golden dew drop shaped fruits hung gloriously- radiating an enticing glare that caused his very own existence to tremble.","Bob had long since released his hand as he crossed his own hands on his chest while speaking with a smile.","|I've taken you a little deeper into the Expanse, Friend. The tree you see before us is one of the many fun things you will come across here, but when I near it...|","His body rapidly floated towards the dense cluster of golden strings that formed the massive tree, but the moment he neared...","HUUM!","His figure became increasingly wrapped with golden strings that stopped his advancement until he couldn't move forward anymore!","|It is very sensitive to complex weavings of existence as someone like me cannot get close. But if it's you, Noah, you should be able to get close no problem! Just grab me a few, and you keep the rest. The taste of the Hearthraes is impeccable, and it can also solidify the weavings of your-|","ROAAR!","In the midst of his words.","A booming roar suddenly echoed out in the distance as Noah's Invictus Maximus Organ pulsed, showing him endless darkness!","In the distance, traveling on thousands of golden strings, a cloud of stellar purple light roared out as it came towards them with immense malice.","The sheer pressure its existence exerted was so terrifying that Noah knew this was not an entity he could face right now.","It was likely in the Omniversal Stage if not higher, with its intent filled with a devouring light of greed hungrily staring at none other than Noah and Bob!","But just as it neared them...","|Tsk...|","The smile on Bob faded, his hand rising as he tapped out.","A tap.","A single, simple, tap.","And yet...it felt like existence itself had turned its back on the entity formed of purple clouds, the golden strings around it briefly turning black as they released an interminable obsidian wave that instantly caused the whole body of this Entity to break down and disperse!","...!","With a mere tap.","Moments later, the golden strings returned to their normal self as Bob shook his head while smiling again.","|I hate interruptions the most. Ah, so how about it, friend? Can you try and get us some of those Hearthraes? After that, we can have a feast and share some stories.|","|...|","Bob.","This terrifying being spoke nonchalantly after eradicating an immeasurably powerful entity with a tap of his fingers.","Noah's figure took everything in strides as he began walking towards the unfathomable cluster of golden lines forming into Authorities as he replied.","|Sure, Bob. Let's try and get these Hearthraes.|","He spoke succinctly as he went forward, his weavings of existence working overtime as he wondered and sought to analyze.","Who the fuck was this Bob?"]},{"number":3255,"title":"Chapter 3255: Chapter 3254 Tainted! II","paragraphs":["Bob.","The name buzzed in Noah's mind as on the Infinite Omniverse, another one of his bodies sat on a multicolored throne that was slowly becoming Tainted with a glorious stellar obsidian light.","|The dimensionality and existence of that being seems extremely high, Master. Prolonged contact with them may not be ideal.|","\"Mmm...\"","The words of the Infinite Omniverse rang out within his mind as even it couldn't make heads or tails of that entity as of yet.","But since he wasn't designated as an enemy right away, Noah observed how things would play out.","Meanwhile...","|The progress is astounding...|","He turned his attention towards his connection with the Infinite Omniverse as he sensed all the fantastical changes brought about by the constant flow of the Megalos Beyond into it.","His body on the throne also carried the same obsidian bands of tattoos that simmered with brilliance, colorless white and black wings extending behind him as at this moment, within his Atlas of Existence, his Third Mundi of Power pulsed.","The System of Existence of the Ingeniare.","A designation of someone who built and designed things!","At this moment, he found its authority automatically moving and weaving across his connection with the Infinite Omniverse as seconds later, a blue illusory model of the whole Infinite Omniverse bloomed in his mind.","The Extremity Vein.","The Aletheian Havens rotating around it.","|The design of the current Infinite Omniverse has been deemed to not be one of utmost efficiency.|","|A new design is proposed that would increase the output of authority and gradual elevation of existence by 584%|","...!","The System of Existence of the Ingeniare proposed such a thing as inside of Noah's mind, the Aletheian Havens were altered from simply rotating around the Extremity Vein, a new model showing the Havens looking like wide disks that wrapped around the Extremity Vein!","Akin to the Vein rising up and piercing the very center of the circular flat Aletheian Havens as they spun around it and generated terrifying waves of existence.","|The force generated from the interactions of Fundamental Particles of Existence across all Aletheian Havens can be focused towards the very center and utilized for the refinement of Existence, forging of Armaments, and more.|","The Authority of the Ingeniare surged.","It was a part of Noah as he fundamentally made all of it, and it buzzed with activity at this moment as after looking at all the proposed changes he was coming up with himself, he passed them on to the Infinite Omniverse.","And the vibrant construct that was already rapidly changing trembled, even vaster and more fantastical changes of design beginning to take place!","—","Across the Megalos Ynnere.","Noah opened his eyes and breathed out calmly as he walked past the throne that Protector Lucretia was sitting on while cautiously staring at him.","|Where are you going?|","She hadn't taken her eyes off of him ever since he phased out of and in existence before, her authority trying to grasp him as much as she could.","Noah spoke without looking back.","\"We are about to arrive.\"","...!","|What are you talki-|","HUUM!","As she gazed towards him incredulously, the Omniversal Voyager they were on rapidly slowed down, the voice of the Command Protector Valeria echoing out across the vessel.","|We're entering the bounds of the Half Tainted Omniverse. From here on out, we will proceed with caution. As we discussed, the goal is to not be discovered for as long as possible. The deeper we go in before discovery, the better. If we get found out early, the droves of Agents of Anti-Life we will have to fight through will bog down a great deal of our authority, so avoid this as much as possible. Come on!|","The eyes of Lucretia squinted as she listened to the intent of her sister, rising and following the entity that continued to get ever so mysterious.","Within moments, they had joined all the other members of the Equestris Protectors, with the Command Protector Valeria looking her calm gaze onto Noah's figure that was holding the Kusanagi- Omniversal Cleaver Armament briefly before her authority rose around her in the form of twinkling golden light that gradually became masked obsidian.","This light wrapped around all five of them as their eyes blazed with attention!","|Stay close.|","The words of the Command Protector Valeria were light as their figures disappeared from the vessel a moment later, appearing out into an area that held branches of obsidian vines pulsing with Outerversal Authority.","Noah looked at the waves of authority with familiarity as it almost looked similar to the weavings of some parts of the changing Infinite Omniverse, but not quite.","These seemed...a lot less stable.","Behind them, the Omniversal Voyager miniaturized and disappeared into Command Protector Valeria as she stood in front of them with variance, her body flashing with dimmed radiance as below their feet, an illusory wheel formed.","A wheel full of intricate lines within it as the moment it appeared below them, it began to spin with a dim glow.","The spinning motion absorbed some of the weavings of existence from below and gushed out a thin film of above where their figures stood, a Veil coming to cover them as a moment later, they disappeared and seemed like tendrils of obsidian Outerversal Authority just moving across space!","|Let's go.|","The voice of Command Protector Valeria echoed out as the Three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors pulled out their Omniversal Armaments.","Protector Lucretia gazed around her at the weavings of the Outerversal Authority tainting the Megalos Ynnere around them as she had a melancholic look, her gaze turning forward to see the smiling face of Noah knowingly nodding towards her as she became stern and gazed ahead.","Noah observed all of this with calm eyes as he had seen this reality play out on multiple different results with the grandeur of Invictus Maximus.","He didn't see everything, but he saw through most things that were to come ahead in this venture.","It was a unique sensation as far ahead, there was an optimum result he was looking forward to the most that he sought to make a reality!","It was the result of aiding the only Omniversal Entity in their midst to successfully take down one of the bodies of Outerversal Morphon Savitar and to use this as an opportunity to do something deeply within the nature of Outerversal Morphons.","To eat up the work of others.","To take the strings of connections to an unknown number of Delegatus the moment that Outerversal Morphon Savitar perished.","It...was also an opportunity for him to test himself. To test his power!"]},{"number":3256,"title":"Chapter 3256: Chapter 3255 Tainted! III","paragraphs":["Possibilities of the future unfolding in many possible directions already flashed before Noah's eyes as his job was a simple one.","He had a future in mind, and he simply had to fill in the gaps for it to come to fruition.","The first gap was delving into this massive Half Tainted Omniverse where an Outerversal Morphon had made his home.","Getting past droves of lifeforms it had bent to its will, and eventually getting past the Outerversal Morphon itself!","WU!","A low scream echoed out a light year away as they delved deeper into the Half Tainted Omniverse, Command Protector Valeria turning towards this direction as there, they could see a few black beasts moving on four limbs, their bodies covered by a shrouded of stellar darkness as they only had jaws at the front of their bodies.","They looked massive, and yet...","SAA!","One of them flashed to instantly a pear a few miles from them as a slimy red tongue lashed out from its jaws to taste the surrounding atmosphere.","The first thing to observe was its shocking speed.","A speed that very few Apogee Autarch could even reach as it was a terrifying sight to witness.","The hand of Command Protector Valeria rose as their figures came to a stop, the obsidian wheel spinning below them calmly as their figures remained masked.","The only thing one could sense or feel when gazing in their direction were more tendrils of Outerversal Authority.","SAA!","In a flash, the massive yet speedy beasts disappeared as they resumed their movements once more.","Softly, the voice of Command Protector Valeria rang out in their minds.","|We have come across Agents of Outerversal Morphon Savitar in other Tainted Omniverses where his most powerful bodies reside. We've come to call them another common moniker for a few Agents of Anti-Life- Existence Reapers. They are fast, and their bodies are capable of rapidly corroding existence if they ever get their hands on you. Your tasks once we get discovered will be to disrupt their weavings of existence without letting them get close.|","DUM!","The Wheel below them pulsed as if it was alive and breathing.","The body of Command Protector Valeria had begun to vibrate with concealed power that seemed to be contracting and ready to be released at any moment.","A heavy bloody ax swirling with trillions of crimson galaxies emanating an Omniversal light was grasped by Protector Actaeon.","Protector Orpheus and Ajax grasped a long multi colored spear and a bow respectively, their bodies swirling with intense concentrated weavings of existence as they were ready to go!","Only Noah and Protector Lucretia seemed to be on the nonchalant side as their group delved deeper and deeper into the Half Tainted Omniverse.","Miles away from them, more and more Existence Reapers appeared and disappeared, their massive bodies and wide jaws moving on four limbs pulsing with heavy Outerverversal Authority!","These were past lifeforms who used to thrive in this Omniverse, and they were now turned into other things entirely as a single one could be made from the existence of one powerful Entity or the horrific product of millions of other existences forcefully fused together.","But undoubtedly, each one carried the power of the Outerversal Morphon Savitar.","Each one was a Delegatus!","DUM!","Their surroundings entirely became tinged with obsidian radiance.","The spinning wheel they stood on moved silently as below it, an endless stretch of shattered black glass began to appear.","Tentacles of darkness grew out of them akin to an infestation as a few dozen Existence Reapers were perched on them.","And the deeper they went...","The clusters of Existence Reapers became denser.","Hundreds.","Thousands.","Hundreds of thousands!","DUM!","The breathing of Protector Lucretia could be felt as the multicolored battle robe on her hugged her body ever closer.","The three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors grasped their weapons ever tighter as they were on high alert!","At this moment, from where they came from, it looked like thousands of Existence Reapers covered everything.","And yet they fearlessly delved deeper as if they were in a nest!","Noah smiled at this scene.","Why were Protectors required to be powerful?","This was the reason why.","They delved into an Omniverse tainted with Outerversal Authority as they were surrounded by millions of Entities that could hurt even an Autarch with a mere touch!","And yet they delved in without fear.","|Be ready.|","Filled with power, Command Protector Valeria's voice echoed out once more.","Even bigger Existence Reapers with tendrils of fur floated around aimlessly as one who was the size of a world passed just miles away from them!","Its hairs vibrated as if feeling the surrounding Existence, but they continued to remain veiled and passed it to go deeper.","Until...","DUM!","Massive tendrils of darkness entered their vision.","Titanic Existence Reapers floated as they radiated sparks of obsidian radiance, their very existence warping nearby space.","Below them, stretches of shattered Domains of Existence lifelessly pulsed within thousands of other Existence Reapers releasing a cacophony of roars.","In the far distance, the pulse of what seemed to be like a breathing living organ could be felt.","The Dark Matter Core that was actively altering this Omniverse- or what remained of it!","Reaching this point was already an astounding enough result as at this moment, Command Protector Valeria came to a stop.","The wheel below them stopped moving forward.","In the next moment.","WUU!","In front of them, a massive furred Existence Reaper opened its jaws and roared out as a crimson tongue radiated waves in front of it!","Waves that instantly disrupted Existence and revealed the five figures floating above an obsidian Wheel.","|...|","A buzz of Outerversal Authority began to rise. From all around, millions of Existence Reapers turned their jaws towards their direction.","All the cacophony of noises died down as immense silence filled with blood curdling horror came in.","And at such a time...","|Do not die.|","Command Protector Valeria spoke out coldly as akin to an arrow knocked from a bow, she blasted off!"]},{"number":3257,"title":"Chapter 3257: Chapter 3256 Tainted! IV","paragraphs":["Command Protector Valeria was the first one to shoot off as she went towards the depths of this obsidian brilliance- two massive Existence Reapers standing opposite her as the hairs on their bodies instantly elongated and turned into millions of spears that surged towards her.","And yet...","Her eyes only flashed with radiance.","Within her depths, boundless weavings of existence surged as instantly, two spinning golden wheels the same size as the Existence Reapers formed, their glows unfathomable glorious as with a single spin...","RIIP!","They surged forward like disks of existence and sliced the massive Existence Reapers in half, her figure tearing across between them unabashed as not a single tendril of Outerversal Authority touched her!","She went to seek Savitar.","And those who came with her...","SAA!","Were faced with millions of flashing obsidian lights of Existence Reapers who moved at shocking speeds!","Protector Acteon grasped his weapon tighter as golden brilliance surrounded him along with a shout.","|For the Commonwealth!|","...!","A bloodied ax was swung as a flash of obsidian Reaper was pushed away. The other two Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors also moved as their potent existences sought to evade and destroy as many Existence Reapers as they could while pushing forward!","Then, there was Noah.","He had yet to make a move.","Protector Lucretia kept her gaze on him as her body became surrounded by dozens of spinning golden wheels that would rebuff any Existence Reaper coming towards her.","She wondered.","What was this being's power?","She was suspicious and curious.","He said he wasn't a Delegatus of an Outerversal Morphon.","But why?","Why did he act the way he did?","She wanted to see his power with her own eyes as at this moment, she noted a flash of powerful obsidian light surging towards him!","And it wasn't alone as over a dozen other terrified Existence Reapers targeted him.","And he...","|...!|","Opened his arms out with a smile as Kusanagi remained on his back.","He...actually closed his eyes as he didn't prepare any defenses!","'What the fu-'","Protector Lucretia was incredulous as she instinctively wanted to move to shield him!","But the Existence Reapers were too fast.","The furred limbs of the first one appeared on his chest like spears as even at this moment, he did nothing!","Lucretia nearly closed her eyes to not see the devastation in the next moment.","But...","SAA!","As if he didn't exist. There was no point of impact, and the body of the Existence Reaper passed through his figure as if he weren't real!","SAA! SAA!","The dozen other Reapers sought to smash into him the same, and the same thing repeated where shockingly, their attacks passed through his body as if he didn't truly exist.","...!","His eyes opened wide thereafter as if he had confirmed something.","And his smile was deep as he voiced out and laughed.","\"You cannot even touch me.\"","The level of his power.","The place he had reached.","He was gradually ascertaining it as at this moment, his carefree demeanor and laughter caused a cacophony of noises as tens of thousands of Existence Reapers felt mocked and challenged!","They turned into flashes of obsidian light that came at Noah from all directions.","And fantastically...","SAA! SAA! SAA!","They all phased through him.","His arms were spread out wide as he smiled.","\"Glorious.\"","His voice was magnetic.","Behind him, colorless white and black wings unfurled.","He felt the tens of thousands of Existence Reapers targeting him and the hundreds of thousands buzzing in the background, ready to join the fray.","He saw them all as if they were small particles constantly moving across space and interacting with each other.","Interacting with him.","But their wavelengths could never reach him.","They were on a whole different level of Existence!","His wavelengths though...could reach all of them with surety.","Invictus Maximus blared.","And Noah opened his lips with unfathomable Tyranny and regality.","\"Fatality.\"","...!","A booming circular wave released from his wings with him at the center.","It was so fast that it covered the surrounding thousands of miles in the blink of an eye!","The speedy obsidian flashes of light that were covered by this wave of brilliance stopped.","And a moment later...","POOF!","Their bodies exploded into clouds of stellar obsidian particles!","All tens of thousands of Existence Reapers who were closest nearby!","Every single one, without fail, exploded into a cloud of obsidian particles as Noah beckoned them all towards him in the next moment- these clouds turning into streams of black light that were pulled into his wings.","|The Value of your Outerversal Descent System of Existence has increased by 44.|","|The Value of your Outerversal Descent System of Existence has increased by 68.|","|The Value of your Outerversal Descent System...|","Prompts came and went as all around, a heavy silence remained as Protector Lucretia looked towards Noah with incredulity.","The three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors drew cold breaths as Protector Actaeon voiced out in shock.","|What the hell, newbie?! You've been holding out on us?|","A level of power that seemed to be nearing the Omniversal Stage buzzed from him.","He seemed unfettered even after the words of Protector Actaeon, his wings flapping with brilliance as he surged forward in the same direction that Command Protector Valeria had disappeared towards.","WU!","In the surroundings, the clouds of thousands of Existence Reapers seemed ever more agitated as they swarmed toward Noah more than anyone else in all directions.","And yet after they clustered towards him by the thousands, they all phased right through his body as his wings would vibrate, and the cluster of Existence Reapers around him would explode into bundles of stellar obsidian clouds that were drawn into his wings!","It was a devastating scene of power.","One that left others shocked as he crossed into the depths of the Half Tainted Omniverse, the pulsing of a Dark Matter Core seemingly radiating an enticing light in the distance while he felt the booming clashes of utterly terrifying power.","What else could they be but the impacts of an Omniversal Entity and an Outerversal Morphon?","There, light years away, a scene he had only observed in possibilities showed itself.","The massive figure of a skeleton with countless limbs rising from it.","Terrific flames burned in its sockets as in the surroundings, hundreds of drained shattered Domains of Existence lay!","Seas of Obsidian radiance surged around him as from them, millions of tentacles filled with Dark Matter pierced into existence.","|I am the One Who Walks.|","WAA!","|A puny thing like you actually dared to aim at a part of me?|","A voice dripping with intense power and majesty.","Filled with deep ancientness and hatred!","It stemmed from Outerversal Morphon Savitar as before him, the small figure of Command Protector Valeria stared forth coldly!"]},{"number":3258,"title":"Chapter 3258: Chapter 3257 The One Who Walks! I","paragraphs":["The One Who Walks.","It was a unique distinction to hear, and the entity who stated it could not be taken lightly as his form was grandiose.","A massive purple skull that cried out utmost glory, with thousands of limbs protruding from behind this skull!","Dazzling purple flames burned in its sockets as around it, debris of decimated Existential Domains lay.","They pulsed weakly with an obsidian light of Corruption as behind this skull, a swirling mass of obsidian light that seemed to be absorbing everything for many light years stood.","The glimpse of the Dark Matter Core.","Command Protector Valeria looked at it all with a calm gaze as her body swirled with the grandeur of a Fabled Omniverse.","She stared deeply into the eyes burning with purple flames as she voiced out.","|I wouldn't aim at any part of you if you just stayed away from our Lands. Must you all be here?|","Her voice held no fear.","She had built up her existence to such an unfathomable extent that even though she knew the enemy before her was a terrible one, this was just one of his bodies.","She could handle a single body.","The purple flames within The One Who Walks sneered as its wide jaws crackled.","|How can we not be here, puny thing? Your Omniverses are akin to untapped fruits waiting to be plucked. This one is almost ripe as your interruption is very much unneeded.|","...!","His voice held unmatched confidence and might.","And yet Command Protector Valeria was undaunted as from behind her, an illusory cerulean wheel rose to her left, and a crimson wheel rose to her right.","They both pulsed with intricate interweavings of lines between them as they emanated ecstatic waves of power.","They released a potent glow of existence that covered her body with celestial auroras of red and blue radiance that easily kept the obsidian radiance of Outerversal Authority at bay!","The purple flames within the socket of Savitar flared at this scene as his booming voice echoed out once more.","|Do you know why they call me the One Who Walks?|","He asked.","And before him, Command Protector Valeria scoffed with a reply.","|Many of your bodies within Tainted Omniverses have asked this question. You seem to really like this accolade.|","|Kaka...!| Her reply caused booming cackling laughter from Savitar as his many limbs clapped and made horrific sounds.","|Yes! If you have heard of me from those who managed to survive my assault, then you may know. But first and foremost...the One Who Walks makes it so that others...will no longer be able to do so.|","WAA!","Obsidian radiance flashed immeasurably quickly.","It covered the whole Half Tainted Omniverse in an instant as wondrously, invisible black lines stretched out and covered everything.","Lines pulsing with Dark Matter that imposed an undeniable Authority.","|Of all those here, none will be able to walk away, O Peon of the Commonwealth. I do not sense from you the quality of existence my other bodies feel from those above-average Peons I have faced before. As sad as it is for you, this is likely the end of your path. Do not worry...I will take from your body and change it to something far greater. This, I promise you.|","HUUUM!","From behind, Noah's figure decimated rows of Existence Reapers to see the glorious scene of shattered Domains of Existence and the figures of Outerversal Morphon Savitar and Command Protector Valeria.","He arrived just in time to hear the words of the One Who Walks as he also turned his flames towards him!","|Oh?|","Seeing the interminable destruction and ease he held, the flames of Savitar were aroused.","|You are...an oddity. You are with her and smell so foreign...and yet familiar at the same time. Have you also come to die?|","Words that could very easily be misconstrued echoed out as Noah arrived gloriously.","Existence Reapers who even neared him with their unfathomable speed exploded before they even neared, their brilliance being pulled towards his wings right after as he floated in with his hands behind his back!","Seeing him, Command Protector Valeria didn't even turn around as her will already captured everything, her intent surging towards him.","|I won't be able to protect you much, so you best have tremendous confidence to be here. If you have any designs or plans, it's best you share them now, otherwise, let me take care of it all.|","Just like the Outerversal Morphon, she blazed with confidence.","It didn't just stem from her Omniversal Stage of power.","It was something deeper.","Her System of Existence!","Noah could now feel it closely as within him, his Third Mundi of Power moved Innately.","Ingeniare was already breaking down the System of Existence that Lucretia utilized, and it was the same for Command Protector Valeria.","Noah smiled as he replied while floating closer.","|You don't worry about me and face him as you would. I will provide support to ensure his fall.|","He spoke confidently as prompts began to fall before his eyes.","|The System of Existence utilized by the core forces of the Commonwealth has been broken down and quantified.|","The System of Existence that the most prominent Entities of the Commonwealth followed.","|The System of Existence of Kuklos is being documented.|","Kuklos!","A word closely related to the weavings of the Wheel!","In the heart of the existence of all Protectors of the Commonwealth, there was a single similarity.","At the base of their Existence, there was the illusion of a Wheel.","|With the mimicking of the Wheel of Existence at their core, the Existence of the followers of the System of Existence of Kuklos face a refinement and elevation of existence at every turn of the Wheel. After their Existence has been raised to a sufficient level, they can utilize the weavings of the Wheel to bend Existence to their will with half the effort and twice the results.|","The dazzling blue and red wheels that appeared behind Command Protector Valeria caused her white skin to flicker with gem-like radiance.","Paired with the spinning Fabled Omniverse coming to life around her, she turned into a radiant beam of light that surged fearlessly toward Savitar!"]},{"number":3259,"title":"Chapter 3259: Chapter 3258 The One Who Walks! II","paragraphs":["A beam of unfathomably powerful light that rejected the Outerversal Authority in the surroundings and made way to achieve a single purpose.","Savitar looked at this brilliant light as he scoffed.","He was the One Who Walks.","He walked across the Megalos Beyond and attained a power that allowed him to be distinguished as The Great Savitar.","A Great One.","Many didn't truly understand what this distinction meant in the grand scheme of things.","Even if Savitar was on the lower rungs of a Great One, he was still a Great One!","Even if his Existence was spread out across the Megalos Beyond and Megalos Ynnere, he was still a Great One!","His Body in this Half Tainted Omniverse may only carry a portion of his power, but even this was enough.","Because what he saw under his gaze and what his enemies saw were entirely different.","His flames twisted into a cruel smile as he let this be known.","|Gahaha, your Existence is powerful, but it is crude. Unlike those other Peons of the Commonwealth, you have not attained that State of Existence.|","...!","A State of Existence.","No matter how much power one held over existence, if they did not flow with it as if they were one. If they were not capable of melding with existence and using it to further their alteration of reality, they would not be placed in the rungs of experts.","|Kaka! Let me show you.|","WAA!","His flaming sockets became sharp as for the first time, his body moved forward.","A massive skull filled with thousands of outstretched limbs, and yet its speed was so unfathomable that it disappeared entirely in the next moment!","Command Protector Valeria kept her calm as the potent glow of existence around her only solidified further, but her gaze changed in the next moment as she turned around.","The thousands of limbs of Savitar were like spears as they bloomed half an inch away from Noah's figure that was floating calmly.","Too fast.","No matter her power, Command Protector Valeria would not be able to reach her on time!","A single limb of Savitar was faster than all others as like a sharp spear, it thundered above Noah's head and crashed into him instantly!","The only thing that would be left would be decimation.","|That is but a glimpse of the pain to come for you, Little Peon. You have other compatriots just like him, yes? They will follow you in deat-...?|","His words didn't finish as he noticed something ecstatic.","His limb smashing onto Noah's figure didn't cause the complete erasure of existence, and wondrously, it was like his spear-like limbs were hitting a very stretchy net- much of its force becoming dissipated as the impact that did arrive only smashed his target downwards rapidly as he smashed onto a shattered glass Domain of Existence in the distance!","BOOM!","And even on this shattered Domain of Existence, his body bounced as if it were a balloon.","His figure was still intact.","On his face was a profound expression and a smile as he confirmed a single thing!","The Existence of Savitar was too profound as he was still able to affect his Existence.","And yet the extent of this effect showed that much of the power of this being would be dissipated, and what remained...","\"Ah...\" Noah brought his hand to his forehead where the sharp point of the limb of Outerversal Morphon Savitar had hit.","There, a drop of incandescent golden blood dripped, his fair skin split open slightly as it already began to heal.","Potent obsidian waves of light sought to ravage this wound and make it even more disastrous, and yet they were devoured seamlessly under the skin as they disappeared.","\"You have caused me to bleed.\"","His finger traced the closing wound as his words caused the One Who Walks to gaze down at him blankly!","Above him, his thousands of limbs rose instinctively as two massive crimson and cerulean wheels smashed towards him while spinning.","The fur on his limbs buzzed like a rough hide as they grasped the intricate structures within the Wheels, bearing their heavy weight as the purple flames within its sockets kept their gaze locked on to Noah!","But the weight of the Wheels was unfathomably heavy- the existence they carried being undeniable as a dozen limbs were twisted and broken from the pressure.","Yet Savitar didn't bat an eye.","|Interesting.|","HUUM!","Instead, obsidian singularities filled with Dark Matter began to appear en masses all around.","In this whole space and as far as the eye could see.","And from these singularities, cylindrical beams of scorching obsidian radiance erupted out in two directions- forming what seemed like two Pillars of pure Outerversal Authority connected to a singularity anchored in space as they began to rotate and spin!","SHIING!","They covered all nearby surroundings.","They constantly spun like milestones that would crush anyone on their path!","Command Protector Valeria's red hair fluttered gorgeously as her body twisted sideways to evade the swing of one of these obsidian Pillars of pure Outerversal Authority, her figure shooting back towards Savitar as she kept part of her gaze on Noah.","Below her feet, a golden wheel bloomed and expanded, smashing into and stopping the spins of nearby Pillars of obsidian radiance while her hands twisted- the crimson and cerulean wheels that Savitar held off with his limbs bearing down with even greater pressure as she voiced out coldly.","|Your opponent is me, O One Who Walks.|","Her might was indomitable even in the face of this Outerversal Morphon!","And yet even at such a time...","\"What State of Existence are you talking about, Outerversal Morphon Savitar?\"","Noah's voice echoed out in its midst as the wound on his forehead had already closed.","The State of Existence that Command Protector Valeria had yet to reach.","The Flames of Savitar flickered after receiving such a nonchalant question in the midst of all of this, and in the next moment, his massive figure disappeared into the surrounding space once more before hundreds of his limbs turned into spears that bloomed in front of Noah!","But now, they were painted with thunderous flames of obsidian brilliance, Savitar's voice echoing out as these spears came in contact with Noah instantly.","|You are interesting. It is a shame only this small body is here, I would love to inspect you with my main body too...how about you make a trip to the Megalos Beyond with me? I will answer all your questions there.|","...!","Even as he made a horrendous attack, he spoke so simply.","And Noah, with his Existential Veil of Transcendence, got a chance to test exactly what the limits of his defenses were!"]},{"number":3260,"title":"Chapter 3260: Chapter 3259 State of Existence! I","paragraphs":["As Noah tested the limits of his Existential Veil of Transcendence.","There was another gaze that was directed towards the Half Tainted Omniverse, and this gaze was one filled with interminable brutality, and concentrated shrewdness.","Far above the Half Tainted Omniverse.","A cloud of darkness could barely be seen as it had melded into the tendrils of Outerversal Authority in the surroundings.","Even against the Existence of another entity with the Great One distinction in the Half Tainted Omniverse below, this cloud of brilliance was not discovered!","|I have you to thank, my Little Delegatus.|","His deep gaze stared past the crowds of Existence Reapers being killed or pushed away by brilliant spinning wheels under the command of Protector Lucretia.","Her red hair was akin to burning flames as dazzling crimson Wheels that sought to imitate something very few could understand spun.","|Such a shame that your Sister has not yet become One With Existence.|","One With Existence!","A terrifying state of being where the concentration and the interactions that one's existence had with the surrounding reality was so in tune and full of resonance that they intrinsically became one with their surrounding existence.","When they acted, they would come to find that very little of their Authority would be required to achieve the same result.","If they had to release an attack that could wound an enemy at the Omniversal Stage, they would come to find that they could release the same attack, but with barely a hundredth of the required authority to cast it!","What they could do was filled with endless possibilities.","The Protectors that had reached such a height with their existence were the ones that the bodies of Great Ones and other Outerversal Morphona within the Megalos Ynnere commonly fought against. |Mmm, very well, I would lend a little bit of aid to ensure that this body of Savitar's is cut off. He will suspect something...but he won't be entirely sure as by the time he even reacts, I would have bound all of the Delegatus connected to this body of his.|","The cloudy gaze flickered as at this moment, it did more than just see. From above the Half Tainted Omniverse, a terrifying but silent authority began to leak out and cover the domain of the One Who Walks.","It released waves of resonance with all nearby weavings of existence to the point that it seemed like they were fully part of it!","—","|What say you, oddity?|","The One Who Walks rebuffed the terrifying wheels of Command Protector Valeria, his gaze on the figure of Noah that continued to pull his interest in a way that he could not fully understand.","For some reason, the very weavings of Dark Matter inside of his existence felt an enticing pull that wanted to bring this entity to him the more that his limbs clashed with him","The One Who Walks made a single definitive conclusion. This oddity had the power to defend against his terrifying waves of Outerversal Authority, but he did not have the power to wound him.","It was as if he had reached a terrifying state of defensive existential prowess, but his offensive side had not caught up just yet.","'How come? What exactly did you attain that makes it so that without even a Fabled Omniverse like the rest of the Peons of the Commonwealth, you can survive against existence-altering strikes filled with Outerversal Authority?'","The more he thought about it, the more enticing this oddity seemed!","Around this space, the obsidian beams spinning around singularities carried horrific intent as Command Protector Valeria destroyed some while evading others, her body beginning to expand an utterly gorgeous Omniverse that erased everything it came across.","Omniverse.","Could one even wrap their mind around such an idea? For the power of a single being to emulate the might and existence of an Omniverse?!","BOOM!","The power Savitar displayed was shocking, with Command Protector Valeria showing her own glory, but at this moment...","|Huh?|","The purple flames in Savitar's skeletal sockets flickered as he sensed something.","Something that had melded into the very fabric of existence of this entire Half Tainted Omniverse, and even himself!","Anger quickly rose soon after as Savitar felt his authority get restricted greatly.","Silently!","|WHO?!|","...!","His booming shout echoed out, but there was no reply.","The extremely perceptive Command Protector Valeria instantly felt the crushing wheels she summoned that were being held at bay move down with much reduced resistance- tearing through the beams of Outerversal Authority much quicker as she made her way towards Savitar with much more ease!","It was a unique progression as it felt like half of the power of Savitar was effectively cut off.","She didn't know if it was a scheme. She didn't know why. She only used this chance to ensure the completion of their objective here today.","The decimation of one of Savitar's bodies and the destruction of a Dark Matter Core.","|YAA!|","Her existence burned brilliantly as she used this chance to release one of her strongest attacks- seeking to not give Savitar any chance to unleash his power after he fell into this weakened state!","Above and below, radiant crimson and cerulean wheels formed.","A scorching hell above, an endless sea below.","Their sizes were pristine, but the color and dangerous waves of existence that these Wheels released were even more glorious to look at as they sought to mimic and pull from the sheer standing of the Wheel of Existence that very few understood!","The wheels spun and applied an unfathomably heavy pressure on the massive body of Savitar, his limbs creaking and shattering as his Outerversal Authority...was not capable of stopping its advancement as easily.","...!","It was a drastic change.","Something had interfered and made things this way!","'Who? Who?! Who?!' Savitar felt increasing anger as with his power, he felt the weavings of Existence rapidly tilt away from his favor for this body here.","And he at least wanted to know who was responsible!"]},{"number":3261,"title":"Chapter 3261: Chapter 3260 State of Existence! II","paragraphs":["At the same time, the figure of Noah below Savitar exploded with authority as his colorless white and black wings stretched out brilliantly.","Invictus Maximus.","They foresaw the assurance of a favored result.","Under his gaze, his Third Mundi of Power pulsed as Ingeniare blazed like flames that were only just beginning to burn.","They clustered in his eyes as he saw...the foreign appearance of an unbreakable Outerversal Authority covering everything like a ceiling.","And this ceiling was akin to a blanket of Dark Matter that effectively cut off a large part of Savitar's power from the Megalos Beyond where his main body should be!","A foreign interference that would go to help them- of course, it wasn't for no reason.","'Interesting...'","His eyes twinkled as his own movements didn't stop. The wings turned into dazzling colorless white and black feathers that formed into lines that began to bind the Limbs of Savitar, some even seeking to wrap around his massive skull to anchor this being in place as two wheels rotated above and below him.","Noah was within this same space, yet the terrifying power of these Wheels was not directed at him- but even if they were, he had interminable confidence to withstand them.","But the power of Command Protector Valeria was not to be scoffed at as she directed her authority to achieve her goal here, Savitar roaring out as the honor and grace of a Great One was being spat on at this moment.","|Impudence! You think that you are taking on an opportunity when you're falling into the schemes of others. Someone else has just made a move and you're only acting as a sword on their behalf! Take a step back and think before doing someone else's bidding, O Peon of the Commonwealth!|","His authoritative voice boomed out as if he still controlled everything.","Yet neither Noah nor Command Protector Valeria stopped their actions as the expansion of Noah's wings began to light up with the Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence!","The colorless hue was much deeper.","It almost seemed liquefied and more real as the power of all three of his Systems of Existence were pulled upon to momentarily aid in holding down an Entity who far exceeded the stages of Existential Dominium Realm- and should have been someone only those in the Omniversal Stage could handle.","Yet Noah's Existential Veil of Transcendence made many things possible.","|Fools!|","The cruel voice of Savitar boomed out as its authority could not suppress both Noah and Command Protector Valeria- his skull beginning to gain visible cracks as the hundreds of spinning Pillars of obsidian radiance stopped being anchored in space and converged towards his body like splicing beams of Existence.","Noah knew his words were not false.","His mind already worked out all the possibilities as he already had an idea of what the foreign interference was!","Since it was a Veil of Dark Matter, the culprit was another Outerversal Morphon.","And out of many possible Outerversal Morphons, who else would know precisely where they were and what they were doing?","He smiled silently as the face of Protector Lucretia rose up.","'Is this the influence of the one who bound you?","He asked such a question to himself as he then placed himself in the perspective of the foreign Outerversal Morphon who leaked Savitar.","What could he gain from this? From a body of Savitar being destroyed?","...!","Noah's eyes radiated unfathomable radiance.","'You are here doing exactly the same thing as me?'","What was he doing right now? He was also interfering and keeping the weakened body of an Outerversal Morphon in place so that after his death...","The Delegatus he had bound would be his!","Now, it seemed there was another seeking to do the same thing.","So who would come out on top? Who would claim the ultimate prize?","|I will not sit here and be disgraced by a bunch of kids being used by others.|","The deep voice of Savitar echoed out as he stopped struggling.","His purple flames gazed above at Command Protector Valeria who looked like a celestial controlling parts of the Wheel of Existence, and he then gazed below towards Noah and his wings that had turned into countless threads encapsulating him!","|A Great One cannot be disgraced by those who are not. You all have managed to earn my ire today, and I will come to collect.|","The words were intense as the expression of Command Protector Valeria instantly changed, her intent booming out towards Noah.","|Release him!|","It was a shout for him to let go.","For him to move as far away as possible.","But even in this situation, Noah did not move a muscle and remained right where he was.","His wings were telling him that this was where he had to be if he wanted to achieve his aims!","The sockets of Savitar instantly extinguished all radiance as his intent rang out for the last time.","|Feel a glimmer of my wrath.|","...!","BOOOM!","He did not wait for his existence within this body to be extinguished.","He ended it himself- and he did so in the most terrifying way possible.","He detonated everything this body stood for!","An Entity with the Distinction of a Great One would rather detonate one of his bodies than face the disrespect and schemes of others!","A blinding obsidian light that unraveled all weavings of Matter exploded out Command Protector Valeria grit her teeth as her figure flickered, stepping on the crimson wheel above as her figure disappeared and was teleported on the blue wheel below- her figure rising up and seeking to pull Noah away from the point of the explosion!","At the same time, dozens of vibrant illusory wheels manifested around them like bastions of unbreakable shields.","...!","The impact was heavy.","Everything felt like it was broken.","The wheels called out shattered and reformed rapidly as the obsidian light was so blinding that Command Protector Valeria had to close her eyes.","The very weavings of matter felt like they were decimated!","Any form of existence would feel a burning sensation as if they were being scorched out of existence!","But in the midst of all this, as she began to feel her existence burning and her Omniversal Armament become torn....Command Protector Valeria felt a body cover her.","...!","She felt her head pushed into a strong chest, and her back wrapped by strong hands filled with unfathomable steadiness.","And the burning of her existence stopped right after.","All weavings of existence were in chaos as even she couldn't easily see what was happening.","But above her, millions of dazzling threads connecting to Delegatus nobody else could see but a single man flashed ever so briefly.","And within this period of time, all of these threads were absorbed into colorless white and black wings as they traversed rapidly across a Second Mundi of Power!"]},{"number":3262,"title":"Chapter 3262: Chapter 3261 The Oriole! I","paragraphs":["A burning sensation.","The self-implosion of one of the bodies of an Outerversal Morphon was not a simple thing, where even Noah, with his Existential Veil of Transcendence, was affected by a large degree!","Those who had not stepped into a higher dimension of existence- the place he called the Higher Weavings of Existence and the place referred to by the unfathomable entity, Bob, as the Expanse...could still injure him.","If their existence was powerful and potent enough, they could still reach him.","He wanted to gauge just to what extent they could still reach him as the action that Savitar had taken made this abundantly clear.","Two conclusions were made as Noah's wings were retracted gloriously, wrapping around the body of Command Protector Valeria while he withstood the endless burning rays of an imploding Outerversal Morphon while also taking in the strings of connections leading to millions of Delegatus.","'Low ranking Omniversal Stage Entities will have the vast majority of damage mitigated against me, with any injuries dealt being inconsequential.'","The first conclusion.","Noah smiled under the burning rays of obsidian radiance as he confirmed the previous statement during this fight with Savitar, and bringing into account the power of Command Protector Valeria.","'And depending on the System of Existence utilized by the enemy, the mitigation of damage can be further increased.'","Yes.","He, as an Outerversal Morphon who was now getting to grasp Dark Matter, with his body even made up of Psioneutrino Particles formed from Dark Matter- was highly resistant to this fundamental aspect of Existence.","Thus, even though the implosion of Savitar was heavy as it dealt injuries that actually burnt a bit of existence, he could still stand it!","Part of his feathery wings were scorched as they healed rapidly, and his skin carried third-degree burns that rapidly began to close up and heal.","Behind him, the obsidian radiance calmly faded as not a single ounce of reality floated there.","Their surroundings were filled with chaotic weavings of Matter and Dark Matter, Outerversal Authority still ravaging everything nearby as slowly, light returned.","Noah's wings that covered him and a figure in his arms opened wide, light flowing down to dance on the crimson red hair of Command Protector Valeria as her head rose from his chest and came to stare at him.","Her beauty alone with heart shaking as anybody who had forged a Fabled Omniverse emanated such pure grace and honor that very few could even stare at without bowing their head down.","And yet...","She stared deeply and calmly into Noah's eyes as he stared back without worry.","The Honor of his Existence.","The Dignity.","They were all so high that she was shockingly the one who found her eyes pressured, her figure pulling away from his body as she gazed up towards the patch of scorched existence and the humming Dark Matter Core in the far distance.","After confirming the erasure of Savitar, she turned her gaze back towards Noah as her voice echoed out.","|What are you exactly after?|","...!","|You unveiled my sister's situation, were unfettered by it, and you stood against an Outerversal Morphon to ensure its death. Your actions are contradictory as I cannot leave it alone without understanding exactly what you want. Old Man Eudemus has vouched for your existence, but...|","Her eyes swirled with two golden wheels.","She was slowly recovering her power as she wondered about the weavings of the man before her!","Noah looked at this powerful Protector of the Commonwealth before him as he smiled.","His body fully healed as his wings retreated into his back and disappeared.","His magnetic voice then echoed out with words that caused the eyes of Command Protector Valeria to tremble.","|I can break off the connection between your Sister and the Outerversal Morphon who had bound her.|","...!","Words that were akin to a bomb echoed out.","—","By sheer proximity alone, the moment that this body of Savitar died, all the connections it had would briefly fall into a limbo before they were destroyed.","In the state of limbo, the closest and most powerful Outerversal Morphon there could obtain all of these connections.","Far above the Half Tainted Omniverse where one of the bodies of a Great One had imploded...there was an Entity.","And he was the only one here with such an influence of an Outerversal Morphon who could pull the threads of connections, even if it was only a mere glimmer of himself that was here in order to not be seen by Savitar himself.","So the veiled entity who had interfered and blocked off Savitar's source of power prepared as the moment he affirmed the brilliant light of Savitar to be extinguished here, his authority spread out to capture the countless lines associated with him before they disappeared!","|...|","And.","And...","|Huh?|","The lines never came.","|What...?|","The veiled Will buzzed.","Its authority encapsulated everything nearby, including the Half Tainted Omniverse below!","And still, nothing!","As if the many lines of Delegatus under the banner of this body of Savitar were never free to be taken.","Or...","'Somebody else has taken them?'","...!","A daring possibility.","But there was only this single possibility!","There was an Outerversal Morphon even closer to Savitar than him, and they had taken control of all the connections in limbo the moment that he died.","And who could it be?","He knew the identities of all new entrants into this past domain of Savitar.","He knew all of them except for one.","The records of Protector Lucretia flashed before the weavings of this entity.","And soon...the visage of a man appeared.","'Hazy...'","He was hazy to see.","This showed how powerful of an existence this entity was to the extent that he couldn't fully be viewed with records by even someone like him!","But he still had the gaze and words of Lucretia.","Of the new Entity who joined their team.","'Noah...Osmont, is it?'","The Will of a Great One burned brightly as it turned its gaze towards a single man!"]},{"number":3263,"title":"Chapter 3263: Chapter 3262 The Oriole! II","paragraphs":["The thoughts of a Great One buzzed.","Yes. A Great One!","The one holding the string of Protector Lucretia was a Great One as naturally, only someone of this caliber would dare to make a move on an entity like Savitar.","But for all of his efforts to go to waste- for someone else to reap the rewards of his efforts...","|...|","The Great One mulled silently.","Noah Osmont was a Protector. From the records of Lucretia, a newly added one at that, as it meant he had to be adorned and cleared to not be on the side of Anti-Matter or Dark Matter before he was given such a distinction.","And yet...he was an Outerversal Morphon!","|Interesting...who are you? You cannot be a nobody, and you should have sensed my intervention. Yet you did what you did regardless. You dared to steal from me...|","The Will of a Great One formed a chilling smile as its intent weaved.","For this Entity, he always had the tendency to know everything about his enemies before he made a move.","He found the process of information collection the most thrilling, as after all possible knowledge about his target was known, he could easily dismember them, their power, and everything else under their banner!","Savitar had fallen to be one of his many targets as he knew a great deal about him.","Like where one of his bodies was hidden, and how he could expose it to the Peons of the Commonwealth to have Protectors sent to kill this body of Savitar on his behalf- only for him to reap the rewards.","He planned, learned, and schemed, and when he made a move...he may even use others as he wouldn't make the move himself!","He had lived far too long.","'Too many eons and cycles can make anyone paranoid...'","He had seen again and again entities of Unfathomable power be toppled, their weavings of existence only ever showing shock and disbelief when they perished.","An Outerversal Morphon staring in shock towards him as they believed him to be their closest ally, and yet he killed them.","An Outerversal Morphon who knew nothing about him, but had gained an opportunity of a Grave of the Great Beyonder that held Pure Dark Matter Crystals. He lost his life even before any of this could be enjoyed.","A Protector of the Commonwealth who had a bright future ahead of her as her Sister had attained the Omniversal Stage and she herself wasn't too far off...only to find herself forced to be a Delegatus of the very enemies she was fighting again!","There were many examples of those who had fallen to his whims and plans.","And even with all preparations, things could still fail unexpectedly as they did just now due to something he couldn't have even accounted for.","Due to someone.","'Mmm...'","The Great One felt a thrill rising within him as he found himself a new target.","With the current Will he had here, he could even choose to make a move against this being right now.","But the chances of success were unknown since he did not know much about him.","And even if he destroyed a single body, so what?","He would have other bodies out there.","Some on Megalos Ynnere. Some in Megalos Beyond.","He would find out where every piece of him lay, and only then would he make a move!","'Ahh, I can already taste it...this will be a long hunt!'","His will buzzed with tremendous weavings of existence.","Down below, Savitar had mentioned a State of Existence.","One With Existence.","This was only the first State of Existence that entities who had greatly forged their Existence could attain.","For those who were even grander, their Existence would begin to change and be distorted.","Until they developed something...utterly unfathomable to others.","HUUUM!","Silently, around the veiled Will of a Great One that was filled with endless darkness melded with existence...the outline of an Eye formed!","The Eye of Existence!","A piercing eye that could get past endless lies and discover countless truths of Existence!","This Eye opened wide at this moment and locked onto none other than Noah Osmont.","'Let us see...'","At this stage of power, Entities could veil weavings of their existence very well, even to the extent that their records would be things others could not find out.","Utilizing the Eye of Existence, this Great One was going about it a different way.","He didn't alert his new target, but his Eye of Existence pulled on the records of his surrounding Existence.","Where he had appeared before.","How he had interacted with the Existence of his surroundings.","The terrifying authority of this Great One focused entirely on the interactions his target had with surrounding weavings of Existence and nothing else!","And the Eye saw.","Interactions within this Half Tainted Omniverse.","Interactions leading to a Vessel.","Interactions tracing all the way back to the Omniverse of the Protectors.","It was glimpses- mere pieces, but it gradually formed a story.","The story of his target!","The Eye continued to see as from the Omniverse of the Protectors, it grasped the weavings of another vessel that traversed Great distances.","And this vessel originated from another Omniverse.","'Oh, a newly discovered one?'","...!","Omniverse X-999!","The Great One traced the interactions of Existence all the way back there as in this place...there were too many interactions!","'Is this...one of your homes?'","The Great One that had reached the state of attainment of the Eye of Existence smiled with unfathomable brilliance.","'Let's probe around and discover more, shall we?'","The information he was getting was too sparse.","Only interactions.","They told him a lot, but also very little.","'Let's see, how about using others again?'","His weavings moved.","A newly discovered Omniverse.","This was a prize as what if he led some Outerversal Morphons there?","'Hmm...hmmm!' The Great One hummed a tune as he realized he was enjoying this particular hunt a great deal.","This was because in all the interactions he was uncovering with his powerful State of Existence, he still didn't uncover any truly personal details about his target.","He wanted to know more!","He was a Great One.","He was the Great Ponderor, Nietzsche!","And he would come to know.","He would come to understand.","Only after he understood would he make a move.","And by the time he made a move, his enemy would already be defeated!"]},{"number":3264,"title":"Chapter 3264: Chapter 3263 Dictum! Decree! Ordinance! I","paragraphs":["Within the Expanse.","What Noah called the Higher Weavings of Existence.","His figure that had reached the depths of the incandescent cluster of golden lines forming the huge tree stopped momentarily as he frowned.","The wings behind him fluttered.","Invictus Maximus released a warning.","But the warning was messy and without a whole lot of information!","Noah focused on it and quickly locked down where its source stemmed from, his weaving pointing to nothing else but the Half-Tainted Omniverse, where one of Savitar's bodies had just perished.","Where he had stolen millions of lines of connections and sent them towards Ozymandias.","Who had he stolen from? Who was scheming and had acted in the middle of the battle to reduce Savitar's power by half?","'The Master of Protector Lucretia...'","The Outerversal Morphon who had bound Lucretia!","Noah's eyes shone brightly as he was certain this sense of danger stemmed from this being as currently, there could be no others.","He began to think and plan.","|My friend, you're almost there, come on!|","Behind him, the figure of Bob was jumping up and down with excitement as if cheering him on- his intent focused on the Hearthraes dangling like glimmering cosmos on this tree.","The Hearthraes were shaped like golden dewdrops filled with immensely concentrated existence, and unlike when Bob went forward...Noah didn't face restrictions that stopped him whatsoever.","His hand simply reached out and grasped the golden dew drop, plucking it lightly as when he did, it was like a string had been cut.","TRIING!","Vibrations spread out across the countless golden strings nearby, with Noah's Existence locking onto the dewdrop in his hands!","|Hearthrae|:: A unique type of Existence that forms in order to be assimilated into the weavings of another Existence- a type of Katholikon. The peak of achievement of its existence is when it is devoured, with the boons it provides being solely dependent on the one who devoured and assimilates it. Entities whose Existence holds an unshakable foundation, potential, records, and complexity of weavings paired with the amount of time their weavings have been active will be capable of benefiting a great deal. An Existence who is more powerful but with a weaker foundation or advanced in the passage of time will experience much less benefit, albeit the taste of a Hearthrae will remain impeccable.","...!","A ridiculous treasure.","Something Noah had never grasped before, with this item actually benefiting those who were youngest since their existence was active!","But how many entities who were extremely young could achieve a Transcendence of their existence and arrive in this place?","There were an unknown number of even Omniversal Stage Entities above Noah who had not arrived at this stage of existence!","Likely, it was entities who had their weavings of existence active for millions, billions, or even eons and cycles of existence who would be in a place like this.","Someone like Bob.","But uniquely, Bob was so powerful and complex that his very weavings were prevented from getting near this unique location!","It was an oddity of wonder of this Higher Weavings of Existence.","Of the place Bob called the Expanse!","Noah grasped the Hearthrae in his hand as he felt the golden dew drop buzz with excitement, waves of golden light actually releasing from it as they formed into an intent that said...","|Eat me!| |Eat me!| |Eat me!!!|","|...|","Right.","This treasure was actually a type of existence, but it formed for the sole purpose of being devoured.","Its achievement in life was to be devoured!","And its weavings made this abundantly clear as it almost danced on Noah's hand.","|Haha, good! Grab some more, my Friend. The more the merrier!|","Bob's voice echoed out from behind as Noah gazed at the vibrant countless strings making up this tree and moved towards all the areas holding golden dew drops.","It was serene.","Peaceful.","As if he had become the farmer he always envisioned himself being at the end of everything, and he was harvesting fruits while literally surrounded by golden strings of radiance all around.","HUUM!","His existence felt a sense of profound serenity and peace as he plucked one golden dew drop after another, losing his own sense of time entirely as he felt like he was doing the most mundane and yet the most fantastical thing at the same time.","The moment he came to grasp his sense of time once more, he found himself at the very top of the Golden tree cluster of lines.","All dew drops were picked clean as they gravitated around him, overflowing from his arms and wings!","The moment he plucked the last dew drop.","The last Hearthrae on this glittering tree.","HUUM!","The countless threads of golden lines trembled before converging towards a single plasmic golden line- this line burning with brilliance as it turned its sharp end towards Noah and surged forward at speeds far faster than his existence could even keep up.","SAA!","In a flash, the plasmic beam of golden line smashed onto his body and passed through him before it disappeared into the distance.","|You have been recognized by the Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree.|","|Your existence has gained the quality of the Primaltree Treasure Compass that will naturally be led to other Primaltree Tresors and other Existential Katholikons within the Expanse.|","...!","In the depths of his existence, the markings of a golden tree appeared and buzzed with activity as Noah made a tremendous gain by doing something seemingly mundane!","At the same time the marking of the Primaltree Treasure Compass was forged within him...","|The weavings of Loot, Protagonist, and Quintessence within your Conceptual System of Existence have made a significant advancement.|","|The Value of your Conceptual System of Existence has increased by +50,000!|","Something even deeper within him responded as his existence cheered.","At this time...","|Haha, you picked them clean, my Friend. Come, let me show you how to best enjoy these.|","The figure of Bob appeared beside Noah after the disappearance of the Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree, grasping one of the many golden dew drops swirling around Noah as his hand pulled on a golden string near them, and...","WAP!","They disappeared."]},{"number":3265,"title":"Chapter 3265: Chapter 3264 Dictum! Decree! Ordinance! II","paragraphs":["Those with power could do things that those without power would look at with awe and shock.","The things Bob was doing were worthy of awe, but Noah only watched them with analytical eyes as within the span of an instant, he found that their surroundings had changed once again.","They appeared in a space where the strings of golden lines surrounded a massive distorted space that held no strings, all of them pushed to form an encirclement of golden strings around this space that actually shone with white radiance.","Akin to a white singularity amidst all the grandeur of gold.","|Come, in this space, we should have no disruptions as we enjoy the Hearthraes with ease. For obtaining all of them, is there anything a new entrant like you is curious to know? I am very knowledgeable, you know!|","Bob hit his chest with confidence as his circular head with the twinkling singularities and devilishly wide smile only became more regal and yet menacing.","Noah floated into this space with Hearthraes swirling around him as he wanted to see how far he could take it with this unknown entity, and just what more he could gain from him.","|What do you know about States of Existence, Bob?|","...!","The thing that Savitar mentioned only truly powerful Protectors having.","Hearing his question, Bob blinked while staring at Noah quizzically, his face flashing with golden brilliance as it instantly flashed with an unfathomable Eye that seemed to observe everything before it disappeared.","He then looked towards Noah as if he was observing a rare animal and shook his head with surprise.","|You really don't know because you actually haven't attained any State of Existence yet...haha, how did you even get here?|","The question from Bob was an important one as he sat down at the center of this white space, tapping his finger out to cause a crystal golden table to appear where all the Hearthraes around Noah floated towards.","His voice then echoed out.","|There are multiple States of Existence that one comes across as their Existence becomes more complex and builds greater Records. At some point, one will come to attain the state of One With Existence.|","At this point, Bob took his limb out and stretched it as in the next moment, it melded in the surrounding space until the entire limb could no longer be seen, as if it entirely assimilated and became one with the surrounding space!","|This is a rudimentary state of existence, the first threshold to cross if one is to eventually transcend their Existence and arrive here. And you, my friend, have yet to even attain this state of existence, but here you are.|","...!","Silence.","Bob stared towards Noah while blinking with bright white brilliance, his voice continuing to echo out.","|After the State of One With Existence, an increasingly complex entity is capable of attaining the state of the Eye of Existence if their very Source of Existence is strong and complex enough. In that state, the number of information about the weavings of Existence at your fingertips is unfathomable. You begin looking at Existence in an entirely different way. This step is what allows you to find the eventual doorway of Transcendence to arrive here.|","|Over the countless cycles, many have reached the apex of this State of Existence and been lucky enough to arrive in the Expanse. But, there is one more State of Existence that some truly terrifying Entities attain before they step foot in the Expanse.|","...!","One With Existence! Eyes of Existence! Preset pathways that all others had to follow, and yet Noah had made a major jump and attained his entry into the Higher Weavings of Existence without any of these. Without having attained any of these states at all.","How difficult was what he had done? How impossible was it? And after these two states, there was still one more.","They all dealt with increasing complexity and power of one's existence to reach an extremely high point before such states could be attained!","|For some, transcending their existence is immeasurably hard due to a great deal of complexity that others cannot even compare to. Such Entities go a step further into the Third State of Existence. Some call it the Decree of Existence. Others call it the Dictum of Existence, or the Ordinance of Existence depending on where they are from. But it is a state where one takes all the complexity of their existence and reduces it all to a single Decree. A single Dictum. A Single Ordinance! Such entities are unfathomably powerful. Should you meet them in this endless Expanse and evoke their ire, say your prayers and prepare for endless darkness, my friend.|","WAA!","Bob spoke with a smiling expression as he broke out into laughter while waving his hands.","|Don't worry though. Even if thousands of such entities appear before us right now, they won't be able to lay a hand on you with me here.|","...!","The mystery surrounding Bob deepened as he uttered a heavy statement.","He talked of Entities so complex and unfathomable in power, and yet he stated that even if thousands of such entities appeared, they wouldn't be able to lay a hand on him.","He crossed his hands and stroked his chin as if he were pondering at this moment, his intent echoing out.","|Entities whose Existence becomes unfathomably complex are very hard to kill. Within the Expanse, and even out there in the Megalos Nihilos, Megalos Beyond, and Megalos Ynnere- you will come across Resurgent Existences. Entities who were once unfathomably powerful but faced destruction...and yet they didn't completely perish. The complexity of their existence and the records they left behind...they find a way to be reborn into another lifeform within their preset bounds of Existence. Those are some truly scary buggers- the ones who have died again and again and keep coming back. I can't tell you the number of times I've had to kill the same entity over multiple cycles...ah!|","|But hey, forget all that. These Hearthraes before us are where existence is really at. The taste! Oh, depending on your foundation and how young you are, they should even help you go towards the first State of Existence.|","...!"]},{"number":3266,"title":"Chapter 3266: Chapter 3265 Advancement! I","paragraphs":["Bob grasped a golden dew drop while stating such words.","The Hearthraes may even be capable of aiding one towards the austere States of Existence Noah brought a golden dew drop in front of his eyes as he digested the powerful waves of information that Bob had just released.","The complexity of Existence.","The mention of Megalos Beyond that belonged to Dark Matter, Megalos Ynnere to Matter, and Megalos Nihilos to Anti-Matter!","The complexity of existence that allowed Entities to grow unfathomably powerful even if they hadn't transcended their existence.","In the midst of all of this, Noah felt like he stood at an incomparably small viewpoint, with his existence having managed to enter a wide field of play very early!","He had been growing within the Megalos Ynnere this whole time, and he had only just stepped into the vast stretches of the Megalos Beyond.","As for Megalos Nihilos that should be the source of the Worms of Existence? He hadn't even seen anything of it!","He felt like there was much to be done as he threw the Hearthrae that was buzzing with excitement into his mouth.","And...","BOOOM!","An explosion of brilliance erupted within him.","The moment it entered his mouth, the Hearthrae dissolved into threads of incandescent radiance that acted like catalytic enzymes.","Like catalysts that urged and initiated waves of reactions in his existence, with him feeling his breadth and all possible scopes of parameters of his existence beginning to buzz!","At the same time, it felt like the threads of golden lines were searching for something within his existence.","They sought for age of his existence.","They sought to understand his foundation.","The complexity and records of his existence comparative to his age and potential!","His age was unrealistically young for his current achievements.","His Foundation was incomparable compared to others!","The complexity of his records compared to his age and potential? All of these were unfathomable to even quantify.","But the Hearthrae sought for all of these details as the moment it held a certain degree of confidence...","BOOOM!","Such radiant golden light exploded out with such a disgusting level of concentration that his body turned to almost become translucent glass.","Above him, the illusion of a golden tree that was extremely similar to the Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree appeared.","Its countless branches twirled and released strings of golden light that swung down and converged towards Noah's visage.","Under him, another appalling concentration of Existence formed as the illusion of a massive mountain formed.","A purple mountain that anchored itself on the countless golden strings down below- their golden brilliance flowing into it as on the peak of this mountain- endless purple clouds gathered!","After a potent amount of such clouds formed, the mountain erupted with purple brilliance that surged like a billowing sea towards Noah's figure- all of it gushing into his translucent figure that was akin to a black hole that took in everything.","Countless strings of golden light above, endless clouds of purple light below.","Bob looked at this scene as he nodded with appreciation, bringing a Hearthrae into his mouth as he chewed on it as if he were chewing on a grape.","His body only flashed with a slight golden radiance as no commotion happened around him.","|The Manifestation of the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree and the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse during absorption...almost the highest possible result one could achieve. Almost...|","There were many factors that could influence just how fruitful the blessings of the Hearthraes plucked from a Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree were!","But if one exceeded the norms of these factors, they could bring about manifestations that would make their absorption equal something others couldn't even understand.","Bob devouring the single Hearthrae right now, for example, could have given him a benefit of +1 due to his age and other factors.","But the single Hearthrae that Noah devoured could be giving him a hypothetical beneficial value of +1,000,000!","That was how wide the discrepancy could be when taking into account the complexity of one's existence compared to their age, among other factors.","At this moment, in his translucent state, Noah reached out to grasp another Hearthrae that was thrown into his mouth right away.","Above him, the Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree became more brilliant, and below him, the Primordial Mountain of the Expanse became ever more luminous.","His Existence itself was suffused with effulgent waves of purity as ever so unconsciously, his translucent figure began to meld with his surrounding existence!","...!","It was the first step.","He was already going towards one of the States of Existence due to how horrific the effects of the augmentations to his existence were.","|You've taken the first step...and there are many more to come.|","In front of him, Bob continued to chuck more and more Hearthraes into his own mouth as he truly did enjoy their taste.","This delicacy was something he couldn't easily get due to the complexity of his existence, as it should not even be viable for him to attain it here!","It wasn't for him, or those like him.","So he smiled while he enjoyed the taste, his intent continuing to flow out regardless of whether Noah could hear him or not at this time.","|The Expanse is a dangerous place, and also one filled with opportunities. It will be rare for you to meet those weaker than you here, so your Existence will be tested. You are far from declaring the Ordinance of your Existence, but I can already sense the regality, dignity, and tyranny within that will make others your enemies rather quickly unless you bend your head...will you bend your head though?|","...!","He seemed to be musing to himself.","He also seemed to be talking to Noah, and yet Noah's existence was currently wrapped up in such brilliance that it didn't even seem like he was capable of focusing on anything else.","|Over the cycles, countless entities across the Megalos Beyond, Megalos Ynnere, and Megalos Nihilos have arrived here. Over the past eons, they have sensed things. They know that something is coming as they have begun gathering themselves together. Strength in numbers, so they think. But even numbers will not hold a candle for what is coming, only your own existence. So...do all you can to be ready.|","WAA!"]},{"number":3267,"title":"Chapter 3267: Chapter 3266 Advancement! II","paragraphs":["After he stated these words, Bob seemed to have come out of a reverie as he realized over half of the Hearthraes between him and Noah were missing, his hands having been fast to eat them all as he coughed at this moment while pulling his hand away.","He had taken just a little bit too much for the sheer taste.","|Alright, that will be all from me. This space here can act as a refuge for you if you need it. Good luck, Little One. You're the Ninth one I've come across...and likely the last.|","His circular head shone as he began to hum and rise up, floating upwards.","Unnaturally, his head twisted as he looked above while voicing out calmly.","|You like peeking at others, don't you? Why just hide over there and watch in silence.|","He left the blank white space he brought Noah in, the space he stated that it could be a refuge for him if he needed it.","Far above, where countless golden lines flowed, existence fizzled in and out as a hazy figure stared toward Bob with caution and calmness.","|Sir...we are not supposed to intervene.|","The words from this hazy space were respectful and yet reproachful at the same time.","Bob heard them while waving his hands dismissively.","|What intervention? I just met someone by chance, and his weavings followed me around for a bit. Are you trying to make trouble for me?|","...!","His mouth, which was always smiling, turned cold as his eyes flashed.","Above, the hazy existence instantly began to tremble while shaking their head.","|I wouldn't dare to, sir.|","|Mmm, then let's go.|","Without looking back, Bob flashed away and disappeared entirely.","Above, the hazy figure stared towards the translucent visage of Noah briefly, almost as if they were debating something, but after an instant, they also disappeared!","All that was left behind was a wide white space surrounded by endless golden strings around it.","Inside of it, a translucent figure encompassed by waves of radiance could be seen- an illusory Primordial Hearthraes Lotus Primaltree above him and a Primordial Mountain of the Expanse below him!","—","In a Half Tainted Omniverse.","Command Protector Valeria had been looking towards Noah with caution after his last words that brought about great shock.","He stated that he could break off the connection between her Sister and the Outerversal Morphon who had bound her!","She wanted to question such a statement, but in the next moment...","HUUM!","His figure began to radiate a shocking amount of golden and purple radiance.","|...Why are you glowing?|","She asked such words while squinting her eyes, but the man before her waved his hands dismissively while gazing behind him.","Past the scorched space.","Towards the tendrils of Outerversal Authority converging into a massive central singularity- the Dark Matter Core!","He could also sense that far in the distance, the figures of Protector Lucretia and the other three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors were wrapping up the Delegatus of Savitar who had lost their master here- the Existence Reapers who were scrambling out while crying like children- many of them escaping towards the shattering waves of Outerversal Authority in the distance.","Among the connections Noah had sent towards Ozymandias, many also included these Existence Reapers among others as Ozymandias would have to grasp them all and identify them!","And alongside all of this, ridiculous changes that he was trying to keep up were initiated by one of his bodies that was within the Higher Weavings of Existence, their boons stretching towards his Atlas of Existence and everything else that made him.","All of it happened at once.","But even now, he had to move quickly to get something else he wanted!","He began to drift towards the space with scorching obsidian radiance where one of Savitar's bodies had perished- going towards the tendrils of the distant Dark Matter Core as he voiced out towards the Command Protector Valeria.","\"I'll help with your sister, and all I ask in return is to be the one that destroys the Dark Matter Core. I can gain something from it that will even help with cutting off the link from your Sister to the Outerversal Morphon she is connected to.\"","...!","Lies were mixed with truth as Command Protector Valeria gazed towards him with hesitation.","Why did she continue to ask for missions of hunting down Morphons? Why did she feel such hatred for them?","It was all for the sake of saving her sister from their grasp.","If this entity could truly be true to his words...","Her gaze shifted multiple times over as she felt the auras of the three Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protectors turn towards this direction along with Lucretia.","|...|","Between them and Noah's figure that was going towards the Dark Matter Core, her body flashed as she turned into a streak of light that went to intercept the rest of the Equestris Protectors!","Within moments, she crossed the heavy folds of Outerversal Authority and appeared in the space where Existence Reapers were running rampant just moments ago, seeing the figures of Protectors clearing any remaining ones away while coming forward as they stopped and smiled with happiness when they saw Command Protector Valeria.","|Haha, Commander, Savitar has perished? I thought we would have to come aid you after we cleared his Peons!|","Protector Acteon radiated his intent wantonly as they gazed towards the distant interminable storms of Outerversal Authority.","Lucretia also drew near her sister while controlling her buzzing existence, her eyes cautiously staring towards the direction where Noah had also surged towards.","|And Protector Osmont?|","A question she threw towards her sister.","One that Command Protector Valeria nodded calmly to as she began to summon crimson and blue Wheels to wipe off any remaining Existence Reapers.","|He is observing the complete destruction of the Dark Matter Core. Come on- let us rid this broken Omniverse of these Agents of Anti-Life entirely!|","Her valiant Command echoed out as the others...only nodded and followed.","In the distance, Noah was coming upon a buzzing Dark Matter Core!"]},{"number":3268,"title":"Chapter 3268: Chapter 3267 Advancement! III","paragraphs":["A Dark Matter Core.","Something formed after an Outerversal Morphon descended onto an Omniverse- drawing all weavings of existence stretched across it towards a single singularity that transformed everything into weavings of Dark Matter.","The Quintillions upon quintillions of lifeforms stretched out across all the Existential Domains containing countless Planes of Existence, Cosmos, Universes, and trillions of worlds.","All were burned and acted as the fuel to further the Dark Matter Core, with Existence Reaper rising from the wanton fusion of the strongest Existences within the Omniverse!","It was a heavy and cataclysmic ordeal that decimated a great deal of life, and Noah came upon this vibrant Core at this moment as he sighed.","Its formation was cruel and brutal, but since it was already here...","|Are you ready for an infusion of even more Dark Matter?|","Noah sent his thoughts out to the Infinite Omniverse that was continuing the process of rearrangement and transformation based on his Source of Existence of Ingeniare.","|Yes, Master.|","The voice of the Infinite Omniverse was firm as on Noah's fingertips...Psioneutrino Particles began to gather.","They acted akin to particles holding a heavy gravitational pull towards the weavings of Dark Matter ahead of them- tendrils of obsidian radiance beginning to flow towards Noah as in response, a film of incandescent obsidian radiance began to erupt from his hand and fold over the Dark Matter Core that was light years wide ahead of him.","He barely seemed like a speck of dust before it, and yet his power was so deep and heavy that the released black film of radiance wrapped around the light years wide Dark Matter Core in an instant, and then...the weavings of Existence themselves began to distort.","His connection with the Infinite Omniverse was put in focus.","His new weavings of existence made up of Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrinos were put in focus!","And then, a tug occurred.","A tug.","But with this mere tug...","WAP!","The Dark Matter Core disappeared.","...!","KAA!","The remnants of anything to do with the Half Tainted Omniverse cried out a devastating bellow.","Noah closed his eyes.","He felt the profound changes his Existence was undergoing at this very moment as it allowed him to be in tune with his surrounding weavings of Existence very, very closely.","The effects of the Hearthraes on him were appallingly great as the values for every single one of his Systems of Existence were shooting up rapidly.","And he felt ever closer towards all surrounding weavings of existence.","As if he could feel a wind passing through everything, and this wind tickled his very skin.","So he could feel it all.","The weavings of existence of quintillions that had perished within this Omniverse.","He felt their minute threads of pain and seconds before they were either eradicated or turned into something else. He felt the shattered Domains of Existence that seemed to be crying in desolation.","|The Complexity of your Existence is rapidly and Quintessentially increasing.|","A prompt flashed in his mind, but he didn't pay attention to it.","He simply felt!","In the grand scheme of things, it could be easy for his mind to be numbed to the idea of the deaths of quintillions upon quintillions of beings.","But it did occur.","An Outerversal Morphon did cause it.","Of course, in their perspective, all of these lives meant nothing and were inconsequential to their grand plans!","But there were families here with dreams. Parents who sought to protect their children. Children who wanted to emulate their parents. Kings and Emperors who wanted to protect their people and enact dynasties lasting for millions of years.","In all of them- as he felt the bursts of the end of their weavings of existence, Noah saw himself.","His biggest fear was to be the father of a family in an Omniverse like this- where they now lay dead without even truly knowing what had killed them.","Only weavings of hatred and regret left behind.","He felt it all very closely.","And he made a promise to all these weavings of pain and decimation that he never wanted to experience himself.","'I will lay waste to the one who caused all this destruction'","...!","The One Who Walks, Savitar! At this moment, the Omniversal Archontes Engineer swore that he would erase the weavings of this existence!","HUUM!","His body buzzed as it began to meld with the surrounding weavings of existence.","Behind him, he felt the auras of Command Protector Valeria and the rest of the Equestris Protectors near, their gazes falling on him as their eyes opened wide.","They saw as in the next moment, his body began to disperse as if it held the same properties as the surrounding weavings of existence- everything about him glowing incandescently before it disappeared into the surroundings!","This was different from his disappearance before on the Omniversal Voyager.","They had seen him meld with the surrounding existence.","This...","This was...!","|One With Existence!|","Protector Lucretia screamed out in shock.","The others watched on in a daze as Command Protector Valeria's gaze became unfathomably stern.","A place she was close to, but had not yet reached.","This being, who wasn't even an Omniversal Entity, was grasping it at this moment as...just who was he? Seeing the absence of the Dark Matter Core also, Command Protector Valeria wondered- didn't this have anything to do with him grasping a new state of existence?","There were too many questions and very few answers.","After all of this, she had to sit down with him and get some answers!","—","Far from the Half Tainted Omniverse that was breaking apart.","Across the Megalos Ynnere and its endless Omniverses.","Within Omniverse X-999, there was a miniature Omniverse inside of it that at this moment...began to approach the same level of breadth and complexity as Omniverse X-999 itself.","Within it, a massive infinity-shaped Extremity Vein coursed with heavy and concentrated waves of Existence, and surrounding this Vein, rings of colorful, flat Aletheian Havens wrapped around it gloriously!ter."]},{"number":3269,"title":"Chapter 3269: Chapter 3268 Advancement! IV","paragraphs":["Inside this wondrous Omniverse, there was already a steady stream of stellar obsidian radiance that was flowing in from its very depths.","From a connection to a distant entity in the Megalos Beyond!","And yet at this moment...","BOOM!","A clap of thunderous sound boomed out as below the circling Aletheian Havens, an extremely dense obsidian core arrived.","A Dark Matter Core!","The moment it arrived, it trembled in an unstable manner as if it sought to cause the very disruption of existence.","But...","WU!","From the massive Extremity Vein, a heavy pressure boomed down that utterly stopped any sense of instability in a domineering manner.","From the Extremity Vein, colorless, blue, and purple radiance descended as the very concentrated weavings of Quintessence, Manadynamics, and Tyranny gushed down massive tendrils of their brilliance that wrapped around this Dark Matter Core!","These tendrils of light...almost seemed like tentacles.","Almost like the features of the inhabitants of the Megalos Beyond!","But they domineeringly wrapped around the Dark Matter Core and stopped any sense of instability, these tendrils of Existential Extremity Authorities clenching as they shockingly split apart the circular blazing core in three, extremely pure Outerversal Authority leaking out that was then sucked into these tendrils and towards the pulsing Extremity Vein.","THUMP!","THUMP!","The Core, as if it were a beating heart, was slowly but surely drained.","And when one looked at the glorious space of the Infinite Omniverse, one would come to notice that some of its weavings were painted with a stellar obsidian hue.","A hue only present in the Megalos Beyond.","It was a subtle change, but it was only the beginning.","What will happen in the future?","When Ozymandias continued to allow weavings of the Megalos Beyond to flow into the Infinite Omniverse?","Would this Infinite Omniverse still belong with the designation of something from the Megalos Ynnere, or of the Megalos Beyond?","Or something else entirely?","This question couldn't be entirely answered at this moment.","But within the depths of the Infinite Omniverse, there was the Manifestation of this construct itself.","Her multicolored visage made up of many different authorities formed the definitive shape of a feminine entity, and yet right now, from her legs where countless lines of authorities extended towards the dazzling throne Noah sat on....vibrant, incandescent, radiant obsidian tentacles began to grow!","The change was not missed by the Infinite Omniverse, her Manifestation staring towards the Master on the throne who currently looked far above.","Towards the connection leading to the Megalos Beyond.","There, Ozymandias was about to step onto a grand field of play.","—","The Megalos Beyond!","A space of endless obsidian radiance, its ends never before observed even after cycles upon cycles passing.","A new entrant had made his mark in a short period of time as since his entry, he had stepped into the Grave of the Great Beyonder that was then shuttled across the Megalos Beyond towards a certain Pantheon- with those around him believing a single thing!","The appearance of the Sign.","The Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of!","The Instrument that would either allow for the destruction of the Megalos Beyond or its endless flourishing.","It was a daring statement as who could believe such a thing?","How could a single being be capable of causing such a huge effect on the Megalos Beyond that had existed for an unknown scale of time?","If only the words could be taken with such skepticism.","But the issue was that they stemmed from the Great Beyonder.","And this Entity...held far, far too much history and trust across the Megalos Beyond.","BOOM!","Obsidian space split apart and formed into a huge rift as from it, a domain encased by a crimson barrier came to fruition.","It was none other than a certain Grave of the Great Beyonder as when it arrived, it brought changes with it.","The connection from a certain Ozymandias to something far greater than a single entity still prompted certain changes, with a flourishing of the very weavings of the nearby Megalos Beyond occurring as in response, there was rain.","Stellar, dark drops of rain that when they flew across the pristine space, an increase in the concentration of Dark Matter would occur.","And the place where the Grave of the Great Beyonder appeared was not a barren one.","Not too far in the distance was a Pantheon that was their target all around.","The Megalos Pantheon of Umbra!","It was like a deep crimson black landmass that was ten times the size of any common Omniverse, its weavings lively as this Pantheon had stood strong for many cycles.","Equivalent to trillions of years.","Its foundation was deep and unfathomable, and the countless Outerversal Morphon residing within it were even more so.","At this moment, the reason for the appearance of Rain, which had never before appeared in the Megalos Beyond...underwent even more changes.","In addition to the connection to an Infinite Omniverse, there were a few other things occurring simultaneously.","A part of himself in the Higher Weavings of Existence was consuming Hearthraes that were causing massive and appalling changes.","Changes that, among many other things, initiated the induction into a State of Existence that only truly complex existences could arrive at.","One With Existence.","At this moment, Ozymandias felt interminably comfortable as his existence felt like it was being cradled by the Megalos Beyond itself.","He felt like his body was melding with the surrounding Megalos Beyond itself!","This...only caused the already ongoing reaction to become even wilder.","The rain became heavier.","More widespread.","The Grave of Great Beyonder pulled towards the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra as at this moment, it came with it...an ever increasing storm of rain that increased the breadth of existence of the Megalos Beyond itself!","The Grave was akin to a grain of sand compared to the Pantheon itself, and yet from around it, the drops of rain forming were too numerous as they converged into a rainfall! Instantly, millions of wills that were peacefully moving about in the nearby sections of the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra began to be aroused..."]},{"number":3270,"title":"Chapter 3270: Chapter 3269 He Has Come! I","paragraphs":["Within the space that pulsed like an organ where Ozymandias and Little Aspasia had remained connected for some time.","Their connection had not been broken as Noah was in a meditative seated position, the weavings of his existence hazy as they seemed to meld in and out of his surroundings.","Whatever reaction he was causing allowed for the concentration of the Megalos Beyond itself to be richer, and the drops of rain forming from his actions only increased in quantity!","Aspasia looked at this scene with sharp eyes as she came to a firm decision.","Following the Will of the Great Mother, she moved!","They were just now arriving at the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra, an extensive domain stretching out for countless light years as even the omniverses of the Megalos Ynnere could not compare.","Inside of this Grave of the Great Beyonder, they were akin to being in a vessel arriving at this place.","And since this vessel held the entity exhibiting all these Signs- and the one that the Great Mother had definitively come to the conclusion that he was the Instrument too...he had to state his welcome.","And so, Aspasia moved to make this welcome.","Her obsidian visage pulsed, her hand coming to smash into her chest as behind her- a secondary visage that looked just like her flashed before it disappeared.","Outside of the Grave of the Great Beyonder floating into the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","HUUM!","Outerversal Authority gathered brilliantly to form the visage of a stellar illusory Aspasia.","It was massive in size, coming out to be even slightly larger than the Grave of the Great Beyonder itself as this figure of Aspasia raised her hands up while the obsidian drops of rain passed through her!","|The Sign that the Great Beyonder had promised! The Instrument that shall offer salvation to the Megalos Beyond...has arrived!|","...!","Her voice boomed out as far as it could reach.","It was showmanship.","She wanted to be seen.","She wanted to be heard.","But truly, how could she not be heard when she quite literally came with Rain?","Something that never, ever appeared in the Megalos Beyond as there were no worlds or conditions to make such a thing possible here.","There were only an unknown number of Megalos Pantheons where many powerful Outerversal Morphons converged, and smaller domains floating in the endless stretches of the Megalos Beyond like the Graves of the Great Beyonder.","The moment Aspasia uttered her words, the wills that had begun to gaze at the shocking phenomenon above a small part of the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra shook.","The Sign? The Instrument?","Many had to dig up from their memories and records as soon, everything clicked.","The words of the Great Beyonder flashed and buzzed in their minds as they looked at the drops of rain falling from a distance.","|Rain shall cover the Megalos Beyond as it will cheer at the arrival of the instrument...|","|Rain shall cover the Megalos Beyond as it will weep at the arrival of the instrument...|","Depending on who the Outerverversal was, different words buzzed in their minds.","But in a united front, a single sentence of the many that the Great Beyonder had uttered flowed out thereafter.","|Great Ones will fall like the drops of rain...|","Rain.","Rain!!!","Some of these drops of rain began to land in insignificantly small portions of the vast Megalos Pantheon of Umbra, and when they hit the black earth of the endless rolling mountains...radiance flourished.","The concentration of Existence itself within the Megalos Beyond flourished!","From the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra, nearly a tenth of it was aroused by Aspasia's words and news traversed quickly.","The Grave of the Great Beyonder they were on was infinitely small compared to the Pantheon, yes, but...how could they not attract attention with such a phenomenon?","Very soon, a few hundred Outerversal Morphons of great size and variation began to gather towards their location.","Since it was within the bounds of the Pantheon, no combat or killing was allowed as decreed by the Great Beyonder- so there was absolute safety in these havens that were Pantheons.","|Is it...is it truly them? The instrument of salvation?|","An intent flowed out from one of the Outerversal Morphons to gather.","It was an entity with the shape of a flower, with thousands of tendrils making its stem.","A terrific aura buzzed from it as hearing the words acted like a trigger for Aspasia- her massive illusory figure waving her hands and causing a certain scene to appear.","It was the scene of Ozymandias within the Grave of the Great Beyonder, his figure brilliantly melding in and out of his surroundings!","|He was born moments ago, and the First Sign of countless connections formed in an instant was observed!|","WAA!","|Now, he ushers rain for the first time in the Megalos Beyond as at the same time...|","...!","They could see his figure melding in and out of existence.","They understood what this meant.","He was just born, and yet he was already...","|One With Megalos!|","|Ah...!|","One With Megalos.","For those in the Megalos Beyond, this was Existence.","At this moment, they saw that this newly born Morphon who brought the rain was somehow already becoming one with existence!","A State of Existence that Outerversal Morphons who had grown increasingly complex could attain over time.","This was undoubtedly the one that the Great Beyonder spoke of.","Seeing the shock and reverence before her, Little Aspasia nodded as she cemented everything.","|The Instrument has come...to call upon those who trust in the words of the Great Beyonder! The Instrument has come...for the Crucible of the Beyonder within this Pantheon!|","...!","Her words were resonant.","The attention they caught was stupendous as in moments, thousands upon thousands of Outerversal Morphons began to surround the Grave of the Great Beyonder coming into the Pantheon protectively, their eyes and intents expressing fervor!","A distance away, there were thousands of Morphons who stayed back- their eyes showing a cold light.","They also believed in the words of the Great Beyonder.","And in them, he also stated that this Instrument could be the one to bring destruction!","Their Existence wholly denied this as they did not wish to see his coming, nor his success.","Gradually, two groups began to form as the Grave of the Great Beyonder descended onto the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra!"]},{"number":3271,"title":"Chapter 3271: Chapter 3270 He Has Come! II","paragraphs":["The Sign!","The Instrument!","He came and brought down rain!","Like fire, such news spread across the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","Within its depths, countless intricate structures weaved together as at this moment, truly powerful beings began to move.","Within moments, a billowing aura that caused others to shudder bloomed in front of the thousands of groups of Morphons.","It was an entity that seemed like an amalgamation of tentacles that formed a massive ring.","Trillions of tentacles overlapping together to form a circular ringed lifeform!","Such a being held heavy prestige as the moment he appeared, hushed whispers echoed out.","|A Great One...|","|The Great Wheel...!|","An Outerversal Morphon alongside the same prestige as the Observer of Old and Young and other Great Outerversal Morphons.","His tentacles pulsed as he spoke out while feeling the drops of rain and the illusory image of Ozymandias.","|Let the Instrument present itself...If it is so, I will personally lead them to the Crucible!|","WAA!","A Great One had spoken!","Little Aspasia felt his power and nodded, her weavings traveling back towards Ozymandias as among those Outerversal Morphons she knew, The Great Wheel was one of the compatriots of the Great Mother.","An ally.","Within the Grave of the Great Beyonder.","Ozymandias received waves of intent as his eyes fluttered, countless flashes of information crossing within them as there were simply too many things he was doing at once.","Millions of lines of connections from Savitar were added to him all at once, this phenomenon only causing his interaction with the Megalos Beyond to get even more pronounced on top of the changes brought by the link to his Infinite Omniverse.","This was the direct cause of the increased Rain- alongside his own existence elevating of course.","'One With Existence...'","He felt the beginnings of this imperceptible state where his existence was telling him he could just disappear into his surroundings if he wished, the sensation being utterly wild as he wondered just how high his values had risen after all of this.","His extremely powerful Existence came up with the answer in a mere instant.","[Megalos Regnum Echelon 3 (53,799/100,000)]---[Megalos Willpower I]---[Megalos Dignity]","[Outerversal Physiology Echelon 3 (88,219/100,000)]---[Outerversal Organs I]---[Dark Matter Core]","...!","He was only just born as an Outerversal Morphon, but his speed was astounding to a large degree.","He felt the subtle changes within himself as he focused on the new additions due to jumps from the Second to the Third Echelons.","The Dark Matter Core was akin to an extremely small singularity inside of him that told him he was now capable of a single thing.","The capability of influencing a body of existence outside of the Megalos Beyond, and if successful, it would form a similar Core from that Body of Existence that could be utilized to further propagate his power!","The capability that Savitar and many others were utilizing across the Megalos Ynnere.","With it, Ozymandias could theoretically do the same thing onto the bodies of existence within the Megalos Ynnere.","It was an ability worthy of looking at closely.","His feature of Outerversal Organs was further elevated as his brain radiated waves of pure Outerversal Authority, his heart pumping even more as it felt like a body was being given multiple engines to allow it to run with even grander waves of power.","It was only the features of the other Aspect of Power of an Outerversal Morphon that Ozymandias had to spend a little more time adjusting to in order to fully grasp its possibilities.","The Aspect of Megalos Regnum that had also jumped to the third Echelon.","Megalos Willpower, and Megalos Dignity.","For the Willpower, Ozymandias felt like he could spread his will out as this alone could be used to exert his power, and his Dignity...held an unquantifiable augmentation with how he interacted with the Megalos Beyond and other Outerversal Morphons entirely.","For these, he needed more time to understand.","WAP!","His eyes fully opened as his figure, which was melding with existence, rose up.","His stellar skin was tinged with deeper and deeper hues of obsidian radiance, the Halos of eldritch might born from tentacles rotating while gushing out streams of Outerversal Authority over his body.","His face was exquisite as it only held the pair of blinding white singularities for eyes, an aurora of obsidian wings pulsing with eldritch tentacles glimmering behind him as he looked out.","His gaze turned outside of the Grave of the Great Beyonder as he saw the thousands of Outerversal Morphons gathered, as well as the massive ring of tentacles that had just appeared before them.","With but a thought, his visage took a step and disappeared, his grandiose figure making his entrance while surrounded by Obsidian radiance as he appeared outside of the Grave and in the space of the vast stretches of the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra!","The never before rain became ever heavier around him.","Moments after, Aspasia's actual body also appeared beside him as flashes of Outerversal Morphons continued to appear thereafter behind them.","The gaze of Ozymandias remained on the one that Aspasia had sent weavings of to be the Great Wheel.","After his entry into the Higher Weavings of Existence and now with him pushing himself towards the state of One With Existence, what he was able to see was greatly expanded compared to before.","He knew that he could roughly...make an estimate of the quantification of powerful beings like the one before him with at least 70% accuracy!","And so, his existence buzzed as his eyes flashed, focused on the terrifying Great Wheel.","Immense pressure that almost caused one to keep their gaze down radiated from him, but Ozymandias got what he wanted.","[The Great Wheel]","[Megalos Regnum Echelon 7 (233,844,439/1,000,000,000)]---[Megalos Willpower V]---[Megalos Dignity IV]---[@&#^$^#]....","[Outerversal Physiology Echelon 8 (3,944,552,782/10,000,000,000)]---[Outerversal Organs VI]---[Dark Matter Core V]---[@$%$]...","...!","A terrifying set of values was shown.","The Great Wheel!"]},{"number":3272,"title":"Chapter 3272: Chapter 3271 The Crucible of the Beyonder! I","paragraphs":["A Great One.","Such a being vibrated with a baleful intent of excitement at this moment as his booming voice echoed out.","|The Instrument has arrived at our Megalos Pantheon of Umbra...let us embrace him and lead him towards the Crucible of the Beyonder!|","WAA!","The words were resonant as they spread out all around.","In the surroundings, thousands of powerful Outerversal Morphons gathered under the banner of the Great Wheel as wondrously, their forms were similar to his.","Tentacles shining with radiant obsidian luster- some with wings or other features as undoubtedly, they mimicked the Great Wheel himself.","All of these were under the banner of the Great Wheel as within this Pantheon of Umbra, he was not just a Great One.","He was also one of the hegemons that controlled the weavings of this Pantheon.","An Outerversal Eldritch Emperor.","Those under his banner forcibly changed their bodies to look like him, but not all.","He had many followers.","And he himself was a follower of the Great Beyonder.","Such a being arrived to welcome the supposed Instrument mentioned eons ago!","Within the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra were many beings.","And it just so happened that in a corner of Umbra, the massive visage of a skeleton with thousands of limbs floated with pulses of anger above an obsidian stretch of land.","|The Sign? The Instrument? Such an obscene thing makes itself clear just when one of my bodies dies?|","...!","The words of Savitar were silent, to himself, and filled with coldness as he was among those who never favored the coming of the Instrument.","Why place his livelihood on someone else just because of the words of the Great Beyonder?","Did he have to treat this being that had long since disappeared with such fanaticism as others?!","|Hmph.|","The visage of Outerversal Morphon Savitar disappeared, only to reappear on the top of an exceedingly tall mountain- the tallest one in this vast Pantheon.","Here, another Outerversal Eldritch Emperor held his base of operations- this tall mountain being covered by stellar obsidian mist as there were countless holes poked across it filled with unique crimson twisting structures and buildings.","Savitar passed through many intricate structures of this mountain, only to arrive at an area where the black earth was turned into obsidian waves of plasma.","In these waves of plasma, a figure was submerged- only a single purple eye being discerned of its massive stature.","Savitar appeared near this space as he voiced out.","|The so-called Instrument has arrived at your Pantheon, with your rival even personally taking him towards the Crucible of the Beyonder. Will you just sit still while this occurs? He is currently a weak little chick. Even after these Crucibles and even in this next cycle, he will still be weak enough for any Great One to kill.|","Savitar voiced out to the other Great One under the wide stretches of obsidian plasma.","Within, a sonorous voice emanated out.","|The Decree of no Morphon perishing within the sacred lands of any Pantheon is what keeps the order of our Megalos Beyond. I will not be one to break this order. As for the Crucible...who knows if he even survives it. If he does, he will need to leave this Pantheon to go to others to overcome their Crucibles too before his standing can be cemented. You are right in that he is currently weak. We can always make a move then, O One Who Walks.|","...!","Towards the end, the words showed their annoyance and distaste as Savitar only harrumphed, staying here briefly before he disappeared.","—","Within the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","More and more Outerversal Morphons were aroused from obscurity as in the obsidian space painted by a stellar crimson hue, clouds of massive Morphons surrounded similarly formed Entities whose bodies looked like the ringed coalescence of countless tendrils.","The followers of the Great Wheel.","They passed over massive colosseum-like structures that rose up like towers and skyscrapers, with some areas being covered by leafless trees making up forests stretching for light years!","The Dark Forests of the Pantheon of Umbra.","Over 50% of this entire Pantheon, which was ten times larger than any common Omniverse, was covered by ancient leafless trees they now crossed over.","And as they did, drops of rain followed the Instrument as many Morphons watched on in awe!","Aspasia followed closely near the Instrument that followed the lead of the Great Wheel, his mere presence there causing the drops of rain to fall on the leafless trees as...","HUUM!","The obsidian trees brimmed with life thereafter, tiny, inconspicuous leaves beginning to rise!","All of this was privy to the eyes of the watching Morphons as whether they favored the Instrument or they were on the side of Heretical Morphons, they could not help but admit what they were seeing was the real deal!","They were crossing over all these lands to head towards the center of the Pantheon of Umbra.","Where the Crucible of the Beyonder lay- as this was another place to cement the standing of the Instrument!","It was said.","The Crucibles of the Beyonder would be the trials that would forge an Instrument to aid in the flourishing or destruction of the Megalos Beyond, or destroy this instrument entirely!","The Crucible of the Beyonder...","It was a terrifying region of space taking over a small portion of a few major Megalos Pantheons, with many Outerversal Morphons not even knowing how the Great Beyonder constructed them and made them the way they were.","Each Crucible was different, but the Great Beyonder had left behind words that stated anybody else who passed the trials of the Crucibles he laid out...were destined to be Morphons whose names would ring out across the Megalos Beyond and even outside of it!","And over the cycles, some had managed to pass any few portions of the Crucibles as they gained partial rewards.","Millions of Outerversal Morphons who were most astounding in the Megalos Beyond had their power attributed to those who partially cleared a Crucible, or multiple of them.","In history, the number of beings who fully cleared a Crucible numbered no more than 10!","Regardless of power, no more than 10!"]},{"number":3273,"title":"Chapter 3273: Chapter 3272 The Crucible of the Beyonder! II","paragraphs":["This was because an Outerversal Morphon who was just born, or even a Great One could all challenge the Crucible.","Its challenge...was tailored to the challenger as the level of difficulty would change drastically depending on who was challenging it.","As for the rewards...they were the unfathomable Transcendent Megalos Abilities that made the Great Beyonder so powerful.","Those who managed to clear even a portion of the Crucibles would gain small sections of these Transcendent Megalos Abilities as even these alone were enough to make them renowned Morphons.","|The Crucible of the Beyonder in our Pantheon of Umbra is also known as the Crucible of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos- aptly named for the Transcendent Megalos Ability one can gain if they successfully clear the Crucible.|","The Amarantos Dream of the Megalos!","This was the Transcendent Megalos Ability one could inherit from clearing the same named crucible.","Led by a procession of terrifying Outerversal Morphons, Ozymandias and Aspasia followed behind the devout followers of the Great Mother and arrived in front of a massive crimson rift at the center of the Pantheon.","The Great Wheel's tendrils vibrated with power as his deep voice echoed out.","|The Crucibles of the Beyonder are a work of art none of us can replicate, with each one leading you into an Isolated Megalos Domain intricately designed by the Great Beyonder. Passing the challenges of the Crucible fully grants one the Full Transcendent Megalos Ability, and passing it a third or halfway will grant a partial Transcendent Megalos Ability. For some, they do not get far as they gain nothing, and one can even have their existence extinguished within the Crucible if they are too weak! O Instrument...do you wish to proceed in at this moment, or shall you wait for the passage of time as you acclimate to who you are? I know you were just born.|","...!","Even those who had lived for many cycles didn't manage to clear the Crucible depending on their power.","Someone that was just born...how exactly would their challenge go? How low were their chances?!","And yet...as all eldritch eyes came to land on Ozymandias, he voiced out with immense calmness and confidence.","|I will enter now.|","WAA!","Unfathomable confidence radiated outwards!","And the ardor in the eyes of some of the Outerversal Morphons only increased.","This was truly the Instrument.","He had to be.","The massive Great Wheel buzzed as one could almost sense the smile on its tentacles.","|Very well. The Great Beyonder was an eccentric being as all challenges made within The Crucible are shown to those outside of it- almost as if to spur those watching to attempt it as well. We will be watching with anticipation out here, O Instrument.|","Around the massive crimson rift, twisting Pillars rose up and twisted back into the red earth, with massive obsidian obelisks and structures circling around it as if felt like an eldritch city was enacted around the crimson rift.","A city for Morphons to make merry and observe any attempts at the Crucible of the Beyonder, with endless stretches of structures continuing on from here and across the rest of the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","At this moment, millions of Morphons had turned their eyes to this place, and many more would undoubtedly make their way over.","Little Aspasia clasped her hands as Ozymandias moved forward.","|We wish you glory and a swift return, O Dream of the Beyonder.|","The distinction of the Dream of the Beyonder that Ozymandias gained after meeting the Great Mother.","Aspasia uttered it at this moment, and it rang out in this space of the Pantheon of Umbra, whispers of it beginning to spread!","And valiantly.","Without an ounce of a doubt!","Ozymandias, the Dream of the Beyonder, went towards the massive Rift of the Crucible as he disappeared!","WAP!","Existence in the surroundings buzzed.","The blaring rift pulsed and radiated waves of wonder, far brighter than when anyone else had entered it before.","|Ah...|","Was this not a further affirmation of his identity?!","Above the massive rift, a light shot out to form a massive illusory screen that showed the outline of the Dream of the Beyonder.","On the sides of the rift, more lights shot out as other illusory screens showing different perspectives also appeared- it was a show more expressive than any other challenges of this Crucible.","|Let us observe and revel in the possibilities of what may be!|","The intent of a Great One reverberated out.","OOOOH! Outerversal Morphons cheered as in the eldritch city filled with obsidian structures down below, festivities began to pick up.","Drinks began to be prepared.","Foods prepared from the supple meat of Outerversal Eldritch Beasts began to be prepared!","And all eyes within Umbra began to focus on one place.","—","A flash of obsidian radiance.","By the time Ozymandias could see again, he found himself standing on a crimson crystalline earth.","All around him, dense clouds of black mist covered everything, only lighting up a cylindrical path ahead of him.","At the end of this path, there was a humanoid eldritch horror whose skin glistened with a mixture of gold and obsidian light.","He only had eyes on his humanoid head that flashed with golden brilliance, and a stellar golden horn rising from his head that was actually the same size as him!","A terrifying intent emanated from this being- and the surroundings masked with clouds of black mist that bloomed before Ozymandias.","|You have entered the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.|","|If successful in getting past all Markers of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the full Transcendent Megalos Ability- the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos will be granted.|","|With it, one can Dream of the Megalos Beyond.|","|A single Dream can last an instant, but span a whole cycle. The gains and power obtained in any Amarantos Dream of the Megalos are retrieved and assimilated in your existence.|","|While others strive for power and connections, all one has to do is Dream and it can all be attained. At the highest level of proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, even the Transcendence of Existence is feasible with but a dream.|","...!","Terrifying weavings of intent came down.","The possible gains to be made here were astonishing as it was a technique left behind by the Great Beyonder!","Something that very few Outerversal Morphons even held the full ability of- with the number of Entities holding it fully being countable in one hand.","All were Great Ones.","Within a mere Dream, even Transcendence was possible!","But to get this Ability...one had to pass through the entire Crucible.","And just the first test alone gave Ozymandias a tremendous sense of pressure as in the distance, the entity with a curved golden horn the same size as his body rose.","It was obviously a fight.","But out of all three weavings of power, Ozymandias could only use Outerversal Authority as the Existential Extremity Authority of Noah Osmont nor His Authority of Ingeniare could be utilized.","The Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence could be pulled out and used to reinforce Outerversal Authority, but at this moment, Ozymandias had to fight like an Outerversal Morphon.","And since he was just born, he had no skills or abilities to speak of as he had to bring his own based on his previous weavings of existence, and the fact that his current body was that of an entity that had Transcended Existence to reach the Expanse!","With all of these factors put together...could he not clear the immeasurably hard Crucible that less than 10 Morphons cleared- a Crucible based on one's own strength?","|I guard the first Gateway of Dreams.|","WAA!","In the distance, the titanic figure of the humanoid morphon whose body shone with crystalline black and gold luster released his intent.","|I have cultivated the Transcendent Megalos Ability of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos to the First Epoch. No Outerversal Authority at the Fourth Echelon or below can harm me.|","...!","The intent was domineering.","The power seemed unsurpassable!"]},{"number":3274,"title":"Chapter 3274: Chapter 3273 Appalling! I","paragraphs":["The Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum of Ozymandias had only just reached the Third Echelon.","On the illusory screens where the Great Wheel and hundreds of thousands of his followers and those standing against him, the words of the Guard who had attained the First Epoch of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos rang out for all of them to hear!","Even just attaining proficiency of the First Epoch, No Outerversal Authority at the Fourth Echelon or below could harm this creature.","The Crucibles of the Beyonder were unique in that sometimes, the challenges within would have weavings of the rewards of other Crucibles.","The Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos was another Transcendent Megalos Ability that could be gained within another Pantheon far from the Pantheon of Umbra, and yet the challenges within the Crucible here had entities who cultivated such a technique as the ones to overcome.","The difficulty was that much greater.","But when Outerversal Morphon heard to intent of the Guard, they couldn't help but draw sharp breaths.","A newly born Morphon had to face someone who had cultivated the First Epoch of the terrifying Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos as the first challenge? What the hell would even come after this?!","But there wasn't even any time to wonder.","The One Who guarded the First Gateway of Dreams moved to instantly appear in front of the Dream of the Beyonder with appalling speed, his obsidian gold hand formed into a fist that thundered down the head of Ozymandias!","|Ah...","Aspasia unconsciously let out her intent as she realized that in all her calculations, she truly had not considered the scope of power that the Instrument could unleash.","He wouldn't...falter here and lose face under the gaze of all these Outerversal Morphons, right?","He needed to keep his momentum and only build from it as he couldn't fall!","'O Great Mother, do not allow him to fall...'","She made a silent prayer as on the illusory screen, the extremely fast fist of the Guard already reached the stellar obsidian head of the Instrument.","And...","BZZZT!","As if an immovable force had met an unstoppable object.","A paradox of a clash boomed between the two sides as the figure of the Guard was pushed back as if he had smashed into an elastic material!","Within the Crucible.","Ozymandias watched with a sense of shock and alarm as just this single Guard who was utilizing a Transcendent Megalos Ability...nearly reached 50% of the threshold of his defenses that he had as a Transcendent Existence.","One of the bodies of Savitar, a Great One, was able to bypass his higher Existence entirely and wound him slightly with his body in the Megalos Ynnere.","While this Guard wasn't able to bypass them at all, the power expressed was truly shocking as... was it all attributed to the Transcendent Megalos Ability?","It made him even more expectant of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos and its grand promises- while he was also reminded of when he used to Dream many months ago. But he put all thoughts aside for now.","He had to take care of the enemy before him.","After being smashed away, the Guard was unfazed as he continued to come.","Hands. Legs. His golden horn!","He seemed to be a pure sheer physical force of nature as he constantly turned into a","streak of obsidian gold light that smashed around Ozymandias.","The only caveat was how the Guard wasn't able to get through!","The Outerversal Morphons watching were shocked as whispers spread.","Just recently born without his Physiology cultivated and nurtured by the Megalos Beyond, and yet...he is comparable if not exceeding the defenses granted by the First Echelon of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos!","Ah...!","Some faces showed their surprise and belief. Others were stern while they only observed with heavy expressions.","And Ozymandias himself...had finished theorizing on how he could attack as an Outerversal Morphon!","He felt the many lines of connections he had stolen from Savitar and other connections he held that allowed him to course with potent Outerversal Authority.","He felt the massive connection with the Infinite Omniverse that was doing a feedback of granting him waves of Psioneutrino Particles that seemed to hold even purer waves of Dark Matter.","And his weavings commanded out.","Start the weavings of a database of Outerversal Skills.","...!","Outerversal Skills to match his fearsome form of an Outerversal Morphon.","A way to express his Outerversal Authority as an attack!","Instantly, his mind felt like an open field ready for any design as when it came to capabilities filled with eldritch horror...Ozymandias already had an idea of how he wanted to express his power.","The first Outerversal Skill shall be based on the Outerversal Organ- the Heart.|","HUUM!","Ozymandias placed his hand on his chest as in the next moment, a fissure bloomed on it as something flashed out.","A deeply obsidian heart.","A terrifying source of Outerversal Authority as at this moment, its veins and arteries that looked like they were cut out wildly began to extend and form into pulsing obsidian tentacles- tentacles that enlarged and radiated a potent glow of Outerversal Authority! The parameters of the Outerversal Skill, Heart of a Morphon, has been designed. What power could Ozymandias tap into when he could currently be considered weak as","a Morphon?","If he didn't want to risk utilizing the Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence under the eyes of terrifying Entities like the Great Wheel, there was one truly pure source of power that was actually part of his strength as an Outerversal Morphon.","His strongest connection.","His strongest supporter.","A small portion of the breadth, weight, and sheer complexity of the weavings of the Infinite Omniverse flows across vast distances to be expressed through your Outerversal","Organ.","...!","15% of the breadth, weight, and sheer complexity of the weavings of the Infinite Omniverse flow through your Heart.]","THUMP!","The Outerversal Heart he held in his hands beat loudly as its vessels constricted with","power.","The tentacles blooming from its veins and arteries smashed out with horrific speed and","force at this moment!","BOOM!","In the small clouded channel.","The rapidly moving Guard, whose body shone with an indestructible brilliance, was","smashed backward for the first time.","On its crystalline golden obsidian chest, a faint white marking could be seen.","...!","Even it seemed astonished as its eyes gazed forth at the enemy holding an inky black heart that at this moment seemed to gain an unfathomably heavy weight!"]},{"number":3275,"title":"Chapter 3275: Chapter 3274 Appalling! II","paragraphs":["The Challenge of the Crucibles was hard, but they reflected the challenger.","Since Ozymandias was in the Third Echelon of his Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum, the enemy he was given was someone interminably powerful in the Fourth Echelon of Outerversal Physiology.","Frankly, even other Outerversal Morphons at the Fourth Echelon would not find it easy to beat it as it practiced the Transcendent Megalos Ability- Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos!","This was the hard challenge that very few could overcome.","If an Outerversal Morphon with the Seventh Echelon of Outerversal Physiology entered, their first challenge would be a Guard equivalent to the Eighth Echelon.","Unless one had unique innate capabilities or other oddities, they wouldn't be able to cross the gulf of power!","And Ozymandias...held a truly ridiculous oddity.","The complexity, weight, and breadth of an Infinite Omniverse flowing through his Outerversal Heart!","Even a percentage of it as his body couldn't currently withstand the full weight of the Infinite Omniverse coursing through him.","10% of the breadth, weight, and sheer complexity of the weavings of the Infinite Omniverse now flow through your Heart.","WUU!","The amount of power flowing through was doubled, the Outerversal Heart of Ozymandias creaking as this was almost the maximum that Ozymandias could currently support without too heavy a strain!","One must remember that the Infinite Omniverse had already undergone Existential Terraforming and subsequently undergone further expansion and elevation with Psioneutrino Particles that rapidly and exponentially increased the sheer size and complexity of its Havens, and it now even assimilated a Dark Matter Core from a whole Omniverse.","Its complexity a day ago was incomparable to its complexity now.","At 5%, a white mark was made on the unbreakable body of the Guard. At 10%...","HUUM!","Deep obsidian radiance erupted with Ozymandias at the center, the tentacles of his heart shooting out with a heavy beat, their speed far exceeding even the guard as they thrashed towards him all around.","DUM! DUM! DUM! CRACK!","Like the beating of drums.","They were utterly majestic and heavy as soon after, cracks formed on the crystalline golden obsidian body of the Guard, and once a single crack occurred...more followed. DUM!","A final beat echoed out.","The tentacles of the Outerversal Organ retracted as the black mist cleared.","Those watching were flabbergasted as they had watched the first challenge of this Crucible many times.","They knew that to clear it...an Outerversal Morphon had to show their power and prestige by at least breaching the defenses of the first Guard of the Amarantos Dream. By causing at least a crack on its body.","But what they saw now...was the body of the Guard of the Amarantos Dream lying shattered in many pieces!","Behind it, the First Gateway of Dreams glowed with an incandescent white light to show that the first challenge had been cleared.","H...","There was an eerie silence in this region of the Pantheon of Umbra at this scene, the Outerversal Morphons observing with awe and other complex feelings as Ozymandias cooly floated forward, the tendrils of his heart pulling him along as they gathered the broken pieces of the Guard of the Amarantos Dream and walked through the gateway silently.","The Second Gateway of Dreams is filled with heavy weavings of Megalos Regnum that make it hard to even take a step, and one will face many more Guards of the Amarantos Dream. Passing it would grant one a portion of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos... will the Regnum of the Dream of the Beyonder be as astonishing as his Physiology?|","An intent echoed out.","Little Aspasia looked around at the intents of amazement and doubt as she clasped her hands on her chest and spoke resonantly.","Naturally.","WU!","A single word of decisiveness!","It was followed by the scene on the illusory screens changing and showing a luxurious mountain surrounded by obscuring mist.","At the foot of this mountain, Ozymandias stood with an obsidian heart in his hands, nine massive tentacles weavings from this heart as he gazed above towards the peak of this","mountain where an obsidian gateway lay!","But from the bottom of the mountain to the top...","WAA!","The figure of multiple Guards of the Amarantos Dream appeared.","Their golden horns rose towards the misty skies as there were at least 50 of them, and the misty atmosphere of the mountain...seemed to be pressing down with a heavy","weight!","As if an unfathomable weaving of gravitational forces were pressing down on everything and making it hard to even take a step.","Megalos Regnum.","An unseen form of power across the Megalos Beyond.","Determined by the amount of influence and change one could affect across the Megalos","Beyond!","The Instrument was just born, so surely, his Regnum had to be low.","It would be hard for him to even take a step towards the peak of the mountain that was guarded by over 50 Guards of the Amarantos Dream, right?","As the Outerversal Morphons watched with anticipation to see how heavy or light the first grueling steps towards the mountain peak would be...","...!","Their tentacles buzzed as Ozymandias...did not walk up the mountain.","He rose.","He floated.","He flew!","As if the oppressive pressure dancing and cascading down from all around absolutely did","not exist for him!","And truly, from the perspective of Ozymandias who was given the pressure of a Megalos Regnum a level above him, it didn't matter.","How high was the Dignity of his other existence within the Infinite Omniverse?","How high was the Dignity and Honor of an Existence that had arrived in the Expanse and","was doping himself with Hearthraes at this very moment, with his existence becoming in tune with both the Megalos Ynnere and Megalos Beyond?!","Could a mere pressure a level above what his Outerversal Physiology expressed even","affect him?!","The answer was clear!","He flew up towards the peak of the misty mountain, the Guards of the Amarantos","Dream shocked at the scene as they bellowed out and charged towards him en masse!"]},{"number":3276,"title":"Chapter 3276: Chapter 3275 Always a Dreamer! I","paragraphs":["\"Ah...\"","|Oh...!|","Weavings of shock spread out on clusters of hundreds of thousands of Eldritch Horrors watching the events within the Crucible of the Beyonder.","Undoubtedly, there were many here who were more powerful as Outerversal Morphons.","But their surprise came from the sheer dominance shown within the challenges of The Crucible that should be a level above any entity challenging it!","So how was he outclassing it all so seamlessly?","Near the terrifying Great Wheel, Little Aspasia grasped her hands with a look of reverence as her intent echoed out.","|Believe in the Dream of the Beyonder! Believe in the Instrument that shall usher in glory for all of Megalos Beyond...!|","Her gaze was reverent.","Her intent spread to others as they couldn't help but watch the illusory screens of the Crucible with rapt attention.","At this same time, a few light years away from this location.","In another area of the Pantheon of Umbra, the figure of Savitar had its eyes gazing all the way from this far distance, and yet he could see everything with clarity as he scoffed.","|The Instrument that shall usher in glory? What a load of shit...|","His eyes contained particularly great distaste as at this moment, space fluctuated behind him to cause the appearance of a Morphon shrouded in black smoke.","They were shrouded so heavily and fully that the figure within couldn't even be seen.","Savitar became stern at the appearance of such a figure as the purple flames in his skull blazed heavily.","|Rare to see you in these parts, O Great Ponderer.|","...!","The Great Ponderor.","Nietzsche!","This being shrouded in mystery even caused Savitar to feel uneasy.","Very rarely did he make a move.","But when he did, all things he wanted fell into place!","|Haha, Old Friend Savitar, what puts you in such a foul mood. Surely this so-called Instrument can't be the cause?|","The black mass, with an indescribable form, released their intent as Savitar scoffed and said nothing.","How could he state that one of his weaker bodies in the Megalos Ynnere was just killed in one of the most ridiculous ways possible?","He kept it to himself as uniquely, he didn't even know the threatening being who appeared right beside him was one of the major causes for why he lost one of his bodies!","|Well, whatever has you sour, I came with an opportunity today. The location of an Omniverse within Megalos Ynnere.|","...!","|Oh?|","The attention of Savitar was aroused.","His flames kindled on his sockets as the Great Ponderor continued.","|A newly discovered Omniverse by the Peons of the Commonwealth. They're wrapping up their little day of discovery as the wills of the Pillars of the Commonwealth are about to leave it. Likely a few weak Protectors will be left behind.|","The flames of Savitar rose higher as he replied.","|If the Commonwealth already has their presence there, I won't even be given time to form a Dark Matter Core...|","|Is that all you need? There would be many juicy Delegatus there for you to grab.|","...!","The Words of the Great Ponderor caused Savitar to pause.","Right.","He had just lost a few million Delegatus with the death of one of his main bodies.","He could recoup his losses here, and make an exit before the truly powerful Peons of the Commonwealth arrive.","But as always...his flames burned suspiciously towards the Great Ponderor.","|And what do you get out of this information? You could do the same for yourself and harvest this Omniverse for its life.|","Yes.","The Great Ponderor never did anything without meaning.","What did they want out of this?","|Haha, naturally, I gain something. By the time the Peons of the Commonwealth react and send more of their nearby forces, they will take those of nearby Omniverses. And once they do...I plan to attack an Omniverse with a particularly delicious Peon I've had my eye on. That I can't share with you...but yes, I will benefit too.|","...!","The Words of the Great Ponderor were straightforward as Savitar nodded.","He had to quell some of his rage and recoup his losses!","|Very well.|","The One Who Walks agreed as the shrouded figure of the Great Ponderor buzzed with brilliance.","Unknown to Savitar, his target lay within Omniverse X-999.","Protector Noah Osmont!","At the thought of this being, the Great Ponderor recalled how not too long ago, he had displayed how he had attained the state of One With Existence to the Equestris Protectors where his Delegatus was hidden.","And here, he received reports that shockingly, the newly born Instrument had attained the State of One With Megalos.","Two different pieces of information.","They only fluttered across his mind briefly before they passed.","There was no possible trigger to someone cause the Great Ponderor to even associate these two events!","His focus at this moment was the Protector that had stolen his hard work.","The one he currently hunted as after Savitar made a move against Omniverse X-999, he would come to understand more about Noah Osmont.","And as always.","Only after he fully understood his enemy would he make a move.","Only then!","And by the time he made a move, his enemy would already be defeated!","For he...was Nietzsche!","|Mmm...|","His existence buzzed as he also observed the so called Instrument in the distance.","He also had to make plans on how he could benefit from this.","Based on the momentum the Instrument carried, should he be a supporter...or a Heretical Morphon?","His weavings flashed with brilliance as they observed the Instrument shoot up the mountain, the unbreakable Guards of the Amarantos Dream surging towards him like Pillars of obsidian gold radiance, and yet his heart smashed out its tentacles with heavy waves of force that smashed them away as they sunk into the earth of the mountain!","When they rose from their craters, their bodies already held fractures.","When they sought to stop him again by throwing their bodies and long golden horns towards him...","BOOM!","They were smashed for a second time with even greater ferocity as when they smashed onto the mountain again, their bodies were already in crystalline pieces!","His relentless advancement could not be stopped as he neared the peak of the mountain.","The moment he passed it, regardless of whether he passed the remaining challenges of this Crucible...he would gain a portion of the Transcendent Megalos Ability, Amarantos Dream of the Megalos!"]},{"number":3277,"title":"Chapter 3277: Chapter 3276 Always a Dreamer! II","paragraphs":["A mere portion!","And this alone was capable of bringing to fruition a powerful Outerversal Morphon.","The Great Ponderor himself didn't have the full Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, but he knew how stupendous it had been for him during his rise to power.","Now...it wasn't as terrifying as someone on his stage truly needed the full technique.","If the Instrument could obtain it...would he be able to transmit it to others?","|Mmm....|","The Great Ponderor...pondered.","—","BOOM! BOOM!","The tentacles of his heart seemed slimy and filled with obsidian stellar blood, and yet they smashed onto the hardened crystalline bodies of Guards who practiced the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos and splintered them to pieces!","The complexity of an entire Omniverse- even if it was a percentage of it, was this overpowering.","BOOM!","Another Guard of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was smashed into a crater on the misty mountain as Ozymandias came to land on the peak.","The Obsidian portal on the peak of the mountain turned white as akin to simply passing by, Ozymandias went through!","...!","Space twisted with radiance.","He barely blinked, and he appeared in a different place.","There were no enemies.","He stood upon a crystalline earth that extended out endlessly, with a single white portal shimmering gently ahead of him.","Above him, the whole skies were replaced with a single scroll.","A scroll that seemed to be filled with interminable complex weavings of existence- the words [AMARANTOS] burning with a gorgeous obsidian hue on it!","It should have been a partial reward for having arrived where he had arrived.","But it was grander than that.","In front of Ozymandias and those watching outside of the Crucible...intents made themselves clear before him.","|The Crucible of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos has deemed it unnecessary to continue challenging you after the dominating weavings displayed.|","|The Full Transcendent Megalos Ability, Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, can now be inherited.|","...!","The eyes of Ozymandias pulsed.","The hand grasping his heart...lowered itself as his chest opened, his heart flowing back in as its tentacles reconnected to his body!","|...|","He was speechless.","He had overpowered the initial stages of the Crucible so much that it didn't pose him the remaining challenges.","The Crucible itself gave up!","From the dazzling scroll covering the skies above, a blinding golden light shot down and bathed Ozymandias with glory!","Within the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","The Tentacles of the Great Wheel vibrated.","His forces and other Outerversal Morphons were flabbergasted.","What was this?","The Crucible deemed it unnecessary to even continue the challenge?","When the hell had this happened before?!","Yes, he showed such dominance in the first and second challenges, but...really?!","|Hidden mechanisms that were never discovered were shown here today...so the Crucible can also be cleared this way!|","An intent echoed out amidst the shock as the Outerversal Morphons clamored.","|Unfathomable!|","|Unbelievable!|","|Unfair!|","Different cries rose out, but the results were undeniable.","Little Aspasia spread her hands out as she echoed out with sharp eyes and a glare.","|Behold...the grandeur of the Dream of the Beyonder!|","The Dream of the Beyonder.","The Sign.","The Instrument!","He made himself clear and present under many eyes today with a shocking show of power, all eldritch eyes watching as he inherited the full Transcendent Megalos Ability, Amarantos Dream of the Megalos!","In that space where the skies were filled with a single massive scroll, a pillar of obsidian light gushed down onto the visage of Ozymandias endlessly as it seemed to be transcribing tremendously complex weavings into his existence.","Ozymandias found that the rays of obsidian light were formed from extremely pure dark matter- its concentration and purity being something that he reached a millionth of right now!","A millionth!","That was how pure these waves of Dark Matter were as they converged into a single point in his existence- this point beginning the outline of a rune.","A rune deeply obsidian in radiance as it read...AMARANTOS!","BOOOM!","Alongside it, the weavings of a complex technique began to burn themselves into his mind.","|The Inheritance of the full Transcendent Megalos Ability, Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, is in process.|","One had to gain this Inheritance to even be capable of utilizing this technique.","Once the terrifying rune of AMARANTOS began to form, one had to utilize swathes of their Outerversal Authority to power it up, and they could begin traversing on the tremendous path of dreaming of the Megalos Beyond!","As the rune formed in Ozymandias.","|The full Transcendent Megalos Ability...Only three Great Ones have attained it!|","Outside.","The intents of Outerversal Morphons raged with abundance as they discussed some lesser known secrets.","|The weavings of the Great Ones have stated that for all of them...the first Dream was a special one. Only an instant was guaranteed to pass for the Megalos Beyond, and yet their dream across the Megalos Beyond...could span entire cycles if they were lucky!|","WAA!","Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was another terrifying capability.","|What will the Dream of the Beyonder...dream of?|","If he truly wasn't the Instrument as many of them now believed.","What would this being Dream? And how shocking would his gains be when he still had very little proficiency in this Transcendent Megalos Ability?","The Morphons and many other eyes watching wondered.","But in that unique space...Ozymandias found himself deeply attracted to the rune of AMARANTOS.","Not because of its shocking power, but purely due to its complexity.","Within this complexity...he saw some similarities.","The subject field of all of this was Dreams.","And he...had always been a Dreamer.","He had dreamt of Dimensions.","He had dreamt of himself spread out for light years.","In the Amarantos rune, he saw similarities of this dream as instantly...","HUUM!","From his connection to the Infinite Omniverse, the already changing Dream Aletheian Haven that was uniquely shining with obsidian sandy gold radiance pulsed.","It was already influenced by Dark Matter through the Psioneutrino Particles.","And now, it felt the pull of something very similar to it carrying even purer weavings of Dark Matter.","BOOM!","The entire Dream Aletheian Haven and its Ascendant Existential Extremity Authority erupted into a grandiose pillar of sandy obsidian gold light that surged across the Infinite Omniverse and towards Ozymandias!","Across the Megalos Ynnere and into the Megalos Beyond.","It arrived with fervor into Ozymandias who was already bearing 10% of the complexity of the Infinite Omniverse- and it pierced into the obsidian rune of AMARANTOS.","A rune that began to flicker with a golden brilliance as with such a massive influx of authority, Ozymandias didn't even need to unleash any of his own.","All he had to do was to...","|Dream.|","WAA!","Yes.","He could dream.","But his Dream...would be unfathomably vast.","The massive rune began to flicker as the words of Ozymandias echoed out within him.","|Dream of the Megalos Beyond.|","...!","|Dream...of the Megalos Ynnere.|","...!"]},{"number":3278,"title":"Chapter 3278: Chapter 3277 An Endless Dream! I","paragraphs":["Dream!","The very weavings of Ozymandias echoed such a command as within him, the forming rune of AMARANTOS burned with a fearsome obsidian gold light as from the Infinite Omniverse, the weavings of the Dream Aletheian Haven tunneled into it endlessly.","The Transcendent Megalos Ability, Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, was something unfathomable that allowed one to experience weavings of existence that were Dreams...and yet the gains of these dreams could be retrieved and assimilated into one's existence.","The time of the Dream varied as a single dream could last seconds, days, or years, and it could be equivalent to seconds, years, or even entire cycles.","It was all unknown.","But from the few who had attained this technique, it was known that the first Dream would only ever take an instant, no matter how much time passed within the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.","At this moment, Ozymandias started his first Amarantos Dream of the Megalos as the forming rune of AMARANTOS exploded out to cover him with a storm of sandy gold brilliance.","And thus...an instant began to tick.","—","BOOM!","His eyes snapped open.","His form was that of an obsidian worm that rose in a dark earth, his segments wiggling around to observe his surroundings as he was just born.","And yet he knew who he was.","He was Ozymandias, and this was but a Dream!","He didn't have his power.","No state of Transcendence.","No state of Existence.","No Infinite Mana.","No connection to the Infinite Omniverse!","He rose up to look around him and found a few other worms like him waking, their bodies as Morphons looking feeble and sumptuous.","And so...","SUU!","His body zapped towards the nearby wriggling Morphons as he began to devour them one by one, his Outerversal Physiology and Regnum beginning to rise maddeningly.","In this Dream, he didn't feel any connection to the Infinite Omniverse or anything else as he could only depend on himself.","After devouring all the newly born Morphons near him, he bid his time and recalled the sensation of Alieia, of the Innate nature of Morphons spreading their weavings to connect to others.","He didn't go too far as he began to fish for connections in the dark earth he was on.","A month passed before he was able to find his first Delegatus- a weak flower tentacle that grew from the dark earth he was on.","With a single Delegatus bound, he was able to feel as if his vision had greatly expanded, his will spreading out towards nearby Flower Tentacles as his Delegatus began to increase rapidly!","His Megalos Regnum slowly strengthened. His Outerversal Physiology began to ebb forward steadily.","Slowly, years passed in this glorious dream.","The small body of a worm was no more, and a renowned Outerversal Morphon had begun to rise in the land where the dark earth was contained in- a small portion of the Megalos Pantheon of Gama!","Under him, his Delegatus extended not just within the Megalos Beyond, but even within the Megalos Ynnere.","His body was now a massive segmented worm with thousands of tentacles pulsing eerily around him, and the Morphons under him reached thousands!","He obtained a great deal of knowledge regarding Outerversal Morphons, and also about the Crucible that stood within the Megalos Pantheon of Gama- the Crucible of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos.","He didn't have anything relating to Noah Osmont or Ozymandias, but he had the Will.","He had the memories.","He held the Dignity!","A hundred years passed.","His power grew to attain the Fifth Echelon of Outerversal Physiology as at such a time, he delved into the Crucible within the Pantheon of Gama.","Given the power he had cultivated all these years along with astounding techniques he designed from previous weavings of existence, he challenged the Crucible!","But it was truly too arduous without the power he commanded outside of this Dream, and he was only able to complete half of the crucible.","Thus, he was awarded with half of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos.","But even this half, when it began to be cultivated...required tremendous amounts of Nectar of Existence among other resources!","But the results...allowed his power to scale tremendously.","He began to gain some true renown on the Megalos Pantheon of Gama, his power at unprecedented levels as hundreds of years passed!","He became known as the Worm of the Deep!","On the 2,500th year.","His power reached a point where all of a sudden...his weavings buzzed as they felt unfathomably sleepy.","Unfathomably so.","And endless slumber overcame him as he fell asleep and began to dream.","—","|GAH!|","Inside of an Omniverse.","A golden furred Simian arose from a verdant pool filled with terrifying waves of existence, 9 Apogee Autarchs and an Omniversal Entity looking at him at the center of the pool as they breathed a sigh of relief!","|You survived the ambush of the Morphons, Protector Alexei...you had us worried for a second!|","...!","Protector Alexei opened his eyes wide and stared at his hands.","The golden fur on them.","His reflection in the verdant waters that looked like a Simian.","It was not who he truly was. Because he knew...that he was in a Dream!","But this Dream had gone from the Megalos Beyond and stretched into the Megalos Ynnere.","At this moment, he closed his eyes as he felt at the Base of his Existence, there was a massive Wheel turning.","A system of existence based on the Wheel of Existence- one seeking to emulate its wonders and be close to it!","Inside of him burned an astonishing bloodline and System of Existence as he rose from the verdant pool while smiling devilishly.","\"I was truly worried for myself too, my Brother!\"","He spoke jovially towards the Omniversal Stage Entity as the endless dream continued!","As a Protector of the Commonwealth- one so close to the Omniversal Stage, he was privy to many secrets.","And he became so unfathomably in tune with the System of Existence of the Royal Simians.","The Existence of the followers of the System of Existence of Kuklos held a refinement and elevation of existence at every turn of the Wheel.","This...he attained seamlessly in this Dream!"]},{"number":3279,"title":"Chapter 3279: Chapter 3278 An Endless Dream! II","paragraphs":["As Protector Alexei, hundreds of years passed as he battled against the forces of Outerversal Morphons and Worms of Existence.","In one Omniverse, he faced the dredges of an ancient Outerversal Morphon who had spread out his influence over dozens of Omniverses.","In another, he was exposed to the terrifying Worms of Existence stemming from the Megalos Nihilos!","Every time he massacred them, the Wheel in his existence turned ever faster.","He could almost feel the forging of his Fabled Omniverse get closer and closer.","In this Dream, over these hundreds of years that passed, he never looked for Omniverse X-999.","This was because of a critical piece of information he had received early on.","On a certain day hundreds of years ago, his Brother on the Omniversal Stage had told him something.","|The Omniverses our Commonwealth has discovered? Hmm, the most recent one is Omniverse X-577. Why?|","...!","Yes.","Within this Dream, it was unknown exactly how many years ago it was before Omniverse X-999 was ever discovered.","In addition to this, another terrifying piece of information was uncovered during another discussion with the Brother of Protector Alexei.","He had just returned from a campaign, and his expression was a cold one.","Seeing the gaze of the golden-furred Protector Alexei, the Brother had sighed and spoken.","|As you get stronger, it will not just be Outerversal Morphons you will have to fight off. Eventually, our own people will fall under your scrutiny.|","...!","|Today, I tracked down Protector Voidsurge who had recently made tremendous advancements in a short period of time. He wouldn't let me Scour the Weavings of his Existence as ultimately, he exploded out with Outerversal Authority...and the illusion of a massive, tenebrous, tentacled Wheel. It was not the Wheel of Existence we all follow, but the Wheel of Enticement! The Great Wheel! The Wheel of the Distorter!|","...!","A terrifying hidden issue was revealed within the bounds of the Commonwealth with those who sought the glory of the Wheel of Existence.","Some were led astray as when they sought the Wheel, they found something else entirely.","This...was something to be mindful of.","Life continued.","Until, on a certain day, Protector Alexei led an incursion against a Half-Tainted Omniverse that had a new player who had never appeared before.","An Outerversal Morphon that looked like a massive snail.","When Protector Alexei and this Morphon came face to face, terrifying weavings of existence flourished as a great battle ensued- and in this battle, his Fabled Omniverse actually began to form as he condensed all of his existence into a fine point!","But before the transformation could be completed.","In the middle of battle.","Protector Alexei began to feel a heavy pull of sleep.","And darkness overcame him entirely.","|...|","And he continued to Dream!","—","PAH!","His consciousness arose once more.","He found himself staring at endless obsidian radiance all around, with his surroundings filled with auras of terrifying creatures","Another dream.","In this dream...Ozymandias was something else entirely.","|O Great Deceiver, are you sure of this? The Instrument has garnered a great deal of power. Multiple Great Ones stand to support him...with the Great Mother being the one who is the most fanatical.|","...!","Near him, an entity that looked like a star formed from Tentacles spoke towards a terrifying Outerversal Morphon that had the head of a bull and the body of a human.","A Great One. The Great Deceiver!","At the intent shown his way, this entity harrumphed as he replied.","|The Great Beyonder has far exceeded all of us as his means are unfathomable. He left this astonishing Legacy not just for the Instrument. Attaining it...will also aid us in our Incursion across the Expanse. We need more to become One With Megalos. More to Transcend their old shells and become something else. So yes...I am sure!|","...!","The area they were in was hazy.","But he stood behind this terrifying Great One as he looked at himself at this moment.","An Outerversal Morphon who also held the head of a bull and the body of a Human.","Someone known as Outerversal Morphon Lexo!","An attendant of this Great Deceiver.","He held terrifying waves of Megalos Regnum, and the connection he had under him...spanned hundreds of millions.","'Fantastic...'","His thoughts were vibrant as he prepared for a long dream.","In front of him, the Great Deceiver turned his will unto him as he spoke out.","|Lexo, contact the Great Ponderor and-....huh?|","The Great One stopped in the midst of his words.","His crimson eyes blinked before a second later, they burned with flames as pillars of crimson stellar light actually erupted from them- these pillars scorching everything on their path as they went to ground Morphon Lexo into nothingness!","|Fucking hell! A Dreamer! A Dreamer actually stood beside me this whole time? Who? WHO?!|","The shouts were filled with rage and waves of wrath, the third Dream being stopped extremely short as this time, the pull of a deep slumber was not felt.","Ozymandias opened his eyes once more, but he found himself in an infinitely vast stellar obsidian space.","And in front of him...three blinding singularities could be seen.","|Due to the erasure of your Existence, the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos has been brought to an end.|","|Your proficiency in the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos currently stands in the First Echelon, with your Proficiency at 66%.|","|Based on this, the weavings of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos you can obtain are extremely limited.|","|All memories of the Dreams are retained.|","|The Weavings of a single Dream can be retrieved fully, and half the weavings of another Dream can be retrieved.|","|The Three Dreams of the Megalos capable of being chosen are as follows|","[The Worm of the Deep- Outerversal Physiology Echelon V, Megalos Regnum Echelon IV. 155,000,000 Pure Delegatus Channels. Half of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability.]","[Protector Alexei- System of Existence of Kuklos Echelon 4. Musings of the formation of a Fabled Omniverse.]","[Outerversal Morphon Lexo- Outerversal Physiology Echelon V, Megalos Regnum Echelon V. 277,000,000 Pure Delegatus Channels.]","...!"]},{"number":3280,"title":"Chapter 3280: Chapter 3279 The Wheel Turns! I","paragraphs":["The first Amarantos Dream of the Megalos had ended, and due to the low proficiency of this Dream, many things were limited for Ozymandias!","In that endless dream, he could be anything within the Megalos Ynnere and Megalos Beyond.","He could start at a grand position, and live for a varied number of years depending on the proficiency of this Transcendent Megalos Ability.","After some hundreds of years passed, a certain Dream he had would forcefully come to an end before he was ushered into another, and if he died...then the entire Amarantos Dream of the Megalos would end.","And he faced further limitations with what he could bring back as at this time, he was at a crossroads.","A choice had to be made, but it wasn't an entirely hard one.","Quickly, the thoughts of Ozymandias went through as he looked at the three blinking singularities in front of him.","[The full weavings of the The Worm of the Deep have been retrieved]","[From the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the following weavings will be granted: Outerversal Physiology Echelon V, Megalos Regnum Echelon IV. 155,000,000 Pure Delegatus Channels. Half of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability.] [Half of the weavings of Protector Alexei have been retrieved.]","[From the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the following weaving will be granted: System of Existence of Kuklos Echelon 4.]","[The Dream of Outerversal Morphon Lexo has been forever lost.] ...!","The choice was made!","He was only in the Third Echelon for both Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum since his age was truly too pitifully low as an Outerversal Morphon, and yet...","HUUM!","In that unique space, his eyes opened wide as he awoke from a dream.","The complexity of his weavings burned as he felt like he had truly lived all those thousands of years.","The memories of the golden furred simian and the secrets of the Protectors floated in his mind.","The memories of the Pantheon of Gama and the Worm of the Deep flowed across his mind freely!","And in addition to all of this, the radiant rune of AMARANTOS in his existence began to spin and pulse as it released a cluster of weavings of existence.","Weavings of Outerversal Physiology Echelon V and Megalos Regnum Echelon IV!","Weavings of 155,000,000 Pure Delegatus Channels- and even Half of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability!","All of it was topped off with his Fourth Mundi of Power in the Atlas of Existence connected to him and another part of him in the Megalos Ynnere beginning to buzz with radiance.","It had detected the weavings of another sufficiently different System of Existence!","Thus, the complex boons of the System of Existence of Kuklos flowed through.","WU! WU!","The massive rune within him spun terrifically as it let everything out, and at the end of it all...it became entirely still and dimmed.","Around it, swirling waves of golden obsidian sandy light flowed from the Dream Aletheian Haven, but it didn't react in any way as if it needed time.","Another Amarantos Dream of the Megalos would not be available to undertake right away or too soon, Ozymandias forced to wait for an indeterminate amount of time!","And so he would wait.","But as he did so...his Physiology began to churn, and the aura around him became extremely potent and concentrated.","He was...taking all the gains that would elevate him towards the Fifth Echelons of Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum!","At the same time, near the dim rune of AMARANTOS, another rune began to form.","Deeply obsidian.","Crystalline in nature as if it could never be broken.","It read...DEFY!","The Transcendent Megalos Ability, Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos.","But it seemed that it was only half completed.","Yet even this, Ozymandias would take!","—","A span of an instant had passed, and the Instrument woke up from his dream.","'What did he gain?'","The Great Wheel had its trillions of tentacles pulse as it thought with a smile.","The Great Wheel.","The one that was termed the Great Deceiver by the Commonwealth in one of the dreams of Ozymandias!","The one that instead of the Wheel of Existence itself, Protectors and powerful figures seeking the Wheel found themselves deceived and bound to him.","He watched with interested eyes as the aura of Ozymandias began to rise maddeningly at this moment.","Above his body, the faint outline of millions of thin golden lines appeared, all of them shooting out and extending in different directions!","|Ah!|","Intents of shock began to echo out in the surroundings.","|A single Dream that passed in an instant! And yet...he gained tens of millions of pure channels of Delegatus!|","...!","How hard did one have to work to gain Delegatus?","A grueling search and fishing day to day for either the Megalos Beyond or Megalos Ynnere, with very few ever capable of extending their reach to the Megalos Nihilos as they simply held no compatibility.","But an Entity who had the Transcendent Megalos Ability of Amarantos Dream of the Megalos? He dreamt once and attained such shocking results!","This was why the abilities of the Great Beyonder were simply too insane.","Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was termed to be one of the top most Transcendent Megalos Abilities purely with how tremendous the gains could be made from it were.","|His Physiology...his Majesty...it is crossing the echelons seamlessly!|","The voice of Aspasia rang out as her eyes shifted around while portraying as much reverence as possible, keeping her promise to the Great Mother of elevating the aura and standing of the Instrument as much as possible.","He had to have as many supporters as possible!","|A single dream of his brought this...would he dream of becoming a Great One in a single Dream and attain such a state right after? This...!|","An unknown voice echoed out.","But the moment it did...","|The Signs!|","Another came down.","|The Signs!|","Another voice chimed in!","The words that the Great Beyonder left behind were filled with mysteries and many did not fully understand them since they were uttered cycles ago.","But there was one sentence that, at this moment, seemed to make things very clear.","|Born in one instant, a Great One in another instant.|","...!"]},{"number":3281,"title":"Chapter 3281: Chapter 3280 The Wheel Turns! II","paragraphs":["As if the words of the Great Beyonder that rang out across the Megalos Beyond all those cycles ago were reverberating right in their ears.","|Ah...|","The sentence represented how fast it would take the Instrument to become a Great One.","It seemed that by their standards...it would be akin to the blink of an eye.","Many of them had lived for multiple cycles.","Countless years.","To them, a single year was extremely short.","Some slept for thousands of years in deep slumber.","So now, they fantasized just how quickly the Instrument would take to jump onto the distinction of a Great One.","The eyes of the followers of the Great Beyonder twinkled with unquenchable fervor.","While in the distance, the eyes of the Heretical Morphons became even more stern.","Within the same Megalos Pantheon of Umbra.","|Hmph, he succeeded and became even stronger. I can't continue watching this shit, lead me to this newly discovered Omniverse. X-999, is it?|","The interminable body of Savitar spoke towards the shrouded figure of Nietzsche, the Great Ponderor.","|Mmm...|","This being nodded with a thoughtful expression as a brilliant obsidian light flowed from him and towards Savitar- a unique set of coordinates being given within the Megalos Ynnere relative where many of Savitar's bodies were in Tainted Omniverses!","With a flicker of weavings, everything was set as, at this moment; Omniverse X-999 became a target of a Great One.","His purpose this time wasn't to even form a Dark Matter Core, but to simply recoup his losses as his purpose...was slaughter!","—","The Wheel of Existence moved and turned as it wished.","Some could seek it.","Some may not even know of it.","But ultimately, too many weavings were bound by it!","After countless turns. After an unknown number of cycles.","At this moment...","The wheel turned once more.","HUUUM!","Silently.","In a manner that truly very few would even be capable of perceiving and understanding.","But the Wheel turned regardless.","As if ushering in another chapter!","Within the Megalos Beyond.","The stretches of obsidian radiance were simply too vast.","The ends were not discovered even now as even for the truly powerful that had Transcended their Existence- some did not know!","In a corner of the Megalos Beyond that was filled with absolutely nothing...","BOOM!","A singularity bloomed.","An interminably potent singularity that was filled with terrifying concentrations of the Megalos Beyond bloomed.","It was the birth of a Morphon!","And yet this birth...","HUUM!","Caused the surroundings of the Megalos Beyond to shudder as naturally a storm began to form.","The singularity released a heavy pulse of weavings as instantly, all surrounding weavings became more potent.","Richer.","So rich that by the time the massive singularity attained any indiscernible form, the surroundings had become extremely chaotic and rich as...droplets of pure weavings of the Megalos Beyond began to form!","Dew drops.","Rain.","When the rain drops fell on this being, he naturally absorbed all of them into his body as behind him, massive obsidian wings unfurled with glory.","His form...was still not so easily apparent.","But from these wings...a dense number of golden strings appeared.","So dense that they numbered millions, these lines instantly shooting out horizontally towards the Megalos Beyond, downwards towards the Megalos Ynnere, and...","...!","Millions of golden lines shot up.","They shot up unfathomably vast distances as they seemed to be seeking...the Megalos Nihilos.","|OOUUUUU!|","A fearsome cry filled with endless loathing and pain echoed from this entity.","His golden strings became reinforced with all of this loathing, and the moment they found something to bind within the Megalos Beyond- they forcefully bound it!","In a nearby Megalos Pantheon.","A large obsidian deluge of a river snaked across a massive mountain, hundreds of small squid-like Outerversal Morphon swimming within it as they conversed with each other.","|Have you heard? The appearance of the Sign! The Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of!|","...!","|Of course! They say countless connections were formed just when he was born! That for the first time, rain appeared in the megalos Beyond. Rain!|","The squid like Morphons extended their tentacles and talked to each other as...","BOOM!","The space above them split as golden lines rained down.","And no matter if they were on the First Echelon, or Third, or Fourth of Outerversal Physiology- their existence was instantly dazed and then bound as they became the Delegatus of something else entirely.","...!","Far from the Megalos Beyond.","Within the Megalos Ynnere.","Omniverse X-999.","Inside of a space filled with an endless golden sea, a golden haired man in white robes stared out with a determined gaze.","Behind him, his people underwent complex changes of Existence as...they couldn't even discern his figure.","Even if he were to be standing in front of them, they wouldn't be able to see him.","This...was a unique standing and power he held due to an unfathomable connection with his Omniverse.","As the Omniversal Ankyra!","Imperium stared at the endless sea as at this moment...","BOOOM!","His surroundings were instantly eclipsed by terrifying waves of Omniversal Authority- ones with such purity and potency that it seemed like all possible Omniversal Authorities were converging around him.","The weavings of existence in the surroundings instantly exploded with terrifying concentration and potency.","Auras of pure weavings of existence began to form, these auroras quickly forming into miniature rivers before they expanded to form into a multicolored sea!","At the center of all this, Imperium felt his existence stretched out as he began to meld with Existence.","As he became One With Existence!","At the same time, his existence was being compressed and refined into increasingly small particles before they exploded with even more mass and energy- a shocking transformation taking place as by the time it was done, an entirely different class of entity would take the stage.","Far from this location.","Across weavings of Existence and Anti-Existence.","Within the Megalos Nihilos.","In a space of endless white space.","So endlessly white that it would burn one's very existence.","In such a place, a wriggling, wormlike singularity bloomed."]},{"number":3282,"title":"Chapter 3282: Chapter 3281 The Wheel Turns! III","paragraphs":["In an area of endless white!","Within the Megalos Nihilos, a wriggling, worm-like singularity bloomed as with it came a shocking intent.","|Haha...success! Just as they bloomed from a singularity in our space, I should have bloomed akin to a singularity in theirs...but where is this?|","The intent was curious as it wanted to look around.","Before it did anything though...","HUUM!","Its surroundings turned tumultuous as this worm-like entity was shocked.","|Rejection?!|","The voice was filled with maddened fervor as it had had too much to get here.","Too many of its subjugated pieces had fallen to the Worms of Existence for it to gain this chance!","For him to be wiped out just as he arrived?","No way.","His weavings tried to wake and come to fruition to resist, but...","|Huh?|","His existence felt a shocking elevation begin to take place as it wasn't a rejection as he expected.","Weavings of authority he never even imagined existed began to flow into him unceasingly!","In this blank white space, potent white rivers and white seas began to form as their heavy concentrations sank into his figure- its wormy visage getting bigger and bigger as amidst the storm, it even felt like it was being stretched out and melding with this surrounding space.","And all of this seemed just like the beginning as he could feel it.","The complexity of his existence.","The weavings.","They were exponentially being raised in a process he didn't understand or expect since his arrival.","He.","The Great Usurper.","Noah Eckert.","A part of him bloomed in the Megalos Nihilos, and he seemed to have triggered or been swept into a shocking process as his Existence began to soar to new heights!","—","Within the Megalos Ynnere.","Omniverse X-999.","In the Wheel of Weavings that was enacted by the Commonwealth- the place that held the Gladiators Arena where champions who would become Protectors were sought!","Three Royal Simians with terrifying waves of power as Apogee Autarchs smiled towards 18 figures that stood before them in a large hall shining with gold and white brilliance.","|Some of you are victors, some of you lost. But undoubtedly, your power showed itself to be sufficient enough to become Protectors of the Commonwealth- so rejoice!|","The matches of the Gladiators Arena had ended as the Viceroy and the shocking delegation of entities he was with had long since left.","Not before his image was portrayed over for all eyes watching as he let it be known who everyone should look up to and thank.","Among the 18, the figures of the Eonic Uterra, Sona, Henry, and the Imperium Autarch could be seen as they actually took four spots among the 18!","Among these 18 Entities, most were Apogee Autarchs, with the rest being Accumulation Autarchs.","|Soon enough, all of you will be transferred to the Omniverse of the Protectors to receive your full position after undergoing verification. Protector Osmont went first, but the rest of you will follo-|","|Hush for a moment.|","...!","A voice interrupted the Royal Existential Omniversal Simian Protector as shock and incredulity arose in the face of others, even the Eonic Uterra turning towards the Imperium Autarch with widened eyes that wondered what he was doing! He actually interrupted an Apogee Protector that gave them all a heavy sense of danger and was, of course, part of the Commonwealth that they all had to bid their time and work under.","The Protector of the Commonwealth who faced such disrespect changed his gaze right away as it became stern.","The two beside him were the same as they all looked towards Imperium with coldness!","|What did you say?|","...!","They were giving him a chance.","For him to think and say it was a lapse in judgment.","For him to bow his knees and get things back on track.","And yet...","Imperium seemed lost in thought as this body of his emanated silent but unique waves of power.","Without even looking at the Protectors, he repeated himself.","|I was telling you all to be quiet for a second. The buzzing of your annoying voices does not need to hold the same arrogance as it did before.|","...!","BOOM!","The words held no hint of respect or decor as the bodies of the three Apogee Autarchs turned unsightly while they exploded with terrifying waves of power.","And yet.","PA!","Imperium tapped out three times.","And an instant later, the blazing auras of the three Autarchs were instantly recalled as if they never existed.","...!","Their eyes trembled as shockingly, the heavy weavings of over nine Autarchical Omniversal Authorities wrapped around them.","Not their influence. Not their weavings. But it felt the very grasp of existence itself that these Omniversal Authorities held wrapped around their Sources of Existence and forcefully bound them down!","Imperium began to walk towards them as his eyes were hazy, but an undeniable aura began to leak from him.","|This Omniverse was never yours to discover or play around with. I will now be taking it back.|","...!","Those behind him were utterly shocked as Henry and Sona watched with sharp eyes, while the 14 Entities who had participated in the matches within the Arena and had been members of the Commonwealth this whole time...","BOOM!","They looked at each other before they made moves towards Imperium!","And yet the moment they did so, their bodies instantly came to a halt as it felt like every inch of their power had dried up.","Imperium didn't even look back at them as it felt like all surrounding weavings of existence were under his control.","He arrived before the three Simian Protectors who looked at him incredulously, not at all believing what was happening right now as in the next moment, Imperium used a finger to tap on their furred foreheads.","And their eyes instantly dimmed and became dazed as foreign weavings of existence perused into them- their power not being able to stop it whatsoever.","|You will tell your forces that everything is proceeding as normal.|","...! As he spoke, golden tendrils of light began to leak as within them, the Autarchical Omniversal Authority of Jugum flowed.","These golden tendrils forcefully opened the mouths of the Three Simian Protectors as Imperium didn't move to kill, only to control.","And Jugum...it was a heavy authority that meant dominance. Subjugation. The capitulation of existence entirely!","Imperium radiated such a profound level of power and majesty as while he did this, nothing was found out by anyone else outside this room!"]},{"number":3283,"title":"Chapter 3283: Chapter 3282 The Wheel Turns! IV","paragraphs":["Within moments, droves of golden rivers had flowed into the Apogee Autarchs as moments later, their eyes remained light as they instantly sank to their knees.","|We pay respects to the Great Imperium.|","WAA!","Apogee Autarchs.","Protectors of the Commonwealth!","They kneeled down towards a native of Omniverse X-999 as the ones in this hall watching were filled with shock and horror!","Imperium only paused briefly before he turned around and released 14 more tendrils of golden light that rapidly shot towards the other 14 champions, the only ones left untouched being the Eonic Uterra, Sona, and Henry.","They gazed towards him with caution and alarm as he voiced out.","|You all belong to this Omniverse as I will spare you from domination. But in the coming future, you will have to fight for your home. I will bring all forces of the Commonwealth here under my control, and after that, we will-...!|","The gaze of Imperium flickered from calmness to sternness very quickly.","He gazed out into the far distance as if he could see something nobody else could.","|It seems blessings and catastrophes come hand in hand...|","He spoke cryptically as he felt something approach the bounds of this Omniverse.","A power he had captured glimpses of in the arena when Osmont unveiled the Agent of Anti-Life!","The heavy aura of an Outerversal Morphon was coming towards the Omniverse!","Across the swathes of endless void governed by unbreakable Omniversal Authorities, Omniverse X-999 had bounds where its vast domain ended.","Near the ends of such a vast domain, a terrifying Skull with thousands of limbs behind it neared.","Purple flames burned in its sockets as it stared at the pristine Omniverse below with a devilish gaze.","|Hmph, I've taken a big loss recently, so let this be my gain. Slaughter is much easier than other methods as today, I shall reap some souls for myself...|","...!","The One Who Walks...had made his way over to Omniverse X-999 after following the weavings given by the Great Ponderor.","He didn't know that veiled and a distance away from here, a terrifying entity with an opened Eye of Existence observed everything closely- this being the Great Ponderor himself!","He had been observing Omniverse X-999 this whole time to learn about his enemy- Protector Osmont.","To learn everything about him and reveal which of the Great Ones he was or which one he was connected to.","But...he just came across a shocking conference of Existential authority in his observations, and much of his gaze was then restricted from there as he wasn't able to see everything even with the Eye of Existence!","What was this?","Just what was this odd Omniverse, and what more could be found from it?","Nietzsche observed calmly while veiled as voraciously, Savitar sank down to ravage and plunder.","—","Many of Noah's Ascendant Existential Extremity Clones remained in the Infinite Omniverse within Omniverse X-999.","As his power rose, the weavings he could uncover increased more and more, and what he could see extended out exponentially.","What the Infinite Omniverse itself could see expanded tremendously!","As another part of him devoured and assimilated Hearthraes in the Higher Weavings of Existence, he fully attained the state of One With Existence as he was currently sensing the elevated form of power one could gain with it.","But not too far back...","|An unfathomable change has occurred within the Omniverse around us.|","Both he and the Infinite Omniverse sensed it.","The Omniversal Authorities went wild.","They became firmer and filled with even grander waves of power as when Noah, The Weaver, placed his gaze out there...","\"The Imperium Autarch?\"","He tracked down the source to a single man as he then viewed his actions through the eyes of Henry and Sona.","But not even a minute after this, his gaze shot up across layers of weavings of Existence as it flickered with brilliance and surprise- sensing the vile aura of someone he just helped in destroying one of the bodies of not too long ago!","It was Savitar!","\"Interesting...\"","A smile crossed Noah's lips.","He had made too many gains and, even at this moment, was continuing to make gains.","His Infinite Omniverse was the same as he simply needed time to digest all of them and then observe his new level of power.","At this moment, he couldn't be grouped as an Autarchical Existence any longer at the Existential Dominium Realm.","But he also didn't fit in the Omniversal Stage as he didn't forge a Fabled Omniverse!","But his power...","As someone who had Transcended their existence, and now as his counterpart Ozymandias attained even grander waves of power as well as two Transcendent Megalos Abilities...","It was going to be even harder to quantify him.","This was because at this very moment, he was already doing something utterly balanced breaking.","Ozymandias was a part of him that he shared an unbreakable connection with, but he was himself within the Megalos Beyond.","His body in the Megalos Ynnere was also himself as at this moment, within the sea of existence inside his body seated on the multicolored throne...he was pulling upon countless tendrils of Outerversal Authority and the particles of Dark Matter still flowing from the connection with Ozymandias.","The heavy flow of the stellar obsidian radiance still flowing from the Megalos Beyond and into the Infinite Omniverse through Ozymandias.","He pulled upon all of it as in the sea of his complex existence...the rune of AMARANTOS was nearly formed completely.","Yes.","The Transcendent Megalos Ability that the Great Beyonder sculpted in the Megalos Beyond would also appear in the Megalos Ynnere!","With his existence split in half but connected in an unfathomable way across two Megalos, Noah actually brought forth this shocking boon.","His existence inherited this Ability as Ozymandias, and passing this Inheritance to another part of his existence was seamless!","So even as the terrifying aura of a Great One approached Omniverse X-999, he wasn't too worried.","First, there was the change of Imperium to observe and understand- with this being the first barrier for the coming Outerversal Morphon.","And then, there was himself. HUUM!","The radiant rune of AMARANTOS finished forming.","After this, the rune of DEFY would soon start thereafter.","But first...seas of golden obsidian radiance from the Dream Aletheian Haven rolled and surged into the newly formed rune of AMARANTOS, ecstatic brilliance unfolding as in the next moment...Noah let out a devilish smile.","\"Dream.\"","...!"]},{"number":3284,"title":"Chapter 3284: Chapter 3283 The Wheel Turns! V","paragraphs":["Something that had only ever appeared in the Megalos Beyond.","Something that the Great Beyonder put in place for the Outerversal Morphons to overcome the complexity of their existence to reach higher and higher stages!","At this moment, it truly landed in the hands of someone from another place entirely.","At this time, Noah's visage of the throne closed his eyes as he fell into a long dream.","—","As if he had been asleep for far too long.","When he woke up, he found himself in the middle of a bloody battlefield.","Around him, all kinds of sounds blared as rivers of crimson gold blood flowed freely on the shattered domain of existence he was on.","Far above, stellar auroras of multicolored light converged as battles were still erupting out, his eyes that belonged to a Paracosm Stage Entity observing Protectors of the Commonwealth facing off against horrific Worms filled with obsidian radiance.","As they fought, they radiated chants that seemed to give them power- illusory wheels appearing around them with terrifying brilliance as they stopped the advancement of the Worms of Existence!","|The purity of existence is what keeps the Wheel turning! O natives of Omniverse X-1038, make sure your existence is pure and seeking a single thing!|","...!","Omniverse X-1038.","A number exceeding X-999.","This Dream...was shockingly a dream of a time that had not even come yet.","It was terrific to come across as Noah felt his body that held a mess of a Conceptual System of Existence filled with a myriad of concepts.","Death. Regality. Destruction. Water. Chaos...","There were many concepts making up this body of a Paracosm soldier.","But after hearing the words of the Protectors above, he wanted to see this conjecture of purity he had heard before that kept the wheel turning.","So he looked at the mess of concepts inside of him...and destroyed them all entirely as from their remnants...","'Quintessence.'","WAA!","His soul remembered Quintessence clearly.","He had lived it. He had forged it.","Like a lost seed, it quickly began to bloom as in the future, he would only focus on Quintessence for all his weavings of existence.","The Purity of existence kept the Wheel turning.","He would put this to a test as within Omniverse X-1038, life moved on.","A year passed, and the Paracosm body he occupied became an Autarch. He was adorned with the distinction of the Quintessential Autarch!","The Protectors of the Commonwealth guarded this Omniverse as he found that at a certain point in the past, changes had occurred that allowed Omniverses to be discovered rapidly by the Commonwealth as their reach only became stronger.","They pushed back the Worms of Existence within this Omniverse, but they seemed unkillable as they always came back and ravaged this Omniverse and many more.","Their numbers propagated much more rapidly than before, and their power was even grander!","The Omniverse he was in turned into one of constant wars and death as in such a state, hundreds of years began to pass.","The distinction of an Apogee Autarch was attained rather quickly as in these hundreds of years, Quintessence was solely focused on to the extent that its complexity...even became capable of affecting the Worms of Existence that tore apart this Omniverse!","In all these years, he was finally able to join the ranks of Protectors as the first thing he sought to do was to track down Omniverse X-999. Would it have himself? Or did he not exist in this Dream entirely? The day he became a Protector, he expressed curiosity towards the older Protectors of the Commonwealth stationed here about expanding his knowledge and visiting other Omniverses, expressing curiosity about X-999 especially!","The Simian Protector looked at him with a sharp gaze at such words before he replied.","|Omniverse X-999...is an anomaly that is still unsolved by the Commonwealth. It has disappeared within the Megalos Ynnere as even now, it is nowhere to be found.|","...!","Shocking words.","Ones that acted akin to a trigger as at this point, the Quintessential Protector felt his mind become hazy.","He almost felt like he was slumbering, and yet at the same time he was awake...but somewhere else.","His gaze became divided.","This dream still continued, but he felt a part of himself opening his eyes within another Dream entirely.","A dream still continued, but answer one started!","This was...was in the Megalos Beyond.","A star shaped Outerversal Morphon opened its single eye as around him, the auras of terrifying Morphons pulsed heavily.","Among them, multiple intents echoed out.","|Is it true? That the Great Beyonder has constructed an unbeatable Crucible on our Pantheon?|","...!","The words instantly caused Noah's single eye to shine brilliantly as he awoke fully.","Another Dream.","And in this Dream, it seemed to be countless cycles ago...before the Great Beyonder had disappeared!","Memories flooded into his mind.","He was Outerversal Morphon Starbright, a native of the Megalos Pantheon of Xerxes.","The groups of Outerversal Morphons he was with were entities who frequently moved with him within this Pantheon, and they were currently in the Undersun Sanctuary that was akin to a citadel ten times the size of an Existential Domain.","Massive obsidian structures and statues filled this place as currently, it was abuzz with the news and weavings of the strongest Outerversal Morphon.","The unfathomable Great Beyonder!","|The Crucible...apparently our Pantheon is not the first. In the Pantheon of Umbra, the Crucible of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was built- nobody knows anything about it as any who have tried it have failed.|","|Oh? And the Crucible here?|","The voices and intents rose with deep power and curiosity as a single answer came.","|The Crucible of the Sword of Megalos...|","...!","Noah's weavings buzzed as he came across the mention of a third Crucible.","All of it was mixed with unknown mysteries as the being responsible for it all...was present in his current Dream!","Who...was the Great Beyonder?","A dreamer questioned as he delved fully into another unfathomable Dream. —","Present time, outside of the Dream a certain Emperor traversed in.","Within the Megalos Beyond, in a Megalos Pantheon.","Within a large obsidian deluge of a river that snaked across a massive mountain, hundreds of small squid like Outerversal Morphon trembled as they gazed up to look at an amalgamation of black flames above them.","They trembled not just because of the power he radiated, but also because this was the being who had forcefully bound them as Delegatus not too long ago!"]},{"number":3285,"title":"Chapter 3285: Chapter 3284 The Wheel Turns! VI","paragraphs":["He had bound them not long ago.","And now, he appeared above them in a terrifying manner.","They couldn't entirely make out his form apart from long spanning obsidian wings that seemed to be melding into the Megalos Beyond itself, and when he stopped above them...they shockingly observed dew drops to begin gathering in the surroundings before moments later, rain began to fall.","Rain!","Seeing this, they were utterly stupefied.","Rain?","Was this not the Sign of the Instrument that the Great Beyonder spoke of? Something occurring all the way in the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra?","What...was this in front of them?","In the next moment, a deep intent that seemed that of a child and an adult rang out at the same time.","|You all were saying there is a Sign? An Instrument that someone spoke of?|","...!","The voice caused them to shudder.","Down to the very depths of their existence, they felt like the intent of this voice alone could do far too many things as they were stupefied.","Seeing their stunned state, this being clouded by stellar obsidian mist instantly flickered out with a few hundred black tentacles for all small morphons here.","|Let me see your memories.|","WUU!","A calm swirling of Outerversal Authority.","And within moments, the squid like Morphons were dazed while all parts of their existence were ready, the tentacles that bound them getting tighter as the one responsible radiated a shocking intent!","|Connections at birth? Rain? The Instrument of the Great Beyonder...is that not me?|","The voice seemed amused and curious at the same time.","Filled with curiosity...and yet immense waves of loathing at the same time.","But the loathing was very subtle.","As if it could barely be felt, akin to being pushed extremely far down the depths of its existence!","|Outerversal Morphon Ozymandias...quite the Pretender, aren't you?|","...!","Someone was out there pretending to be him.","Pretending to be in a position of power and standing that he did not deserve.","No matter.","He was just born.","He needed to find himself.","His purpose.","Was it truly as the memories of these Morphons stated?","Something already deemed and set in stone by the Great Beyonder?","|The Great Beyonder...who are you to dictate what comes and what will be?|","The question was filled with interminable curiosity.","And this...was the first direction that this newly born entity followed. It wanted to understand more of the Great Beyonder as it turned towards the depths of this Pantheon it had appeared in.","It would learn. It would grow. And in the future, it will meet this Ozymandias.","But before them...","BOOM!","Above its body, millions of golden lines gushed out again and spread out across the Megalos to bind onto more Delegatus.","Whether they wanted to or not!","—","In the Megalos Nihilos.","In a region filled with white blackness, a few hundred massive worms with crystalline black scales and sharp white wings crossed through space rapidly.","Hundreds of jagged teeth could be seen clattering on mouths placed on different areas of their bodies, no eyes present on these Entities.","Yet their intent and weavings were filled with Anti-Matter!","|The signal is close. Get into the Genesis Formation and prepare for battle if need be.|","|Yes.|","|Affirmative.|","Voices rose and fell after the first one as the massive bodies of worms radiated complex weavings that would make Foundation Autarchs tremble.","They weaved across the white space as thin black lines emerged from each of them and connected to each other, their positions constantly shifting and moving as within moments...","BOOM!","Their bodies faded away as a titanic illusory form of a Nine Horned Winged Worm of Existence emerged.","A rare entity lost countless cycles ago and only mentioned by Great entities within the Megalos Nihilos.","Its form emerged as hundreds of Worms of Existence formed a unique formation, the aura it radiated instantly shooting past Foundation, Accumulation, and Apogee Autarchical levels of power as it very quickly settled at the Omniversal Stage!","Its speed also blazed as it tore across space to cautiously appear where they all felt the signal.","And there, a distance away, they could see roaring waves of auroras and seas of Anti-Matter.","Deeply white with a tinge of gray, and at the center of it all...a black and white worm with feathery wings stretched out gloriously.","Nine blazing eyes that shone like singularities currently opened and closed as if they were acclimating and looking around curiously, these eyes locking onto the newly arriving formation of the Nine Horned Winged Worm of Existence as the moment they did so...","BZZT!","The massive formation shuddered as the worms within were shocked by the aura of regality and domination radiated from the eyes of this being.","It caused their very weavings to feel subservient- as if it stemmed from the very depths of their existence!","A single glance from it caused the Nine Horned Winged Worm of Existence to bow its head as its intent echoed out.","|We see the brilliance of the Great Worm and bow our existences.|","...!","Their intent echoed out with clarity.","Opposite them, the feathery Winged worm with nine eyes blinked as it sought to understand already complex weavings of existence flooding into it, and seeing this new reality, Eckert could not help but utter out silently.","'What the fuck is going on, huh?'","Too many changes were occurring all at once.","But seeing the subservient cluster of Worms of Existence in the distance...","HUUM!","Strands of white tendrils of light erupted from his new body as they were filled with potent waves of Anti-Matter.","They went to latch towards the faint Worms that made up the massive formation as, at the very least, he would subjugate them as he further understood where he was currently at and what these complex weavings of existence he received truly meant!","Subtle changes bloomed.","Not just within Megalos Beyond, but within Megalos Ynnere and Megalos Nihilos as well.","The Wheel had taken a turn, whether many entities knew it or not.","As for what all the changes would bring? Nobody could say for sure!","But at this moment, there was a single man that was dreaming.","Dreaming of the Megalos Beyond, and Dreaming of the Megalos Ynnere!"]},{"number":3286,"title":"Chapter 3286: Chapter 3285 Odd I","paragraphs":["The Dreams were unique.","The Dreams were long.","The proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was low as Noah knew it wouldn't allow him to spend too many years within a Dream.","Going by the Dreams of Ozymandias, a range of 2,000 to 3,000 years was the maximum currently, and he had to ensure that he didn't expose himself to any Great Ones or entities of similar power as they would know he was a Dreamer.","An oddity that, similar to the last Dream of Ozymandias, he would be killed and the Dream would come to an end!","So even though he appeared at a time when the Great Beyonder was active, he only collected information about this entity while preparing to obtain the biggest possible gain from this Dream.","The Transcendent Megalos Ability, the Sword of the Megalos!","He didn't have his Infinite Mana, his Infinite Omniverse, or his Atlas of Existence, but he could still bring a semblance of what made him outstanding into these dreams.","He could take his power to be a level above others as gradually, the weavings of these Dreams became clear.","He felt like he was walking across past records if the Dream was in the past, and if the dream was of the future, he felt like he was walking across a possible future.","A fragment of the weavings of Existence.","Because in the Dream of the Megalos Ynnere where he had risen to be a Protector of the Commonwealth while he relied on Quintessence alone, over two thousand years passed as he elevated himself in power and battled Outerversal Morphons and Worms of Existence who seemed to be invading with even greater fervor.","2,000 years into the future.","This was what entirely convinced him that this Dream was a jump into a possible weavings of Existence- a mere fragment that didn't take into account many things.","Because how long had he been active since the blue planet faced an apocalypse? A mere few years!","And look at the level of power he had reached.","Would 2,000 years truly pass thereafter where nothing about himself could be heard? Where those of the Megalos Beyond, Megalos Ynnere, and Megalos Nihilos still fought as the Three Body Problem continued to remain unsolved?","In all these years, he heard nothing of the weavings of Noah Osmont as he treated this Dream as a mere fragment of existence to further increase his strength and obtain as much information as he could for what possibilities there were.","3,000 years passed within the Dream.","And on that mark...the terrific voice of the Viceroy of the Commonwealth echoed out across the bases of the Protectors.","|For too long, we have remained passive in defending against our enemies. We shall remain passive no longer. On this day, we have managed to create stable channels that cross from our lands into theirs as we shall bring this war to them!|","...!","A grandiose declaration.","And within days, the forces of the Commonwealth were gathered within recovered Tainted Omniverses that swirled with heavy weavings of Dark Matter Cores.","In front of these Cores, rivers of Dark Matter were being siphoned off as a massive obsidian gateway was formed, with the group of Protectors that Noah belonged to contributing to the campaign against the Outerversal Morphons!","|Fantastic, aren't they?|","Beside him, an Omniversal Protector of the Commonwealth standing shoulder to shoulder with him spoke while gazing at the massive obsidian gates.","|Apparently, the core forces of the Commonwealth have long since transcended their weavings of Existence, and subtle changes have been occurring over these past thousand years that they took advantage of to seamlessly create stable channels across the Megalos. We...may merely be pawns in this war as those above us consider these incursions an expansion of the complexity of existence. Haha...pawns!|","The Omniversal Protector had a smile while they spoke of this as within moments, Legions of the Commonwealth spearheaded by Omniversal Stage Entities crossed through the massive gateway within a Tainted Omniverse.","And there were many recovered Tainted Omniverses where such gates were forged as the forces of the Commonwealth made their way into the Megalos Beyond!","It was a terrific achievement.","The clashing weavings of Matter and Dark Matter could distinctly be felt by Noah as they traversed across immeasurable distances, and in a short period of time...","BOOM!","They made their entry into the Megalos Beyond.","Alongside their entry, titanic golden wheels rose above them and spun with austere glows of power, the stellar obsidian radiance of the Megalos Beyond being pushed back as their group...shockingly appeared above a Pantheon.","At the forefront, Royal Existential Omniversal Simians with terrifying waves of power led these armies with ferocity as below them, booming cries of Outerversal Morphons echoed out.","Monstrosities arose.","Eldritch armies assembled as the forces of the Commonwealth arrived to wage war right before a Pantheon, and an existence breaking battle unfolded!","As Noah and the other Protectors clashed, a unique weaving of existence unfolded.","Noah stared towards an opposing Outerversal Morphon a distance away from him as it was a massive star shaped Morphon with a single eye.","...! It was himself...in his other dream.","The dream whose goal was a Transcendent Megalos Ability that was actually more than halfway achieved!","The moment their eyes met...","HUUUM!","An undeniable pull shut everything down as, after an excess of 3,000 years, the dream came to an end.","Noah felt like he was coming out of an extremely long sleep, his eyes opening to observe an endlessly vast obsidian space.","Within this space, only two singularities shone brightly.","|Due to the low proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the Dream has been brought to an end after an excess number of years and an intersection of Dreams occurred.|","|Your proficiency in the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos has been elevated to the Second Echelon, with your Proficiency at 1%.|","|Based on this, the weavings of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos you can obtain are somewhat limited.|","|All memories of the Dreams are retained.|","...!","Memories of the past, and memories of the possible future.","All of it buzzed in Noah's mind as a choice had to be made!"]},{"number":3287,"title":"Chapter 3287: Chapter 3286 Odd II","paragraphs":["|The Weavings of a single Dream can be retrieved fully, and half the weavings of another Dream can be retrieved.|","|The Two Dreams of the Megalos capable of being chosen are as follows|","[The Quintessential Protector- Conceptual System of Existence Echelon 5. The formation of a Quintessential Fabled Omniverse. Musings of the Ordinance of Quintessence. Omniversal Armaments- Armor of the Commonwealth, Spear of the Commonwealth, Omniversal Voyager II]","[Outerversal Morphon Starbright- Outerversal Physiology Echelon V, Megalos Regnum Echelon V. 458,550,020 Pure Delegatus Channels. Half of the Sword of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability.] ...!","Two dazzling singularities.","Noah only glanced at them for a moment before the choice was made.","[The full weavings of the Quintessential Protector have been retrieved]","[From the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the following weavings will be granted: Conceptual System of Existence Echelon 5. The formation of a Quintessential Fabled Omniverse. Musings of the Ordinance of Quintessence. Omniversal Armaments- Armor of the Commonwealth, Spear of the Commonwealth, Omniversal Voyager II] [Half of the weavings of Outerversal Morphon Starbright have been retrieved.]","[From the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos, the following weaving will be granted: 200,000,000 Pure Delegatus Channels. Half of the Sword of the Megalos Transcendent Megalos Ability.]","[Part of the Dream of Outerversal Morphon Starbright has been forever lost.] He was asleep for an instant.","He dreamed for an instant!","Noah opened his eyes on the multicolored throne as after this passage of an instant, his power was about to jump tremendously once more.","\"Ah...\"","He looked at his fair hands that held vibrant bands pulsing with the grandeur of Transcendence of Existence as if he was returning back to his old self.","A dream of over three thousand years was very real, but within a second, Noah was able to isolate those long memories and break them down as he returned to himself right after.","This was the true reality.","He wouldn't need hundreds or thousands of years to make progress here as in this passing of an instant, he made tremendous gains!","Above his, the weavings of existence themselves seemed to have been violated as the colorless radiance of Quintessence gushed down from a pulsing rune of AMARANTOS.","Not just this, but three Omniversal Armaments were spat out as one was a multicolored armor, a golden Spear, and a miniaturized Vessel that could traverse across the Omniverses of the Megalos Beyond!","But the most astounding thing was Quintessence.","The single, pure concept he had focused on for three thousand years as by doing this...he even gained musings of the Ordinance of Quintessence!","Ordinance.","Dictum.","Decree!","It was the stage after one grasped the Eye of Existence, where they could have a truly and unequivocally extreme weaving of existence that was termed the Ordinance of Existence.","A state where one took all the complexity of their existence and reduced it all to a single thing.","Noah attained mere musings of this possibility even though he had only just arrived at the first State of Existence.","\"Mmm, come...\"","He beckoned to the terrifying weavings of Quintessence as his First Mundi of Power began to seethe.","Within the boons he retrieved was also an elevation of this System of Existence, and a Fabled Omniverse.","He could effectively leave the shackles of an Autarchical Existence- of someone in the Existential Dominium Realm, and step into the Omniversal Realm!","But...","'I never belonged to any of these Realms to begin with...'","His thoughts were filled with unbound Tyranny as he began to process the weavings of a Fabled Omniverse.","His path was not a simple one where he would forge a Fabled Omniverse like all others and be considered an Omniversal Entity.","This would merely be a part of him.","Even during the dream of a few thousand years, he already theorized and planned for many things.","His First Mundi of Power could take on the weavings of a Fabled Omniverse as he already had a grandiose plan of possibilities for the other Mundis that made his Atlas of Existence!","Within the Outerversal Descent System of Existence, he wanted to enact a Fabled Pantheon.","Within the System of Existence of Kuklos, of Ingeniare, and all others to follow, he wanted them to have something unique and of their own as when all Nine Mundis of Power were filled...what would the product be?","This was something for him to design and look forward to. |Quintessence is becoming undisputed within your Conceptual System of Existence.|","...!","Around him, the obsidian rune of AMARANTOS flashed as rivers of colorless brilliance surged out and covered everything. |Quintessence seeks to break down countless records and make them part of the Quintessential Fabled Omniverse within the First Mundi of Power.|","|Quintessence seeks to compress countless records into a single Quintessential Quark, and from this Quark, bloom the Quintessential Fabled Omniverse.|","The methods of the Commonwealth.","They took all their records and weavings of existence after they became complex enough, compressed it all into a Quark, and then used the compression and explosion of power to bloom a Fabled Omniverse from a single Quark.","Countless quarks erupt from a single one, and this formed the basis of the Fabled Omniverse.","But...unlike the Dream, Noah's System of Existence did not just contain Quintessence.","HUUM!","His Atlas of Existence began to tremble.","|Infinity denies being broken down and assimilated.|","|The Protagonist denies being broken down and assimilated.|","|Entropy denies being broken down and assimilated.|","|Tyranny denies being broken down and assimilated.|","...!","A myriad of other concepts arose in defiance at this moment.","Inside the first Mundi of Power, Quintessence was akin to a massive colorless sun that exceeded all other concepts in size and standing at this moment.","Around it, a blue star representing infinity shone brightly.","A golden star representing the Protagonist released hues of radiance.","There were many other dazzling stars as all of them were either ten or twenty times less in size and stature, but they still glowed brightly in defiance.","Quintessence gazed at their blatant rebellion calmly as if it so chose...it could unleash a cleansing.","BOOM!","The moment this thought even arose, the first Mundi of Power pulsed as seated on the multicolored throne, Noah's body had a massive crack bloom on his chest and extended upward!","He looked at this calmly before he voiced out in a deep tone right after.","|Wrap it up.|","...!","A single command.","And within the First Mundi of Power, the massive star that was Quintessence stopped gazing at all the others and began to spin by itself.","Countless records converged as their main component...was not Quarks alone.","There were Leptons there. There were Psioneutrino Particles there.","Matter. Dark Matter.","The Commonwealth had one methodology for forming a Fabled Omniverse.","The Omniversal Archontes Engineer was now enacting another!"]},{"number":3288,"title":"Chapter 3288: Chapter 3287 Odd III","paragraphs":["Everything was contained within the First Mundi of Power.","Quintessence took the boons of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos and began compressing a great deal of Noah's weavings of existence in trillions of Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrino Particles.","A vast majority of his weavings...compressed into the smallest fundamental Particles of Existence that made him!","Thereafter...","These trillions of Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrino Particles began to be forcefully fused into each other.","A convergence of all that terrifying authority.","From trillions to billions. From billions to millions!","HUUM!","The amount of weaving being compressed created a shocking storm of power as they continued to fuse into each other, their mass and density reaching unfathomable levels along with their levels of energy!","When only 1,000 Quarks, Leptons, and Psioneutrino Particles remained, they found it hard to fuse as here, the colorless brilliance of the Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence surged down in waves.","A thousand became 500.","500 became 250!","It seemed to become extremely hard to continue as three separate clouds covered by the grandeur of Quintessence had powerful particles being stabilized while they smashed into each other, but they still needed a spark.","Something to drive everything home.","And...","BOOM!","Seas of deeply blue brilliance surged from the depths of Noah's existence.","Endless waves of extremely pure mana.","A form of energy purest in nature as it further stabilized every single particle, its endless influx causing all of them to instantly fuse into each other until...","A single radiant Quark.","A blazing Lepton.","An iridescent Psioneutrino.","They seemed to contain endless waves of records and brilliance at this moment, and these three particles...acted as the base for something utterly grandiose.","Quintessence bound them all heavily when they were trillions.","Now converged into single particles, Quintessence was ever tighter around them as these three singularities began to spin.","Spin and spin!","They spun and pulled each other with a terrifying force that was possible of even ripping apart tens of Apogee Autarchs, and all of such force buzzed within Noah's existence as eventually...these spinning singularities were moving so fast that it seemed like only a single orb of light was present.","|The Quintus Core of Existence has been successfully formed.|","|The Basis of the Quintessential Fabled Omniverse has been stabilized.|","...!","From the Core.","An explosion bloomed out- an explosion so regal and contained as from it, a circular Omniverse shining with dazzling colorless and golden waves of light emerged.","|The First Fabled Omniverse within the Conceptual System of Existence is blooming.|","The first.","It was an indication that there would be more.","Today, it was Quintessence that took the first step!","Within the first Mundi of Power, the Protagonist did not just sit still while observing this process.","Because from the eruption of this Quintessential Fabled Omniverse, all of Noah's weavings became much more complex and potent as the Protagonist grabbed onto this complexity!","Paradox grabbed onto this increasing complexity.","Cheats grabbed onto this elevation of Existence!","Infinity, Uncertainty, Relativity...every single concept jumped on the train that Quintessence led as if they were small, tiny stars before, they began to enlarge and shine brilliantly within the First Mundi of Power.","Seated on the multicolored throne, Noah's existence, which was already being exponentially raised by the constant devouring of Hearthraes in the Expanse, proceeded to have another jump in complexity!","Around his body that simmered with radiance, the illusion of a colorless gold Omniverse flashed for the first time.","It was a glorious result due to a single Dream.","As this unfolded, the rune of an obsidian SWORD formed within his existence near AMARANTOS and DEFY, another Transcendent Megalos Ability being inherited even though it was only half.","This whole time, the Omniversal Archontes Engineer took everything in and quantified exactly what it all meant and translated to in terms of his power!","Because as a result of what was occurring in his First Mundi of Power, the Value of his Atlas of Existence rose tremendously.","Because of the continued added weavings relating to the Megalos Beyond, and the millions of pure Channels gained from the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos that were taken by Ozymandias...his System of Existence of Outerversal Descent also rose tremendously!","It was a rapid advancement that needed at least a few seconds to be digested.","But were there even these seconds to spare?","—","Outerversal Morphon.","It was a unique distinction, and one that was made even more unique when one attained the distinction of a Great One.","A Great One.","Even among such beings...Savitar felt like he didn't truly belong.","His Empire was not as great as others.","His reach was not as extensive.","Even his State of Existence...he felt like he was infinitely close to attaining the Eye of Existence, and yet he never grasped it even now.","The most recent failure only made his faults more glaring as at this moment...he just wanted to let loose.","To release untold destruction as within him- within his Outerversal Physiology that held a burning skeletal heart within his Skull, it craved destruction.","It craved death and decimation to the extent that he had once lost himself in a state of frenzy and decimated an entire Omniverse!","This spoke more to the loose control of the Complexity of his Existence, but he wanted to be in that free state once more.","|Recoup my losses and turn everything within into Existence Reapers...and just let loose for the first time in a while.|","As he stared at the distant and yet massive outline of an Omniverse, he was akin to a speck of dust in size.","But even with this difference in size, he knew he could decimate such a vast space freely!","And so...","He walked.","He turned into a streak of black light that sought to break past the thick boundary of Omniversal Authorities that governed this Omniverse and enjoy the life forms within it!","|Kakaka! Let it begin!|","His cacklings echoed out as...","BOOM!"]},{"number":3289,"title":"Chapter 3289: Chapter 3288 Odd IV","paragraphs":["His massive flaming skull smashed head first into the thick boundary of Omniversal Authorities as...he was actually pushed back while the boundary trembled.","...!","|What?|","He stared at the boundary in amazement as he had never come across this.","He had taken over a dozen Omniverses himself as he remembered how it felt every time he entered it.","Whether it was through pure power like now, or whether he had a Delegatus within that he sacrificed to begin his Descent.","They could never stop his entry like this!","He looked at the Omniverse with burning purple flames as he wondered with a hint of expectations.","|An Exalted Omniverse?!|","His flames instantly rose higher.","Exalted.","Every now and then, unique Omniverses would be discovered that held terrifying resistance or resonance to the Dark Matter of the Megalos Beyond.","Even the inhabitants of the Commonwealth themselves had no way of finding out whether an Omniverse was Exalted or not unless they utilized Outerversal Authority!","But whenever an Outerversal Morphon discovered such an Omniverse, they came to find that the successful induction of a Dark Matter Core within such an Omniverse would create a terrifying Quintus Dark Matter Core!","A core that was many times more valuable that with it, they could absorb terrifyingly pure levels of Dark Matter that would aid one in elevating the Echelons of their Outerversal Physiology and Megalos Regnum past the 7th and 8th Echelons.","Exalted Omniverses were rare.","The weavings of Omniversal Authorities that bound them were extremely complex!","Some of the more powerful Great Ones were lucky enough to find such an Omniverse as their power only became more cemented thereafter.","|Haha...is it time for I, Savitar, to actually make tremendous gains?|","His flames burned brightly as in his joy, the only thing preventing full euphoria was the fact that the Great Ponderor knew about the location of this Omniverse.","And he stated blatantly that once Savitar began his slaughter, Protectors of the Commonwealth would be drawn here as this was what the Great Ponderor wanted- a diversion so that he could attain something else!","|Mmm...|","He had to change plans.","He couldn't just rampage.","|Find the Protectors, bind them, and prevent any communications. If I can successfully shift the location of this Omniverse from its anchor within the Megalos Ynnere...then it will all be mine.|","His weavings burned brightly.","He approached the boundary filled with complex Omniversal Authorities, not smashing into it this time as the many limbs behind him grabbed onto it as if they were claws.","After thousands of limbs sank in, he thrust his skull forward as his body began to meld with Existence itself!","One With Existence.","It covered his whole body as after a brief clash and struggle...","HUUM!","The boundary vibrated as his body seamlessly passed through.","A Great One delved into an Exalted Omniverse.","A distance away, a cloud of black darkness was watching this in a stupor while cursing.","|It was an Exalted Omniverse? And I fucking shared it's coordinates? This...this...!|","The Great Ponderor simmered in a low rage before he calmed himself.","He couldn't have known unless he tried to enter himself and extend his reach.","He calmly brooded before moments later, he decided on a course of action.","At the center of the mist, a massive Eye of Existence was kept active as the weavings of Protector Osmont sought to be discovered and read much more.","This Morphon veiled as a Protector was actually hiding in an Exalted Omniverse? And he didn't make it his?","It caused him to be even more cautious of this being.","Unless he absolutely understood him and his weaknesses, he would not make a move!","So for now...he would observe how the threat of Savitar would be dealt with. From there, he could alter his plans!","—","Inside Omniverse X-999.","A golden haired man was surrounded by seas of multicolored Omniversal Authorities as he opened his eyes.","They shone like luminous suns that further brightened the golden sea around him, and he looked towards his Exarchs and the forces of the Imperium he had raised to the current stage as he sighed.","|You all have come far, but are nowhere close to being capable of handling a threat like this.|","...!","A threat.","He sensed it the moment it tried to gain entry, and after it successfully gained entry as through the countless intricate weavings of the Omniverse that he was bound to, he could even track the location of the Outsider that had appeared!","An Outsider.","His aura was retracted as he waded through the Omniverse silently, not even leaking out a semblance of his aura as he seemed to be looking for something.","Its deathly skull radiated waves of black light as it seemed to be looking for directions before it began going in a straight line toward a certain place.","...!","Where the forces of the Commonwealth were clustered since they discovered this Omniverse!","Imperium observed such a scene with complex weavings emerging and falling within him as sensing the power of this being, he questioned being capable of expelling him at his current state.","He had only just begun to familiarize himself with his new power.","There was still much he didn't know!","But for the sake of this Omniverse...","WAP!","His main body disappeared.","Just like when he made the heavy choice with another Outsider, the Lumen Emperor...he would make the same choice today.","All to protect this Omniverse he was in!","The Omniversal Ankyra silently moved.","In another region within this Omniverse, Noah remained within the bounds of the Infinite Omniverse that was akin to a grain of sand compared to its vastness.","He sensed the heavy presence of Dark Matter- of the Outerversal Morphon seeking to hide its aura while it moved as to him...there was no way it could hide!","The sensitivity to Dark Matter for the Infinite Omniverse was currently at an all-time high while it assimilated a Dark Matter Core and continued to expand its breadth and complexity with the authority of the Megalos Beyond itself.","And himself...a grandiose colorless gold Omniverse swirled magnificently as his existence currently emanated terrifying waves of power.","Power so suffocating that any Apogee Autarch may be forced to fall on their knees!"]},{"number":3290,"title":"Chapter 3290: Chapter 3289 Unlucky! I","paragraphs":["He sat on the throne filled with countless multicolored threads that extended into the Infinite Omniverse.","He laid back languidly as around him, three Omniversal Armaments swirled like galaxies around a colorless gold Omniverse that twinkled with radiance!","The Armor of the Commonwealth, the Spear of the Commonwealth, and the Omniversal Voyager II to traverse across the Megalos Ynnere.","Multicolored radiance shone from each of them as these boons of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos were all things that Noah finished analyzing while he kept tabs on the rapidly moving signature of an Outerversal Morphon he recognized!","\"Savitar...\"","Noah had a smile on his face as he tapped the throne he sat on.","The eyes of the Weaver saw across countless threads as very quickly, a few possibilities arose.","For this same Great One to appear in his Omniverse, it was naturally connected to the Half Tainted Omniverse he raided with the Equestris Protectors.","There, he had aided in the destruction of the body of Savitar, but there was another hidden Entity who also helped in this- the backer behind Protector Lucretia!","Noah had stolen from whatever boons this being planned to get from one of Savitar's bodies perishing as he had gotten under its gaze and now...","\"You've even backtracked to the home of Protector Osmont...\"","Noah stroked his chin as he thought languidly.","It should be something easy with Protector Lucretia as his Delegatus, but for thus being to not even come forward himself and to instead send Savitar, the same Morphon he plotted against...","\"You are a schemer,\" Noah spoke confidently as he rose from his throne.","An Outerversal Morphon within Omniverse X-999.","An Outerversal Morphon likely outside of it observing everything.","In front of him, space distorted as another version of him appeared before his main body.","It was the Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Quintessence.","Standing stupendously in the Fifth Phase of Ascendancy, Quintessence outshone all others as colorless gold robes draped over him.","Bands of stellar radiance covered his skin underneath, and his hair sparkled with the astral light of an unfathomable omniverse.","A Quintessential Fabled Omniverse!","Born from Matter and Dark Matter.","Occupying vast stretches of space within the First Mundi of Power, this Fabled Omniverse made Quintessence paramount at this moment as if Noah faced the Worms of Existence again, he wouldn't even need the Authority of the Administrator of the Atlas of Existence to be capable of wounding them!","Noah looked at himself as the prompts he ignored came down all at once.","|The Quintessential Fabled Omniverse has been forged within your Existence as you have escaped the bounds of the Existential Dominium Realm.|","|You have touched upon the established ranking of the Omniversal Realm that cannot truly distinguish your complexity.|","|The demarcation of power within the Omniversal Stage is being studied and analyzed.|","|The role of Quintessence has been greatly expanded, and its effects on the weavings of existence are currently stipulated to be capable of altering the quality of the highest forms and most complex weavings of existence.|","Within him, all other concepts couldn't say a single thing at this moment as Quintessence truly took center stage!","But this was only part of Noah's achievements.","|The Transcendent Megalos Ability, the Sword of the Megalos(Half), has been fully analyzed. With the Rune of this Transcendent Megalos Ability as the key, one can release an output of 150% of their Complexity of Existence, and the surrounding weavings of existence covering the size of half an Omniverse will naturally be drawn into this attack. If one has attained the state of One With Existence, 90% of the cost of this ability will be paid for by the surrounding weavings of existence. If one has attained the state of Ordinance of Existence, the output of the released attack could be increased by a range of 100% to 1,000,000% depending on the type of Ordinance.|","|The Transcendent Megalos Ability, the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos(Half), has been fully analyzed. With the Rune of this Transcendent Megalos Ability as the key, one can constantly change the quality of their Physiology to resist and even eventually nullify weaker weavings of Existence. Items, constructs, naturally occurring treasures of Existence, and certain unique authorities are required in order to build up the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos. The First Echelon that can be successfully cultivated is the Bastion of Existence, with the Second Echelon- Existence Defying, only available in the full inheritance of this Transcendent Megalos Ability.|","...!","In addition to a shocking elevation of Quintessence, there were of course, the two Transcendent Megalos Abilities apart from the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos Beyond.","These two Abilities seemed to be just as terrifying as the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos Beyond, and Noah put them into account when he looked at himself and his level of power at this moment.","[Atlas of Existence Echelon 2 (1,333,855/100,000,000)]---[Laborer]---[Administrator]","[Conceptual System of Existence Echelon 5 (19,930,375/100,000,000)]---[Dominium Organs]---[Omniversal Control]---[Omniversal Mantle]---[Fabled Omniverse]","[Outerversal Descent System of Existence Echelon 3 (3,754,448/5,000,000)]---[Outerversal Siphoning]","His existence was elevating rapidly and steadily.","As his main body looked at his Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Quintessence, he nodded while urging the rune of the Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos to begin churning.","\"Let's go test this power against another body of Savitar. This time, it won't be a team battle...\"","His eyes were bright as his Clone of Quintessence disappeared.","And before his eyes...","|The Transcendent Megalos Ability, Existence Defying Physiology of the Megalos, seeks a source of authority, Items, constructs, or any naturally occurring treasures of Existence that can be broken down to cultivate the first Echelon, the Bastion of Existence.|","The rune spun hungrily while asking for something.","And Noah didn't answer it yet as, in the next moment, a crimson gold light flashed from his chest and formed into the visage of a dazzling bejeweled young woman whose entire existence shone with resplendence.","Thousands of multicolored golden lines formed an almost see-through dress, tens of thousands of jewels covering the gaps as everything about her screamed richness and majesty!"]},{"number":3291,"title":"Chapter 3291: Chapter 3290 Unlucky! II","paragraphs":["Potent weavings of colorless Quintessence wrapped around her as the complexity of her existence did not seem normal.","Her crimson hair vibrated with an astral light as the moment she appeared, Ruination reached out towards the Sword of the Commonwealth, the Armor of the Commonwealth, and the Omniversal Voyager II.","A crimson-gold light flashed over them as they turned translucent for a brief moment.","After this moment...","HUUM!","Existence distorted.","Opposite these Omniversal Armaments, illusory replicas of them bloomed as they became ever so real with every passing second!","Golden brilliance surged around them as from Ruination, heavy weavings of Loot unfolded.","And in a matter of seconds...","...!","Dazzling replicas of the Omniversal Armaments were forged.","Replicas- and yet after a while, one couldn't notice any difference between the Armaments!","Ruination nodded with a placid gaze as she then turned towards Noah with bright eyes- almost as if seeking affirmation.","Noah patted her head with a smile as he directed the target of the spinning rune in his existence to the newly duplicated Armaments.","WUU!","Like a millstone, the rune of DEFY released terrifying waves that actually began to break down the multicolored Sword of the Commonwealth and Armor of the Commonwealth- along with the round vessel as if they were nothing.","An ability that grew from being fed Loot.","It would undoubtedly reach terrifying levels of power soon enough as while this occurred, Noah cast his gaze away from himself and towards the distant Omniverse.","Behind him, Invictus Maximus buzzed with astral radiance as they occasionally seemed to flicker into and out of existence.","What was to come?","What was the cause, and what would be the effect?","He went into a Half Tainted Omniverse with the Equestris Protectors as this led to Savitar. He aided in the death of Savitar and devoured his Delegatus and the Dark Matter Core, and this drew the attention of another terrifying Outerversal Morphon that was plotting behind the scenes. This Morphon was then powerful enough to locate Omniverse X-999 and lead Savitar towards it!","Cause! Effect!","It felt like countless intricate strings that were all moving together, and if Noah could manipulate them enough...he felt like he could control the possible future effects from whatever causation there were.","This...was the aim of Invictus Maximus!","—","Within Omniverse X-999.","Savitar's massive body crossed as his Outerversal Authority leaked out and caused vibrant reactions with the surrounding Omniverse that caused him to feel giddy.","The sheer concentration of Omniversal Authority within this Omniverse was nuts as he had been in other Omniverses that the Commonwealth held control in!","He had some weak Delegatus in some as he knew of the Existential Terraforming the Commonwealth commonly performed.","But this didn't answer why the surrounding weavings of this Omniverse seemed so reactive to Outerversal Authority.","This reactivity told him that if he could successfully cultivate a Quintus Dark Matter Core within this Omniverse, it might hold surprises that other Great Ones may have not even discovered yet!","But...all of this would be for naught if he couldn't stop the entry of reinforcements from the Commonwealth.","So his first set of actions were those of stealth.","To locate the Protectors stationed here and silently bind them to himself, and only then could he covertly begin his actions","This was his grandiose plan as-","|What does a thing like you want here?|","...!","The massive skull of Savitar came to a halt and looked around coldly.","Far above, the astral space split apart as a Golden haired man filled with ecstatic beauty appeared.","His white robes fluttered with majesty as the very surroundings of the Omniverse seemed to be convergent towards him. Savitar observed the scene coldly, but within his existence, he was shocked.","He had attained the state of One With Existence. His perception of the weavings of existence in any nearby space was much greater than other entities as, at this moment, he could feel as if every single ounce of weaving of this Omniverse were supporting the entity ahead of him!","Such a thing was unfathomable, as he had come across and even killed many Omniversal Ankyras before.","Such beings had a small sense of convergence of Omniversal Authorities, and that was it. Nothing on this scale. Nothing this massive.","And even worse, he could sense this Omniversal Ankyra to have their existence too sublimated with the surroundings as likely, they had also attained the state of One With Existence!","He cursed at such a scene as he questioned... just how unlucky he could be?","His Bodies moving across the Megalos Ynnere ranged with the power of Outerversal Physiology Echelon 5 to Echelon 7.","He left his most powerful Bodies at the Seventh Echelon in his most prized Tainted Omniverses that continued to nourish him and his Main Body in the Megalos Beyond that attained the Eighth Echelon!","The Body here was only at the Fifth Echelon as it was equivalent to an Omniversal Entity who had attained the state of One With Existence or even the Eye of Existence.","'Okay. An Omniversal Ankyra...I can work with. If I find a high degree of confidence in the success of this Exalted Omniverse, I will call over another body or two here if I have to...'","He never wanted to sacrifice too much of his strength for an unknown.","So he would make things clear first!","He looked at the golden-haired Omniversal Ankyra as he was ready to catch this young entity off guard, but before he could make a move...","|Interesting...whatever happened to you, Imperium?|","...!","Another intent bloomed out.","An intent that caused Imperium to constrict his pupils with care as he turned towards another direction where the figure of Noah with colorless gold robes and waves of astral light surrounding him could be seen! n/o/vel/b//in dot c//om","The moment his intent had echoed out, the purple flames within the sockets of Savitar vibrated in disbelief.","That voice.","That intent.","That arrogance and self-confidence as if everything would be as he wanted!","|No fucking way...| Savitar uttered out with rage and incredulity as he turned towards the direction of the Entity who didn't even spare him a glance and seemed to be more interested in the Omniversal Ankyra.","But there he was.","With his devilish eyes simmering with endless brilliance.","With those wings releasing a heart-shaking glare!","Protector Osmont- the same one who had contributed to the death of one of his bodies not too long ago.","He...was he truly so fucking unlucky to run into this demon again so quickly?!"]},{"number":3292,"title":"Chapter 3292: Chapter 3291 Who is the actual Omniversal Ankyra?! I","paragraphs":["That arrogance!","That self-confidence!","Savitar could not forget such a demeanor on anyone, especially if this being had the same exact face.","He arrived and didn't even bat an eye towards Savitar as he instead questioned the Omniversal Ankyra for what happened to him.","Such a demeanor caused the flames within Savitar to burn with even greater ferocity.","If he was here, then surely, the Protectors of the Imperium he sought to quietly control so that nobody interrupted him with his plans of this Exalted Omniverse...would also be altered.","|...|","So the teeth in this skull cluttered with coldness as its intent boomed out.","|Peon of the Commonwealth...are Protectors supposed to be scattered around so much like you?|","...!","The words of the buzzing Outerversal Morphon echoed out and drew the attention of everything.","The gaze of the white robed golden haired Imperium frowned as he glanced towards Noah while potent rivers of existence began to surge around him.","|You know this Outsider, Osmont?|","Outsider.","Noah smiled at this term that could apply to him as well, and he nodded.","|The other body of mine that has been inducted as a Protector faced him with the aid of an Omniversal Stage Command Protector. He is....the One Who Walks, Outerversal Morphon Savitar.|","...!","His last sentence had a more ridiculing tone as Savitar could feel the disdain dripping from him!","The thousands of limbs behind his skull began to buzz with obsidian tendrils of Outerversal Authority that caused space to fizzle and decay.","|Outerversal Morphon...| Imperium repeated these words coldly before his right hand rose up threateningly towards this Great One.","|I know not of your intent, but you are not welcome in this Omniverse. From the malice and death emanating from you, you have already been allowed in the bounds of this Omniverse for too long already as you can now perish.|","WAA!","He was more than anyone Omniversal Ankyra at this moment.","He had received something far too profound as he needed time to assimilate it and understand it.","But until then, he would still act to ensure the safety of this Omniverse!","HUUM!","His surroundings pulsed as it felt like all nearby surrounding weavings were resonating.","Instantly, over a dozen Autarchical Omniversal Authorities descended and wrapped around his body before they flowed into his hand like massive multicolored snakes.","He then thrust his hand out and downwards rapidly as in a shockingly short period of time, all surrounding weavings seemed to only be following his decree!","From above, an utterly massive palm formed and crashed down towards Savitar.","It shone with a myriad of colors as it seemed like the hand of the Omniverse itself, everything under it facing a terrifying gravitational constriction that sought to collapse all existence!","Gloriously gold.","Its size actually eclipsed the massive stature of Savitar!","Potent with three weavings of multiple Autarchical Omniversal Authorities!","|Hmph!|","Savitar harrumphed towards the massive hand bearing down as the obsidian light gushed from him and melded with the surrounding existence, dozens of obsidian Pillars of light blooming and spinning around him as his thousands of limbs turned into obsidian spears that thrust into the massive palm.","And....","A blinding explosion of gold and black radiated out.","It was enough to scorch the retinas of even Foundation Autarchs as chaotic weavings of existence bloomed due to this impact, and shattered pieces of a massive hand could be seen strewn about as Savitar's deeply tenebrous Outerversal Authority leaked out madly!","|I'm fucking fed up with all this shit.|","His voice boomed out with cold rage one tentacle after another began to emerge from his back.","Imperium became stern as truly, he wasn't there yet.","He needed time to assimilate the new power he had just gotten and then elevate his level of Existence due to it, with his still not escaping the bounds of the Existential Dominium Realm.","This was why even though he held a terrifying level of control over Omniversal Authorities and even the surrounding Omniverse itself, he wasn't able to deal a serious enough injury to this being!","But what would be done now?","He continued to gather power around him as he didn't let up, but the aura around Savitar only became more maddening.","|One of my bodies gets killed, and now any creature that hasn't even attained the Fifth Echelon of Existence thinks they have the chance to oppose me.|","...!","His purple flames buzzed gloriously with ecstatic power!","Tens of thousands of tentacles began to seethe from behind him.","His power reached an unprecedented peak as his dominating voice continued!","|Let me show you all what it truly means to be a Great On-...!|","|Sword.|","WU!","Savitar's words were forcefully stopped as the core of his existence began to tingle with unfathomable danger.","He turned his will fully towards the entity that had been watching everything with that distant gaze of his.","That gaze that Savitar hated the most- of someone he believed to be below him thinking they were something far above.","A gaze he hated as he had seen such eyes from those distinguished as Great Ones!","How dare this being have the same eyes? Eyes that seemed to hold an Innate regal light of unfathomable glory and honor that others couldn't replicate.","Eyes filled with a sense of endless dignity that Savitar himself never seemed to radiate!","|...of the Megalos.|","This foul being gazed towards him with such eyes as he uttered out...","|Huh?|","Everything came to a halt around Savitar.","He stared into the eyes of this being filled with Dignity as he questioned a single thing.","Did this being just say...Sword of the Megalos?","Sword of the Megalos.","Was that not...a Transcendent Megalos Ability only attainable within the Crucible of the Beyonder, the Crucible of the Sword?","That was the last thought Savitar had before everything around him turned immeasurably sharp.","Far above, a white gold sword of titanic stature began to form!","Its sharpness seemed to permeate all around as it drew in complex weavings of Existence.","Not just here, but across half of this expansive Omniverse X-999.","Every shred of weaving was pulled to give the terrifying sharpness of this Sword!"]},{"number":3293,"title":"Chapter 3293: Chapter 3292 Who is the actual Omniversal Ankyra?! II","paragraphs":["An output of 150% of Noah's complexity of existence, in addition to the surrounding weavings of existence covering the size of half an Omniverse.","This made up the single attack of the Sword of the Megalos!","Initiating and releasing it, Noah felt 5% of the reserves of his authorities leave him.","But the results...were utterly astonishing.","What did his complexity mean?","His Quintessential Fabled Omniverse.","Quintessence itself.","His System of Existence of Ingeniare. Of Outerversal Descent. Of the still forming System of Kuklos!","Of his whole Atlas of Existence.","And for added measure, a portion of the complexity of the Infinite Omniverse.","The result was the horror above that seemed like a Sword of Existence that could cut everything!","It was heavy, and it was fast as it swung down and only left behind a line of white gold light.","By the time its brilliance could be followed again, the massive illusory white gold sword was actually behind the massive skull of Savitar.","...!","A clear white line bloomed vertically across Savitar's skull as it instantly split in half, its thousands of limbs and tentacles beginning to furiously burn with white gold flames as in its sockets...","Purple flames blazed with shock and incredulity!","That Sword.","That Sword!","That was the amalgamation of the shocking wonders of the Great Beyonder.","Something the most supreme Morphon of their Megalos Beyond constructed that allowed existence to be weaved under the banner of the user, truly making it the Sword of the Megalos as when striking out- nearly all surrounding weavings of existence struck out with you!","He had seen it on a few renowned Great Ones who managed to halfway clear the Crucible of the Sword.","Why...did this demon have it?!","He had to be-","BOOM!","The limbs and tentacles on him furiously burned away as the terrifying effects of the fast Sword unfolded, his skeletal figure that was bisected also becoming covered with white gold flames as it crackled and was burnt out of existence.","|...|","In the distance, Imperium's gaze was a frozen one as he seemed to be questioning the reality before him.","As everything about Savitar dissipated into white gold flames, the illusory white gold sword returned towards Noah's side briefly as he motioned towards it before it disappeared entirely.","Silently as a miniscule singularity was captured in his hands from it that nobody noticed.","As everything about Savitar dissipated into white gold flames, the illusory white gold sword returned towards Noah's side briefly as he motioned towards it before it disappeared entirely.","Silently as a miniscule singularity was captured in his hands from it that nobody noticed.","Under his eyes, millions of pure Delegatus Channels lost their controller as the hidden weavings of the Outerversal Descent System of Existence pulled on them, his eyes going towards Imperium as he nodded with interest.","|You seem to have undergone some great changes in a short period of time...has your status as an Omniversal Ankyra taken a big jump?|","He asked calmly as if he didn't just wave his hands and cause a terrifying Outerversal Morphon who had rebuffed Imperium's attack to perish.","Imperium took in his words as he wondered.","Between the two of them...who was actually the Omniversal Ankyra here?!","A distance away from the location where Imperium was looking towards Noah cautiously as if he were a monster.","Within Cappadocia that was one of the central points of Existential Terraforming.","One of Noah's bodies was seated on a sea of red and blue waters as he sat in this place, observing the silent waves of terraforming as if he were keeping watch to make sure no massive instabilities unfolded.","At this moment, his right hand unfurled to reveal a singularity as the wings behind him veiled everything in this space.","From that singularity, the small trace weavings of none other than Savitar could be seen as Noah released them and even sent in pure waves of existence to nurture it- a small miniature skull with purple flames forming in front of him as they gazed forward with ferociousness!","Noah looked at this trace remnant of Savitar as he shook his head.","\"Frankly, I feel bad on your behalf, big guy. Don't you find it odd that I just happened to be in another Omniverse you arrived in? Someone must have sent you here, right?\"","...!","His words caused the flames of the One Who Walks to flicker as the miniaturized skull floated back.","|You keep a trace of my will to mock me? For you to have the Sword of the Megalos...What are you? Which Great One are you?|","A flood of questions came.","But Noah shook his head while replying with an expression of pity.","\"You are missing the point. I saved a trace of you in order for me to understand my enemy better. My...true enemy, not you.\"","16:20","...!","The flames within Savitar's sockets seethed as Noah continued.","\"The one who sent you to this Omniverse. Do you not even know that he was the same one who interfered and cut off half of your weavings that led to your death in the Half Tainted Omniverse?\"","BOOM!","A pillar of purple flames arose as Noah watched calmly.","|What are you...?! What!|","The flames were furious but also analyzing everything.","\"Mmm, I caught the attention of whoever that being is after your death. He had to have been watching your demise while waiting to reap your hard work. What I find utterly cruel to you is that after causing the death of one of your bodies...he actually went on to use you to gain more information about me by sending you here. Of course, this is all conjecture and I could be wrong, but did someone send you here? I am picturing an enemy who doesn't like to make moves himself. He manipulates others from behind and schemes around a great deal.\"","...!","|This...! This!| The skull of Savitar was shaking.","|Fuck!|","Expletives followed thereafter as purple flames burned brightly!","|He played me? He fucking played ME?!|","WUU!","The flames rose and fell.","Waves of wrath could be felt raging within Savitar as the miniature skull of his clattered and trembled.","Opposite him, the Omniversal Archontes Engineer smiled as around him, unique weavings of existence swirled.","He had a veiled smile as he looked at the scene before him.","Cause and effect.","He wanted to see how much further he could take and control these weavings of causality as he voiced out.","\"Who is this enemy scheming against me? Scheming against you? Who is...our enemy?\"","...!"]},{"number":3294,"title":"Chapter 3294: Chapter 3293 The enemy of my enemy I","paragraphs":["In red and blue waters that stretched out mystically, with the allure of stellar brilliance shining all around.","The Omniversal Archontes Engineer cooly sat on these waters as he talked to a trace will of Savitar, his gaze firm as he continued.","\"Since he led you here, you must know a great deal about them. Tell me who he is so his schemes can be put to rest.\"","...!","Who was the Outerversal Morphon behind Protector Lucretia?","Who had managed to bend a Protector of the Commonwealth, and how many more Protectors were there that were his Delegatus?","Noah observed the buzzing figure of Savitar that was pulsing between wrath and hesitation, this being keeping his intent in without revealing anything else as Noah raised his brows and continued.","\"Will you not even reveal him? Are you fearful of him? From his actions, he treats you as a joke. He helps kill one of your bodies one day, and then goes to use and manipulate you the next day as if nothing happened. How low must he think of you? You are a Great One, yes? For a Great One to be treated like a joke-\"","|There are ranks to the Great Ones!|","A bellow of wrath and humiliation came through.","The skull of Savitar bobbed and fell on the waters as weavings of wrath and shame circled around him, and he looked spitefully towards Noah while his purple flames burned.","|He manipulated me, and you think you can sit here and speak of what you think to be my weakness to manipulate me too? You will not get anything from me, O Manipulator.|","...!","The One Who Walks was firm.","He reigned in his rage and insecurities as Noah gazed at him calmly.","Then, the hands of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer arose as interminably pure waves of Outerversal Authority began to swirl around him.","\"Is my identity what is causing you reservations? We stem from the same source, Savitar. I have waded the Megalos Beyond for too many years for one of my peers to treat me as an outsider. This is something we can discuss between each other Morphon to Morphon, without any reservations.\"","WAA!","Savitar stared at the extremely pure waves of Outerversal Authority as his purple flames burned brilliantly.","|The Sword of the Megalos...Outerversal Authority...you aren't a mere Delegatus. Who are you?|","His flames flickered subtly.","Noah looked at him and shook his head with a smile as he replied.","\"I have not intertwined my weavings with others for too many cycles. I do not know much of you all, and you all have likely not heard of me, or I may have been forgotten entirely. But you can call me...\"","Noah's mind churned as he decided on a new distinction for himself.","After a second, he laughed internally while continuing.","\"...The Dreamer of the Megalos.\"","HUUM!","Words held power.","Choices held power.","Distinctions even more so!","|The Dreamer of the Megalos...|","Savitar uttered these words as he looked closely at Noah and the silent waves of pure Outerversal Authority.","\"We are of the same breed. So let us discuss the enemy seeking to use us as chess pieces. I have confidence in my own power to strike back against them...I just need the target to be made clear.\"","|...|","His words caused silence to descend as Savitar only stared at him with flickering purple flames.","It was only after a few seconds...","|The Great Ponderor.|","WAA!","|He is a Great One who has managed to survive for far too many cycles. Others have said that he was alive all the way back to when the Great Beyonder still moved across the Megalos. He is a Great One that other Great One steer clear of...Nietzsche!|","...!","Nietzsche!","Noah carved this name into his memory as he nodded, letting out a light sigh.","\"The Great Ponderor...I have only heard whispers of him since I woke up. The Great Beyonder though...ah, he was something else.\"","Cryptic words echoed from him that shocked Savitar as this Morphon looked towards him quizzically.","The way he spoke made it seem as if he had lived in the cycles when the Great Beyonder was active too!","|You...did you know the Great Beyonder? Did you observe his feats?|","He asked cautiously.","And Noah smiled as truly, he had dreamed of the cycle when the Great Beyonder was just constructing Crucibles.","He smiled with a sense of mystery and replied.","\"I know a lot, and I still know very little. Recently though, I observed some changes in the Megalos Beyond where a young Morphon overcame the Crucible of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos on the Pantheon of Umbra...the so called Instrument, is it?\"","WAA!","His words instantly shocked Savitar as his skull moved much closer!","|You...your main body is currently within the Pantheon of Umbra?! The Great Ponderor is there as well! Even one of my bodies is...|","\"I am not there...\" Noah raised his hand to stop this being who had inexplicably thought of him much differently than before.","\"I told you, I am the Dreamer of the Megalos. The amount of information I can obtain is astronomical without ever having to be in that place myself. But it is great to know where one of the bodies of my enemy is. Where else is he in the Megalos Beyond? Which Tainted Omniverses is he feeding from within the Megalos Ynnere?\"","Savitar heard his questions clearly as he calmed down.","He seemed to come to a decisive point as his flames flickered firmly.","He was hooked.","Without a shadow of a doubt, he believed Noah to be another terrifying Great One.","After all, he even knew of something as recent and intricate as what was occurring on the Megalos Pantheon of Umbra!","|I...know of at least 9 of the Tainted Omniverses under his control. As for the locations of his bodies across the Megalos Beyond, he is scattered. Nobody knows where his Main Body lies. You...are you sure you are able to go against him? He...he alone is powerful. And he has many, many allies.|","...!"]},{"number":3295,"title":"Chapter 3295: Chapter 3294 The enemy of my enemy II","paragraphs":["Was he sure?","Savitar spoke such words with hesitation as at such a tone, Noah's smile actually faded as the gaze he gave towards Savitar was one he had seen too many times before.","A gaze of disappointment. A gaze that was akin to looking at a worm wriggling on the ground!","With such a gaze, the Dreamer of the Megalos spoke as Savitar felt like needles were piercing across his will.","|A Morphon kills you, manipulates you, and lies to your face the next day- showing utter disregard and disrespect to you, and all you have are worries and insecurities against him? Are you truly a Great One? Are you someone I can even work with to oppose this enemy?|","...!","His words were piercing as Savitar's skull trembled!","He knew how he was talked about behind the scenes.","He knew what other Great Ones thought of him!","Even his distinction...the One Who Walks, was taken as a joke by others.","The one who runs away more often than not. The one who is the quickest to retreat in the face of danger.","That...was the One Who Walks. Cycles worth of memories crossed through his mind in the span of an instant as the flames within him burned savagely.","|I am a Great One.|","HUUM!","He said the words to himself, these same words also being a declaration!","His sockets burned with purple flames as he faced Noah's visage without looking away and repeated himself.","|I am...a Great One!|","The flames within this trace of a will burned brightly as when Noah faced them, he nodded while speaking calmly.","\"The enemy of my enemy...is a friend. We may have begun on the wrong foot, but we can still ensure that the one plotting against us has an assured downfall.\"","|...|","Two entities stared at each other.","The One Who Walks now held an extremely decisive demeanor as his intent weaved out succinctly.","|At the end of it all, I get to be the one that eats the main body of the Great Ponderor. That defiles him and lets him know who Savitar really is! You can have his Tainted Omniverses. You can have his other bodies. I just...I want his core being to myself.|","His will was resonantly made clear as to this...Noah nodded with a smile.","\"Now, it feels like I'm truly talking to a Great One. Come.\"","He waved his hands behind him and caused a colorless rift to open, his figure walking through it as without hesitation, Savitar's will followed.","A flash of obsidian radiance bloomed as on the other side of this rift...sandy obsidian gold mountains rose and fell with profound turbidity!","It was...a small, carved-out section of the Dream Aletheian Haven that was transformed with the Psioneutrino Particles to be a haven filled with both Matter and Dark Matter.","Arriving here, Savitar felt a shocking tug from the depths of his existence towards the seas of obsidian gold mountains as Noah's voice echoed out.","\"Regardless of where we are now, I still acted to destroy one of your bodies...so let me help you reconstruct it. Even better than before...and then we can get started.\"","...!","As he spoke, he waved his hands to reveal a golden dew drop that caused the surrounding weavings of existence to shudder.","It felt like it was something far, far too heavy to even exist here, and even Noah frowned in the next moment as he felt an indescribable force seeking to pull this dew drop away!","It was something from the Expanse- a Hearthrae!","\"Quickly.\"","He spoke towards the miniature Savitar who shockingly arrived with a blank look of greed and fanaticism towards the appearance of the Hearthrae, his skull opening its jaws to swallow it as if he were passed.","A blinding golden radiance shone as the force that seemed to be stemming from the Expanse, which was pulling back something that belonged in that place, disappeared.","Thereafter, rivers of obsidian gold sandy light rose from the nearby mountains of Dreams as they surged towards the miniature visage of Savitar that rapidly began to expand and grow larger!","It was the first alteration of an entity that wasn't Noah, this test being done with only the authority of a single Aletheian Haven filled with Psioneutrino Particles as what changes could be brought to a natural Morphon who wasn't Noah?","All of this came as after twisting Causality, Noah knew the enemy hiding in the dark.","The Great Ponderor, Nietzsche!","In the mind of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer, countless weavings were already blooming on how he could fuck this morphon up.","—","Within the stretches of the Megalos Ynnere.","Over 999 Omniverses now stood under the banner of the Commonwealth, even though they knew there could very well be countless others out there.","Within an Exalted Omniverse towering over ten times the size of a normal Omniverse.","Massive golden metallic boundaries surrounded it entirely, a statue of golden Royal Existential Omniversal Simian floating serenely outside the bounds of this Omniverse.","Past this constructed golden boundary and countless layers of intricate structures and Wheels of Weavings.","Towards the center of this Omniverse, there was a titanic golden wheel constantly spinning as a hundred Omniversal Stage Entities were seated on temples around it.","Almost as if...they were guarding something.","And they were terrifying Entities to have as guards as all of them had their existence partly melding and fusing with the surrounding space as at the very least- they had attained the state of One With Existence!","Deeper inside this wheel, towards the very center, there was a round domain the size of a world.","Paradisiacal landscapes of verdant earth and trees filled it to the brim as within such a place...a single disheveled human could be seen.","In a place that was so tightly guarded, the disheveled human- a supposed prisoner, suddenly raised his head and gazed upwards.","It was only a single movement.","But it was one that triggered countless mechanisms as blaring alarm sounds began to echo out right away!","The disheveled man paid no attention to this as he spoke for the first time in eons.","\"Has that time come?\"","...!"]},{"number":3296,"title":"Chapter 3296: Chapter 3295 An Unfathomable Emergence! I","paragraphs":["Has that time come.","A single sentence.","A single glance up.","Yet this was all it took to cause blaring alarms to ring out within this idyllic paradise and across the entire Wheel it was connected to.","Within this idyllic space the size of a small word, there were small twinkling circular orbs that floated around like stars, but each one seemed to hold a terrifying weight that could collapse the surrounding space if another force wasn't holding them up.","The disheveled man waved his hands towards these unfathomably heavy orbs spread out across this idyllic space as they all twinkled before coming to circle around him, forming into a cluster of dazzling orbs.","The disheveled man then took out a worn out looking treasure chest, the orbs circling around him beginning to move into this treasure chest slowly!","As they came, they reduced in size before they disappeared entirely.","If one looked closer towards these orbs, they would shockingly come to notice that they held vibrant Omniversal boundaries, with countless complex weavings of existence buzzing within each one as these were...Omniverses!","Omniverses.","And the ones circling around the disheveled man and going into the worn out treasure chest numbered in the hundreds.","This entity wasn't hurried at all, and he truly paid no attention to the alarms that had rang out.","He didn't even bother to raise his head to see that around the idyllic landscape the size of a world, over a hundred Royal Existential Omniversal Simians at the Omniversal Stage were surrounding him, and another blinding flash of light bloomed as...The Sword of the Commonwealth himself arrived!","The moment he did so, space around him distorted as he fused with the surrounding existence, a massive Eye of Existence opening above him while a golden staff appeared in his hands that he swung down towards the isolated world below.","...!","The staff smashed into an invisible boundary, and not even a decibel of sound was made.","The Sword of the Commonwealth stared threateningly inside this small world as truly, it wasn't a prison in the truest sense.","It was a prison as the being inside had never come out for eons now.","But...the Simians didn't make this prison, nor could they enter it. They had only constructed the tight Wheel of Weavings around it within this Exalted Omniverse!","And no matter what they did over the eons, they have never been able to enter that small, isolated space.","The worn out treasure chest closed calmly as the disheveled man waved his hands and caused it to disappear, his figure slowly straightening up as a clear white robe appeared on him, his hand waving over his head and causing vibrant dark hair to bloom down to his shoulders wildly.","His fair skin glinted with untold brilliance as he gazed up again, ignoring the Omniversal Stage Simians staring at him with wide eyes, some even showing apprehension and shock as his gaze was looking at something extremely far away.","\"It is time. As the Omnifather had stated...\"","A slight sigh seemed to escape him as in the next moment, he took a step.","A single step.","And his figure entirely disappeared!","Along with hundreds of Omniverses, the white-robed man disappeared under the eyes of the terrifying forces of the Commonwealth.","|...|","Stark silence descended in the surroundings as an instant later, beside the Sword of the Commonwealth, and spatial light flashed as another entity appeared.","It was none other than the Shield of the Commonwealth- Eudemus!","His messy dark and white hair seemed out of sorts as he sighed while looking at the empty idyllic world below them that remained untouched.","\"Well, this is something I did not anticipate. In all these eons, he stayed still. For him to move now...it seems that shit is about to really hit the fan.\"","...!","His words were calm and yet filled with a sense of somberness!","He was the only human in the midst of Simians as the Sword of the Commonwealth had his fur tinged with golden light as he gazed towards his direction before speaking out coldly.","\"He was a prisoner this whole time, and we simply grew complacent thinking he was broken. He will be found again.\"","These words caused Eudemus to raise his brows as he shook his head.","\"Was he ever truly our prisoner? In all these past eons, nobody was able to get into that small domain, and he now left it just as freely. We haven't been able to lock him down here, nor have we been able to find him in the Expanse. I really think...we should just leave things as is...\"","The words were those seeking peace.","In the past, Eudemus had told Noah that he sought a solution to the Three Body Problem- whether this was through peace or Annihilation!","At this time...","\"How can things be left as is? After what we did to them. You know this more than anyone else, Eudemus...there can be no peace.\"","...!","There can be no peace.","Eudemus remained quiet after such words as he thought about the past.","The rise of the Commonwealth was not a seamless one.","The rise of the Commonwealth was a bloody one!","Beneath the rubble of their rise...the force of the prisoner that had just left lay!","But were they truly defeated all the way back then?","With their power, why did they not fight back? This whole time, why had this being not made a move?","And with him moving right now, just what did it say about the coming future?!","|...|","There were no answers. Only the stern faces of Protectors gazing at the empty idyllic space with uncertainty. The Sword of the Commonwealth looked around at all the powerful Protectors nearby as he waved his hands towards them.","|You no longer need to stand guard as for now, spread out. If you come across Morphons, Worms, or anything else- spread the word. Anything not belonging to the Commonwealth...eradicate it!|","WAA!","A command was given.","And it was then followed."]},{"number":3297,"title":"Chapter 3297: Chapter 3296 An Unfathomable Emergence! II","paragraphs":["As terrifying new changes bloomed elsewhere in the Megalos Ynnere, even more unique changes bloomed within the existence of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer.","He stood on a mountain of obsidian gold sandy light as he observed the engineering of an Outerversal Morphon, his body currently adorned in a white lab coat and wide glasses on the bridge of his nose as he got in the spirit of experimentation.","His dark hair radiated a shocking astral luster as his eyes...the complexity of existence they held within their pupils was so intense that even Autarchical Stage Entities at the peak of the Existential Dominium Realm would find it hard to withstand his gaze.","He observed as Savitar's body that was in the form of an obsidian skull gained hues of gold markings on it, its thousands of limbs becoming filled with spikes as from behind, an aurora of obsidian gold wings erupted out!","|GAH! What is this? What resource is this?!|","The voice of Savitar was filled with incredulity as he felt like this body was rebuilt to be even better than its old self.","The speed at which Outerversal Authority coursed through him, the potency, the weight!","Everything seemed to have been elevated as his body seemed to be filled with astonishing weavings of power at his very core.","If he could take these and alter his main body in a similar manner...","...!","His weavings buzzed resplendently as he also recalled that golden dew drop that his existence had madly surged towards.","That was also 50% of the reason why his current changes were so profound.","His sockets were now filled with obsidian gold flames as he looked over Noah's direction silently before...","|Have you...already reached that place?|","...!","That place.","Noah heard such words and smiled sharply as he questioned.","\"That place?\"","|The truly powerful Great Ones within the Megalos Beyond have reached it. The Ponderer likely has as well. It was even theorized that the Crucibles and other wonders that the Great Beyonder made must have all come from that place. A grander weaving of existence where entities from all the Megalos could arrive to once their existence achieves a certain nirvana!|","His words were filled with fanaticism as if he sought that place with great need.","He looked towards Noah for answers as he just smiled while pushing the spectacles on his face closer to his eyes.","\"Maybe. But let's focus on the matter at hand. The Tainted Omniverses where the Great Ponderor has his bodies in...where are they? I shall start there.\"","He had many means under his banner.","The Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction still being designed and improved- with Dark Matter and Psioneutrino Particles being incorporated to make something utterly disastrous.","He just needed a direction.","Savitar gazed at him with a gaze that seemed to be trying to understand, and he then released weavings that contained bundles of information.","Coordinates across the Megalos Ynnere- relative to where they currently were. Relative to Omniverse X-999 itself!","Noah took it all with expectant eyes as at this time...","HUUM!","His eyes lit up as the depths of his existence began to radiate an extremely heavy light.","'Oh?'","It was the completion of the construction of something that was handed down from the Dream of Ozymandias.","It was the true emergence of a golden wheel in the depths of Noah's existence.","The emergence of Kuklos!","The Wheel!","When seeking the Wheel of Existence, one may find nothing at all.","Others may find something relating to the Wheel, or something not even correlated with the wheel at all.","A prominent ordeal the Commonwealth faced was their people seeking the Wheel of Existence and instead finding one of the more terrifying Outerversal Morphons to plague their lands- the Great Wheel!","When Noah sought out the Wheel of Existence, what would he find?","|The System of Existence of Kuklos has come to fruition as your weavings experience unquantifiable changes.|","When the System of Existence of Kuklos fully formed a dazzling wheel inside Noah...a golden light encompassed his vision entirely to the extent that briefly, he couldn't see a thing.","And when his vision returned...","...!","He saw something else entirely.","An Expanse of the darkness of the void lay all around him.","And within this void, there were many, many speckles of golden light stretched out between vast distances.","When he looked close towards these spicules of light, his vision zoomed in as he focused on one point of light that he felt a particularly unique tug from!","And this point of light...","...!","Was an Omniverse. Omniverse X-999.","His native Omniverse!","This meant...that he was currently looking at his Omniverse and the myriad of other points of light were other Omniverses!","His vision zoomed out.","He felt like he was gazing below as, at this moment, he changed his point of view.","Or tried to.","But he was only able to glance upwards for a brief second as there, endlessly far away...he caught a glimpse.","A glimpse of an unfathomably complex Wheel!","...!","A second of a glimpse.","He then felt countless complex weavings of existence flow over him, his gaze no longer capable of turning upwards as he could only stare down and around the stretches of vastness below him!","|A point of connection has formed between the Fourth Mundi of Power and the Wheel of Existence.|","|An irregularity emerged during this connection as due to factors relating to your existence, boons unique to you were obtained.|","...!","His existence analyzed and broke down everything.","At the same time, he felt Quintessence within his First Mundi of Power shine brightly.","The Protagonist and Cheats followed as his very existence seemed to resonate with the boons he was currently gaining as he was viewing an array of Omniverses scattered out across the Megalos Ynnere!","From above, tendrils of complex golden lines fell onto his weavings as his vision only became more and more clear.","|You have gained the distinction of the Cartographer of Existence.|","...!"]},{"number":3298,"title":"Chapter 3298: Chapter 3297 An Unfathomable Emergence! III","paragraphs":["The Cartographer of Existence!","Cartographer.","A word that related to an entity that designed maps and generally drew in countless waves of information and laid it out in a geographical manner.","Such a distinction was given to Noah at this moment as truly, he felt like he was gazing at a portion of an endlessly vast map, with many twinkling lights representing Omniverses strewn about.","His vision was centered around the Omniverse he was currently in, its depth spreading around it as even at this moment, it couldn't see everything.","After a certain distance, he only saw endless darkness without any glimmer of stars as there, his vision could not yet extend to.","|The Region your Cartographer's Vision extends to currently has been defined and designated the distinction of Sector 1.|","|The location of Omniverses and pertinent weavings within Sector 1 of the Megalos Ynnere are being further defined.|","...!","It was unique.","A male generally had a sense of direction and what the distance was between two points, but Noah could barely get a gauge on even distance between Omniverses at this moment.","In a corner of what was deemed Sector 1 of the Megalos Ynnere purely because this was where Noah's native Omniverse currently was and where his current vision was limited to, Noah was also able to hone in on another Omniverse where his body was in.","The Half Tainted Omniverse...and even the Omniverse of the Protectors!","These two were on opposite ends of Sector 1, with Noah currently not being able to judge their distance even though he knew their relative positions.","It was a unique experience as with this, Noah could effectively begin mapping the vastness of the Megalos Ynnere...so long as he continued to extend his vision past his current limitations.","And with such a tool, he could easily traverse from one Omniverse to another without wandering aimlessly!","But he knew this wasn't all.","This was a boon under his new System of Existence of Kuklos.","Brimming with a profound connection to the Wheel of Existence itself, there were still other wonders in store.","|On Omniverses where your weavings are present, the Cartographer's Gateways can be formed, with each one laid down in an Omniverse allowing instantaneous passage to all other connected Omniverses.|","Cartographer's Gateways!","It was a passage from one Omniverse to another.","But even though this weaving seemed dazzling, Noah felt like there was another, even more dazzling weaving in this terrifying new distinction.","|As the Cartographer of Existence, the Existential Displacement of Omniverses or other bodies of existence at a similar level is possible for an extremely high cost that your weavings of Existence will have to bear.|","...!","Existential Displacement.","Now that...seemed like a grandiose capability.","Noah focused on the weavings of such an ability as his vision of Sector 1 of the Megalos Ynnere only became clearer, his intent beginning to test things out right after.","'Begin the formation of the Cartographer's Gateway within Omniverse X-999...and the Half Tainted Omniverse.'","He began to test things out.","At the same time, he blinked- his vision changing from one landscape to another as within an instant, his main body opened its eyes within the depths of the Infinite Omniverse.","Another flash of light echoed from him and disappeared as outside of the Infinite Omniverse, within a section of the red and blue waters of Cappadocia, a golden robed Noah appeared.","His figure seemed ethereal and filled with radiance as in front of him, space began to distort while a colorless rift began to tear apart the surroundings- seeming as if existence itself was being torn!","At the same time.","Within the Fourth Mundi of Power.","A newly formed golden wheel was spinning while radiating pulses of golden light, waves of potent authority being burned by it as around this body of Noah, a colorless gold Quintessential Fabled Omniverse expanded around him to support the terrifying expenditure of the first Cartographer's Gateway!","A door that could lead from one Omniverse to another instantly.","This...was just part of Noah's boons as he added a fourth System of Existence to his Atlas.","He had made tremendous progress in the past days as after the Commonwealth made their entry into this Omniverse, he had since then filled up multiple new Sources of Existence, condensed a Fabled Omniverse and escaped the Existential Dominium Realm, and he even had another part of himself stirring waves within the Megalos Beyond!","His power...had spilled within the Fifth Echelon of Existence.","It was a good measure that seemed equivalent across the board, with the body of Savitar within the Half Tainted Omniverse having been at this stage, and Command Protector Valeria being at the same stage.","But Savitar's main body within the Megalos Beyond was likely on the Seventh Echelon of Existence as his power was a potent one!","But the traversal of this power across the Megalos was difficult as in a different Megalos than the one that you were born in, it seemed like one's power had to be raised again.","The disconnect between Matter, Dark Matter, and Anti-Matter was very real.","But even this...Noah was already beginning to merge Matter and Dark Matter to produce shocking effects as he was on his way.","Many more days from now, who knew what ridiculous height he would have reached?","When the rune of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos was active again, what level of power would he gain even though this time, a single dream wouldn't last an instant?","The weavings of Invictus Maximus pulsed as even though Noah may not fully know, he could see possible glimpses.","And to arrive at the most pristine ones...causality would be twisted and distorted under his banner!","With an expectant gaze, he watched the formation of the first Cartographer's Gateway.","Within the same Sector 1 of the Megalos Ynnere.","An unknown distance away from where the first Cartographer's Gateway was forming, another one of Noah's bodies floated into the vessel termed the Omniversal Voyager as the eyes of Command Protector Valeria and Protector Lucretia never left him.","The Three Simian Protectors of the Equestris Protectors were looking towards him with scrutiny and disbelief as they saw the scene they just saw of this man before them melding with the surrounding Existence!"]},{"number":3299,"title":"Chapter 3299: Chapter 3298 An Unfathomable Emergence! IV","paragraphs":["One with Existence.","It was a state only the truly powerful Protectors who had forged their Fabled Omniverse attained.","Since their complexity was potent enough, they had more success in resonating with their surrounding existence and having their power explode greatly.","Even Command Protector Valeria had not attained this state yet, no matter how close she may be.","So how did this being...","They all had their doubts, but Command Protector Valeria said nothing as the entrance to the Omniversal Voyager closed, the figure of Noah gazing out of its transparent crystalline membrane into the Half Tainted Omniverse that seemed to be swirling with Unstable Existential Storms.","|The Dark Matter Core was all that was left holding the Omniverse, and once that is destroyed, the Omniverse itself follows. Even if its Omniversal Ankyra were still alive, nothing could be done to prevent its destruction. And if left alone...the poison of Dark Matter would only continue to spread across our lands, eventually affecting other Omniverses. This is just our duty as Protectors.|","Command Protector Valeria stopped a few meters away from Noah as she said this.","Her gaze was one with many questions as Noah smiled while gazing out at the unstable weavings of existence.","Duty. This was a heavy word that was hard to ensure at times.","Not too long ago, Noah had felt the weavings of countless extinguished souls within this very same Omniverse as he had made a point that he may as well eradicate the cause of all this.","This was Savitar, and yet not too long after, even though he killed 2 of Savitar's bodies, he now manipulated this being to first attain his own goals and for information as at this moment...they didn't stand as enemies!","Duty.","It was malleable for many as no being could completely carry it out.","The Commonwealth...what secrets did it have underneath its demeanor of saviors across the Megalos Ynnere?","Noah already knew his own selfishness and gains to protect himself and those he loved was paramount before anything else, and he continued to move with this as the basis of his actions!","HUUUM!","The Omniversal Voyager began to move away as Command Protector Valeria asked him with slight hesitation.","'You said you could help my sister...how do we start?'","Her intent was sent directly to him as with his hand behind his back, Noah replied succinctly.","'The one behind her is an Outerversal Morphon. It is nearly impossible to break the link of an Outerversal Morphon unless you kill the Outerversal Morphon itself. To release your sister, I will take you to kill the Outerversal Morphon behind her.'","...!","His eyes shone with vibrant luminosity.","He had just obtained multiple Tainted Omniverses where the bodies of the Great Ponderor resided.","The question was whether his current power could take out these bodies, but even if it wasn't sufficient...he could always send his Weapons of Mass Existential Omniversal Destruction!","The Fat Monkey continued to be improved and a next generation weapon was already being designed.","How glorious would it be to wipe out his enemies as the bombardment of missiles and singularities that utterly wiped out existence?","With plots and schemes rising abundantly, the Omniversal Voyager left.","In the unstable remnants of the Half Tainted Omniverse...","RIIIP!","A massive rift arose as a Cartographer's Gateway formed here to complete the first test of instantaneous traversal across the Megalos Ynnere, and also because Noah didn't like to waste anything.","Even though he had already devoured the Dark Matter Core of the Half Tainted Omniverse, there was still the vast Omniverse itself remaining, even if it was breaking down.","This would be the first Omniverse that would be entirely devoured and assimilated into the Infinite Omniverse.","The first...of just how many?","Dazzling colorless radiance bloomed out as the Cartographer's Gateway went towards completion!","—","In a Sector of the Megalos Ynnere unmapped by the Cartographer.","WAP!","Space distorted as a white robed man whose entire body screamed of age and power appeared.","The space before him flickered as in no time, a worn out treasure chest appeared and flung open as hundreds of miniaturized Omniverses floated out and began to spin around him serenely!","His whole body exuded a shocking glow of power as around him, trillions of multicolored wheels appeared and began to spin crazily.","Trillions.","The radiating glow wrapped around the serenely floating Omniverses- triggering some sort of a reaction and resonance as a moment later...","\"What the Omnifather ordained shall be exposed. Let us hope that it is enough...\"","HUUM!","Cryptic words echoed out from him as a blinding pillar of white light erupted in this area- this pillar of light extending in all directions rapidly as it quickly grew to be larger than most Omniverses!","It then began to pulse with waves upon waves of light that stretched out far and wide.","They stretched out to Sectors the Cartographer of Existence had yet to map out, and even reached the single Sector that he had mapped out!","When these waves of light smashed into Omniverses they came across...","Profound changes began to bloom.","Within the Omniverse of the Protectors.","Verdant waves of light permeated all around, the wills of Protectors covering all surfaces of this vast Omniverse as in the next second...","HUUM!","A wave of brilliance passed through the Omniverse that aroused many gazes.","And an instant later, towards the center of this Omniverse...","Space fluctuated and tore apart as a square white portal instantly emerged!","|Who!|","Booming wills of Protectors instantly covered it as alarms were raised, with hundreds of Protectors being notified as they began to arrive one by one in the area where the white square portal had emerged.","They circled around it sternly as if they prepared for a great enemy to come out of it.","But...nothing came out.","Within Omniverse X-999.","Noah was observing the completion of the Cartographer's Gateway when suddenly, an unseen wave of brilliance filled with heavy complexity while through, and it was followed with the emergence of a dazzling white square portal!"]},{"number":3300,"title":"Chapter 3300: Chapter 3299 The Weavings of the Omnifather! I","paragraphs":["A square portal!","It bloomed instantly the moment the wave of brilliance passed over the Omniverse, and it was near the vast empire of the Imperium itself.","But the sheer presence it radiated was so potent that Noah found himself inexplicably drawn towards it.","HUUM!","His figure flickered across the Omniverse, crossing great distances to instantly appear in front of this fully formed white portal!","It brimmed with complex weavings of existence.","So complex that they didn't seem to belong in these weavings of Existence!","But the moment Noah stood before it...","|Loot feels an unfathomable tug of brilliance.|","|Destiny unfurls with brilliance...|","|Cheats opens its eyes wide at the unknown possibilities that can cause such a reaction.|","...!","His extremities were buzzing.","His Distinctions even moreso!","As the Weaver of Extremity and the Weaver of Existence, nearly every part of him was urging for him to enter this white portal.","The more this urge came, the more careful he was as just what could make something like this appear?","SAA!","Not too far from him, the figure of Imperium appeared with his golden hair waving majestically.","His eyes showed alarm and serendipity as he had many intents flow into him through the many connected Omniversal Authorities as he also felt a shocking pull towards this white portal!","|What is this...how did it bloom? Why?|","Questions that even Noah sought to answer.","But since no answers were available...","\"Only one way to find out...\" Noah's eyes shone brilliantly as his Clone subtly changed.","It took on the identity of the Ascendant Existential Extremity Clone of Cheats, turning into a streak of light that surged straight into the white portal!","Behind him, the gaze of the regal Imperium flickered as golden waves of light surged around him, another body merging from his current one as he also delved into the white portal.","They weren't the only ones.","Across too many Omniverses.","Across the Megalos Ynnere.","All habitable Omniverses with a certain level of complexity within them had a dazzling white portal appear within- each one radiating a gravitating pull that drew in all those with high enough levels of existence!","Within a Tainted Omniverse.","A shrouded visage of the Great Ponderor gazed at a square white portal that had caused an area of white brilliance to spread out around it- the weavings of Dark Matter nearby being disrupted tremendously.","\"Bellerophon....\"","The Great Ponderor spoke out to one of its more powerful generals.","\"Enter, and let us see what it holds in store.\"","He commanded.","And Bellerophon moved to this command as his figure flashed towards the white portal!","BOOM!","But shockingly, his skeletal figure was flung back with heavy rejection as if he had hit an inviolable wall.","As if the very makeup of the Outerversal Morphon was rejected by this portal!","At such a reality, the veiled gaze of the Great Ponderor turned immensely sharp.","Within another distant unnamed Sector that the Cartographer of Existence had not yet been to.","The entity responsible for initiating this chain of events stared at hundreds of miniaturized Omniverses that were spinning around him.","Within these Omniverses as well, square white portals appeared as...what lay within these Omniverses?","Omniverses untouched by the Commonwealth.","Omniverses that were undoubtedly in existence even before the Commonwealth began its Hegemony.","Just who lay within them?","—","After passing through the square white portal, Noah felt like his very own existence had undergone a warping to an extremely distant place.","Complex weavings even he couldn't fully grasp circled all around him as the only thing he could confirm...was that he was still within the Megalos Ynnere!","But apart from that, nothing.","BOOM!","A wave of brilliance smashed into him that disrupted even his vision, his figure facing temporary darkness as when he could see again...he was exposed to utterly new fantastical weavings.","He grabbed his head as if he was waking up from a long slumber, his hands splashing on water as he found himself to be on top of a serene body of water.","Water so beautiful and so endlessly blue.","He was rising atop the calm waves of this endless body of water, and when he looked around, he wasn't alone!","A few miles away from him, a titanic entity who was at least twenty times his size also stepped on the cerulean calm waves while looking around him, his body radiating a shockingly heavy pressure of power as he looked humanoid, but his skin pulsed with purple radiance and purple flames of...","\"Entropy?\"","Noah blinked at the familiarity, but he truly recognized shockingly pure waves of Entropy surrounding this purple being whose entire body seemed wreathed in purple violet flames!","When he gazed at him, this being also gazed back.","HUUM!","And he gazed back with appalling power as above his head that was filled with majestic purple violet flames that made him seem like an ancient titan, a terrifying illusory eye formed that observed everything.","An Eye of Existence!","It seemed to be penetrative everything to observe Noah as moments later...","|Interesting...of which Lineage are you, Little One?|","A deep intent boomed out.","An intent that didn't have any malice within it, simply curiosity.","Noah gazed at this being as the complex weavings he could sense from them...were similar to his.","Those of someone who had arrived in the Expanse.","Those of someone who had transcended their weavings of existence!","|I am of the Lineage of the Omniversal Archontes Engineer. What about you, Big One?|","Noah used the same tone as the regal flames of Entropy around this being surged while he smiled.","|I am part of the Antediluvian Leviathans. I thought you were one of our descendants...the others should be arriving here soon-|","WAP!","Around them, flashes of brilliance began to bloom one after another.","But they came in sequence.","The first one that Noah noticed...was a Royal Existential Omniversal Simian.","An entity with green fur and the similarities of a humanoid monkey- with their bodies cautiously exhibiting a few thousand layers of illusory Fabled Omniverses around him!","Thereafter, Noah noticed another titanic entity appear in another direction.","This one was wreathed in golden flames as she held a striking figure full of curves, with the golden flames around her body radiating nothing else other than...","'Destiny!'","...!"]}]);
